{"id": "0", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman in a pink suit gives a speech at a podium while a crowd claps in applause.", "pred": "A woman in a pink blazer speaks at a podium into a microphone, and the audience responds with applause.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman in a pink blazer speaks at a podium into a microphone, and the audience responds with applause.", "cot": "[\"A woman in a pink blazer speaks at a podium into a microphone, and the audience responds with applause.\", \"A woman in a pink blazer speaks at a podium with a microphone, followed by loud, sustained applause from an unseen audience.\", \"A woman in a pink blazer speaks at a podium. Applause is heard, followed by her voice as she says, \\\"I'm excited about this TV commercial and I feel like I'm a small part of it.\\\"\", \"A woman with blonde hair, wearing a pink blazer, stands at a podium speaking into a microphone. She points her right index finger forward as the audience behind her applauds.\"]", "time_sec": 40.709, "generation_time_seconds": 39.0021, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0008, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 42.11, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "1", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The wind whispers through the leaves as a leaf blower hums, while a black snake slithers in the grass near a tree.", "pred": "A close-up view of a dark, fuzzy object, resembling a beehive, is attached to a wooden post within a wire fence, surrounded by dense green vegetation, while the loud, continuous hum of a large engine is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A close-up view of a dark, fuzzy object, resembling a beehive, is attached to a wooden post within a wire fence, surrounded by dense green vegetation, while the loud, continuous hum of a large engine is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A close-up view of a dark, fuzzy object, resembling a beehive, is attached to a wooden post within a wire fence, surrounded by dense green vegetation, while the loud, continuous hum of a large engine is heard in the background.\", \"A black and silver garden tool is being used to clear green weeds from the ground. The audio consists of the continuous, low-pitched hum of a running motor.\", \"1.  **Visual Analysis:** The video shows a first-person perspective looking down at a black and yellow leaf blower nozzle resting on green grass and weeds next to a tree trunk and a wire fence.\\n2.  **Auditory Analysis:** The sound is a loud, continuous, low-frequency hum, characteristic of a large engine or heavy machinery, with a rhythmic pulsing quality.\\n3.  **Synthesis:** The visual shows a leaf blower on the ground, while the audio is the sound of a large engine running. These two elements are unrelated.\\n4.  **Final Sentence:** A leaf blower rests on grass beside a wire fence, while the sound of a large engine idles in the background.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a dark, metallic, segmented object, possibly a robotic claw or mechanical arm, moving slowly through dense green vegetation. The accompanying audio consists of the distinct, rhythmic clicking of a turn signal relay, layered over the low rumble of a large engine and faint wind noise.\"]", "time_sec": 65.477, "generation_time_seconds": 64.3251, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "2", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman speaks softly as water splashes and trickles and she sitting on a large rock in the middle of a lake .", "pred": "A person wearing a red and black jacket stands on a large rock in the water, touching it while speaking in Russian.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing a red and black jacket stands on a large rock in the water, touching it while speaking in Russian.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing a red and black jacket stands on a large rock in the water, touching it while speaking in Russian.\", \"A woman in a red jacket and life vest stands on a large rock in the water, touching its surface as waves lap around it. She speaks in Russian, describing the location as a place of powerful energy where she is recharging herself and the rock.\", \"A person wearing a red and black jacket stands on a large, wet rock in a body of water, touching its surface. In the background, a treed shoreline is visible under a cloudy sky. The person speaks in Russian, describing the location as a sacred place with strong energy.\", \"A woman in a red life vest stands on a large rock in a body of water, touching it while speaking in Russian.\"]", "time_sec": 43.778, "generation_time_seconds": 42.4873, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 4.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "3", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a kitchen, a man  with a glass of water in hand opens the door of a refrigerator, speaking amidst rattling and banging with a high frequency ringing.", "pred": "A man in a dark shirt opens a white cabinet, takes out a glass, and turns to speak, while the distinct sound of a drawer opening and shutting is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a dark shirt opens a white cabinet, takes out a glass, and turns to speak, while the distinct sound of a drawer opening and shutting is heard.", "cot": "[\"A man in a dark shirt opens a white cabinet, takes out a glass, and turns to speak, while the distinct sound of a drawer opening and shutting is heard.\", \"The man, who is speaking, reaches up into the cabinet and pulls out a glass bowl.\", \"A man in a dark shirt opens a white upper cabinet door in a kitchen, retrieves a glass, and turns toward the camera while speaking, as the sound of the cabinet door closing and a glass being set down is heard.\", \"A man in a dark shirt opens a cabinet, takes out a glass, and speaks while a glass object clanks against a hard surface.\"]", "time_sec": 38.165, "generation_time_seconds": 37.4611, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.75, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "4", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a tiled bathroom, a person lifts the toilet lid as tapping noises are heard, followed by the sound of a toilet flushing.", "pred": "The video displays a white toilet on a brown tiled floor, with a \"CRANE PLUMBING\" sign visible in the background. A hand reaches into the frame to flush the toilet, which produces a loud, gurgling sound as it fills with water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a white toilet on a brown tiled floor, with a \"CRANE PLUMBING\" sign visible in the background. A hand reaches into the frame to flush the toilet, which produces a loud, gurgling sound as it fills with water.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a white toilet on a brown tiled floor, with a \\\"CRANE PLUMBING\\\" sign visible in the background. A hand reaches into the frame to flush the toilet, which produces a loud, gurgling sound as it fills with water.\", \"A hand presses the toilet flush handle, initiating a loud, forceful draining and gurgling flush within a bathroom that features a white toilet and mosaic tile flooring.\", \"A hand presses a toilet flush handle, causing the toilet to flush and making a sound of rushing water.\", \"The video shows a white toilet with its lid up, and the sound of a toilet flushing is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 38.856, "generation_time_seconds": 37.6728, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "5", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A person in white gloves pours orange liquid from a plastic bottle while a series of compressed air sprays and a motor hums in the background.", "pred": "A gloved hand uses a spray can to apply red paint to a jar, creating a fine mist that is accompanied by the distinct hiss of the spray mechanism.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A gloved hand uses a spray can to apply red paint to a jar, creating a fine mist that is accompanied by the distinct hiss of the spray mechanism.", "cot": "[\"A gloved hand uses a spray can to apply red paint to a jar, creating a fine mist that is accompanied by the distinct hiss of the spray mechanism.\", \"A gloved hand holds a silver aerosol can, spraying a fine mist of red paint onto a small, translucent red bottle resting on a dark surface. The background features a sign with a rainbow gradient and the text 'vernic spray' and 'QMD'. A continuous hissing sound is heard, corresponding directly to the act of spraying.\", \"A hand in a white glove sprays a clear liquid into a bottle with a rainbow-colored sign in the background, accompanied by the continuous hissing sound of an aerosol can.\", \"A gloved hand holds a red spray paint can, emitting a continuous hissing sound as it applies a coat of paint to a clear bottle.\"]", "time_sec": 45.076, "generation_time_seconds": 43.8869, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "6", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The tribal drums beat as a green frog sits in a natural environment, surrounded by the sounds of shuffling footsteps, chirping crickets, and wet dirt.", "pred": "A spotted green frog is in a video game environment, and the sound of a horse trotting on a dirt road can be heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A spotted green frog is in a video game environment, and the sound of a horse trotting on a dirt road can be heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A spotted green frog is in a video game environment, and the sound of a horse trotting on a dirt road can be heard in the background.\", \"A green spotted frog with orange eyes sits on the ground, while the sound of a galloping horse is heard in the background.\", \"A green, spotted frog is in a grassy field with trees and mountains in the background.\\nThe audio contains the sound of hoofbeats on a hard surface, followed by a dog barking, then a horse whinnying.\", \"A large, green, spotted frog sits on the ground in a cartoonish landscape with trees and mountains. The audio features a continuous, rhythmic electronic beep, similar to a heart monitor, layered over a low, sustained, synthesized drone.\"]", "time_sec": 42.914, "generation_time_seconds": 42.2357, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "7", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A small dog sitting in a basket with a leash on the floor, accompanied by the sound of a person snoring.", "pred": "A pug dog is lying down and making a loud, continuous snoring sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A pug dog is lying down and making a loud, continuous snoring sound.", "cot": "[\"A pug dog is lying down and making a loud, continuous snoring sound.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a pug dog in a dark environment, accompanied by a loud, continuous buzzing sound.\", \"A pug dog is seen lying down in a dimly lit environment, and it is audibly snoring.\", \"A pug dog is shown in a close-up, dark shot, while the audio consists of a loud, rhythmic snoring sound.\"]", "time_sec": 32.537, "generation_time_seconds": 31.9143, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.58, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "8", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red and blue helicopter landing on a runway as a small plane sits nearby.and some poles are visible.", "pred": "A red, white, and blue helicopter is on a landing pad with its tail rotor spinning. The sound of a very loud, high-pitched engine is heard, consistent with the helicopter's rotor blades.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red, white, and blue helicopter is on a landing pad with its tail rotor spinning. The sound of a very loud, high-pitched engine is heard, consistent with the helicopter's rotor blades.", "cot": "[\"A red, white, and blue helicopter is on a landing pad with its tail rotor spinning. The sound of a very loud, high-pitched engine is heard, consistent with the helicopter's rotor blades.\", \"I observe a blue, red, and white helicopter on a paved surface, its main rotor blades spinning rapidly.\\n Simultaneously, I hear the loud, powerful, and rhythmic sound of a large engine or turbine, characteristic of a helicopter's rotor blades cutting through the air.\\n The combination of the spinning blades and the engine noise indicates the helicopter is active and likely preparing for or completing a flight.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A blue, red, and white helicopter with spinning rotor blades is on a paved surface, accompanied by the loud, powerful noise of its engine.}\", \"A blue, red, and white helicopter is stationary on a grassy field with a runway and trees in the background, while a loud, high-pitched engine sound is heard.\", \"A blue, red, and white helicopter is stationary on a paved surface, while a loud, high-pitched whirring sound, characteristic of a rotor, continuously plays from it.\"]", "time_sec": 54.919, "generation_time_seconds": 53.9387, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "9", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The roaring helicopter flies low over a building in the windy cityscape. and one man also visible.", "pred": "A white and yellow helicopter, identified as S-CHMU, is on a grassy area, its main rotor spinning rapidly, creating a loud, high-pitched whirring sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white and yellow helicopter, identified as S-CHMU, is on a grassy area, its main rotor spinning rapidly, creating a loud, high-pitched whirring sound.", "cot": "[\"A white and yellow helicopter, identified as S-CHMU, is on a grassy area, its main rotor spinning rapidly, creating a loud, high-pitched whirring sound.\", \"A white and yellow helicopter with the registration G-SMMU hovers low over a grassy area in front of a multi-story building, while the loud, deep roar of its turbine engine fills the air.\", \"A white and yellow rescue helicopter with the registration G-SAMU is on a grassy area in front of a multi-story building. The loud, deep whirring of its powerful rotors dominates the audio.\", \"A white and yellow helicopter with the registration G-SMMU is seen flying low over a grassy area, moving from right to left in front of a large building, while its loud, roaring engine creates a continuous, high-pitched whine as it passes by.\"]", "time_sec": 47.365, "generation_time_seconds": 45.8086, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "10", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the sun sets, a very long train passes by with warning bells ringing and a honking horn.", "pred": "A large freight train, consisting of a locomotive and numerous silver tanker cars, travels along tracks next to a gravel embankment during sunset.\n Simultaneously, the loud, rhythmic clatter of the train's wheels on the rails and a prominent, repeating horn are heard.\n\\boxed{A freight train with silver tanker cars moves along the tracks at sunset, accompanied by the loud clatter of its wheels and a repeating horn.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large freight train, consisting of a locomotive and numerous silver tanker cars, travels along tracks next to a gravel embankment during sunset.\n Simultaneously, the loud, rhythmic clatter of the train's wheels on the rails and a prominent, repeating horn are heard.\n\\boxed{A freight train with silver tanker cars moves along the tracks at sunset, accompanied by the loud clatter of its wheels and a repeating horn.}", "cot": "[\"A large freight train, consisting of a locomotive and numerous silver tanker cars, travels along tracks next to a gravel embankment during sunset.\\n Simultaneously, the loud, rhythmic clatter of the train's wheels on the rails and a prominent, repeating horn are heard.\\n\\\\boxed{A freight train with silver tanker cars moves along the tracks at sunset, accompanied by the loud clatter of its wheels and a repeating horn.}\", \"A long freight train with a red locomotive and silver tanker cars moves from right to left along multiple tracks, passing by buildings and mountains silhouetted against a bright sky, while a loud, multi-toned train horn blares followed by the rhythmic clatter of its wheels on the rails.\", \"A train with a red locomotive and silver cars moves right to left on tracks. A person stands near the tracks. The scene is at dusk. A loud, multi-toned train horn sounds, followed by the rhythmic clatter of wheels on rails.\", \"A long freight train with a red locomotive travels along multiple tracks at sunset, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic clatter of its wheels on the rails and a powerful, multi-tone air horn.\"]", "time_sec": 58.235, "generation_time_seconds": 56.8053, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.27, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "11", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A train horn blares, and a train passes by a road with a red traffic light and a gate with a sign.", "pred": "The visual shows a closed railway level crossing with red warning lights, a lowered white and red striped barrier, and yellow road markings, while the audio captures the sound of a train horn and the rumble of its passage.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The visual shows a closed railway level crossing with red warning lights, a lowered white and red striped barrier, and yellow road markings, while the audio captures the sound of a train horn and the rumble of its passage.", "cot": "[\"The visual shows a closed railway level crossing with red warning lights, a lowered white and red striped barrier, and yellow road markings, while the audio captures the sound of a train horn and the rumble of its passage.\", \"A railway level crossing with red flashing lights and a lowered red-and-white barrier is shown, accompanied by the sound of a train approaching and a loud horn blast.\", \"A red and white striped railway crossing barrier is down across a paved road, flanked by two square red warning lights and signs, while a train horn sounds.\", \"I see a lowered red-and-white striped railway crossing barrier with flashing red lights and yellow road markings, while I hear the distant rumble of an approaching train followed by a loud, sustained train horn.\"]", "time_sec": 42.386, "generation_time_seconds": 41.0616, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "12", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The roaring engine of an orange car fills the air as firefighters , creating a dramatic scene.", "pred": "An orange car performs a burnout, producing a large cloud of white smoke, while a powerful engine revs loudly and tires squeal on the pavement.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "An orange car performs a burnout, producing a large cloud of white smoke, while a powerful engine revs loudly and tires squeal on the pavement.", "cot": "[\"An orange car performs a burnout, producing a large cloud of white smoke, while a powerful engine revs loudly and tires squeal on the pavement.\", \"An orange car performs a burnout, creating a large cloud of white smoke on a track, while a crowd watches and a person in a yellow jacket holds a red flag; simultaneously, the sound of a powerful engine revving and then sputtering and dying is heard.\", \"At a motorsports event, an orange car performs a burnout, creating a large cloud of white smoke. Two people in yellow fire-resistant suits stand nearby, and a crowd watches from behind a barrier. The dominant sound is a loud, high-revving V8 engine that roars and accelerates rapidly, accompanied by the distinct screech of tires spinning on the asphalt.\", \"An orange sedan performs a burnout, creating thick white smoke on a paved surface while a crowd watches, and the sounds of a powerful engine revving and tires screeching are heard.\"]", "time_sec": 51.338, "generation_time_seconds": 49.1588, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "13", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A small frog sits in the leaves of a green bush at night, surrounded by the soothing sounds of frogs and crickets chirping and croaking.", "pred": "A dark, textured frog is camouflaged among wet, green cypress-like foliage, while in the background, a chorus of high-pitched, rhythmic frog croaks can be heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A dark, textured frog is camouflaged among wet, green cypress-like foliage, while in the background, a chorus of high-pitched, rhythmic frog croaks can be heard.", "cot": "[\"A dark, textured frog is camouflaged among wet, green cypress-like foliage, while in the background, a chorus of high-pitched, rhythmic frog croaks can be heard.\", \"A frog is perched on a green, dew-covered bush. The frog's skin is a mottled brown and grey. The frog croaks loudly.\", \"{\\n\\\"An amphibian with mottled brown skin rests on dark green, dew-covered foliage, while a chorus of distinct, high-pitched croaking sounds is heard in the background.\\\"\\n}\", \"A brown toad with a textured back is camouflaged within wet green coniferous foliage. The distinct croaking of a frog is heard in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 42.785, "generation_time_seconds": 40.763, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "14", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man, humming and rustling, gives a thumbs up in front of the casino entrance and there are cars are parking.", "pred": "A bald man in a black jacket stands on a paved street in front of the Trump Taj Mahal casino, speaking to the camera while gesturing with his hands, as a constant low-frequency rumble is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A bald man in a black jacket stands on a paved street in front of the Trump Taj Mahal casino, speaking to the camera while gesturing with his hands, as a constant low-frequency rumble is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A bald man in a black jacket stands on a paved street in front of the Trump Taj Mahal casino, speaking to the camera while gesturing with his hands, as a constant low-frequency rumble is heard in the background.\", \"A bald man in a black jacket speaks to the camera on a paved street in front of a building with a large \\\"Trump Taj Mahal\\\" sign, while a constant low-frequency hum is audible in the background.\", \"A bald man in a black jacket stands on a paved area in front of the 'Trump Taj Mahal' casino, speaking and gesturing towards the camera, while a continuous mechanical whirring sound is heard in the background.\", \"A bald man in a black jacket stands on a paved area in front of the Trump Taj Mahal casino, speaking to the camera as cars are parked nearby and water flows in a fountain, while his voice is heavily distorted by a loud, continuous, low-frequency buzzing sound.\"]", "time_sec": 49.196, "generation_time_seconds": 48.293, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "15", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a snowy parking lot, the sound of a truck engine revving mixes with honking horns as people talk, while vehicles drive.", "pred": "A large, camouflage-patterned monster truck with oversized tires performs donuts, kicking up snow and smoke on a snowy, overcast day. The deep rumble of its engine is followed by a loud, multi-chime horn honking, and an excited male voice shouts.\n\\boxed{A camouflaged monster truck spins in the snow, its engine roaring before a loud horn blares and a man shouts.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large, camouflage-patterned monster truck with oversized tires performs donuts, kicking up snow and smoke on a snowy, overcast day. The deep rumble of its engine is followed by a loud, multi-chime horn honking, and an excited male voice shouts.\n\\boxed{A camouflaged monster truck spins in the snow, its engine roaring before a loud horn blares and a man shouts.}", "cot": "[\"A large, camouflage-patterned monster truck with oversized tires performs donuts, kicking up snow and smoke on a snowy, overcast day. The deep rumble of its engine is followed by a loud, multi-chime horn honking, and an excited male voice shouts.\\n\\\\boxed{A camouflaged monster truck spins in the snow, its engine roaring before a loud horn blares and a man shouts.}\", \"A large monster truck with oversized tires performs donuts in a snowy clearing, kicking up clouds of snow, while the sound of its engine and a car horn can be heard.\", \"A large, dark off-road vehicle performs donuts, spinning its tires and kicking up snow on a frozen lake. In the background, several other vehicles are parked in a line. The sound of the vehicle's engine is prominent, and a horn honks repeatedly.\", \"A large, black off-road vehicle with oversized tires performs a donut in a snowy, open area, creating tracks in the snow, while multiple other off-road vehicles are parked in the background, and a horn is sounded.\"]", "time_sec": 51.915, "generation_time_seconds": 51.2428, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.04, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "16", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The rhythmic hum of a sewing machine as a person stitches fabric.", "pred": "A person operates a large, industrial sewing machine, which emits a rhythmic, mechanical whirring sound as it stitches a piece of white fabric.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person operates a large, industrial sewing machine, which emits a rhythmic, mechanical whirring sound as it stitches a piece of white fabric.", "cot": "[\"A person operates a large, industrial sewing machine, which emits a rhythmic, mechanical whirring sound as it stitches a piece of white fabric.\", \"A person's hands guide a fabric strip under the needle of a sewing machine, and the sound of the machine's needle rapidly moving up and down is heard.\", \"A person's hands operate a sewing machine, with the needle moving rapidly up and down as a piece of white fabric is fed through, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic whirring of the machine's motor.\", \"The audio features the loud, rhythmic clatter of a manual typewriter, while the visual shows a pair of hands operating a large, industrial sewing machine on a white material.\"]", "time_sec": 41.588, "generation_time_seconds": 40.1239, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 54.55, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "17", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man discusses as footsteps crunch on dirt and gravel, and birds chirp, while a pile of food and bags, a bag of trash, and other litter lay scattered on the ground.", "pred": "At the beginning of the video, a red bag of Sevin insect killer is visible on the dark ground. A male speaker with a Southern accent discusses different lawn care products, noting that both have the same numbers but that one has a stronger weed killer for weeds that have already emerged.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "At the beginning of the video, a red bag of Sevin insect killer is visible on the dark ground. A male speaker with a Southern accent discusses different lawn care products, noting that both have the same numbers but that one has a stronger weed killer for weeds that have already emerged.", "cot": "[\"At the beginning of the video, a red bag of Sevin insect killer is visible on the dark ground. A male speaker with a Southern accent discusses different lawn care products, noting that both have the same numbers but that one has a stronger weed killer for weeds that have already emerged.\", \"The visual shows several bags of lawn care products, including a red bag of \\\"Sevin Lawn Insect Granules\\\" and a large white and green bag of \\\"LAWN SPRING\\\" fertilizer, on a dark ground surface. Simultaneously, a male voice discusses the properties of these products, comparing the \\\"lawn spring\\\" fertilizer to another and noting that the \\\"lawn spring\\\" is a stronger weed killer specifically for weeds that have already emerged.\", \"The video shows four bags of lawn care products on a paved surface next to a wheelbarrow, while a man speaks, comparing their weed-killing strengths and noting one has a stronger effect on already-emerged weeds.\", \"The video displays several bags of lawn care products on the ground, including 'Lawn Spring' and 'Southern Lawn Insect Granules', while a person discusses the weed-killing properties of the 'Lay Spring' product.\"]", "time_sec": 56.996, "generation_time_seconds": 56.0312, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "18", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man is scrapping and filing wood while a man talks, surrounded by wooden toys and a barking dog in the background.", "pred": "A craftsman in a pink tank top is filing a wooden object at a table covered in craft supplies, while a man speaks in Spanish in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A craftsman in a pink tank top is filing a wooden object at a table covered in craft supplies, while a man speaks in Spanish in the background.", "cot": "[\"A craftsman in a pink tank top is filing a wooden object at a table covered in craft supplies, while a man speaks in Spanish in the background.\", \"A man in a pink tank top files a wooden object with a rasp, producing a scraping sound, while speaking in Spanish in a room with other wooden items on a table.\", \"A craftsman in a pink tank top files a wooden craft at a table. A man speaks in Spanish while the sound of sanding is heard.\", \"A man wearing a pink tank top and glasses sits at a white table, vigorously filing a wooden object with a coarse tool, causing a prominent scraping sound, while speaking in Spanish.\"]", "time_sec": 39.634, "generation_time_seconds": 38.6153, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.63, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "19", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a blurry room, a man shouts before and after a person belches loudly, while a young woman in a black kitchen smiles by a plate of food with meat and onions.", "pred": "A woman with dark hair in a black top is seen yelling or laughing in a room with a window. Simultaneously, a loud male voice exclaims, \"What is that?\" followed by a wet, gurgling burp and the word, \"Exactly.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman with dark hair in a black top is seen yelling or laughing in a room with a window. Simultaneously, a loud male voice exclaims, \"What is that?\" followed by a wet, gurgling burp and the word, \"Exactly.\"", "cot": "[\"A woman with dark hair in a black top is seen yelling or laughing in a room with a window. Simultaneously, a loud male voice exclaims, \\\"What is that?\\\" followed by a wet, gurgling burp and the word, \\\"Exactly.\\\"\", \"A close-up of sliced pink meat on a white plate with a fork is shown, followed by a woman in a dark top making a surprised face in a room with a window, and then the view returns to the plate of meat as a male voice asks, \\\"What is that?\\\", is followed by a loud belch, and then the voice says, \\\"Exactly.\\\".\", \"The audio presents a man asking, \\\"What is that?\\\", immediately followed by a loud, guttural burp, and then the man exclaiming, \\\"Exactly!\\\"\", \"A woman with dark hair in a dark top reacts with surprise to a plate of sliced meat, immediately followed by a loud, deep, guttural growl from an unseen source.\"]", "time_sec": 50.252, "generation_time_seconds": 49.7284, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "20", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of sizzling steaks and ribs on the grill, accompanied by whispers and music playing through headphones.", "pred": "The image displays multiple steaks with grill marks on a barbecue, one being flipped with tongs over a flame, while a person speaks the words \"Epic sound effects\" followed by the sound of sizzling food.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The image displays multiple steaks with grill marks on a barbecue, one being flipped with tongs over a flame, while a person speaks the words \"Epic sound effects\" followed by the sound of sizzling food.", "cot": "[\"The image displays multiple steaks with grill marks on a barbecue, one being flipped with tongs over a flame, while a person speaks the words \\\"Epic sound effects\\\" followed by the sound of sizzling food.\", \"A grill with multiple steaks is shown, with one steak being turned with tongs over an open flame, while a male voice says \\\"Epic Sound FX\\\" followed by a loud, sustained static noise.\", \"I see grilled meat on a barbecue with a \\\"Subscribe\\\" button overlay. I hear a male voice say \\\"Epic sound effects,\\\" followed by a loud, sustained sizzling sound.\", \"A grill sizzles with steaks as a voice announces 'Epic sound effects,' which is immediately followed by a burst of loud, crackling static.\"]", "time_sec": 43.234, "generation_time_seconds": 42.4209, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "21", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The digital beep is followed by a man speaking in this screenshot of a website.", "pred": "The audio features a male voice introducing a tutorial on loading data from a server in Angular JS, while the accompanying video displays a computer screen showing a Microsoft Word document with a blue header and the \"20Fingers2Brains\" logo.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features a male voice introducing a tutorial on loading data from a server in Angular JS, while the accompanying video displays a computer screen showing a Microsoft Word document with a blue header and the \"20Fingers2Brains\" logo.", "cot": "[\"The audio features a male voice introducing a tutorial on loading data from a server in Angular JS, while the accompanying video displays a computer screen showing a Microsoft Word document with a blue header and the \\\"20Fingers2Brains\\\" logo.\", \"A screen recording displays a Microsoft Word document with text and a \\\"20Fingers2Brains\\\" logo, while a male voice narrates instructions for loading data from a server in AngularJS.\", \"A screen recording displays a Microsoft Word document within a PowerPoint presentation, showing text about loading data in AngularJS, while a male voice narrates the same topic.\", \"The video displays a Microsoft PowerPoint presentation with the title \\\"20Fingers2Brains\\\" and a list of bullet points, which is being narrated by a male voice explaining how to load data from a server in AngularJS.\"]", "time_sec": 44.963, "generation_time_seconds": 43.8978, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "22", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman and another woman chat as a goat baaing is heard, while a black and white kid  is held on a white towel by a person.", "pred": "A black and white goat kid is being held by a person in a white coat, wrapped in a white towel, and placed onto a green towel on a surface. The person uses a blue object on the goat's chest while others encourage it to stand, remarking it hasn't walked yet and doesn't have the strength, as the goat bleats.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black and white goat kid is being held by a person in a white coat, wrapped in a white towel, and placed onto a green towel on a surface. The person uses a blue object on the goat's chest while others encourage it to stand, remarking it hasn't walked yet and doesn't have the strength, as the goat bleats.", "cot": "[\"A black and white goat kid is being held by a person in a white coat, wrapped in a white towel, and placed onto a green towel on a surface. The person uses a blue object on the goat's chest while others encourage it to stand, remarking it hasn't walked yet and doesn't have the strength, as the goat bleats.\", \"A person in a white coat holds a small, black-and-white goat on towels while another person attempts to dry it with a green towel and encourages it to stand, but the goat bleats and remains on the ground.\", \"A black and white goat kid is being held and rubbed with a green towel by a person in a white coat, while a human female speaks and the goat bleats.\", \"A black and white goat kid is being supported by a person on a towel in a clinical setting, while the person encourages it to stand and it bleats.\"]", "time_sec": 46.781, "generation_time_seconds": 45.9674, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.65, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "23", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a woman delivers a speech at an event, standing at a podium with a microphone in front of a flag.", "pred": "A woman in a black dress speaks at a podium labeled \"JACKSON DAY\" in front of a large red, white, and blue backdrop, identifying herself as being from the hills of East Tennessee.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman in a black dress speaks at a podium labeled \"JACKSON DAY\" in front of a large red, white, and blue backdrop, identifying herself as being from the hills of East Tennessee.", "cot": "[\"A woman in a black dress speaks at a podium labeled \\\"JACKSON DAY\\\" in front of a large red, white, and blue backdrop, identifying herself as being from the hills of East Tennessee.\", \"A woman stands at a podium in front of a blue, white, and red backdrop, speaking into a microphone. She says, \\\"I'm a hillbilly, I live very far away. I live up in the hills of East Tennessee. And the only thing I ever did was that I went and got myself on TV.\\\"\", \"A woman in a black dress stands at a podium labeled 'JACKSON DAY' with a blue and red backdrop behind her, while she speaks into a microphone about living in the hills of East Tennessee.\", \"A woman with dark hair, wearing a black and white dress, stands at a podium with a \\\"JACKSON DAY\\\" sign and speaks into a microphone, her right hand raised in gesture, while a large blue, white, and red star-patterned backdrop is visible behind her.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A woman in a black and white dress speaks at a \\\"JACKSON DAY\\\" podium with a microphone, gesturing with her right hand, against a large blue, white, and red star-patterned backdrop.}\"]", "time_sec": 58.82, "generation_time_seconds": 58.035, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "24", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The motorbike engine purrs softly as it sits on display, showcasing its intricate details up close.", "pred": "A small orange and white Honda motorcycle with a rear passenger seat is shown, while a hand turns its engine, which starts and idles with a loud, sputtering, chugging sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A small orange and white Honda motorcycle with a rear passenger seat is shown, while a hand turns its engine, which starts and idles with a loud, sputtering, chugging sound.", "cot": "[\"A small orange and white Honda motorcycle with a rear passenger seat is shown, while a hand turns its engine, which starts and idles with a loud, sputtering, chugging sound.\", \"A close-up shows a person's hand near the engine of an orange and white Honda motorcycle, while the sound of a loud, sputtering, and misfiring engine is heard.\", \"This is a close-up of a small Honda motorcycle with an orange fuel tank and a black passenger seat, where a hand is attempting to start the engine, which audibly sputters and fails to catch.\\n\\\\boxed{}\", \"A hand turns the kickstarter of a small orange and white Honda motorcycle, producing a loud, sputtering, and uneven engine sound.\"]", "time_sec": 42.65, "generation_time_seconds": 41.0859, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "25", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling studio, the sound of aluminum cans clanking and compressed air spraying mingles with the gentle rattling of plastic as artists work on their paintings of various subjects.", "pred": "A person wearing a dark shirt and white gloves kneels on a blue tarp, spraying orange and yellow paint from a red can onto a white canvas, while the sharp, rhythmic sound of a staple gun firing repeatedly can be heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing a dark shirt and white gloves kneels on a blue tarp, spraying orange and yellow paint from a red can onto a white canvas, while the sharp, rhythmic sound of a staple gun firing repeatedly can be heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing a dark shirt and white gloves kneels on a blue tarp, spraying orange and yellow paint from a red can onto a white canvas, while the sharp, rhythmic sound of a staple gun firing repeatedly can be heard in the background.\", \"A person wearing gloves is kneeling and spray painting a white canvas with orange and yellow paint.\\n Simultaneously, the distinct, rhythmic sound of a manual typewriter's keys striking paper can be heard.\", \"The video shows a person using spray paint on a canvas, and the audio consists of the distinct rattling and spraying sounds of the aerosol cans being used.\", \"A person wearing gloves uses an orange spray paint can to create a vibrant orange and yellow abstract design on a white canvas, while the sharp, repetitive sound of a staple gun is heard in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 46.603, "generation_time_seconds": 43.9415, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.16, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "26", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The eerie sound of a beep is accompanied by retching and muffled speech, as a young child in a stroller holds a blanket .", "pred": "The video opens with a black screen displaying red text and a skull logo, followed by a test pattern. It then cuts to an outdoor scene where three women walk on a sidewalk. A man's voice is heard, stating, \"But never mind, I don't want kids anymore.\" This is immediately followed by a loud, deep monster roar, which is then answered by a second, similar roar.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video opens with a black screen displaying red text and a skull logo, followed by a test pattern. It then cuts to an outdoor scene where three women walk on a sidewalk. A man's voice is heard, stating, \"But never mind, I don't want kids anymore.\" This is immediately followed by a loud, deep monster roar, which is then answered by a second, similar roar.", "cot": "[\"The video opens with a black screen displaying red text and a skull logo, followed by a test pattern. It then cuts to an outdoor scene where three women walk on a sidewalk. A man's voice is heard, stating, \\\"But never mind, I don't want kids anymore.\\\" This is immediately followed by a loud, deep monster roar, which is then answered by a second, similar roar.\", \"The video sequence begins with a black screen displaying red text that reads \\\"FRIDAY\\\", a website address, and a rating, followed by a test pattern with a skull logo. This is immediately followed by a scene showing three women walking on a city sidewalk. A male voice says, \\\"Never mind, I don't want kids anymore.\\\" This is followed by a loud, distorted monster growl, after which the same voice says, \\\"That lady in the...\\\"\", \"The video begins with a black screen displaying red text and a skull logo. It then cuts to a baby with a bald head being held by an adult in a red shirt, spitting a stream of liquid from its mouth. A high-pitched electronic beep sounds, followed by a deep, monstrous growl. The scene changes to show three women standing on a city sidewalk, with two of them looking surprised. A male voice speaks, saying, \\\"Lady in the...\\\"\", \"The video begins with a red \\\"FRIDAY\\\" title card and a \\\"DEVILSDEMONIC.COM\\\" watermark, followed by a test pattern and a scene showing three women on a sidewalk, all while a male voice speaks and is then abruptly cut off by a loud, deep, monstrous roar.\"]", "time_sec": 71.053, "generation_time_seconds": 70.327, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "27", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black crow perched in a cage with a yellow cup, chirping as it strikes the bars.", "pred": "A dark-colored bird is perched on a horizontal bar inside a wire cage with a green hue. A series of melodic whistles from a bird are followed by a sequence of sharp, percussive snaps.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A dark-colored bird is perched on a horizontal bar inside a wire cage with a green hue. A series of melodic whistles from a bird are followed by a sequence of sharp, percussive snaps.", "cot": "[\"A dark-colored bird is perched on a horizontal bar inside a wire cage with a green hue. A series of melodic whistles from a bird are followed by a sequence of sharp, percussive snaps.\", \"A bird sits in a cage, while a person plays a high-pitched, warbling melody on a wind instrument, followed by the sound of a door slamming shut.\", \"A black bird is perched on a horizontal bar inside a wire cage. The cage contains a yellow liquid feeder. The scene is illuminated by a strong green light. The background shows a room with white window bars and a light-colored wall. A continuous, high-pitched, melodic electronic tone is audible throughout.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A black bird perches in a green-lit cage containing a yellow feeder, while a high-pitched electronic tone plays in the background.}\", \"A dark bird is perched inside a wire cage, while a series of loud, high-pitched, and complex bird calls and squawks are heard from the audio.\"]", "time_sec": 52.471, "generation_time_seconds": 51.6369, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0008, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "28", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The woman and child speak as the little boy in a green shirt holds his hands to his ears while sitting on the couch.", "pred": "A young boy in a green polo shirt sits on a couch, rubbing his eyes with his right hand. An off-screen female voice asks him about his homework and how fun his day at school was. The boy quietly replies, \"Yeah.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young boy in a green polo shirt sits on a couch, rubbing his eyes with his right hand. An off-screen female voice asks him about his homework and how fun his day at school was. The boy quietly replies, \"Yeah.\"", "cot": "[\"A young boy in a green polo shirt sits on a couch, rubbing his eyes with his right hand. An off-screen female voice asks him about his homework and how fun his day at school was. The boy quietly replies, \\\"Yeah.\\\"\", \"A young boy in a green striped polo shirt sits on a brown couch, rubbing his eyes. An off-screen female voice asks him about his day at school, and he replies affirmatively.\", \"A young boy in a green polo shirt sits on a couch, rubbing his eyes with his right hand. A woman's voice off-screen asks him about his day at school.\", \"A young boy in a green striped polo shirt sits on a brown couch and rubs his eyes as a woman asks him about his day at school and his homework.\"]", "time_sec": 43.392, "generation_time_seconds": 42.6753, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.91, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "29", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A young lady in a green and red sari is speaking on a news program.", "pred": "A woman wearing a green and red saree sits at a desk in a studio, speaking in Tamil. Behind her is a large purple sign with the white text \"Dial Sanakara\" and a blue graphic with squares. A logo in the top right corner reads \"SRI SANKARA LIVE\".", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman wearing a green and red saree sits at a desk in a studio, speaking in Tamil. Behind her is a large purple sign with the white text \"Dial Sanakara\" and a blue graphic with squares. A logo in the top right corner reads \"SRI SANKARA LIVE\".", "cot": "[\"A woman wearing a green and red saree sits at a desk in a studio, speaking in Tamil. Behind her is a large purple sign with the white text \\\"Dial Sanakara\\\" and a blue graphic with squares. A logo in the top right corner reads \\\"SRI SANKARA LIVE\\\".\", \"A woman in a green and red sari speaks in a studio; a male voice narrates in Tamil over the scene, with a graphic displaying \\\"Dial Shankara\\\" and a \\\"Sri Sankara LIVE\\\" logo visible.\", \"A woman in a green and red sari sits on a studio set with a 'Dial Shankara' backdrop, speaking in Tamil, while the audio captures her voice along with ambient sounds of a vehicle moving on a road.\", \"The video displays a woman in a green and red sari speaking in a studio, while the audio features a different female voice speaking in Tamil.\"]", "time_sec": 47.931, "generation_time_seconds": 47.1824, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "30", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling kitchen, the sound of a machine clicking is heard as a person mixes pink cotton candy in a bowl.", "pred": "A hand rapidly pulls fluffy pink cotton candy from a silver bowl, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched whirring of a machine motor.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand rapidly pulls fluffy pink cotton candy from a silver bowl, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched whirring of a machine motor.", "cot": "[\"A hand rapidly pulls fluffy pink cotton candy from a silver bowl, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched whirring of a machine motor.\", \"A large quantity of pink cotton candy is being spun inside a metal bowl by a machine, and the loud, rhythmic mechanical clatter of the machine is audible.\", \"A close-up shows a large, fluffy mass of pink cotton candy being spun inside a silver metal bowl by a rapidly rotating machine. The distinct, high-pitched whirring sound of the machine's motor is continuous and dominant throughout the clip.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a large, fluffy pink ball of spun sugar, likely cotton candy, being held in a large metal bowl, while the audio features the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train with a prominent metallic squeal.\"]", "time_sec": 45.934, "generation_time_seconds": 43.5309, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 35.71, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "31", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman's voice narrates as a man works diligently on a sewing machine at a wooden table.", "pred": "A person operates a Singer sewing machine on a wooden table, guiding fabric under the needle, while a woman speaks in Spanish in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person operates a Singer sewing machine on a wooden table, guiding fabric under the needle, while a woman speaks in Spanish in the background.", "cot": "[\"A person operates a Singer sewing machine on a wooden table, guiding fabric under the needle, while a woman speaks in Spanish in the background.\", \"A man operates a sewing machine, with a lamp providing light, while a female voice speaks in Spanish.\", \"A person operates a Singer sewing machine on a wooden table, with a lamp illuminating the work area, while a woman speaks in Spanish in the background.\", \"A person operates a Singer sewing machine, guided by a lamp, while a female voice speaks in Spanish.\"]", "time_sec": 34.433, "generation_time_seconds": 33.7209, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "32", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a white room, a camera on a stand is ready to be installed, while men speak with light clicks, vibrations, and digital clicks.", "pred": "A white quadcopter drone sits on a light-colored wood floor indoors while a person's hand adjusts its left arm; simultaneously, a person speaks in Japanese and a camera shutter sound is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white quadcopter drone sits on a light-colored wood floor indoors while a person's hand adjusts its left arm; simultaneously, a person speaks in Japanese and a camera shutter sound is heard.", "cot": "[\"A white quadcopter drone sits on a light-colored wood floor indoors while a person's hand adjusts its left arm; simultaneously, a person speaks in Japanese and a camera shutter sound is heard.\", \"A person's hand touches the top of a stationary white and gold drone. A person speaks in Japanese, followed by a loud, high-pitched electronic beep.\", \"A white DJI Phantom drone rests on a light-colored wooden floor. A hand briefly touches the top of the drone. The audio consists of a person speaking in Japanese, followed by the sound of a camera shutter clicking.\", \"A person's hand adjusts a white drone on a wooden floor as a man speaks in Japanese, followed by a loud electronic beep.\"]", "time_sec": 41.057, "generation_time_seconds": 39.5743, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "33", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The muffled sound of an aircraft engine hums as the wing of an airplane flies through a blue sky with clouds.", "pred": "The video displays an airplane wing viewed from a passenger seat, initially obscured by thick white clouds. The scene transitions to reveal a clear blue sky with scattered white clouds as the plane flies, accompanied by the constant, low-frequency roar of the jet engines.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays an airplane wing viewed from a passenger seat, initially obscured by thick white clouds. The scene transitions to reveal a clear blue sky with scattered white clouds as the plane flies, accompanied by the constant, low-frequency roar of the jet engines.", "cot": "[\"The video displays an airplane wing viewed from a passenger seat, initially obscured by thick white clouds. The scene transitions to reveal a clear blue sky with scattered white clouds as the plane flies, accompanied by the constant, low-frequency roar of the jet engines.\", \"The video shows an airplane wing seen from a passenger window, transitioning from a view through thick white clouds to a view of the wing against a blue sky with white clouds. The audio consists of the continuous, low-frequency roar of the aircraft's jet engines operating in flight.\", \"The video shows an airplane wing against a white sky, which then clears to reveal a blue sky with white clouds, all while the distinct, deep, and continuous rumbling of the aircraft's jet engines is heard.\", \"The video displays an airplane's wing from a passenger's viewpoint, initially obscured by heavy fog and clouds, which then clears to reveal a bright blue sky with scattered white clouds. The accompanying audio consists of the continuous, low-frequency drone of the aircraft's engines and the rushing sound of air moving past the fuselage.\"]", "time_sec": 52.412, "generation_time_seconds": 51.6167, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.27, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "34", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man revs a vehicle engine as a woman with a microphone stands in the street, surrounded by a crowd of people talking and whistling and a some people are cleaning a road.", "pred": "A large crowd of people watches an event from a grassy hill as a powerful engine revs loudly and a vehicle accelerates away.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large crowd of people watches an event from a grassy hill as a powerful engine revs loudly and a vehicle accelerates away.", "cot": "[\"A large crowd of people watches an event from a grassy hill as a powerful engine revs loudly and a vehicle accelerates away.\", \"A crowd watches from a grassy hillside as people stand near a road, while the powerful engine of a large vehicle, like a truck or tractor, idles loudly nearby.\", \"A large crowd of spectators watches an event from a grassy hillside as a powerful engine revs loudly and a vehicle accelerates away from the camera.\", \"A crowd watches a green tractor on a grassy hill, while a man in an orange vest stands by a white barrel and a man in a black shirt holds a long pole; simultaneously, the loud, roaring engine of a vehicle accelerates in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 43.185, "generation_time_seconds": 41.0677, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.25, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "35", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The red and white plane's engine roars as it takes off from the airport runway, with people watching from the nearby fence.", "pred": "A red Full Dream Airlines airplane is on a runway, while a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine is audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red Full Dream Airlines airplane is on a runway, while a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine is audible.", "cot": "[\"A red Full Dream Airlines airplane is on a runway, while a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine is audible.\", \"A red and white FUA Airlines Embraer regional jet taxis on a wet tarmac under an overcast sky, its powerful jet engines producing a loud, low-frequency roar.\", \"A red Full Dream Airlines aircraft taxis on a wet runway under an overcast sky, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched whine of its jet engines.\", \"A red FTD Airlines airplane is taxiing on a runway, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched whine of its jet engines.\"]", "time_sec": 37.924, "generation_time_seconds": 36.5819, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "36", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The rhythmic hum of a train engine fills the air as a black and white train travels down the tracks near a wooded area.", "pred": "A train with a black locomotive and white freight cars moves along tracks, accompanied by the sound of its horn, the rhythmic clatter of wheels, and a high-pitched metallic screech.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A train with a black locomotive and white freight cars moves along tracks, accompanied by the sound of its horn, the rhythmic clatter of wheels, and a high-pitched metallic screech.", "cot": "[\"A train with a black locomotive and white freight cars moves along tracks, accompanied by the sound of its horn, the rhythmic clatter of wheels, and a high-pitched metallic screech.\", \"A long freight train, led by a black locomotive, travels on tracks beside a dirt path under a blue sky. At the same time, the loud, multi-tone blast of a train horn is heard.\", \"A black and white freight train moves along a track beside a dirt path under a blue sky, accompanied by the sound of its horn and the rhythmic clatter of wheels on the rails.\", \"A black and white train travels along a track beside a dirt path and trees under a blue sky, while a loud, multi-chime train horn sounds.\"]", "time_sec": 42.977, "generation_time_seconds": 41.7462, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "37", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A flock of pigeons coo and flap their wings while a distant rooster crows, with a white pigeon standing on top of a dirt floor.", "pred": "A group of pigeons, including white and grey ones, are on the ground in a coop, followed by a shot of a rooster crowing and then the sound of a pig oinking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A group of pigeons, including white and grey ones, are on the ground in a coop, followed by a shot of a rooster crowing and then the sound of a pig oinking.", "cot": "[\"A group of pigeons, including white and grey ones, are on the ground in a coop, followed by a shot of a rooster crowing and then the sound of a pig oinking.\", \"A group of pigeons, including a distinctive pale pink one, are on the ground in a dark enclosure, while the sound of a rooster crowing and the cooing of pigeons are heard.\", \"The video shows a flock of pigeons, including a prominent white one, inside a coop with dirt and wood, while the audio captures the sounds of a rooster crowing and multiple chickens clucking.\", \"The video shows a group of pigeons on the ground, including a prominent white one, as a rooster crows loudly and chickens cluck in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 43.469, "generation_time_seconds": 42.3464, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "38", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A horse-drawn carriage clip-clops through a lush green field with sheep grazing in the background and an engine idling nearby.", "pred": "A horse-drawn carriage moves along a paved path in a green park, accompanied by the rhythmic clopping of horse hooves and the creaking of the carriage wheels.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A horse-drawn carriage moves along a paved path in a green park, accompanied by the rhythmic clopping of horse hooves and the creaking of the carriage wheels.", "cot": "[\"A horse-drawn carriage moves along a paved path in a green park, accompanied by the rhythmic clopping of horse hooves and the creaking of the carriage wheels.\", \"A two-horse carriage travels along a paved path through a park, accompanied by the rhythmic clopping of hooves and the creaking of its wheels.\", \"The audio features the distinct sound of a horse-drawn carriage moving on a hard surface, which is visually confirmed by a horse-drawn carriage with a yellow and white body being pulled by two dark horses along a paved road in a grassy park.\", \"A horse-drawn carriage with a yellow and white body and a white canvas top is pulled by two dark horses along a paved road. The carriage travels from left to right, moving through a park-like landscape with a large green field, a wooden fence, and trees in the background. The sound of the carriage wheels moving on the road is audible throughout the clip.\"]", "time_sec": 49.491, "generation_time_seconds": 47.9933, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "39", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a garage, an old car and truck are parked as a loud bang is heard, followed by an engine idling loudly.", "pred": "Inside a garage, the rear of a vintage silver muscle car is visible next to a gray pickup truck, while the loud, sputtering, and rhythmic sound of a car engine starting and struggling to idle is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Inside a garage, the rear of a vintage silver muscle car is visible next to a gray pickup truck, while the loud, sputtering, and rhythmic sound of a car engine starting and struggling to idle is heard.", "cot": "[\"Inside a garage, the rear of a vintage silver muscle car is visible next to a gray pickup truck, while the loud, sputtering, and rhythmic sound of a car engine starting and struggling to idle is heard.\", \"A vintage silver Ford pickup truck and a dark-colored classic Chevrolet Camaro are parked inside a garage. The loud, rhythmic chugging of a vintage, out-of-tune engine can be heard.\", \"A grey vintage pickup truck and a dark two-door muscle car are parked inside a garage. The pickup truck's front end is covered by a white cloth. The garage has a red door and an orange floor. A person is partially visible near the muscle car. The loud, continuous, and rhythmic metallic rattling suggests a running engine with significant mechanical issues.\", \"The audio features the loud, irregular, and sputtering sound of a car engine attempting to start but failing, while the visual shows a garage interior with two classic cars parked side-by-side.\"]", "time_sec": 49.775, "generation_time_seconds": 48.4224, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 35.29, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "40", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a small room filled with toys, a young girl plays joyfully as a woman talks and a man shouts in the background, creating a lively atmosphere of laughter and excitement.", "pred": "A young child laughs while a woman speaks, followed by a sneeze and the child laughing again.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young child laughs while a woman speaks, followed by a sneeze and the child laughing again.", "cot": "[\"A young child laughs while a woman speaks, followed by a sneeze and the child laughing again.\", \"A young child is seen in a room with a staircase, while the audio captures the sounds of a baby laughing, a person speaking, and a sneeze.\", \"The visual shows a young child in a white shirt in a carpeted room with a staircase, while the audio features the child laughing, a woman speaking, and a person sneezing.\", \"A young girl in a white shirt stands in a room with a staircase, laughing and squealing as an adult woman speaks and then sneezes, causing the girl to laugh even harder.\"]", "time_sec": 39.069, "generation_time_seconds": 38.3723, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "41", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the bustling kitchen, a man's voice narrates as he prepares a meal, cutting shrimp and  while water sprays into the sink and drains.", "pred": "A person's hands are shown cracking a cooked crawfish, while a male voice gives instructions on how to remove its head and tail.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands are shown cracking a cooked crawfish, while a male voice gives instructions on how to remove its head and tail.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands are shown cracking a cooked crawfish, while a male voice gives instructions on how to remove its head and tail.\", \"A person's hands are shown peeling cooked crawfish in a metal tray. As they pull the shell from the tail, a man speaks, explaining his method of removing the head by pulling it out with his fingers.\", \"A person's hands are shown peeling a cooked crawfish over a metal tray. As the person pulls the tail meat from the shell, a man speaks, explaining his method for removing the head by putting his finger in a hole.\", \"The video shows a person's hands methodically deheading cooked crawfish in a clear container. In the background, a person is speaking and mentions the action of \\\"tucking\\\" the head and pulling it out, while a continuous sizzling sound is audible.\"]", "time_sec": 45.25, "generation_time_seconds": 44.5053, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "42", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice crackles over the radio as water splashes and trickles, while a person in a red kayak paddles through the rain-drenched ocean.", "pred": "A red kayak is pointed forward through choppy water under a grey sky, viewed from a first-person perspective with a mounted camera. Simultaneously, a loud, distorted, and urgent male voice speaks in Dutch over a radio or public address system, with the sound of strong wind audible in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red kayak is pointed forward through choppy water under a grey sky, viewed from a first-person perspective with a mounted camera. Simultaneously, a loud, distorted, and urgent male voice speaks in Dutch over a radio or public address system, with the sound of strong wind audible in the background.", "cot": "[\"A red kayak is pointed forward through choppy water under a grey sky, viewed from a first-person perspective with a mounted camera. Simultaneously, a loud, distorted, and urgent male voice speaks in Dutch over a radio or public address system, with the sound of strong wind audible in the background.\", \"I see a first-person perspective from a red kayak moving through choppy grey water under an overcast sky, with a compass mounted on the bow. Simultaneously, I hear a radio transmission with a male voice speaking Dutch, accompanied by the loud, persistent sound of strong wind.\", \"A first-person view from a red kayak shows choppy grey water under a grey sky, with a person's arms and yellow paddles visible, while the audio captures a loud, distorted radio transmission with static and crackling.\", \"The camera is mounted on a red and yellow kayak navigating choppy water under a gray sky. Water splashes onto the lens. A person speaks in Dutch over the loud, continuous rushing sound of wind and water.\"]", "time_sec": 51.78, "generation_time_seconds": 50.803, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "43", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The aircraft engine roars as the plane soars high above the clouds, with the sun shining brightly in the sky.", "pred": "The audio captures the loud, powerful roar of a jet engine. Visually, the scene is a view from an airplane window showing the aircraft's wing and engine, flying above a sea of clouds during sunrise or sunset.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio captures the loud, powerful roar of a jet engine. Visually, the scene is a view from an airplane window showing the aircraft's wing and engine, flying above a sea of clouds during sunrise or sunset.", "cot": "[\"The audio captures the loud, powerful roar of a jet engine. Visually, the scene is a view from an airplane window showing the aircraft's wing and engine, flying above a sea of clouds during sunrise or sunset.\", \"This is a view from an airplane window showing a large jet engine and wing against a horizon of clouds and a setting sun. A loud, continuous, low-frequency engine roar is heard, accompanied by a lower-pitched, rhythmic whirring or humming sound. The sound is consistent with the jet engine during flight.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{An airplane engine and wing are visible against a horizon of clouds and a setting sun, accompanied by the loud, continuous roar of the engine and a lower, rhythmic whirring.}\", \"The video shows a view from an airplane window at sunrise or sunset, with the wing and engine visible above a layer of clouds, while the audio consists of the loud, continuous roar of the aircraft's jet engines.\", \"The audio consists of the loud, continuous roar of a large engine, while the visual shows the wing of an airplane flying above a layer of clouds with the sun low on the horizon.\"]", "time_sec": 55.628, "generation_time_seconds": 54.7289, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "44", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young man with no shirt on is laying in bed, with footsteps walking on a hard surface followed by a person snoring.", "pred": "A shirtless man is seen lying on a dark couch, his head tilted back and mouth open as he emits a series of loud, guttural snoring sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A shirtless man is seen lying on a dark couch, his head tilted back and mouth open as he emits a series of loud, guttural snoring sounds.", "cot": "[\"A shirtless man is seen lying on a dark couch, his head tilted back and mouth open as he emits a series of loud, guttural snoring sounds.\", \"A shirtless man is lying on a dark leather couch, his head tilted back with his mouth open as if groaning or screaming. Simultaneously, the audio captures the sound of a person snoring loudly and heavily.\", \"A shirtless man with a goatee lies on a dark couch, his head tilted back with his mouth wide open. A loud, continuous buzzing sound, like a chainsaw, plays continuously in the background.\", \"A shirtless man with a goatee lies on a dark couch, his mouth open as he produces a deep, guttural, and rhythmic snoring sound.\"]", "time_sec": 42.972, "generation_time_seconds": 42.3827, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "45", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the wind blows hard and the engine hums loud, a man drives a boat on a lake with a purple background.", "pred": "A person steers a white boat across a lake with a forested shoreline under a cloudy sky, while the loud, continuous roar of the boat's engine fills the air.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person steers a white boat across a lake with a forested shoreline under a cloudy sky, while the loud, continuous roar of the boat's engine fills the air.", "cot": "[\"A person steers a white boat across a lake with a forested shoreline under a cloudy sky, while the loud, continuous roar of the boat's engine fills the air.\", \"A first-person perspective shows a boat moving across a lake with a forested shoreline under an overcast sky. The loud, roaring sound of a powerful engine, likely from a jet ski, is heard, along with the splashing of water as the vessel accelerates.\", \"A white boat's bow cuts through choppy water, with a hand on the steering wheel and a tree-lined shore in the distance, as the loud, roaring engine of the boat dominates the soundscape.\", \"A person is driving a white boat across a lake, creating a large wake, while the loud, roaring sound of a powerful engine is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 44.684, "generation_time_seconds": 43.4841, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "46", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The intense audio of gunshots firing transitions to two men talking, then music playing, as a man sitting on a couch holds a bottle of water.", "pred": "Two men sit on a couch discussing magic tricks; one holds a water bottle and a promotional graphic for 'INSTANT RADIO Ver2' is visible on screen, while a voice describes the bottle as part of a trick.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Two men sit on a couch discussing magic tricks; one holds a water bottle and a promotional graphic for 'INSTANT RADIO Ver2' is visible on screen, while a voice describes the bottle as part of a trick.", "cot": "[\"Two men sit on a couch discussing magic tricks; one holds a water bottle and a promotional graphic for 'INSTANT RADIO Ver2' is visible on screen, while a voice describes the bottle as part of a trick.\", \"Two men sit on a couch in front of a computer screen displaying a magic product review, while the man on the right holds a water bottle and speaks, introducing a magic trick.\", \"Two men are sitting on a couch for a product review; the man on the right holds a water bottle as a male voice describes it as a trick.\", \"Two men are sitting on a couch for a product review, with props for \\\"Magic Pack\\\" and \\\"Sponge Tense\\\" displayed. One man holds a water bottle and begins to describe it as a trick, while a loud, rhythmic, and percussive rattling sound, similar to a shaker, is heard in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 47.786, "generation_time_seconds": 46.2093, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "47", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a woman is heard breathing heavily, sneezing twice, and sniffing her nose, in the dark room.", "pred": "The image is completely black, providing no visual information, while the audio exclusively captures a person repeatedly inhaling sharply through their nose followed by a forceful exhalation, accompanied by a deep sigh.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The image is completely black, providing no visual information, while the audio exclusively captures a person repeatedly inhaling sharply through their nose followed by a forceful exhalation, accompanied by a deep sigh.", "cot": "[\"The image is completely black, providing no visual information, while the audio exclusively captures a person repeatedly inhaling sharply through their nose followed by a forceful exhalation, accompanied by a deep sigh.\", \"The audio captures a person audibly exhaling, followed by a sharp, wet cough, and then more labored breathing, all occurring in a quiet, reverberant indoor space.\", \"The audio contains the sound of a person breathing heavily, followed by a sneeze. There is no visual information present in the frame.\", \"The audio exclusively captures a person audibly coughing, breathing heavily, and sighing, with no visual information available in the provided frame.\"]", "time_sec": 39.677, "generation_time_seconds": 39.1812, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "48", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A brown dog sound on top of a rug next to a large tire whimpers and barks while breathing rapidly.", "pred": "A brindle dog lies on a red patterned rug next to a black inner tube, barking and growling at the camera.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A brindle dog lies on a red patterned rug next to a black inner tube, barking and growling at the camera.", "cot": "[\"A brindle dog lies on a red patterned rug next to a black inner tube, barking and growling at the camera.\", \"The video shows a brindle boxer dog lying on a red patterned rug next to a black tire, while the audio captures the dog barking and making excited grunting sounds.\", \"A brindle boxer dog is lying on a red patterned rug next to a tire, panting and barking as it is being filmed from a low angle.\", \"A brindle dog lies on a red patterned rug next to an inner tube, panting and barking aggressively while a low hum is audible in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 39.363, "generation_time_seconds": 38.6206, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "49", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The whimpering of several small dogs can be heard as a group of puppies play together in the grass.", "pred": "Several small, brown, curly-haired puppies are playing on a grassy area with dry leaves, while the audio captures their high-pitched yipping, whimpering, and low, guttural growling.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Several small, brown, curly-haired puppies are playing on a grassy area with dry leaves, while the audio captures their high-pitched yipping, whimpering, and low, guttural growling.", "cot": "[\"Several small, brown, curly-haired puppies are playing on a grassy area with dry leaves, while the audio captures their high-pitched yipping, whimpering, and low, guttural growling.\", \"Several small, reddish-brown puppies play on a grassy patch with dry leaves, while the distinct sounds of a barking dog and a cat meowing are heard in the background.\", \"A group of small, brown puppies are playing together on a grassy area next to a wooden deck, and their high-pitched yipping and whining can be heard.\", \"A group of brown puppies play on a grassy area with dry leaves, while a separate dog in the background pants and growls.\"]", "time_sec": 42.577, "generation_time_seconds": 41.1895, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0007, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "50", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In front of a blue house with a red front door, a man stands as a toy helicopter powers down before starting up.", "pred": "A child in pajamas stands in a house doorway, while a small, white, rotating drone is on the ground in front of the house, and a loud, high-pitched whirring sound is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A child in pajamas stands in a house doorway, while a small, white, rotating drone is on the ground in front of the house, and a loud, high-pitched whirring sound is heard.", "cot": "[\"A child in pajamas stands in a house doorway, while a small, white, rotating drone is on the ground in front of the house, and a loud, high-pitched whirring sound is heard.\", \"A small, silver, multi-rotor drone with flashing lights is on the ground in front of a house's brick steps. It then lifts off and flies forward, while a loud, high-pitched whirring and buzzing sound is heard.\", \"A small, white, multi-rotor drone sits on a concrete walkway in front of a house with a red door.\\nThe drone's rotors are spinning, producing a loud, high-pitched buzzing sound characteristic of a small electric motor.\\nThe drone is not moving, it is stationary on the ground.\\n\\\\boxed{A small drone sits motionless on a walkway in front of a house, its spinning rotors emitting a loud, high-pitched buzz.}\", \"A small aircraft with a propeller is seen crashing onto a concrete path in front of a house, accompanied by the loud roaring and whining of a high-revving engine.\"]", "time_sec": 54.536, "generation_time_seconds": 53.5741, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.75, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "51", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man whistled as the small dogs on the bed looked into a mirror, followed by a yell as plastic rustled and clanked in the background.", "pred": "A large brown mother dog stands in a red-fenced kennel, looking down at two puppies, a light-colored one and a black one, as a person calls out to her in an excited, high-pitched voice, repeatedly saying \"Mama\" and \"Snow\".", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large brown mother dog stands in a red-fenced kennel, looking down at two puppies, a light-colored one and a black one, as a person calls out to her in an excited, high-pitched voice, repeatedly saying \"Mama\" and \"Snow\".", "cot": "[\"A large brown mother dog stands in a red-fenced kennel, looking down at two puppies, a light-colored one and a black one, as a person calls out to her in an excited, high-pitched voice, repeatedly saying \\\"Mama\\\" and \\\"Snow\\\".\", \"Inside a red-walled pen, a brown mother dog stands over two small puppies, one tan and one black, as a person calls out, \\\"Mama, Mama Snow, Mama come over here baby.\\\"\", \"A brown adult dog and two puppies are inside a red-fenced enclosure with a white patterned blanket. The adult dog is seen through a mirror, and the two puppies interact with each other and several dog toys. A person can be heard calling out, \\\"Mama! Mama Snow! Mama, come over here, baby!\\\"\", \"Inside a red-enclosed pen with a white patterned blanket, two small puppies, one light brown and one black, are visible. A larger brown dog is seen in a mirror's reflection behind them. The sound of a person whistling is heard, followed by them calling out, \\\"Mama, Mama Snow,\\\" and then, \\\"Mama, come over here, baby.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 58.207, "generation_time_seconds": 57.0526, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "52", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a dark forest, a man speaks with whistling and rain background noise.", "pred": "A static, black-and-white shot shows a rain-streaked, multi-paned window. Over this, a high-pitched, repetitive whistle sounds, then cuts off abruptly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A static, black-and-white shot shows a rain-streaked, multi-paned window. Over this, a high-pitched, repetitive whistle sounds, then cuts off abruptly.", "cot": "[\"A static, black-and-white shot shows a rain-streaked, multi-paned window. Over this, a high-pitched, repetitive whistle sounds, then cuts off abruptly.\", \"I see a black and white photograph of a multi-paned window with streaky condensation. I hear a rhythmic, fluctuating whistle, like a steam or train whistle, that grows louder before cutting off abruptly.\", \"The scene shows a static, high-contrast black-and-white view of a rain-streaked, multi-pane window. Simultaneously, a slow, melancholic, and ominous synthesized melody plays, creating a suspenseful atmosphere.\", \"A fogged window with six panes is visible, while a rhythmic, descending whistle sounds in the audio.\"]", "time_sec": 42.171, "generation_time_seconds": 41.4715, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "53", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a scene filled with whimsical characters, a man dressed as a cow speaks in a high tone while a goat bleats, as a woman in a white costume holds a hat.", "pred": "A person in a white rabbit costume holds a glass of yellow liquid and speaks in Japanese, while a goat bleats loudly in the background.\n\\boxed{A person in a rabbit costume holds a glass of yellow liquid and speaks, as a goat bleats loudly in the background.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a white rabbit costume holds a glass of yellow liquid and speaks in Japanese, while a goat bleats loudly in the background.\n\\boxed{A person in a rabbit costume holds a glass of yellow liquid and speaks, as a goat bleats loudly in the background.}", "cot": "[\"A person in a white rabbit costume holds a glass of yellow liquid and speaks in Japanese, while a goat bleats loudly in the background.\\n\\\\boxed{A person in a rabbit costume holds a glass of yellow liquid and speaks, as a goat bleats loudly in the background.}\", \"A person in a white animal costume with large ears and a yellow bow tie holds a glass of yellow liquid. They are speaking in Japanese, but their voice is heavily distorted and interrupted by a loud, continuous, low-frequency electronic buzz.\", \"A person in a white bunny costume holds a yellow drink, while a male voice speaks in Japanese and a goat bleats in the background.\", \"A person in a white rabbit costume holds a tall glass of yellow liquid and speaks directly to the camera, while Japanese text is visible on the right side of the screen and the sound of a goat bleating is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 46.414, "generation_time_seconds": 45.4882, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.27, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "54", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black train blows its horn while traveling down the tracks near a street and trees.", "pred": "A black steam locomotive, emitting a loud, rhythmic, metallic clanking and a high-pitched screech from its wheels, moves from right to left across the foreground, passing a railway crossing signal and barrier on a sunny day.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black steam locomotive, emitting a loud, rhythmic, metallic clanking and a high-pitched screech from its wheels, moves from right to left across the foreground, passing a railway crossing signal and barrier on a sunny day.", "cot": "[\"A black steam locomotive, emitting a loud, rhythmic, metallic clanking and a high-pitched screech from its wheels, moves from right to left across the foreground, passing a railway crossing signal and barrier on a sunny day.\", \"A black steam locomotive with \\\"STRAIGHT\\\" written on its side approaches and passes a railway crossing on a sunny day. The loud, rhythmic chuffing of its engine is heard as it moves forward, followed by the sound of its wheels running on the tracks.\", \"A black steam locomotive is seen approaching and passing a railroad crossing, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic chugging of its engine and the resonant blast of a steam whistle.\", \"A black steam locomotive with a red passenger car approaches and passes a railway crossing on a sunny day, its loud, multi-toned whistle echoing as it moves.\"]", "time_sec": 46.512, "generation_time_seconds": 45.1273, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "55", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man in the garage is changing a tire on a car while a short spray is followed by a louder, longer spray.", "pred": "A man in a blue shirt and gloves works on a car tire mounted on a blue and black machine, which is then heard releasing a burst of pressurized air.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a blue shirt and gloves works on a car tire mounted on a blue and black machine, which is then heard releasing a burst of pressurized air.", "cot": "[\"A man in a blue shirt and gloves works on a car tire mounted on a blue and black machine, which is then heard releasing a burst of pressurized air.\", \"A person in a workshop uses a tire machine to mount a tire, and the sound of air being released from a valve is heard.\", \"A person uses a blue tire machine to mount a tire on a silver rim, which is immediately followed by the loud hiss of air being released from the tire.\", \"A mechanic in a garage uses a tire machine to mount a tire, followed by the sound of a power tool and a hissing noise.\"]", "time_sec": 37.99, "generation_time_seconds": 37.2752, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "56", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a hospital room, a baby cries while a woman speaks amidst the background noise of other conversations, as a newborn baby lays in a hospital bed.", "pred": "A newborn baby, wrapped in a yellow blanket, lies in a hospital bassinet and cries intensely.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A newborn baby, wrapped in a yellow blanket, lies in a hospital bassinet and cries intensely.", "cot": "[\"A newborn baby, wrapped in a yellow blanket, lies in a hospital bassinet and cries intensely.\", \"A newborn baby lies in a crib and cries loudly, its mouth open in a wail, while a person speaks in the background.\", \"A newborn baby, wrapped in a blanket, lies in a crib and cries loudly, with the sound of its high-pitched wails dominating the audio.\", \"A newborn baby is lying in a hospital bassinet, wrapped in a pale blanket, and is crying loudly and intensely.\"]", "time_sec": 34.608, "generation_time_seconds": 33.8425, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "57", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of ocean waves crashing in the distance accompanies the laughter of children playing on the beach, as a young girl  make faces in the sand, capturing moments of joy and creativity.", "pred": "A pink mask lies partially buried in sand, creating the illusion of a reclining figure, as a person speaks in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A pink mask lies partially buried in sand, creating the illusion of a reclining figure, as a person speaks in the background.", "cot": "[\"A pink mask lies partially buried in sand, creating the illusion of a reclining figure, as a person speaks in the background.\", \"A human-shaped figure is buried in sand, with a pink mask for a head and two pebbles for eyes. A person speaks, instructing someone to take a picture of the figure as a lad and then as a girl.\", \"A pink doll's head and body are buried in sand, with two small stones placed near the lower body, while a person speaks in the background.\", \"A static, top-down shot shows a sand sculpture of a reclining woman with a pink doll head for a face and stones for her breasts. A person speaks, instructing someone to take a picture of this figure as a lad and then as a girl.\"]", "time_sec": 44.147, "generation_time_seconds": 42.7458, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "58", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The boat motor roars as the small boat speeds across the vast blue water, creating splashes in its wake, before the wind takes over.", "pred": "A blue and white motorboat travels at speed across a body of water, creating a large white wake and a loud engine roar that is accompanied by strong wind noise.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A blue and white motorboat travels at speed across a body of water, creating a large white wake and a loud engine roar that is accompanied by strong wind noise.", "cot": "[\"A blue and white motorboat travels at speed across a body of water, creating a large white wake and a loud engine roar that is accompanied by strong wind noise.\", \"A white and blue motorboat speeds across a body of water, leaving a large white wake, while the loud, high-pitched whine of its engine dominates the soundscape.\", \"A blue and white speedboat moves from right to left across the water, creating a large white wake. The powerful, roaring sound of its engine is prominent, accompanied by the noise of the water being churned by the hull and the boat's movement, suggesting high speed.\", \"A blue and white speedboat with a person at the helm drives across a wide body of water, creating a large wake. The loud, continuous roar of its engine and the sound of rushing water are heard as it moves away from the camera past a red buoy.\"]", "time_sec": 46.899, "generation_time_seconds": 46.1458, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "59", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of hissing steam, a man stands by a black train with red wheels.", "pred": "The video shows a close-up of a black and red steam locomotive with the number Л-5231, from which steam is escaping and a rhythmic chugging sound is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of a black and red steam locomotive with the number Л-5231, from which steam is escaping and a rhythmic chugging sound is heard.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a close-up of a black and red steam locomotive with the number Л-5231, from which steam is escaping and a rhythmic chugging sound is heard.\", \"This is a close-up of a black steam locomotive with red-trimmed wheels and a red star emblem on the front. Steam is actively venting from the engine as it moves, and the number Л-5231 is visible on its side. The audio consists of the rhythmic clatter of the wheels on the rails, the deep rumble of the engine, and the powerful hiss of escaping steam.\", \"A black steam locomotive with the number Л-5231 is shown from multiple angles, with steam venting from its cylinders and wheels, while a loud hiss of steam and mechanical clanking is heard.\", \"A large black steam locomotive, numbered Л-5231 with a red star emblem, is shown up close as it releases a massive cloud of white steam and emits a loud, rhythmic hissing and clanking sound.\"]", "time_sec": 52.289, "generation_time_seconds": 51.6344, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "60", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man is using a tool to fix the engine of a motorcycle while speaking with distant hums and horns of passing traffic in the background.", "pred": "The audio features a person speaking in Kannada, describing a machine component as the \"turbine,\" while the corresponding video shows a close-up of a person's hand manipulating a large, metallic, multi-finned mechanical assembly on a blue stand outdoors.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features a person speaking in Kannada, describing a machine component as the \"turbine,\" while the corresponding video shows a close-up of a person's hand manipulating a large, metallic, multi-finned mechanical assembly on a blue stand outdoors.", "cot": "[\"The audio features a person speaking in Kannada, describing a machine component as the \\\"turbine,\\\" while the corresponding video shows a close-up of a person's hand manipulating a large, metallic, multi-finned mechanical assembly on a blue stand outdoors.\", \"A person's hand is shown on an engine's yellow fan belt, while a male voice speaks in Kannada in the background.\", \"A person's hand manipulates a small, silver internal combustion engine with a yellow fan on a blue stand, while a male voice speaks conversationally in the background.\", \"A man's hands manipulate a component on a large, silver, radial engine outdoors while a male voice speaks rapidly in Marathi.\\n\\\\boxed{A man's hands manipulate a component on a large, silver, radial engine outdoors while a male voice speaks rapidly in Marathi.}\"]", "time_sec": 44.664, "generation_time_seconds": 43.6655, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "61", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The revving idling engine hums as a crowd of people excitedly takes photos of a concept car on display at the auto show.", "pred": "A white sports car is on display at an indoor event with people in the background, while the sound of a large, roaring engine, like a motorcycle or race car, is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white sports car is on display at an indoor event with people in the background, while the sound of a large, roaring engine, like a motorcycle or race car, is heard.", "cot": "[\"A white sports car is on display at an indoor event with people in the background, while the sound of a large, roaring engine, like a motorcycle or race car, is heard.\", \"A white sports car is displayed indoors in front of a crowd, while the powerful sound of a large, roaring engine is heard.\", \"A white sports car is on display in front of a crowd of people, while a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine, like a monster truck engine, is heard in the background.\", \"A white sports car is on display with a crowd around it, while the sound of a large, powerful engine, like a motorcycle, is heard in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 40.479, "generation_time_seconds": 39.3513, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "62", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The motorcycle's engine chugged slowly before revving up, parked on the side of the street with a close-up view of its engine .", "pred": "A silver motorcycle with a black seat is parked on a concrete surface, while its engine is heard starting and then revving loudly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A silver motorcycle with a black seat is parked on a concrete surface, while its engine is heard starting and then revving loudly.", "cot": "[\"A silver motorcycle with a black seat is parked on a concrete surface, while its engine is heard starting and then revving loudly.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a silver motorcycle's chrome engine and exhaust pipes on a concrete surface, while the audio features the distinct sound of a small engine, consistent with a lawnmower, starting and idling.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a chrome motorcycle's engine and exhaust as it starts and idles, producing a deep, rumbling mechanical sound with a distinct rattling noise.\", \"The video shows a silver and chrome motorcycle parked on a concrete surface while the audio captures the sound of a mechanical ratchet mechanism being operated, followed by the engine being started and revved.\"]", "time_sec": 42.441, "generation_time_seconds": 40.9588, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.63, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "63", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a game room, a child's cries are heard as a person blows their nose amidst computer mouse clicks, with a video game displayed on the screen.", "pred": "The audio features the distinct bleating of a goat, while the visual shows a scene from a colorful animated children's video game or show, featuring a light blue character, a teddy bear, and several small purple creatures with large eyes in a whimsical room.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features the distinct bleating of a goat, while the visual shows a scene from a colorful animated children's video game or show, featuring a light blue character, a teddy bear, and several small purple creatures with large eyes in a whimsical room.", "cot": "[\"The audio features the distinct bleating of a goat, while the visual shows a scene from a colorful animated children's video game or show, featuring a light blue character, a teddy bear, and several small purple creatures with large eyes in a whimsical room.\", \"The video shows a colorful cartoon scene from the game 'My Little Pony: Equestria Girls - Rainbow Rocks', featuring several characters like the blue-haired character, Twilight Sparkle, and Pinkie Pie in a room with a pink door and a spinning wheel. The audio consists of a dog whimpering and then growling.\", \"The video displays a colorful animated scene from what appears to be a children's game or show, featuring several cartoon characters, including a blue creature and a bear, in a stylized room with a \\\"LEVEL 10\\\" indicator. This visual is accompanied by the distinct, high-pitched sounds of a baby crying and whimpering.\", \"A cartoon scene features several animated characters, including a blue bird and a brown bear, on a stage with a pink door and a game show-style wheel. Simultaneously, a dog is heard whimpering and making distressed, high-pitched vocalizations.\"]", "time_sec": 56.008, "generation_time_seconds": 55.3729, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.04, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "64", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a small room, a man's voice is heard followed by the sound of a camera muffling and footsteps shuffling, while a brown cardboard box kept on a wooden table next to a chair.", "pred": "A person's hands place two identical, unfinished wooden armatures onto a workbench. A male voice explains that this is the stand for his first model and that he has started working on the arms.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands place two identical, unfinished wooden armatures onto a workbench. A male voice explains that this is the stand for his first model and that he has started working on the arms.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands place two identical, unfinished wooden armatures onto a workbench. A male voice explains that this is the stand for his first model and that he has started working on the arms.\", \"The camera focuses on a black metal pipe stand with a red base, then shifts to show two cylindrical wooden pieces on a workbench, accompanied by a male voice explaining that the stand is for his first model and that he is starting to work on the arms.\", \"A person is working on a wooden project, initially showing a black metal pipe mounted on a red and black base, then presenting two wooden arms with a clear plastic band around the ends, and finally placing the arms on a workbench, all while speaking about making a stand and doing the arms.\", \"A hand holds two wooden arms for a model, while a male voice explains that he is about to start on them.\"]", "time_sec": 46.488, "generation_time_seconds": 45.4977, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "65", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the forest, a man speaks amidst a swarm of bees buzzing around a tree branch with berries in forest.", "pred": "The audio features a person speaking in French about multiple beehives, while the continuous buzzing of a large number of bees is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features a person speaking in French about multiple beehives, while the continuous buzzing of a large number of bees is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"The audio features a person speaking in French about multiple beehives, while the continuous buzzing of a large number of bees is heard in the background.\", \"A dense thicket of green leaves and brown branches is shown, with a white object partially visible on the left. A person speaks in French about a beehive, and the continuous buzzing of many insects is audible.\", \"Visually, the video shows a close-up of dense green leaves and brown, dead plant matter. The audio features a man speaking in French about bees, accompanied by the continuous buzzing sound of a large swarm.\", \"The video shows a dense green bush with numerous insects clustered together, while a person speaks in French and the continuous buzzing of insects is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 43.058, "generation_time_seconds": 40.6837, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "66", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "An adult female speaks as a blue and white bus idles at a stop, with passengers boarding and vehicle traffic passing by on the city street.", "pred": "A B35 Limited bus is stopped on a city street with its door open, while the loud, high-pitched whine of the bus's engine is audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A B35 Limited bus is stopped on a city street with its door open, while the loud, high-pitched whine of the bus's engine is audible.", "cot": "[\"A B35 Limited bus is stopped on a city street with its door open, while the loud, high-pitched whine of the bus's engine is audible.\", \"A large blue and white bus with the route number B35 LIMITED is stopped at a city sidewalk. A person in a dark jacket stands nearby as the bus door is open. The sound of the bus's engine and the hiss of its air brakes are audible.\", \"A large blue and white city bus, labeled B35 LIMITED on its front sign, is stopped with its doors open on a city street. People are visible on the sidewalk and inside the bus, while the sound of a large engine, possibly from a truck or bus, is heard running and then accelerating.\", \"A blue and white B35 Limited bus is stopped on a city street with its doors open. A person in a grey hoodie is standing next to it. The loud, continuous roar of an engine, like that of a motorcycle or scooter, is heard in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 51.813, "generation_time_seconds": 50.5876, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "67", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of water running from a flushed toilet fills the tiled bathroom as a white toilet bowl with bubbles of water inside it is shown.", "pred": "The video shows a toilet bowl from a top-down perspective as it flushes, creating a swirling vortex of water that gradually subsides, while the accompanying audio captures the distinct sound of rushing water during the flush followed by the quieter gurgle of the bowl refilling.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a toilet bowl from a top-down perspective as it flushes, creating a swirling vortex of water that gradually subsides, while the accompanying audio captures the distinct sound of rushing water during the flush followed by the quieter gurgle of the bowl refilling.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a toilet bowl from a top-down perspective as it flushes, creating a swirling vortex of water that gradually subsides, while the accompanying audio captures the distinct sound of rushing water during the flush followed by the quieter gurgle of the bowl refilling.\", \"A toilet bowl is shown as water swirls and drains into it, accompanied by the distinct sound of a toilet flushing.\", \"A top-down view shows a white toilet bowl flushing, with water swirling and then draining away, accompanied by the sound of a powerful toilet flush followed by the sound of the toilet refilling with water.\", \"The video provides a top-down view of a white ceramic toilet bowl as water is flushed, creating a swirling vortex that gradually subsides, while the accompanying audio captures the distinct sound of the water swirling and the toilet refilling.\"]", "time_sec": 45.822, "generation_time_seconds": 44.5003, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.91, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "68", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice narrates as a child yells, with an aircraft flying in the distance, while a little girl stands on a swing overlooking the ocean and a young boy rides a skateboard on a boat deck.", "pred": "A young child in a purple shirt stands on a green-painted boat deck with a metal railing, looking out at the water as a male voice speaks over the ambient noise of the boat engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young child in a purple shirt stands on a green-painted boat deck with a metal railing, looking out at the water as a male voice speaks over the ambient noise of the boat engine.", "cot": "[\"A young child in a purple shirt stands on a green-painted boat deck with a metal railing, looking out at the water as a male voice speaks over the ambient noise of the boat engine.\", \"A person speaks from a moving vehicle, stating they are going to Cebu, while the background audio contains the sound of an engine and wind.\", \"The audio features a man speaking in a foreign language, accompanied by the sound of a train moving on tracks.\", \"A child in a purple shirt walks on a boat with a green deck, passing orange life preservers and a blue slide, while a man speaks and a cat meows amidst the sound of the boat's engine.\"]", "time_sec": 41.3, "generation_time_seconds": 39.0746, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.27, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "69", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A white sports car accelerates down the highway, passing a train and a truck, with the wind roaring and the sun shining through the windshield.", "pred": "A white sports car accelerates rapidly down a drag strip, its engine roaring and tires squealing on the asphalt.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white sports car accelerates rapidly down a drag strip, its engine roaring and tires squealing on the asphalt.", "cot": "[\"A white sports car accelerates rapidly down a drag strip, its engine roaring and tires squealing on the asphalt.\", \"This is a high-speed drag race. A white sports car launches from a starting line on an asphalt track. The vehicle's engine roars with immense power as it accelerates rapidly down the strip, the sound of its tires screeching on the pavement. The car's exhaust produces a deep, aggressive, and high-pitched note, culminating in a loud, sustained engine whine as it speeds away from the camera.\", \"A white sports car accelerates rapidly from a drag racing starting line, emitting a high-pitched engine whine, followed by a sharp tire screech and the forceful, low-frequency roar of its engine as it speeds down the track.\", \"A white car accelerates down a drag strip, its high-revving engine roaring and tires screeching as it speeds away from the starting line.\"]", "time_sec": 48.185, "generation_time_seconds": 47.4467, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 42.86, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "70", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A muffled helicopter engine flying over a tree-filled lake in a park.", "pred": "A red and white helicopter flies over a grassy field with bare trees, carrying a person in a red suit suspended by a cable, while the loud, rhythmic chugging of a steam engine is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red and white helicopter flies over a grassy field with bare trees, carrying a person in a red suit suspended by a cable, while the loud, rhythmic chugging of a steam engine is heard.", "cot": "[\"A red and white helicopter flies over a grassy field with bare trees, carrying a person in a red suit suspended by a cable, while the loud, rhythmic chugging of a steam engine is heard.\", \"The audio features the loud, rhythmic chugging of a helicopter's rotor blades. Simultaneously, the video shows a red and white helicopter flying over a leafless wooded area.\", \"A red and white rescue helicopter flies low over a grassy field with bare trees, while the loud, rhythmic chugging of its rotor blades dominates the audio.\", \"The audio features the loud, continuous, and rhythmic chugging of a train's engine and the clatter of its wheels on a track.\\n Simultaneously, the video shows a helicopter with red and white markings flying low over a park with bare trees, and a person in a red jacket is visible on the ground below.\\n The helicopter is flying through the trees, and a text overlay is present.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A helicopter flies low over a park with bare trees while a loud, rhythmic train engine chugs in the background.}\"]", "time_sec": 53.747, "generation_time_seconds": 53.0521, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "71", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman in a red and black jacket is speaking over a microphone on stage.", "pred": "A woman in a red jacket stands on a stage before a yellow dotted screen, speaking about a song and a convention, while faint audience noise is audible in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman in a red jacket stands on a stage before a yellow dotted screen, speaking about a song and a convention, while faint audience noise is audible in the background.", "cot": "[\"A woman in a red jacket stands on a stage before a yellow dotted screen, speaking about a song and a convention, while faint audience noise is audible in the background.\", \"A woman stands on a stage in front of a yellow digital screen, speaking about the song \\\"Light the Fire Within\\\" and its relevance to the \\\"Light It Up\\\" convention theme.\", \"A woman is speaking on a stage in front of a yellow, gridded background. She is wearing a red jacket, a black top, and patterned pants. She is holding a small black object in her hand. The audio consists of her voice describing a song and the theme of a convention.\", \"A woman in a red jacket and patterned pants stands on a stage in front of a yellow pixelated screen, speaking to an audience about an inspiring song and a convention theme.\"]", "time_sec": 46.014, "generation_time_seconds": 44.4143, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 40.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "72", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a young woman in a blue skirt is seen holding a paper as a speech in front of a door.", "pred": "A young woman in a blue and white dress stands indoors, reading from a white paper she holds in her hands, while a female voice describes the medical abortion pill.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young woman in a blue and white dress stands indoors, reading from a white paper she holds in her hands, while a female voice describes the medical abortion pill.", "cot": "[\"A young woman in a blue and white dress stands indoors, reading from a white paper she holds in her hands, while a female voice describes the medical abortion pill.\", \"A young woman in a blue and white patterned dress stands in front of a white door, reading aloud from a piece of paper.\\nThe audio is a female voice clearly explaining that medical abortion uses pharmaceutical drugs, also known as the abortion pill.\", \"A young woman in a blue and white dress stands in a room with blue walls, holding a white piece of paper and reading aloud. She explains that medical abortion uses pharmaceutical drugs, known as the abortion pill, which is only effective during the first trimester.\", \"A woman wearing a blue and white patterned dress stands in front of a white door, holding and reading from a piece of paper. She is speaking about medical abortion, also known as the abortion pill, and its effectiveness during the first trimester.\"]", "time_sec": 47.681, "generation_time_seconds": 47.0652, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "73", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The booming engines of cars racing on the highway as a red car speeds down the road in the right lane.", "pred": "Two cars race on a drag strip, with a white car and a red car accelerating hard. The sound of a powerful engine is heard, which then revs extremely high and abruptly cuts out.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Two cars race on a drag strip, with a white car and a red car accelerating hard. The sound of a powerful engine is heard, which then revs extremely high and abruptly cuts out.", "cot": "[\"Two cars race on a drag strip, with a white car and a red car accelerating hard. The sound of a powerful engine is heard, which then revs extremely high and abruptly cuts out.\", \"Two cars accelerate down a drag strip, with a loud engine and tire screeching sound.\", \"Two cars race on a drag strip while spectators watch from bleachers, the sound of their powerful engines roaring and accelerating.\", \"A silver and a red car race side-by-side down a drag strip, their engines roaring intensely before the silver car pulls ahead as the red car's engine suddenly revs loudly.\"]", "time_sec": 37.554, "generation_time_seconds": 36.6028, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "74", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman standing at a podium giving a speech while playing a musical instrument in a quiet environment.", "pred": "A woman in traditional attire speaks at a podium, and the audio confirms she is requesting a deviation from existing protocol due to limited time.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman in traditional attire speaks at a podium, and the audio confirms she is requesting a deviation from existing protocol due to limited time.", "cot": "[\"A woman in traditional attire speaks at a podium, and the audio confirms she is requesting a deviation from existing protocol due to limited time.\", \"A woman in a colorful headwrap and green dress speaks at a podium, stating she has little time and is begging to stand on existing protocol, with a banner behind her reading \\\"1914 - 2014 NIGERIA\\\".\", \"A woman wearing a colorful headwrap and glasses speaks at a podium, her mouth open mid-sentence, while a low, sustained electronic tone plays in the background.\", \"A woman wearing a colorful headwrap and glasses stands at a podium and speaks into a microphone, with a banner displaying \\\"1914 - 2014 NIGERIA\\\" behind her.\"]", "time_sec": 42.474, "generation_time_seconds": 41.7396, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "75", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the serene ambiance of a bathroom, water softly flows as a man speaks amidst the presence of a shower head, a toothbrush, an umbrella on a tripod, and a person holding a plunger.", "pred": "The audio features a man speaking over the continuous high-pitched beeping of an electronic device. Simultaneously, the visual shows a hand pressing a button on a control panel, which causes the red indicator lights to turn off and the green indicator lights to turn on.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features a man speaking over the continuous high-pitched beeping of an electronic device. Simultaneously, the visual shows a hand pressing a button on a control panel, which causes the red indicator lights to turn off and the green indicator lights to turn on.", "cot": "[\"The audio features a man speaking over the continuous high-pitched beeping of an electronic device. Simultaneously, the visual shows a hand pressing a button on a control panel, which causes the red indicator lights to turn off and the green indicator lights to turn on.\", \"A hand presses a button on a metal detector, causing its red and green lights to illuminate and a loud, high-pitched electronic beep to sound, followed by a male voice commenting on the device's sensitivity.\", \"A hand adjusts the settings on a green metal detector as its control panel's red and green LEDs flash, accompanied by a high-pitched electronic beeping sound and a male voice explaining the machine's sensitivity.\", \"A hand presses a button on a green metal detector's control panel, causing a green light to illuminate, as a man speaks and an electronic beeping sound is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 46.579, "generation_time_seconds": 45.3453, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "76", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The soothing sound of water trickling and dripping accompanies a bustling crowd's chatter, as a man captures a mesmerizing image of fish swimming in a large aquarium.", "pred": "The video displays a fish tank, while the accompanying audio consists of the sound of a toilet flushing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a fish tank, while the accompanying audio consists of the sound of a toilet flushing.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a fish tank, while the accompanying audio consists of the sound of a toilet flushing.\", \"The audio consists of the continuous, low-frequency rumble of a large, heavy machine, possibly an engine or industrial equipment, running at a steady pace. This sound is constant throughout the clip, with no other distinct noises such as speech, music, or environmental sounds present.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{The audio features the continuous, low-frequency rumble of a large machine operating steadily.}\", \"The video shows a black, triangular object being rinsed under a stream of running water, which is heard as a continuous gurgling and splashing sound.\", \"The video opens with a close-up of a black object with water droplets, then pans to a fish tank. Inside the tank, fish swim around coral and rocks, and a blue fish is visible near the center. The sound of a toilet flushing is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 47.526, "generation_time_seconds": 46.8493, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "77", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a red shirt and black tie plays a musical instrument on stage at night, while a person whistles along to the music in the background.", "pred": "A man in a red shirt and black jacket stands on a stage, speaking into a microphone as a keyboard plays a melody in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a red shirt and black jacket stands on a stage, speaking into a microphone as a keyboard plays a melody in the background.", "cot": "[\"A man in a red shirt and black jacket stands on a stage, speaking into a microphone as a keyboard plays a melody in the background.\", \"A man in a red shirt and dark jacket stands at a microphone on a stage, while a high-pitched, synthesized electronic melody plays.\", \"A man in a red shirt and black jacket sings into a microphone on a stage, while a complex, synthesized electronic sound plays in the background.\", \"I see a man in a red shirt and black jacket standing at a microphone on a stage, with another person partially visible behind him. I hear the sound of a wind instrument, likely a flute, playing a melody.\"]", "time_sec": 39.027, "generation_time_seconds": 38.2584, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 48.28, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "78", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The high frequency humming followed by a smack woke up the person sleeping on the bed with a blanket and pillow and drone making sound.", "pred": "The image shows a child sleeping in a crib under a zebra-print blanket in a room with beige curtains, while the audio captures a drill being used twice, followed by a brief pause and then the drill being used a third time.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The image shows a child sleeping in a crib under a zebra-print blanket in a room with beige curtains, while the audio captures a drill being used twice, followed by a brief pause and then the drill being used a third time.", "cot": "[\"The image shows a child sleeping in a crib under a zebra-print blanket in a room with beige curtains, while the audio captures a drill being used twice, followed by a brief pause and then the drill being used a third time.\", \"A person sleeps under a black-and-white striped blanket in a wooden crib within a room containing a window with curtains and a sliding door.\\nThe high-pitched whirring of a small motor, likely from a handheld vacuum cleaner, is heard twice as it starts and stops.\", \"A person lies in a crib under a zebra-print blanket in a room with beige curtains and a wooden door, while the loud, high-pitched whirring of a power drill is heard twice.\", \"A person is lying in a wooden crib covered with zebra-patterned blankets, while a loud, high-pitched whirring sound is heard, followed by a loud metallic clank and then the whirring sound resumes.\"]", "time_sec": 49.779, "generation_time_seconds": 47.9509, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "79", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The actress is seen accepting the award for Best Actress on stage while a female voice speaks continuously.and background visible all frames", "pred": "A woman in a dark blue gown stands on a stage holding an award and speaks into a microphone. The background features a large sign for the musical \"Pippin\" and a screen displaying \"DIRECTION OF A MUSICAL.\" She is giving an acceptance speech, thanking the Harvard President and Barry Weissler.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman in a dark blue gown stands on a stage holding an award and speaks into a microphone. The background features a large sign for the musical \"Pippin\" and a screen displaying \"DIRECTION OF A MUSICAL.\" She is giving an acceptance speech, thanking the Harvard President and Barry Weissler.", "cot": "[\"A woman in a dark blue gown stands on a stage holding an award and speaks into a microphone. The background features a large sign for the musical \\\"Pippin\\\" and a screen displaying \\\"DIRECTION OF A MUSICAL.\\\" She is giving an acceptance speech, thanking the Harvard President and Barry Weissler.\", \"A woman in a dark blue dress stands at a microphone on a stage, holding an award. The background features large posters for the musicals \\\"Pippin\\\" and \\\"The 25th Annual Putnam County Spelling Bee.\\\" She is speaking, and the audio captures her voice as she says, \\\"...and to the Harvard president, Drew Faust, who says creativity is a form of knowledge. To Barry Weissler, Howard and Janet Kagan and all their producing teams for...\\\"\", \"A woman in a dark dress stands at a podium, holding an award and speaking. The audio confirms she is giving a speech, thanking individuals and teams.\", \"A woman in a dark blue dress stands on a stage, holding a golden statuette and speaking into a microphone. Behind her, two illuminated marquees display the titles \\\"Pippin\\\" and \\\"DIRECTION OF A MUSICAL\\\".\\n\\\\boxed{A woman in a dark blue dress holds a golden statuette and speaks into a microphone on a stage with illuminated marquees for \\\"Pippin\\\" and \\\"DIRECTION OF A MUSICAL\\\" behind her.}\"]", "time_sec": 65.386, "generation_time_seconds": 64.3763, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0007, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.78, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "80", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man stands next to a horse as the wind blows, a distant goat bleats, and women speak softly in the background.", "pred": "A man is petting two lying horses in a grassy field, where a donkey is also grazing, while a small, white dog runs around the animals and a person can be heard speaking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man is petting two lying horses in a grassy field, where a donkey is also grazing, while a small, white dog runs around the animals and a person can be heard speaking.", "cot": "[\"A man is petting two lying horses in a grassy field, where a donkey is also grazing, while a small, white dog runs around the animals and a person can be heard speaking.\", \"The audio features a woman speaking and a goat bleating, while the video shows a man in a dark jacket kneeling and petting two lying horses in a grassy field, with a donkey grazing to the left.\", \"A man in a blue shirt sits on the grass with two horses, one brown and one dark, while a donkey stands nearby; the sound of a goat bleating is heard as people speak in the background.\", \"A person in a dark jacket and cap pets a reclining brown horse in a grassy field, while a donkey grazes nearby.\\n A second person, a woman, speaks off-screen, asking, \\\"What you doing?\\\"\\n The first person replies, \\\"Baby's running around on Rio,\\\" as the second person responds with a surprised \\\"Oh my gosh.\\\"\\n The sound of a goat bleating is also audible.\"]", "time_sec": 52.541, "generation_time_seconds": 51.5703, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "81", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of rattling accompanies a man riding a motorcycle on a trail through a wooded area.", "pred": "A person wearing a helmet and protective gear rides a white dirt bike down a dirt trail in a forest, and a male voice shouts \"Yeah!\" followed by laughter.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing a helmet and protective gear rides a white dirt bike down a dirt trail in a forest, and a male voice shouts \"Yeah!\" followed by laughter.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing a helmet and protective gear rides a white dirt bike down a dirt trail in a forest, and a male voice shouts \\\"Yeah!\\\" followed by laughter.\", \"A person wearing a helmet and yellow and black gear rides a white dirt bike down a forest path. The sound of the engine and tires on the trail is followed by a male voice saying \\\"Yeah!\\\" and laughing.\", \"A motorcyclist wearing a helmet and protective gear rides a white dirt bike down a steep, forested hill. The sound of the dirt bike's engine and crunching tires on gravel are followed by a man shouting \\\"Yeah!\\\" and then laughing.\", \"A person wearing a helmet and yellow shirt rides a dirt bike down a forested hill, and a man exclaims \\\"Yeah!\\\" after the bike passes.\"]", "time_sec": 44.296, "generation_time_seconds": 43.4087, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "82", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of hissing background noises, a man speaks under a night sky resembling a block of cheese, with a view of the moon and stars twinkling above.", "pred": "A person is speaking while a hissing sound is audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person is speaking while a hissing sound is audible.", "cot": "[\"A person is speaking while a hissing sound is audible.\", \"A person is speaking instructions, stating the need for a constant flow of plus 40 psi through a one-eighth orifice, while the sound of a power tool, like a drill or saw, operates in the background.\", \"A close-up shot shows a dark, textured surface, possibly fabric, with a small, light-colored corner visible in the upper left. A male voice provides technical instructions, stating, \\\"you want a constant flow of plus 40 psi going through a 1/8th orifice, basically.\\\"\", \"A dark, textured surface is shown, with a light-colored, pointed object in the upper left corner, while a male voice speaks about maintaining a constant flow of pressure.\"]", "time_sec": 43.402, "generation_time_seconds": 42.2542, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "83", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young man in a hat and t-shirt sits on a couch holding a white tablet, speaking followed by a digital beep.", "pred": "A young man wearing a white baseball cap and a black t-shirt with white text sits on a couch, speaking and gesturing with his hands. He holds up a green and white game case and continues talking before a loud, sustained electronic buzzer sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young man wearing a white baseball cap and a black t-shirt with white text sits on a couch, speaking and gesturing with his hands. He holds up a green and white game case and continues talking before a loud, sustained electronic buzzer sounds.", "cot": "[\"A young man wearing a white baseball cap and a black t-shirt with white text sits on a couch, speaking and gesturing with his hands. He holds up a green and white game case and continues talking before a loud, sustained electronic buzzer sounds.\", \"A man in a white cap and black t-shirt sits on a couch, speaking and gesturing. A loud, continuous electronic tone begins abruptly and persists until the end of the clip.\", \"A young man wearing a backwards white cap and a black t-shirt with white text sits on a light-colored couch and speaks to the camera. His speech is interrupted by a series of electronic beeps, suggesting a recording or editing error.\", \"A young man wearing a backwards baseball cap and a black t-shirt sits on a couch and speaks, but his speech is repeatedly interrupted by a loud, low-pitched electronic buzzer sound.\"]", "time_sec": 46.772, "generation_time_seconds": 45.7365, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.82, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "84", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a dimly lit room, a young woman with glasses holding a smartphone bursts into laughter after taking a picture, accompanied by loud burps and giggles from her friends.", "pred": "The video opens with a dark, blurry view of wooden beams. A woman with dark hair and glasses appears, looking at the camera. She makes a burping sound, followed by a laugh, and the video ends with a black screen.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video opens with a dark, blurry view of wooden beams. A woman with dark hair and glasses appears, looking at the camera. She makes a burping sound, followed by a laugh, and the video ends with a black screen.", "cot": "[\"The video opens with a dark, blurry view of wooden beams. A woman with dark hair and glasses appears, looking at the camera. She makes a burping sound, followed by a laugh, and the video ends with a black screen.\", \"The video shows a dark, indistinct scene that resolves into a close-up of a person's face with glasses, all under warm, dim lighting. Simultaneously, the audio captures the person speaking, followed by a burp and then laughter.\", \"The video shows a dimly lit interior, possibly an attic, with wooden beams. A woman with dark hair and glasses appears in the frame and looks towards the camera. She emits a loud, wet, gurgling burp, followed immediately by her laughter.\", \"The video shows a person in a dark, wood-paneled room, but the audio contains the sound of a person burping, followed by a child laughing.\"]", "time_sec": 47.816, "generation_time_seconds": 46.7983, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.89, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "85", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A cheerful scene with female speech and laughter accompanied by birds chirping and rustling, as various birds interact with toys and food on tables.", "pred": "Two green and orange parrots interact on a yellow blanket next to a blue food bowl; a person speaks, followed by a squeaking sound and an electronic tone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Two green and orange parrots interact on a yellow blanket next to a blue food bowl; a person speaks, followed by a squeaking sound and an electronic tone.", "cot": "[\"Two green and orange parrots interact on a yellow blanket next to a blue food bowl; a person speaks, followed by a squeaking sound and an electronic tone.\", \"Two green and yellow parrots interact on a yellow blanket next to a food bowl and an orange swing, while a person speaks and a continuous high-pitched electronic tone plays in the background.\", \"Two green and orange parrots are on a yellow blanket near a blue food bowl, while a person speaks followed by a rattling sound.\", \"Two green and orange parrots are on a yellow blanket with a bowl of food, while a person speaks and a high-pitched squeaking sound occurs.\"]", "time_sec": 39.333, "generation_time_seconds": 38.187, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "86", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A white sports car speeds down the road at sunset, sirens blaring, as a man urgently speaks.", "pred": "I observe a white sports car driving on a road in a video game, with a police car visible in the background and on-screen text indicating a \"CHECKPOINT\" and \"10-44 in progress.\" Simultaneously, I hear the loud, high-pitched screech of tires and a male voice over a radio saying, \"10-44 in progress, call all units, code 3.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "I observe a white sports car driving on a road in a video game, with a police car visible in the background and on-screen text indicating a \"CHECKPOINT\" and \"10-44 in progress.\" Simultaneously, I hear the loud, high-pitched screech of tires and a male voice over a radio saying, \"10-44 in progress, call all units, code 3.\"", "cot": "[\"I observe a white sports car driving on a road in a video game, with a police car visible in the background and on-screen text indicating a \\\"CHECKPOINT\\\" and \\\"10-44 in progress.\\\" Simultaneously, I hear the loud, high-pitched screech of tires and a male voice over a radio saying, \\\"10-44 in progress, call all units, code 3.\\\"\", \"A white sports car speeds down a city street with a police siren wailing, while a police radio broadcast plays in the background.\", \"The video displays a white sports car driving on a road from a third-person perspective, while the audio features a police siren, the sound of a high-performance car engine, and a male voice making a radio call with the unit number \\\"944\\\".\", \"The audio contains a police siren and a dispatcher's voice, but the visual is a white sports car driving on a road in a video game, with no police vehicle present.\"]", "time_sec": 50.654, "generation_time_seconds": 49.6008, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "87", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The chaotic night scene is filled with the deafening wail of an emergency siren and the roaring engine of a large truck as vehicles speed down the street.", "pred": "The scene is a dark street at night, illuminated by a bright overhead light and the flashing red lights of a stationary emergency vehicle. A loud, wailing siren can be heard, indicating the presence of a police car or ambulance.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The scene is a dark street at night, illuminated by a bright overhead light and the flashing red lights of a stationary emergency vehicle. A loud, wailing siren can be heard, indicating the presence of a police car or ambulance.", "cot": "[\"The scene is a dark street at night, illuminated by a bright overhead light and the flashing red lights of a stationary emergency vehicle. A loud, wailing siren can be heard, indicating the presence of a police car or ambulance.\", \"I see a nighttime street scene with a bright, flashing red and white emergency vehicle light. I hear the loud, wailing siren of a fire truck approaching and then passing.\", \"At night, a street scene illuminated by streetlights shows an emergency vehicle with flashing red lights, accompanied by the sound of a high-pitched, wailing siren.\", \"At night, a bright streetlight illuminates a road where an emergency vehicle with flashing red lights is present, accompanied by a loud, wailing siren.\\n\\\\boxed{A nighttime street scene shows an emergency vehicle with flashing red lights, illuminated by a streetlight, while a loud, wailing siren sounds.}\"]", "time_sec": 47.374, "generation_time_seconds": 46.3882, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.39, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "88", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On stage at an event, a man and a woman engage in conversation, a bell rings, and a cat meows, and a crowd applause.", "pred": "The audio features a male speaker introducing a professor named Jerry Coyne. Simultaneously, the visual shows a debate stage with two teams, \"#TeamCats\" and \"#TeamDogs\", where a man in a blue shirt is shaking hands with a man in a white shirt at a central podium, while a large screen displays a close-up of animal paws.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features a male speaker introducing a professor named Jerry Coyne. Simultaneously, the visual shows a debate stage with two teams, \"#TeamCats\" and \"#TeamDogs\", where a man in a blue shirt is shaking hands with a man in a white shirt at a central podium, while a large screen displays a close-up of animal paws.", "cot": "[\"The audio features a male speaker introducing a professor named Jerry Coyne. Simultaneously, the visual shows a debate stage with two teams, \\\"#TeamCats\\\" and \\\"#TeamDogs\\\", where a man in a blue shirt is shaking hands with a man in a white shirt at a central podium, while a large screen displays a close-up of animal paws.\", \"A stage features two teams, #TeamCats and #TeamDogs, with a large screen above them showing animal footage. A man in a suit walks on stage as an audience claps and a male speaker says, \\\"You're pushing it,\\\" followed by a female speaker saying, \\\"Alright,\\\" and then the male speaker saying, \\\"Jerry Coyne is a professor in the department of ecology and evolution at the...\\\"\", \"A man in a suit stands at a central podium on a stage, flanked by two panels labeled \\\"#TeamCats\\\" and \\\"#TeamDogs\\\", while a large screen behind him displays images of animals; the sound of applause and cheering from an audience is heard as the man speaks.\", \"A man speaks on a stage in front of an audience and two teams, \\\"#TeamCats\\\" and \\\"#TeamDogs\\\", while a large screen behind him displays an image of animal legs. He is introduced as Professor Jerry Coyne, a professor of ecology and evolution, as the audience applauds.\"]", "time_sec": 63.433, "generation_time_seconds": 62.2915, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.51, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "89", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a lush green field next to a white fence, a man speaks as a woman screams, accompanied by the distant clip clops of horses.", "pred": "A person on a brown and white horse gallops across a green field, passing a white fence and a white jump standard. A man speaks, followed by a woman shouting \"Woo!\" and the sound of a horse galloping.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person on a brown and white horse gallops across a green field, passing a white fence and a white jump standard. A man speaks, followed by a woman shouting \"Woo!\" and the sound of a horse galloping.", "cot": "[\"A person on a brown and white horse gallops across a green field, passing a white fence and a white jump standard. A man speaks, followed by a woman shouting \\\"Woo!\\\" and the sound of a horse galloping.\", \"A horse with a rider gallops across a grassy field towards a white jump, while a person speaks and another person cheers, and the sound of the horse's hooves is audible.\", \"A brown and white horse gallops across a grassy field, passing a white fence and a white jump standard, while a person speaks and a child shouts in the background.\", \"The video shows a horse and rider jumping over a white fence in a grassy field, while the audio captures a person saying, \\\"There they go,\\\" followed by a whoop, and then a child speaking.\"]", "time_sec": 44.914, "generation_time_seconds": 43.8715, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 36.84, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "90", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red and yellow train, accompanied by a truck, travels down the tracks as the train horn blows and the signal beeps in the background.", "pred": "A red and yellow BNSF locomotive is shown. The sound of a train horn is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red and yellow BNSF locomotive is shown. The sound of a train horn is heard.", "cot": "[\"A red and yellow BNSF locomotive is shown. The sound of a train horn is heard.\", \"A red and black BNSF locomotive sits beside a white trailer under a clear sky. A train horn sounds loudly, followed by the sound of a train moving on tracks.\", \"The video shows a multi-unit BNSF freight train moving from left to right. The audio consists of the train's horn, followed by the loud, continuous hiss of its air brakes being applied.\", \"A multi-unit red and yellow BNSF freight train is moving along the tracks under a clear blue sky, while a loud, multi-toned air horn sounds repeatedly.\"]", "time_sec": 39.429, "generation_time_seconds": 38.4355, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 34.78, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "91", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the darkness of the night, a man's voice squeals and rustles as a lion hides in tall grass and bushes.", "pred": "A brown dog is partially visible behind dense, dry brush. A person speaks, encouraging someone named Gil to jump and bring something back, while a high-pitched squeaking sound, likely from a toy, is repeatedly heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A brown dog is partially visible behind dense, dry brush. A person speaks, encouraging someone named Gil to jump and bring something back, while a high-pitched squeaking sound, likely from a toy, is repeatedly heard.", "cot": "[\"A brown dog is partially visible behind dense, dry brush. A person speaks, encouraging someone named Gil to jump and bring something back, while a high-pitched squeaking sound, likely from a toy, is repeatedly heard.\", \"The video shows a large, light-brown, four-legged animal moving slowly through dense, dry brush. Simultaneously, audio captures a person giving commands in English, such as \\\"go kill,\\\" followed by a loud, high-pitched, distressed animal squeal.\", \"A goat with large, curved horns stands amidst dense, dry brush. It bleats loudly and repeatedly while a person speaks to it in a commanding tone.\", \"A brown feline, partially obscured by dry brush, is seen and hears a person calling it \\\"Gil\\\" and \\\"Jim\\\" and telling it to \\\"bring it\\\".\"]", "time_sec": 46.196, "generation_time_seconds": 44.1248, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "92", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the audio, two men are chatting and laughing, while in the visual, a person is holding a controller and playing a free video game available on operating system software.", "pred": "A person's hands shuffle a deck of Yu-Gi-Oh! trading cards on a \"Yu-Gi-Oh! World Championship Qualifier Regional 2015\" playmat while a person speaks in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands shuffle a deck of Yu-Gi-Oh! trading cards on a \"Yu-Gi-Oh! World Championship Qualifier Regional 2015\" playmat while a person speaks in the background.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands shuffle a deck of Yu-Gi-Oh! trading cards on a \\\"Yu-Gi-Oh! World Championship Qualifier Regional 2015\\\" playmat while a person speaks in the background.\", \"The audio features a person speaking, followed by a loud, sudden horn blast. Simultaneously, the visual shows a close-up of hands handling a Yu-Gi-Oh! trading card game playmat and cards.\", \"I see a person's hands sorting Yu-Gi-Oh! trading cards on a playmat that reads \\\"Yu-Gi-Oh! Trading Card Game World Championship Qualifier Regional 2015.\\\" I hear a person speaking in a conversational tone, listing card names like \\\"Maxx 'C',\\\" \\\"Stun,\\\" and \\\"Fusion,\\\" followed by a second person laughing.\", \"A person's hands are shown at a Yu-Gi-Oh! World Championship Qualifier Regional 2015 playmat, while two male voices discuss a card game strategy, one mentioning \\\"maxi\\\" and \\\"fusion,\\\" followed by a laugh.\"]", "time_sec": 54.085, "generation_time_seconds": 52.8846, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "93", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of children screaming mixes with a man's laughter, followed by a whisper and a young boy's voice, as a child  hugs a young girl at the bottom of the stairs of a house, with a woman standing nearby.", "pred": "A young girl runs away from a man on a couch, then runs into the arms of a smiling man by a staircase, as children scream and shout excitedly in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young girl runs away from a man on a couch, then runs into the arms of a smiling man by a staircase, as children scream and shout excitedly in the background.", "cot": "[\"A young girl runs away from a man on a couch, then runs into the arms of a smiling man by a staircase, as children scream and shout excitedly in the background.\", \"The video shows a young girl in a striped top laughing and running away from a boy in a grey shirt, who is also laughing and chasing her through a hallway. The audio consists of the children's excited shouts and laughter, culminating in the girl shouting \\\"I got it!\\\" as she runs.\", \"A young girl runs from a man in a dark sweater, who then chases her. A man in a grey shirt and jeans smiles from the top of a staircase. The girl runs up the stairs as a child screams and laughs, and the man says, \\\"I got her.\\\"\", \"A young girl runs from a man on a couch toward a staircase where a woman is standing. The girl jumps into the woman's arms, and the woman hugs her. The girl then runs away from the woman and up the stairs. The woman follows after her. The audio contains sounds of children shouting and laughing, along with some indistinct speech.\"]", "time_sec": 53.87, "generation_time_seconds": 53.1262, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "94", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of rustling followed by a brief speech accompanies the visual of a white toilet bowl with water inside in a bathroom setting.", "pred": "A person presses the flush button on a toilet, which then produces a loud, gurgling sound as it empties and refills with water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person presses the flush button on a toilet, which then produces a loud, gurgling sound as it empties and refills with water.", "cot": "[\"A person presses the flush button on a toilet, which then produces a loud, gurgling sound as it empties and refills with water.\", \"A close-up shot shows a white toilet bowl as a person speaks and then flushes it, creating a loud, gurgling sound of rushing water.\", \"The camera pans over a white toilet bowl, and the sound of a toilet flushing is heard.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a white toilet bowl, which is then flushed, accompanied by the sound of a male voice saying \\\"Now I'll make it flush\\\" just before the loud, gurgling sound of the water rushing and swirling during the flush.\"]", "time_sec": 39.256, "generation_time_seconds": 38.5287, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "95", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a kitchen with a small white dog on the floor, amidst a blue sky of hope and love, white noise is followed by muffled speech and rustling.", "pred": "The scene opens with text on a blue screen. It then cuts to a kitchen where a small, fluffy white dog runs from an open cabinet toward a person, who then closes the cabinet door. The sound of a door closing is heard, followed by a high-pitched, sustained electronic tone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The scene opens with text on a blue screen. It then cuts to a kitchen where a small, fluffy white dog runs from an open cabinet toward a person, who then closes the cabinet door. The sound of a door closing is heard, followed by a high-pitched, sustained electronic tone.", "cot": "[\"The scene opens with text on a blue screen. It then cuts to a kitchen where a small, fluffy white dog runs from an open cabinet toward a person, who then closes the cabinet door. The sound of a door closing is heard, followed by a high-pitched, sustained electronic tone.\", \"A small white dog runs in a kitchen, jumps, and pushes a cabinet door closed with its head as a person speaks and the dog barks.\", \"The video opens with a text overlay stating 'gg, 7 months old, learns to close doors - Fall, 2007'. It then cuts to a kitchen where a small, fluffy white dog walks towards an open lower cabinet door. As the dog nudges the door, a distinct mechanical click is heard, and the door swings shut.\", \"A small white dog stands in a kitchen, and at the same time, a loud door slam is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 46.783, "generation_time_seconds": 45.9514, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "96", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of footsteps approaching a sliding door, followed by a man speaking, then the door creaking shut, in a small kitchen with white cabinets and a refrigerator.and towels also.", "pred": "The video shows a laundry room with a white washer and dryer. A sliding door opens and closes with a metallic sound, followed by a man identifying the appliances as a \"washer dryer,\" and then a mechanical whirring sound begins.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a laundry room with a white washer and dryer. A sliding door opens and closes with a metallic sound, followed by a man identifying the appliances as a \"washer dryer,\" and then a mechanical whirring sound begins.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a laundry room with a white washer and dryer. A sliding door opens and closes with a metallic sound, followed by a man identifying the appliances as a \\\"washer dryer,\\\" and then a mechanical whirring sound begins.\", \"The video shows a laundry room with a washing machine, dryer, and an open door. A person speaks, identifying the appliances as 'washer dryer', followed by the sound of a door closing.\", \"The camera moves through a cluttered laundry closet containing a white washing machine and dryer, while a person says \\\"washer dryer\\\" and the sound of a door opening and closing is heard.\", \"The sound of a door opening and closing is heard as the camera moves through a doorway into a laundry room. Inside, a white washer and dryer are visible, and a person can be heard saying the words \\\"washer dryer.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 45.174, "generation_time_seconds": 44.4212, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.27, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "97", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a green field, a small dog chases a duck while a film projector runs, capturing the playful symphony of quacks, whimpers, and chirps.", "pred": "A black and tan dog is on a grassy lawn with a duck, and the dog barks just as the duck begins to quack.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black and tan dog is on a grassy lawn with a duck, and the dog barks just as the duck begins to quack.", "cot": "[\"A black and tan dog is on a grassy lawn with a duck, and the dog barks just as the duck begins to quack.\", \"A dog plays with a white duck on a grassy lawn, and a person can be heard coughing and laughing in the background.\", \"A black-and-white dog plays with a duck in a grassy yard while a rooster crows and chickens cluck in the background.\", \"A black and tan dog is in a grassy yard with a duck, and then the dog runs across the grass while a dog barks and a person laughs.\"]", "time_sec": 38.0, "generation_time_seconds": 36.3445, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "98", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The muffled sound of a vehicle engine revving and running idle as cloth rustles, with a modern car dashboard displaying the speedometer and tachometer.", "pred": "The dashboard of a stationary vehicle is illuminated with various warning lights, including a yellow battery symbol and a red brake symbol, while a low, continuous electronic hum is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The dashboard of a stationary vehicle is illuminated with various warning lights, including a yellow battery symbol and a red brake symbol, while a low, continuous electronic hum is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"The dashboard of a stationary vehicle is illuminated with various warning lights, including a yellow battery symbol and a red brake symbol, while a low, continuous electronic hum is heard in the background.\", \"The interior of a stationary Audi is shown, with its digital dashboard illuminated by red and green warning lights, while a low-frequency mechanical hum is audible in the background.\", \"The video displays a car's instrument cluster and center console, showing a red seatbelt warning light, a red parking brake light, and a digital display indicating a temperature of 20.0°C. Simultaneously, the audio captures the sound of a car engine starting, followed by the distinct noise of a power window rolling up.\", \"The video displays a car's illuminated dashboard, showing a speed of 0 km/h and a fuel gauge at one-quarter, while the audio captures the sound of a car engine idling.\"]", "time_sec": 47.026, "generation_time_seconds": 45.8705, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "99", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of clicking and clacking fills the room as a person types on an old typewriter, their hands focused on the black keys, with a bell ringing and a clack as the carriage returns, set on a table with a sheet of paper.", "pred": "The video shows a close-up of a black manual typewriter being operated, with a person's hands pressing the keys. Concurrently, the audio captures the rapid, rhythmic, metallic clatter of the typewriter's keys and typebars striking the page.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of a black manual typewriter being operated, with a person's hands pressing the keys. Concurrently, the audio captures the rapid, rhythmic, metallic clatter of the typewriter's keys and typebars striking the page.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a close-up of a black manual typewriter being operated, with a person's hands pressing the keys. Concurrently, the audio captures the rapid, rhythmic, metallic clatter of the typewriter's keys and typebars striking the page.\", \"A close-up shows a hand typing on a black vintage typewriter, with the keys and mechanical carriage moving, while the corresponding sharp, rhythmic clacking of the typewriter's typebars striking the paper is heard.\", \"A close-up shows a black and red vintage typewriter with a white sheet of paper loaded. A hand presses the keys, and the distinct, rapid clatter of the typewriter's typebars striking the paper is heard.\", \"The camera provides extreme close-ups of a black and red vintage typewriter. A hand is visible pressing the keys, which are raised to strike the paper. This action produces a rapid, loud, and rhythmic clatter of mechanical keys, characteristic of typing on a manual typewriter.\"]", "time_sec": 50.499, "generation_time_seconds": 49.0328, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.02, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "100", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a train engine running with bells chime, a lawn mower, and a steam engine running with a steam whistle blowing, as a crowd of people stand near a small train on the tracks.", "pred": "A green and red miniature steam train moves along a track in a park, emitting steam and a high-pitched whistle, while people stand nearby observing and conversing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A green and red miniature steam train moves along a track in a park, emitting steam and a high-pitched whistle, while people stand nearby observing and conversing.", "cot": "[\"A green and red miniature steam train moves along a track in a park, emitting steam and a high-pitched whistle, while people stand nearby observing and conversing.\", \"A green and yellow miniature steam train is on the tracks in a park, with people around it, accompanied by the sound of a vehicle engine, a horn, and human speech.\", \"A small green and yellow steam train emits a high-pitched whistle while moving along a track in a park, with a crowd of people watching from the platform.\", \"A green miniature steam train with a black smokestack and red wheels moves along a brown track in a park, emitting a high-pitched whistle while people stand near a green metal shed.\\n\\\\boxed{A green miniature steam train moves on a track, emitting a high-pitched whistle, with people near a green shed.}\"]", "time_sec": 45.707, "generation_time_seconds": 44.4111, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.2, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "101", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The video game world bursts with a gunfiring, a large screen background.", "pred": "The player character fires a weapon at multiple red enemy figures on a platform, causing them to explode in blue particle effects, while the audio features the sharp, rapid sound of gunfire and the subsequent thud of impacts.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The player character fires a weapon at multiple red enemy figures on a platform, causing them to explode in blue particle effects, while the audio features the sharp, rapid sound of gunfire and the subsequent thud of impacts.", "cot": "[\"The player character fires a weapon at multiple red enemy figures on a platform, causing them to explode in blue particle effects, while the audio features the sharp, rapid sound of gunfire and the subsequent thud of impacts.\", \"A pixelated character fires a weapon at red enemy figures on a platform, accompanied by a loud, repetitive electronic buzzing sound.\\n\\\\boxed{A pixelated character fires a weapon at red enemies on a platform, accompanied by a loud, repetitive electronic buzzing sound.}\", \"The visual shows a pixel-art shooter game where a character fires a weapon, creating large blue explosive effects on a wall and defeating red enemy figures. The audio consists of sharp, rapid gunfire, accompanied by a high-pitched male scream, a low-frequency roar, and a final mechanical click.\", \"The video displays a side-scrolling action game where a character shoots at multiple enemies, causing explosions and particle effects, while the audio consists of intense electronic music combined with sharp, rapid gunfire and monstrous creature sounds.\"]", "time_sec": 49.025, "generation_time_seconds": 48.4081, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "102", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of plastic clacking is followed by the roar of motorcycle engines as a couple of men ride red motorcycles down a sidewalk next to a brick building.", "pred": "The audio features the sound of a motorcycle engine starting and revving, while the visual shows two young men with a black motorcycle and a red motorcycle in a driveway.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features the sound of a motorcycle engine starting and revving, while the visual shows two young men with a black motorcycle and a red motorcycle in a driveway.", "cot": "[\"The audio features the sound of a motorcycle engine starting and revving, while the visual shows two young men with a black motorcycle and a red motorcycle in a driveway.\", \"Two individuals on sport motorcycles accelerate rapidly down a paved alleyway, the deep roar of their engines filling the air as they quickly drive away from the camera.\", \"Two young men on motorcycles start their engines, which idle and rev loudly, as they drive away down a driveway.\", \"Two young men stand with a black and a red motorcycle in a driveway. The red motorcycle's engine roars to life and revs loudly, and both motorcycles drive away down the driveway.\"]", "time_sec": 38.12, "generation_time_seconds": 37.2683, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "103", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a city under dark clouds, a man speaks as rain falls with distant thunder, while a flock of birds sit on a wire and some leaves.", "pred": "A dark, swirling waterspout extends from a storm cloud to the water's surface. The sound of a person speaking is accompanied by the loud, continuous roar of rushing water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A dark, swirling waterspout extends from a storm cloud to the water's surface. The sound of a person speaking is accompanied by the loud, continuous roar of rushing water.", "cot": "[\"A dark, swirling waterspout extends from a storm cloud to the water's surface. The sound of a person speaking is accompanied by the loud, continuous roar of rushing water.\", \"A dark, rotating funnel cloud extends from a massive storm cloud towards the ground over a silhouetted cityscape, accompanied by the sound of heavy rain and a male voice speaking in Korean.\", \"A dark, powerful waterspout extends from a storm cloud to the ground over a body of water, with the silhouettes of buildings and foliage in the foreground, while the audio captures the intense sound of rushing water and a male voice speaking in a non-English language.\", \"A large, dark tornado funnel descends from a storm cloud toward a silhouetted city skyline, while the sound of heavy rain, thunder, and a person speaking are heard.\"]", "time_sec": 44.814, "generation_time_seconds": 44.0981, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "104", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A birds chirping sound the wire fence at various animals, accompanied by the soothing sounds .", "pred": "A small, fluffy, light-colored dog is seen interacting with a large brown cow through a wire fence in a grassy outdoor area, while a man speaks in the foreground and the distinct, high-pitched bleating of a goat is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A small, fluffy, light-colored dog is seen interacting with a large brown cow through a wire fence in a grassy outdoor area, while a man speaks in the foreground and the distinct, high-pitched bleating of a goat is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A small, fluffy, light-colored dog is seen interacting with a large brown cow through a wire fence in a grassy outdoor area, while a man speaks in the foreground and the distinct, high-pitched bleating of a goat is heard in the background.\", \"A small, long-haired, light-colored dog stands on a grassy area, facing a brown cow that is on the other side of a wire fence, while a person speaks in the background.\", \"A small, light-brown dog stands on a grassy area and barks at a large brown cow on the other side of a wire fence, while a person speaks in the foreground and birds chirp in the background.\", \"A small, fluffy, light-brown dog stands on a grassy patch and barks at a goat that is on the other side of a wire mesh fence, while a man's voice is heard speaking in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 46.777, "generation_time_seconds": 46.0464, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "105", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a dark room at night, a man stands alone holding a cell phone in front of a crescent moon, while speaking with the humming of an engine and some rustling.", "pred": "The audio features a man speaking about his truck, which he is backing up, while heavy mechanical rumbling and clanking sounds are heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features a man speaking about his truck, which he is backing up, while heavy mechanical rumbling and clanking sounds are heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"The audio features a man speaking about his truck, which he is backing up, while heavy mechanical rumbling and clanking sounds are heard in the background.\", \"The audio captures a man speaking over the loud, rumbling sound of a large vehicle, possibly a truck, idling or moving slowly.\", \"The audio features a man speaking about his truck while a loud, continuous mechanical grinding or crushing sound plays in the background.\", \"A dark, shaky camera pans across the interior of a vehicle, revealing a seatbelt and a headrest. A male voice speaks as the loud, continuous rumble of a powerful engine is heard in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 38.121, "generation_time_seconds": 37.5354, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "106", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A car drives down a wet road at night in the rain, its headlights illuminating the dark street with water and trees as rain falls and thunder roars in the distance.", "pred": "A vehicle with bright headlights approaches on a wet road at night, its lights reflecting off the wet surface, accompanied by the loud, continuous roar of heavy rain.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A vehicle with bright headlights approaches on a wet road at night, its lights reflecting off the wet surface, accompanied by the loud, continuous roar of heavy rain.", "cot": "[\"A vehicle with bright headlights approaches on a wet road at night, its lights reflecting off the wet surface, accompanied by the loud, continuous roar of heavy rain.\", \"A vehicle's headlights approach on a wet surface, reflecting light, while the audio captures the sound of a heavy downpour.\", \"A vehicle with two bright headlights approaches on a wet road at night, its lights reflecting off the water, while the sound of heavy rain falling on a surface is heard.\", \"A vehicle with bright headlights drives along a wet path at night, its lights reflecting on the wet ground, accompanied by the sound of a large vehicle engine and wind.\"]", "time_sec": 38.304, "generation_time_seconds": 37.255, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.58, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "107", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young girl talks, followed by another young girl laughing, and a young man yelling as a train crosses a wooden bridge over a river with a crowd of people talking in the background.", "pred": "The video shows a first-person view from a boat on a water ride, splashing past rocks and a wooden platform with people on it. The audio consists of the loud sound of splashing water, followed by a woman laughing, then a man saying, \"Hey, what's up?\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a first-person view from a boat on a water ride, splashing past rocks and a wooden platform with people on it. The audio consists of the loud sound of splashing water, followed by a woman laughing, then a man saying, \"Hey, what's up?\"", "cot": "[\"The video shows a first-person view from a boat on a water ride, splashing past rocks and a wooden platform with people on it. The audio consists of the loud sound of splashing water, followed by a woman laughing, then a man saying, \\\"Hey, what's up?\\\"\", \"From a low angle inside a boat, a large splash erupts near the vessel, sending water onto the camera, while people on an elevated wooden platform laugh and shout greetings to each other over the loud noise of the water.\", \"The video shows a first-person perspective from a moving boat splashing through water, with a wooden platform holding several people visible in the background, all accompanied by the loud, continuous roar of water and the sounds of people laughing and shouting.\", \"A vehicle splashes through water on a wooden platform. People on the platform laugh and shout greetings as the loud water splashes.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A vehicle splashes through water on a wooden platform, with people laughing and shouting greetings as loud water splashes.}\"]", "time_sec": 50.487, "generation_time_seconds": 49.3857, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "108", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the wind blows, a young man wearing glasses and a black jacket with a hood walks in the park, whistling a tune.", "pred": "A young man wearing glasses and a black parka with a fur-lined hood sits in a park with bare trees. He is making a sustained, high-pitched, wavering sound with his mouth, similar to blowing a whistle.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young man wearing glasses and a black parka with a fur-lined hood sits in a park with bare trees. He is making a sustained, high-pitched, wavering sound with his mouth, similar to blowing a whistle.", "cot": "[\"A young man wearing glasses and a black parka with a fur-lined hood sits in a park with bare trees. He is making a sustained, high-pitched, wavering sound with his mouth, similar to blowing a whistle.\", \"A person wearing a black winter coat with a fur-lined hood and glasses is sitting outdoors in a park during the day, with trees and dry grass in the background, while a person off-screen is whistling a tune.\", \"A young man wearing glasses and a black winter coat with a fur-lined hood is speaking directly to the camera in an outdoor park setting. Simultaneously, the distinct sound of a person whistling a melody can be heard in the audio.\", \"A young man with glasses wearing a black winter coat with a fur-lined hood is sitting outside in a park with bare trees and hears a person whistling.\"]", "time_sec": 45.181, "generation_time_seconds": 44.6059, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 38.89, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "109", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A yellow helicopter lands on the pitch of a stadium, its engine humming loudly  vibrations and wind.", "pred": "A yellow ADAC helicopter with spinning rotors is on a grassy soccer field in front of stadium seating, while a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A yellow ADAC helicopter with spinning rotors is on a grassy soccer field in front of stadium seating, while a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine is heard.", "cot": "[\"A yellow ADAC helicopter with spinning rotors is on a grassy soccer field in front of stadium seating, while a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine is heard.\", \"The visual shows a yellow ADAC helicopter on a green field in front of stadium seating. The audio consists of the loud, high-pitched whirring of the helicopter's main rotor blades spinning up to full speed.\", \"A yellow ADAC helicopter with black lettering and a blue and yellow tail, displaying the European Union flag, is on a grassy field in front of empty stadium seats, while the loud, powerful sound of its main rotor blades creates a continuous, high-pitched whirring noise.\", \"A yellow ADAC helicopter with spinning rotor blades is on a green sports field in front of a stadium, while the loud, sustained roar of its engine and rotors fills the air.\"]", "time_sec": 45.838, "generation_time_seconds": 45.0676, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "110", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The ticking of a clock  through a metal sculpture  with gears and wires.", "pred": "A complex, dark metal sculpture featuring numerous interconnecting gears and clock-like hands is shown in a close-up. The sculpture is mounted on a wooden base and is positioned in front of a plain, light-colored wall. The distinct sound of a manual typewriter being used is heard in the background, with the clatter of keys and the thunk of the carriage return.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A complex, dark metal sculpture featuring numerous interconnecting gears and clock-like hands is shown in a close-up. The sculpture is mounted on a wooden base and is positioned in front of a plain, light-colored wall. The distinct sound of a manual typewriter being used is heard in the background, with the clatter of keys and the thunk of the carriage return.", "cot": "[\"A complex, dark metal sculpture featuring numerous interconnecting gears and clock-like hands is shown in a close-up. The sculpture is mounted on a wooden base and is positioned in front of a plain, light-colored wall. The distinct sound of a manual typewriter being used is heard in the background, with the clatter of keys and the thunk of the carriage return.\", \"A complex, dark metal sculpture with intertwined gears, springs, and human-like figures is shown against a white background. The distinct, rhythmic ticking of a mechanical clock can be heard in the audio.\", \"A complex, dark metal sculpture featuring interlocking gears, springs, and clock-like faces sits on a wooden base with visible text, while a low, rhythmic mechanical whirring and clicking sound emanates from the object.\", \"A complex, dark-colored metal sculpture with a heart-shaped component and a visible gear mechanism sits on a wooden base, while the sounds of a vehicle's turn signal and an engine are heard.\"]", "time_sec": 49.377, "generation_time_seconds": 48.5753, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "111", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young man in a black shirt operates a sewing machine, the hum of the machine followed by a metal click.", "pred": "A man with tattoos operates a sewing machine at a white table, producing black fabric items, while a loud, rhythmic clanking sound, characteristic of a printing press, plays in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man with tattoos operates a sewing machine at a white table, producing black fabric items, while a loud, rhythmic clanking sound, characteristic of a printing press, plays in the background.", "cot": "[\"A man with tattoos operates a sewing machine at a white table, producing black fabric items, while a loud, rhythmic clanking sound, characteristic of a printing press, plays in the background.\", \"A man with tattoos and a black shirt sits at a white table, operating a sewing machine to stitch black fabric, while a loud, rhythmic, metallic clanking sound, like a train on tracks, is heard in the background.\", \"A man operates a sewing machine in a workshop, the rhythmic, mechanical whirring of the machine being the dominant sound.\", \"A man sits at a sewing machine, operating it with his hands to create a garment, while the distinct mechanical sound of the machine's needle moving up and down is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 41.431, "generation_time_seconds": 40.8114, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.25, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "112", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man talks while typing on a keyboard, showcasing a website with text and images alongside another website with text.", "pred": "The video displays a screen recording of a Python program for a guessing game, where a developer types the command `print(\"You are a winner face\")` into an editor, and a voice narrates the typing process.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a screen recording of a Python program for a guessing game, where a developer types the command `print(\"You are a winner face\")` into an editor, and a voice narrates the typing process.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a screen recording of a Python program for a guessing game, where a developer types the command `print(\\\"You are a winner face\\\")` into an editor, and a voice narrates the typing process.\", \"A screen recording shows a text editor with C++ code for a \\\"GUESSING GAME\\\" next to a chalkboard with the same title. A voice reads the code aloud, saying \\\"open parentheses, you are a winner face.\\\"\", \"The video displays a split screen with code on the left and a 'GUESSING GAME' title on the right, while the audio consists of a voice reading the code, saying 'underscore input, open parenthesis, you are a winner face'.\", \"The screen shows a code editor with a Python guessing game program next to a chalkboard-style title slide, while a person speaks the text \\\"Enter your guess: \\\" and types it into the code.\"]", "time_sec": 47.903, "generation_time_seconds": 46.2963, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.06, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "113", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A  helicopter flies with loud chopping noises over a city with tall buildings.", "pred": "A red and white helicopter is flying between two tall buildings in a city, while the loud, continuous roar of its rotors is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red and white helicopter is flying between two tall buildings in a city, while the loud, continuous roar of its rotors is heard.", "cot": "[\"A red and white helicopter is flying between two tall buildings in a city, while the loud, continuous roar of its rotors is heard.\", \"A red and white helicopter flies between tall, modern buildings, while the sound of its rotors is audible.\", \"A red and white helicopter flies through the air between tall city buildings, its rotors creating a loud, continuous whooshing sound.\", \"A red helicopter with a spinning rotor is flying through an urban environment between tall buildings, while the prominent sound of rushing water is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 35.154, "generation_time_seconds": 34.1493, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 41.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "114", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a lively backyard setting, a person claps as two black and white dogs playfully bark and  while birds chirp in the background.", "pred": "The scene shows multiple dogs in a grassy backyard, while a dog barks and a cat meows in the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The scene shows multiple dogs in a grassy backyard, while a dog barks and a cat meows in the audio.", "cot": "[\"The scene shows multiple dogs in a grassy backyard, while a dog barks and a cat meows in the audio.\", \"Four dogs, including a black and tan Rottweiler and a tan greyhound, are in a grassy yard. The black and tan dog barks, and the other dogs bark in response.\", \"In a grassy backyard with a wooden fence, four dogs—one tan, one black and tan, one gray, and one small white dog—are present as the sharp, high-pitched bark of one dog is clearly heard.\", \"A group of dogs, including a black and tan dog and a tan dog, are in a grassy yard. The black and tan dog barks loudly.\"]", "time_sec": 42.952, "generation_time_seconds": 41.3147, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "115", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The steam engine train hisses and chugs as a man and a young boy sit on the front, surrounded by onlookers.", "pred": "A miniature black and gold steam train with the number '6' emits a loud, rhythmic chuffing sound as it moves along its tracks, carrying several people past a brick building.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A miniature black and gold steam train with the number '6' emits a loud, rhythmic chuffing sound as it moves along its tracks, carrying several people past a brick building.", "cot": "[\"A miniature black and gold steam train with the number '6' emits a loud, rhythmic chuffing sound as it moves along its tracks, carrying several people past a brick building.\", \"The video shows a miniature black and gold steam locomotive moving along tracks next to a building, emitting white steam from its smokestack and wheels, as a man in a black shirt sits on the front. This visual is accompanied by the loud, rhythmic chugging of the steam engine and the metallic clatter of its wheels on the rails.\\n\\\\boxed{A miniature black and gold steam locomotive emits white steam and moves along tracks, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic chugging and metallic clatter of its engine.}\", \"A small black and gold steam engine emits steam and moves along tracks, its metallic wheels clattering over the rails, while a person in a dark shirt operates it from the front and another stands on the running board.\", \"A miniature black and gold steam locomotive moves along narrow-gauge tracks, its metallic wheels clacking against the rails, while a low-pitched, rhythmic chuffing sound, characteristic of a steam engine, is heard in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 56.337, "generation_time_seconds": 55.0878, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "116", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The church bells ring out over the old gothic cathedral as a crowd murmurs in the distance, accompanied by the sound of rain and wind blowing into the microphone.", "pred": "\\boxed{A close-up view of a large stone cathedral's facade is accompanied by the sound of a grand pipe organ playing music from within.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of a large, ornate stone cathedral with detailed gothic architecture, including pointed arches and a large rose window. Simultaneously, the audio captures the sound of a grand, resonant pipe organ playing music from within the building. The combination of the visual and auditory elements suggests the scene is inside a cathedral or large church, with the organ being the source of the music.\n\n\\boxed{A close-up view of a large stone cathedral's facade is accompanied by the sound of a grand pipe organ playing music from within.}", "cot": "[\"The video shows a close-up of a large, ornate stone cathedral with detailed gothic architecture, including pointed arches and a large rose window. Simultaneously, the audio captures the sound of a grand, resonant pipe organ playing music from within the building. The combination of the visual and auditory elements suggests the scene is inside a cathedral or large church, with the organ being the source of the music.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A close-up view of a large stone cathedral's facade is accompanied by the sound of a grand pipe organ playing music from within.}\", \"A large stone cathedral with a green roof is shown, while the sound of a large bell ringing is heard.\", \"The aerial view shows a large, historic stone cathedral with numerous spires and arched windows. Overlaid on this visual is the sound of a large, complex musical instrument, specifically a pipe organ, playing rich, resonant chords and musical phrases.\", \"The video provides a high-angle view of a large, historic stone cathedral with numerous spires and arched windows, while the sound of large, resonant bells playing a peal is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 56.01, "generation_time_seconds": 53.5604, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "117", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The race car speeds up as the engine roars, reflected in the accelerating speedometer on the dashboard.", "pred": "A car's speedometer, showing a reading of 100 mph, is displayed while the vehicle's engine revs loudly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A car's speedometer, showing a reading of 100 mph, is displayed while the vehicle's engine revs loudly.", "cot": "[\"A car's speedometer, showing a reading of 100 mph, is displayed while the vehicle's engine revs loudly.\", \"The audio captures the sound of a car engine accelerating. Simultaneously, the visual shows the car's speedometer needle moving from 60 mph towards 120 mph, corresponding with the increasing engine noise.\", \"A blurry close-up shows a car's speedometer needle rising from 0 to approximately 100 mph, with the digital odometer reading 201582, while a loud, high-revving engine can be heard accelerating rapidly.\", \"This is a close-up of a car's dashboard, showing a speedometer needle moving from approximately 80 mph towards 100 mph, while the engine revs loudly and the vehicle accelerates rapidly.\"]", "time_sec": 44.276, "generation_time_seconds": 43.6719, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.05, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "118", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of plastic crumpling fills the room as a man's hand reaches for papers on a desk, surrounded by cards , while an adult male speaks.", "pred": "A hand holds a black comic book cover with a silver seal, while the sound of crinkling cellophane is heard, and a male voice describes the item as having a \"comic book type of seal.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand holds a black comic book cover with a silver seal, while the sound of crinkling cellophane is heard, and a male voice describes the item as having a \"comic book type of seal.\"", "cot": "[\"A hand holds a black comic book cover with a silver seal, while the sound of crinkling cellophane is heard, and a male voice describes the item as having a \\\"comic book type of seal.\\\"\", \"A hand lifts a stack of items from a table, revealing a black card with a white logo and a white card with a black border, while the sound of crinkling plastic is heard and a person identifies it as a comic book.\", \"A hand holds a black comic book with a silver seal, as the speaker identifies the item and the sound of the seal being handled is heard.\", \"A hand holds a black object while the sound of crinkling plastic is heard, accompanied by a person describing the object as having a \\\"comic book type of seal.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 42.68, "generation_time_seconds": 41.7411, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "119", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man's voice is heard over the idle bus engine, while the camera pans from the open door of the bus to the metal steps of an escalator going up and down.", "pred": "The video shows a close-up of a bus's metal, mesh-textured ramp with a yellow handrail, as a man speaks, stating that the ramp can hold three or four wheelchairs and that the vehicle is a 2001 model.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of a bus's metal, mesh-textured ramp with a yellow handrail, as a man speaks, stating that the ramp can hold three or four wheelchairs and that the vehicle is a 2001 model.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a close-up of a bus's metal, mesh-textured ramp with a yellow handrail, as a man speaks, stating that the ramp can hold three or four wheelchairs and that the vehicle is a 2001 model.\", \"The video shows the exterior of a white bus, focusing on its open side door and a deployed metal ramp with a yellow handrail. A man's voice describes the ramp as being able to hold up to three or four wheelchairs and points out a grab rail for entry, noting that the vehicle is a 2001 model.\", \"The video shows the metallic wheelchair lift of a public transit bus, which is being narrated by a man describing its capacity for three or four wheelchairs and pointing out the grab rail for entry.\", \"A close-up view shows the metal mesh steps and yellow handrail of a bus ramp. A male voice describes the interior, mentioning it can hold three or four wheelchairs and features grab rails, identifying the vehicle as a 2001 model.\"]", "time_sec": 53.716, "generation_time_seconds": 52.2911, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "120", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a woman  is speaking in front of a green screen, with people communicating in the background.", "pred": "The video shows a woman with long blonde hair and a face-tracking grid against a green screen, while an off-screen voice counts from zero to nine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a woman with long blonde hair and a face-tracking grid against a green screen, while an off-screen voice counts from zero to nine.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a woman with long blonde hair and a face-tracking grid against a green screen, while an off-screen voice counts from zero to nine.\", \"A woman with long brown hair and a red top is shown from the chest up against a solid green background.\\n Her face is covered in a blue mesh of tracking points.\\n She smiles and speaks, while the audio captures a person counting from zero to nine.\\n The word \\\"fiv\\\" appears in yellow text on the lower left and right sides of the screen.\", \"A woman with a face-tracking grid on her face smiles as she speaks, counting aloud from zero to nine.\", \"A woman with long brown hair and a red top is shown from the chest up against a green screen. A blue wireframe mesh outlines her face and neck, indicating facial tracking. The word 'fiv' appears in yellow text on the screen. In the background, a person can be heard counting from zero to nine.\"]", "time_sec": 49.66, "generation_time_seconds": 48.9575, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "121", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio-visual caption captures the essence of a lively event with music, male speech, and distant sizzling, featuring a collage of pictures of men wearing hats and sunglasses, celebrating in a crowd.", "pred": "The video begins with a static collage of people and graphics, then cuts to a man with long blonde hair, sunglasses, and a hat, who speaks directly to the camera while the audio features an announcer introducing the musical act \"Big Kenny Sound the System.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video begins with a static collage of people and graphics, then cuts to a man with long blonde hair, sunglasses, and a hat, who speaks directly to the camera while the audio features an announcer introducing the musical act \"Big Kenny Sound the System.\"", "cot": "[\"The video begins with a static collage of people and graphics, then cuts to a man with long blonde hair, sunglasses, and a hat, who speaks directly to the camera while the audio features an announcer introducing the musical act \\\"Big Kenny Sound the System.\\\"\", \"A man with long, curly hair, a black hat, and dark sunglasses, wearing a dark shirt and beaded necklaces, speaks directly to the camera. He is in a dark environment, possibly at night, with a yellow and red banner visible behind him to his left. The audio features a male voice introducing himself as \\\"Big Kenny\\\" from \\\"Sound the System,\\\" accompanied by a loud, upbeat rock music sting at the beginning.\", \"The audio begins with a male voice introducing \\\"Big Kenny\\\" and \\\"Sound the System,\\\" which is immediately followed by the start of upbeat rock music featuring a driving drum beat, a prominent bassline, and an electric guitar riff.\", \"A man wearing a hat and sunglasses speaks directly to the camera, introducing himself as \\\"Big Kenny\\\" from the band \\\"Alborosie\\\" and encouraging listeners to \\\"check it out,\\\" all while a driving, upbeat ska/reggae fusion track plays with prominent horns and a strong bassline.\"]", "time_sec": 57.737, "generation_time_seconds": 56.5265, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.51, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "122", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a horn blares as wind gusts through the trees, accompanying the rumble of a motor vehicle engine, while a yellow bus drives down a street lined with trees and parked vehicles.", "pred": "A yellow and red bus drives forward on a paved road, while a high-pitched, electronic melody plays continuously in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A yellow and red bus drives forward on a paved road, while a high-pitched, electronic melody plays continuously in the background.", "cot": "[\"A yellow and red bus drives forward on a paved road, while a high-pitched, electronic melody plays continuously in the background.\", \"A yellow and red bus is moving forward on a wet road, with a blue and yellow bus parked in the background, while a car horn honks and an engine idles.\", \"A yellow and red bus drives forward on a wet road, with other buses and motorcycles parked nearby, while the loud, high-pitched wail of an emergency vehicle siren is heard.\", \"A yellow and orange bus drives on a wet road next to a parking lot with other buses and motorcycles. A loud, high-pitched, and chaotic electronic melody, similar to music from a slot machine or arcade game, plays continuously in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 42.591, "generation_time_seconds": 41.4519, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "123", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The blaring siren of an emergency vehicle echoes through the street as a man's voice cuts through the parade of cars, trucks, and motorcycles passing by a crowd of onlookers.", "pred": "A white van, a red fire truck, and a white hearse drive down a street lined with spectators, accompanied by the loud wail of a siren.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white van, a red fire truck, and a white hearse drive down a street lined with spectators, accompanied by the loud wail of a siren.", "cot": "[\"A white van, a red fire truck, and a white hearse drive down a street lined with spectators, accompanied by the loud wail of a siren.\", \"A white van and a red fire truck with an extended ladder drive down a street lined with spectators, accompanied by a loud, high-pitched siren.\", \"A white van and a red fire truck with a ladder are driving down a street lined with spectators, accompanied by the sound of a siren.\", \"A procession moves down a city street, featuring a white van, a large red fire truck with a ladder, and two police officers on white scooters, while a loud, continuous siren from an emergency vehicle sounds in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 41.604, "generation_time_seconds": 40.1176, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "124", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The short loud vibration resonated through the room, illuminating the diamond accents on the antique earrings and white gold ring displayed against the blue backgrounds.", "pred": "The video displays a close-up of a 24V LED light bulb, and a loud, low-frequency buzzer sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a close-up of a 24V LED light bulb, and a loud, low-frequency buzzer sounds.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a close-up of a 24V LED light bulb, and a loud, low-frequency buzzer sounds.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a 24V LED bulb with Japanese text on a blue screen, followed by a shot of the back of a white truck with a red taillight, while the audio consists of a single, sustained, low-pitched electronic tone.\", \"The video displays a blue screen with white Japanese text, followed by a close-up of a clear, multi-bulb LED light bulb with a metallic base, and then a rear view of a white truck with a \\\"BACK\\\" sign on the tailgate and license plate \\\"88-24\\\", all while a continuous, low-pitched electronic tone is heard.\", \"The video displays a blue screen, followed by a close-up of a 24V LED bulb, and then shows the rear of a white truck with a US license plate, all while a low, continuous humming sound is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 50.959, "generation_time_seconds": 50.3882, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "125", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The cooing of pigeons echoes through a room filled with a bunch of  animals in a cage.", "pred": "A large group of pigeons, many with black and white feathers, are gathered together in a dimly lit, confined space such as a loft or cage, and the distinct sound of their cooing can be heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large group of pigeons, many with black and white feathers, are gathered together in a dimly lit, confined space such as a loft or cage, and the distinct sound of their cooing can be heard.", "cot": "[\"A large group of pigeons, many with black and white feathers, are gathered together in a dimly lit, confined space such as a loft or cage, and the distinct sound of their cooing can be heard.\", \"A large, dense flock of pigeons, many with white and black plumage, are gathered closely together in a dimly lit, enclosed space. The constant, overlapping cooing and soft fluttering of wings from the numerous birds dominate the audio, creating a sense of a crowded aviary.\", \"The video shows a group of pigeons, many with white and black feathers, gathered closely together. Their collective cooing forms a continuous, low-pitched, and rhythmic chorus, creating the ambient sound of a pigeon loft.\", \"The video shows a flock of various pigeons, including white, black, and brown ones, gathered closely together in an enclosed space. The accompanying audio consists of the continuous cooing and vocalizations of the birds, confirming their presence and activity.\"]", "time_sec": 50.434, "generation_time_seconds": 49.813, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "126", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a small bedroom with a bed and closet, a young girl in a pink dress stands while clattering and banging occur, as a strong breeze blows through the wind.", "pred": "A young girl in a pink outfit runs into the room and jumps onto a bed, causing a loud crash and the sound of splintering wood.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young girl in a pink outfit runs into the room and jumps onto a bed, causing a loud crash and the sound of splintering wood.", "cot": "[\"A young girl in a pink outfit runs into the room and jumps onto a bed, causing a loud crash and the sound of splintering wood.\", \"A young girl in a pink outfit runs from behind a bed towards a closet. The sound of her running feet on a hard floor is followed by a loud crash, as if something heavy fell and broke. The girl then runs back towards the bed, and a young child's voice says \\\"No!\\\"\", \"A young girl in pink pajamas runs into a room where a large object crashes loudly to the floor, causing the girl to scream in surprise.\", \"A young girl in pink pajamas runs into a bedroom, jumps onto a bed, and then falls off, accompanied by the sound of her shouting, a loud crash, and the subsequent sound of shuffling and movement.\"]", "time_sec": 44.078, "generation_time_seconds": 43.1707, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0008, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "127", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A loud, long explosion echoes through the night sky,  while the air force symbol and abstract backgrounds add a sense of power.", "pred": "The words \"HIGH DEFINITION\" appear in a glitchy, blue, fragmented style, followed by a loud, deep rumble and a sharp cracking sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The words \"HIGH DEFINITION\" appear in a glitchy, blue, fragmented style, followed by a loud, deep rumble and a sharp cracking sound.", "cot": "[\"The words \\\"HIGH DEFINITION\\\" appear in a glitchy, blue, fragmented style, followed by a loud, deep rumble and a sharp cracking sound.\", \"The text 'HIGH DEFINITION' is displayed in a glitching, metallic font on a black background, accompanied by a deep, resonant electronic drone that suddenly cuts to a loud, sharp explosion.\", \"First, the words \\\"HIGH DEFINITION\\\" appear in a digital, glitchy font on a black background. Then, a loud, low-frequency electronic hum is heard, immediately followed by a sharp attack and a long, reverberating decay of a metallic impact.\", \"The video displays a digital glitch effect where the text \\\"HIGH DEFINITION\\\" shatters into particles against a black background, synchronized with a low-frequency electronic pulse that culminates in a loud, sharp crackle.\"]", "time_sec": 44.359, "generation_time_seconds": 43.5273, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "128", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The church bells ring as a man stands on a balcony in front of a building with clock.", "pred": "A man in a green shirt and blue jeans stands on a balcony, ringing a massive, dark-colored bell. The bell produces a deep, resonant, and sustained tolling sound that reverberates through the air.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a green shirt and blue jeans stands on a balcony, ringing a massive, dark-colored bell. The bell produces a deep, resonant, and sustained tolling sound that reverberates through the air.", "cot": "[\"A man in a green shirt and blue jeans stands on a balcony, ringing a massive, dark-colored bell. The bell produces a deep, resonant, and sustained tolling sound that reverberates through the air.\", \"A person in a green shirt stands on a balcony and rings a large bell, which produces a series of loud, resonant, and rhythmic clangs.\", \"A man in a green shirt stands on a balcony with ornate metal railings, swinging a large wooden beam to strike a very large, dark bell. The bell is housed within a structure featuring tall, light-colored columns and a clear blue sky. The sound of the large bell ringing out, with a deep, resonant tone, is heard.\", \"A man in a green shirt stands on a balcony between large columns, striking a large bell that produces a sustained, low-pitched, metallic ringing sound.\"]", "time_sec": 46.276, "generation_time_seconds": 45.6856, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "129", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A racing vehicle speeds down a dirt road lined with a crowd of people, as a horn honks and wind blows into the microphone.", "pred": "The video shows a rally car driving on a paved track, followed by a scene of a large crowd of spectators gathered on a grassy hillside under white tents. The audio features the loud roar of a powerful engine accelerating, accompanied by the high-pitched squeal of tires losing traction on the pavement.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a rally car driving on a paved track, followed by a scene of a large crowd of spectators gathered on a grassy hillside under white tents. The audio features the loud roar of a powerful engine accelerating, accompanied by the high-pitched squeal of tires losing traction on the pavement.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a rally car driving on a paved track, followed by a scene of a large crowd of spectators gathered on a grassy hillside under white tents. The audio features the loud roar of a powerful engine accelerating, accompanied by the high-pitched squeal of tires losing traction on the pavement.\", \"A dark rally car with green accents drives aggressively on a paved road, kicking up dust, as a crowd watches under white tents, and the sound of its engine accelerating is followed by a loud, high-pitched tire screech.\", \"A crowd watches from a grassy hillside as a dark rally car with green wheels speeds along a paved road, its engine roaring and tires screeching, before a loud crack and shattering glass indicate an impact.\", \"The audio captures the high-pitched whine and engine roar of a rally car accelerating on a dirt track, while the video shows a crowd of spectators gathered on a grassy hillside beside a paved road.\"]", "time_sec": 49.755, "generation_time_seconds": 48.1762, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.26, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "130", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the man talks with a slide whistle sound, typing on a keyboard and mouse clicking, woodwind music plays in the background, a ship sails through the game with pirate ships in sight.", "pred": "In a pixelated pirate ship scene, a green dinosaur character is shown, accompanied by a UI menu and a status bar, while a person can be heard typing on a keyboard and speaking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "In a pixelated pirate ship scene, a green dinosaur character is shown, accompanied by a UI menu and a status bar, while a person can be heard typing on a keyboard and speaking.", "cot": "[\"In a pixelated pirate ship scene, a green dinosaur character is shown, accompanied by a UI menu and a status bar, while a person can be heard typing on a keyboard and speaking.\", \"The video displays a pixel-art pirate ship game interface with a green dinosaur-like creature on the rigging, a central menu box, and a top bar with icons, while the audio features a person saying \\\"stealth like\\\" and \\\"okay, attack, use adjective\\\" amidst keyboard typing sounds.\", \"The video shows a pixel-art pirate ship with a green dragon character, while the audio captures a person typing on a keyboard and saying, \\\"Okay, attack, use adjective.\\\"\", \"The video shows a pixelated ship with a green dragon, a red \\\"X\\\" icon, and a game menu, while the audio features a person saying \\\"stuff like\\\" and typing \\\"attack use adjective\\\" on a keyboard.\"]", "time_sec": 47.702, "generation_time_seconds": 46.0521, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.51, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "131", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The baby cries as a woman speaks, while a little girl in a pink dress sits on a red chair with a small child.", "pred": "A young child crawls on a carpeted floor, then a young girl in a pink dress lies on a pink couch holding a floral-patterned blanket, while a baby cries continuously in the background and an adult female voice speaks.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young child crawls on a carpeted floor, then a young girl in a pink dress lies on a pink couch holding a floral-patterned blanket, while a baby cries continuously in the background and an adult female voice speaks.", "cot": "[\"A young child crawls on a carpeted floor, then a young girl in a pink dress lies on a pink couch holding a floral-patterned blanket, while a baby cries continuously in the background and an adult female voice speaks.\", \"A young child crawls on a light-colored floor near a wooden chair, then a girl in a pink dress lies on a red couch opening a wrapped gift, while a baby cries in the foreground and a woman speaks.\", \"A baby crawls on a carpeted floor near a doorway, then a young child is seen sitting on a pink armchair holding a floral gift bag as a baby cries and an adult woman speaks in the background.\", \"A baby crawls on the floor near a wooden chair, followed by a young girl in a pink dress sitting on a couch and opening a floral gift bag, while a baby cries and a woman speaks.\"]", "time_sec": 46.24, "generation_time_seconds": 45.5088, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 38.89, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "132", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a woman speaks affectionately, a pig oinks  on the bed.", "pred": "A woman asks a pig what it is doing under the covers, and the pig grunts in response.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman asks a pig what it is doing under the covers, and the pig grunts in response.", "cot": "[\"A woman asks a pig what it is doing under the covers, and the pig grunts in response.\", \"A pig lies on a bed under a dark blanket, and a woman’s voice can be heard speaking to it.\", \"The video shows a small pig lying on its back in a dark room, with a female voice asking, \\\"What are you doing under there?\\\" followed by the pig making a grunting sound and the voice saying, \\\"Night night.\\\"\", \"The video shows a pink pig's face under a dark blanket, while a woman's voice is heard asking, \\\"What are you doing under there?\\\", followed by the sound of rustling fabric.\"]", "time_sec": 39.727, "generation_time_seconds": 38.9018, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "133", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black sports car speeds down a curvy road with the sound of humming and revving engine, accompanied by squealing tires.", "pred": "A black sports car drifts through a sweeping curve on a paved road, its tires screeching loudly, as an aggressive engine revs and accelerates.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black sports car drifts through a sweeping curve on a paved road, its tires screeching loudly, as an aggressive engine revs and accelerates.", "cot": "[\"A black sports car drifts through a sweeping curve on a paved road, its tires screeching loudly, as an aggressive engine revs and accelerates.\", \"I see a black car drifting around a paved corner on a track, with trees in the background. Simultaneously, I hear the loud, high-revving sound of a performance car engine and the squeal of tires on pavement.\", \"A black sports car drives around a paved curve on a sunny day, accompanied by the loud revving of its engine and the squealing of its tires.\", \"A black car performs donuts on an asphalt road, its tires screeching loudly as it spins in circles.\"]", "time_sec": 39.986, "generation_time_seconds": 39.007, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 40.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "134", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A child and a man engage in conversation as bird sounds fill the air, including a bird in a cage on the roof of a building and a broken cage on the roof of a building.", "pred": "Several pigeons are on a rooftop with a large wire cage and a brick chimney. The audio features a child speaking in Spanish, followed by a man speaking in Spanish.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Several pigeons are on a rooftop with a large wire cage and a brick chimney. The audio features a child speaking in Spanish, followed by a man speaking in Spanish.", "cot": "[\"Several pigeons are on a rooftop with a large wire cage and a brick chimney. The audio features a child speaking in Spanish, followed by a man speaking in Spanish.\", \"A flock of pigeons is on a rooftop; one flies away as a child cries and a man speaks in Spanish.\", \"The video shows multiple pigeons on and around a rooftop coop as one flies away, accompanied by the faint, high-pitched cry of a small child and the low-frequency hum of an engine in the background.\", \"I see several pigeons on a rooftop, with one flying and others perched on a white metal cage. Simultaneously, I hear a child's voice speaking in Spanish and a goat bleating in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 41.669, "generation_time_seconds": 40.4453, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.65, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "135", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man's voice narrates as he cuts wood with a knife on a wooden table, followed by the sound of paper shuffling.", "pred": "A person's hands use a square to mark a line on a piece of wood, then a saw cuts along the line, accompanied by a man's voice explaining the action.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands use a square to mark a line on a piece of wood, then a saw cuts along the line, accompanied by a man's voice explaining the action.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands use a square to mark a line on a piece of wood, then a saw cuts along the line, accompanied by a man's voice explaining the action.\", \"A person uses a hand saw to cut a piece of light-colored wood on a workbench, guided by a metal square, while a male voice speaks and the distinct sound of sanding is heard.\", \"A person's hands use a metal square to mark a piece of light-colored wood, followed by the sound of a saw cutting and a voice stating, \\\"We're going to cut the length.\\\"\", \"A person's hands use a large metal chisel to cut a piece of light-colored wood on a wooden surface, accompanied by the sound of sawing and the person saying, \\\"We're going to cut the length and then we're going to cut these.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 44.722, "generation_time_seconds": 43.9126, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "136", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the intense video game scene, clicks, gunshots, and breathing are heard as a woman navigates through a cave.", "pred": "A first-person video game view shows a character holding a shotgun in a dark tunnel, then switching to a rifle as multiple gunshots are fired and a male voice says, \"He's reloading.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A first-person video game view shows a character holding a shotgun in a dark tunnel, then switching to a rifle as multiple gunshots are fired and a male voice says, \"He's reloading.\"", "cot": "[\"A first-person video game view shows a character holding a shotgun in a dark tunnel, then switching to a rifle as multiple gunshots are fired and a male voice says, \\\"He's reloading.\\\"\", \"The player character moves through a dark, stone-walled area while holding a shotgun, as rapid gunfire and footsteps are heard, followed by a male voice stating, \\\"He's reloading.\\\".\", \"The first-person perspective shows a player holding a shotgun in a dark, stone-walled environment, as the sound of a shotgun being pumped, a male voice shouting, and a reloading sound effect are heard.\", \"The first-person perspective shows a player moving through a dark, stone-walled corridor in a video game, holding a shotgun that is fired multiple times, accompanied by the distinct metallic sounds of reloading, all while a male voice provides commentary.\"]", "time_sec": 44.362, "generation_time_seconds": 43.6856, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "137", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man stands on a train track , as steam billows out followed by knocking sounds.", "pred": "A man in a light-colored jacket and cap operates a lever on a black steam locomotive with the number 9851, as the rhythmic clatter of its wheels on the track is accompanied by a continuous hiss of escaping steam.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a light-colored jacket and cap operates a lever on a black steam locomotive with the number 9851, as the rhythmic clatter of its wheels on the track is accompanied by a continuous hiss of escaping steam.", "cot": "[\"A man in a light-colored jacket and cap operates a lever on a black steam locomotive with the number 9851, as the rhythmic clatter of its wheels on the track is accompanied by a continuous hiss of escaping steam.\", \"A man in a grey uniform stands beside a black steam locomotive with the number 985, while the sound of a train's steam whistle and chuffing engine are heard.\", \"A man in a grey uniform performs a maintenance task on a black steam locomotive, which emits loud hissing steam and clanking sounds.\", \"A man in a grey suit stands in front of a black steam train with the number 985 on the side, and the sound of the train's steam whistle is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 43.53, "generation_time_seconds": 42.0886, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "138", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a man talks, footsteps on dirt are heard amidst buzzing insects and chirping birds, while a beekeeper inspects a frame of bees inside a wooden beehive.", "pred": "A person's hands manipulate wooden beehive frames covered in bees, while the person speaks in Polish, saying \"To można wziąć\" (This can be taken).", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands manipulate wooden beehive frames covered in bees, while the person speaks in Polish, saying \"To można wziąć\" (This can be taken).", "cot": "[\"A person's hands manipulate wooden beehive frames covered in bees, while the person speaks in Polish, saying \\\"To można wziąć\\\" (This can be taken).\", \"A person's hands manipulate wooden frames within a beehive while a male voice speaks in Polish, followed by a sustained, low-pitched electronic tone.\", \"A person's hands are manipulating wooden frames covered in bees within a beehive, while a male voice speaks in Polish and a continuous buzzing sound from the insects is audible.\", \"A person's hands are shown manipulating wooden frames inside a beehive. Simultaneously, a man speaks in Polish, saying, \\\"to można wziąć\\\" (that can be taken), followed by a soft exhalation.\"]", "time_sec": 43.069, "generation_time_seconds": 41.4164, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.65, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "139", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Birds quack amidst passing traffic as they stand on the ground near a small garden with a bird bath and potted plants, while a black bird perches on a fence nearby.", "pred": "The video shows a black chicken in a garden and two Muscovy ducks on a paved surface, accompanied by the sound of a crow cawing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a black chicken in a garden and two Muscovy ducks on a paved surface, accompanied by the sound of a crow cawing.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a black chicken in a garden and two Muscovy ducks on a paved surface, accompanied by the sound of a crow cawing.\", \"The video shows a black chicken in a garden, followed by two Muscovy ducks on a paved area, while the audio captures their distinct duck quacking and the heavy, rhythmic breathing of a dog.\", \"The video displays black chickens, a black and white cat, and two dark-feathered ducks with red facial markings on a dirt and concrete surface, while the audio captures the distinct quacking of the ducks and the sound of a person breathing heavily.\", \"The video shows two Muscovy ducks on a concrete patio, while the audio captures the sound of a person breathing heavily, accompanied by faint background birdsong.\"]", "time_sec": 43.92, "generation_time_seconds": 41.938, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "140", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the serene setting of nature, a man speaks amidst the chirping of birds and the squeaking of a frog, as a green frog and a snake coexist in the dirt with rocks and plants nearby.", "pred": "A small, yellow and black patterned animal, possibly a snake, is partially buried in dark soil. A person speaks in Mandarin, saying the animal is angry because it was accidentally dug up, and the animal then hisses.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A small, yellow and black patterned animal, possibly a snake, is partially buried in dark soil. A person speaks in Mandarin, saying the animal is angry because it was accidentally dug up, and the animal then hisses.", "cot": "[\"A small, yellow and black patterned animal, possibly a snake, is partially buried in dark soil. A person speaks in Mandarin, saying the animal is angry because it was accidentally dug up, and the animal then hisses.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a frog partially submerged in dark soil, which then jumps out. A person speaks in Mandarin, saying, \\\"It's so angry. Be careful. I helped you dig it up. You're so angry.\\\"\", \"A yellow and black frog sits in dark soil, then suddenly jumps out, while a person speaks in Mandarin and a dog barks.\", \"A yellow and black patterned frog is half-buried in dark soil. A person speaks in Mandarin, saying, \\\"You're so angry. Be careful, I dug you up. You're so angry.\\\" The frog then lets out a loud, high-pitched croak.\"]", "time_sec": 46.643, "generation_time_seconds": 45.7173, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 4.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "141", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two men discuss while an insect buzzes by, wind blows, and birds chirp in the distance, as a person holding a pen  draws a map of the area.", "pred": "A hand holding a blue-tipped pen points at a topographic map with contour lines and grid coordinates, while two men discuss a geographical feature, one noting, \"because the leads can't be that wide,\" and planning a route with a \"channel coming up here.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand holding a blue-tipped pen points at a topographic map with contour lines and grid coordinates, while two men discuss a geographical feature, one noting, \"because the leads can't be that wide,\" and planning a route with a \"channel coming up here.\"", "cot": "[\"A hand holding a blue-tipped pen points at a topographic map with contour lines and grid coordinates, while two men discuss a geographical feature, one noting, \\\"because the leads can't be that wide,\\\" and planning a route with a \\\"channel coming up here.\\\"\", \"A hand holding a blue-tipped pen points to a topographical map with contour lines and grid references, while a person speaks in a conversational tone about an unseen landscape, mentioning \\\"leads\\\" and a \\\"channel\\\" that curves.\", \"A hand holding a blue pen points at a technical map, while two men discuss a lead and a channel, their conversation accompanied by the sound of a boat engine and the gentle lapping of water.\", \"A hand uses a blue pen to trace a dotted line on a topographical map while two men discuss the map's features, noting the presence of a lead and a channel.\"]", "time_sec": 45.889, "generation_time_seconds": 45.1569, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.27, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "142", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice narrates as a motorcycle accelerates down a narrow road with a blue car following behind.", "pred": "From a first-person perspective, a motorcyclist rides a narrow country road, passing a blue car, while a male voice comments on the vehicle's sudden acceleration.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "From a first-person perspective, a motorcyclist rides a narrow country road, passing a blue car, while a male voice comments on the vehicle's sudden acceleration.", "cot": "[\"From a first-person perspective, a motorcyclist rides a narrow country road, passing a blue car, while a male voice comments on the vehicle's sudden acceleration.\", \"From a first-person perspective, a rider on a motorcycle travels down a sun-dappled, tree-lined rural road, with a blue car visible ahead. The dominant sound is a loud, high-pitched engine, likely from the motorcycle, accompanied by a male voice speaking in a conversational tone.\", \"From a first-person perspective, a person rides a motorcycle down a paved, tree-lined road, following a blue car, and then a loud engine revs as a male voice exclaims that the vehicle suddenly turns into a sport bike.\", \"From a first-person perspective, a motorcycle is driven down a tree-lined road, following a blue car, while a man speaks over the loud sound of the motorcycle's engine.\"]", "time_sec": 46.652, "generation_time_seconds": 45.241, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 34.48, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "143", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A person on a boat catches a bass with a hook in its mouth, as water splashes, a duck quacks, and the person laughs.", "pred": "A person in a red and white boat holds a fishing rod, pulling a large, dark fish from the water. The fish flops on the surface, its mouth open, as the person prepares to unhook it. The sound of splashing water is heard, followed by the distinct quacking of a duck nearby.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a red and white boat holds a fishing rod, pulling a large, dark fish from the water. The fish flops on the surface, its mouth open, as the person prepares to unhook it. The sound of splashing water is heard, followed by the distinct quacking of a duck nearby.", "cot": "[\"A person in a red and white boat holds a fishing rod, pulling a large, dark fish from the water. The fish flops on the surface, its mouth open, as the person prepares to unhook it. The sound of splashing water is heard, followed by the distinct quacking of a duck nearby.\", \"A person in a boat holds a brown fish by its mouth, while the sound of a duck quacking is heard in the background.\", \"A person on a boat reels in a fish, which splashes in the water, while a duck quacks and a dog pants nearby.\", \"A person on a boat pulls a small fish from the water, and as they bring it close to the camera, a duck can be heard quacking in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 42.803, "generation_time_seconds": 41.4826, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.82, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.8, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "144", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A crowd of people cheers and applause to the dancers for dance performs on stage.", "pred": "A theatrical cast of ten performers stands in a line on a stage with a beige curtain behind them, facing a large audience whose hands are raised in applause, while the loud, sustained sound of that audience applauding fills the space.\n\\boxed{Ten performers stand in a line on a stage before a curtain as a large audience applauds loudly.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A theatrical cast of ten performers stands in a line on a stage with a beige curtain behind them, facing a large audience whose hands are raised in applause, while the loud, sustained sound of that audience applauding fills the space.\n\\boxed{Ten performers stand in a line on a stage before a curtain as a large audience applauds loudly.}", "cot": "[\"A theatrical cast of ten performers stands in a line on a stage with a beige curtain behind them, facing a large audience whose hands are raised in applause, while the loud, sustained sound of that audience applauding fills the space.\\n\\\\boxed{Ten performers stand in a line on a stage before a curtain as a large audience applauds loudly.}\", \"Ten performers in casual clothing are on a stage before a curtain, bowing to a large, appreciative audience that is clapping and cheering loudly.\", \"A group of young performers in casual clothing stands in a line on a stage with a beige curtain behind them, raising their arms to acknowledge a large, unseen audience that is audibly cheering and applauding.\", \"A group of dancers performs a synchronized routine on a stage in front of a large audience, as the crowd erupts in loud, sustained applause.\\n\\\\boxed{A group of dancers performs on stage before a large audience, who respond with loud, sustained applause.}\"]", "time_sec": 49.492, "generation_time_seconds": 48.4663, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "145", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the bathroom, a man with a beard is shaving on his face,while there is a sink  and water splashing sounds in the background.", "pred": "A young man with shaving cream on his face is shown in profile as he applies it with a brush; the sound of water running from a faucet into a sink is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young man with shaving cream on his face is shown in profile as he applies it with a brush; the sound of water running from a faucet into a sink is heard.", "cot": "[\"A young man with shaving cream on his face is shown in profile as he applies it with a brush; the sound of water running from a faucet into a sink is heard.\", \"A person with shaving cream on their face is shown, and the sound of a toilet flushing is heard.\", \"A man in a white t-shirt applies white shaving cream to his face with a brush, followed by the sound of a toilet flushing.\", \"A man with shaving cream on his face is seen wiping it off with a white towel, and the sound of a toilet flushing is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 36.106, "generation_time_seconds": 34.8077, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "146", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The hissing spray of a pressure washer cleans the roof as liquid patters on the surface, while a man works diligently atop the metal roof with a squeegee.", "pred": "A person is seen on a white tiled roof, holding a pressure washer wand that is actively spraying a high-pressure stream of water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person is seen on a white tiled roof, holding a pressure washer wand that is actively spraying a high-pressure stream of water.", "cot": "[\"A person is seen on a white tiled roof, holding a pressure washer wand that is actively spraying a high-pressure stream of water.\", \"A person is spraying a white, corrugated roof with a pressure washer, which produces a loud, high-pitched, sustained hissing sound.\", \"A person wearing shorts and socks stands on a white, corrugated tile roof under a blue sky with clouds, using a pressure washer to clean the tiles while the loud, high-frequency hiss of the spray is heard.\", \"A person on a white tiled roof uses a long-reach pressure washer, which produces a loud, high-pressure hissing sound as it sprays water across the tiles.\"]", "time_sec": 39.653, "generation_time_seconds": 38.9058, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "147", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The helicopter flies low over a field, its engine running idle as the wind blows heavily into the microphone.", "pred": "A large military-style helicopter with its main rotor blades spinning is seen on a dry, grassy field under a bright sky, while the loud, powerful sound of its engine and the rushing noise of displaced air are heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large military-style helicopter with its main rotor blades spinning is seen on a dry, grassy field under a bright sky, while the loud, powerful sound of its engine and the rushing noise of displaced air are heard.", "cot": "[\"A large military-style helicopter with its main rotor blades spinning is seen on a dry, grassy field under a bright sky, while the loud, powerful sound of its engine and the rushing noise of displaced air are heard.\", \"A large military helicopter is on a grassy field, with its main and tail rotors spinning, creating a loud, sustained roar of powerful wind and engine noise.\", \"A large, dark helicopter is silhouetted against a bright sky on a grassy field, its main rotor blades spinning rapidly.\\n Simultaneously, the loud, powerful sound of rushing wind and the deep thrum of the rotor blades dominate the audio.\\n This combination of visual and auditory information indicates that the helicopter's rotors are spinning at high speed.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A large helicopter's rotors spin rapidly on a grassy field, creating a powerful rushing wind and a deep thrumming sound.}\", \"A large military helicopter is stationary in a dry grass field under a clear sky, while the loud, powerful whirring of its main rotor blades dominates the audio.\"]", "time_sec": 51.367, "generation_time_seconds": 50.7389, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.51, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "148", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man speaks on a pier next to a body of water as waves splash in the background.", "pred": "A wooden pier extends into a calm body of water under a cloudy sky, while the sound of gentle waves lapping against the pilings is audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A wooden pier extends into a calm body of water under a cloudy sky, while the sound of gentle waves lapping against the pilings is audible.", "cot": "[\"A wooden pier extends into a calm body of water under a cloudy sky, while the sound of gentle waves lapping against the pilings is audible.\", \"The camera pans across a calm body of water next to a rocky shore under a cloudy sky, with a wooden dock visible on the left, while a man speaks and the sound of water lapping is heard.\", \"A low-angle, shaky camera pans from a rocky shoreline across a calm body of water towards a wooden pier, while a male voice states his location and the sound of water lapping against the dock is heard.\", \"The video shows a calm body of water next to a rocky shore and a wooden pier, while the audio features a man speaking and the sound of waves lapping against the dock.\"]", "time_sec": 41.814, "generation_time_seconds": 41.0359, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "149", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the man's voice blends with the sound of ocean waves trickling and splashing, the bow of a sailboat navigates through the open sea with the wind and waves.", "pred": "A sailboat moves across choppy water with a mountain in the background under a cloudy sky, while a person speaks over the loud sound of wind.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A sailboat moves across choppy water with a mountain in the background under a cloudy sky, while a person speaks over the loud sound of wind.", "cot": "[\"A sailboat moves across choppy water with a mountain in the background under a cloudy sky, while a person speaks over the loud sound of wind.\", \"A white sailboat with a furled sail and coiled ropes moves through dark, choppy water. The speaker says they need to figure out how to muffle something as the loud, constant sound of wind blows into the microphone.\", \"A white sailboat moves through choppy, sun-dappled water with mountains in the background, while a person speaks and strong wind blows into the microphone.\", \"A white sailboat's bow cuts through choppy, sun-dappled water, its sails and rigging visible as it sails past a distant, hazy landmass under a cloudy sky, while a person speaks over the loud, rushing sound of wind.\"]", "time_sec": 44.264, "generation_time_seconds": 43.3772, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "150", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bathroom with a white urinal and a black drain, a man's voice is muffled by the camera as water gurgles in the drain, followed by the sound of a toilet flushing.", "pred": "A hand presses a white button on a green wall, which triggers the sound of a toilet flushing and water splashing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand presses a white button on a green wall, which triggers the sound of a toilet flushing and water splashing.", "cot": "[\"A hand presses a white button on a green wall, which triggers the sound of a toilet flushing and water splashing.\", \"The video shows a first-person view of a hand pressing a button on a white flush tank next to a squat toilet, followed by the sound of the toilet lid closing and a very loud, powerful flushing noise.\", \"A white squat toilet is shown on a tiled floor. The toilet is flushed, and the sound of a powerful, gurgling flush is heard as the water level rapidly drops.\", \"A hand pulls a lever on a wall-mounted toilet flusher, followed by the sound of the toilet being flushed.\"]", "time_sec": 38.024, "generation_time_seconds": 37.0976, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 35.71, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "151", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling city, a man in a suit and tie walks down a train as a woman gazes out the window, while a group of people chat amidst the sound of a crying infant and a muffled bus engine.", "pred": "A baby's persistent crying is heard over the indistinct murmur of background conversation.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A baby's persistent crying is heard over the indistinct murmur of background conversation.", "cot": "[\"A baby's persistent crying is heard over the indistinct murmur of background conversation.\", \"The audio contains a baby crying, while the visual shows a person wearing a dark-colored shirt with a zipper.\", \"A person wearing a dark grey sweatshirt with a silver zipper is seen on a bus, while a baby cries in the background and a woman speaks.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a dark blue fabric with a silver zipper pull, while the audio captures the distinct bleating of a goat amidst indistinct human speech.\"]", "time_sec": 34.892, "generation_time_seconds": 34.0019, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.45, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "152", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of metal clacking sharply as water drains down a pipe is accompanied by the visual of a white urinal with a red hole in the drain.", "pred": "The video captures the inside of a bathtub where a red drain stopper is being removed, followed by the sound of a large volume of water draining and splashing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video captures the inside of a bathtub where a red drain stopper is being removed, followed by the sound of a large volume of water draining and splashing.", "cot": "[\"The video captures the inside of a bathtub where a red drain stopper is being removed, followed by the sound of a large volume of water draining and splashing.\", \"The video displays a white bathtub containing murky, greenish water. The water is in a state of turbulence, swirling around the central drain. The sound of a toilet flushing is heard.\", \"A red drain plug is pulled from a bathtub drain, causing the water to drain away and creating a swirling vortex, which is accompanied by the loud, gurgling sound of the water being evacuated.\", \"A red bathtub drain stopper is in place. A toilet is flushed, and water then runs, presumably from a sink.\"]", "time_sec": 38.811, "generation_time_seconds": 38.328, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "153", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The engine vibrates as a man speaks while looking under the hood at the exposed engine of a car.", "pred": "The video shows a close-up of a car engine with a blue wire and a black plastic cover, while the audio captures the loud, continuous revving of the engine before it abruptly stops.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of a car engine with a blue wire and a black plastic cover, while the audio captures the loud, continuous revving of the engine before it abruptly stops.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a close-up of a car engine with a blue wire and a black plastic cover, while the audio captures the loud, continuous revving of the engine before it abruptly stops.\", \"A close-up view of a car engine bay with a blue distributor cap and wires is shown, while the sound of a loud, sputtering engine starting and then idling is heard.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a car engine, which is then started and idles, while the audio captures the engine's startup and the sound of a person speaking in Korean.\", \"The video displays a close-up of a car engine's internal components, such as the valve cover, spark plug wires, and a fuse box, while the audio captures the sound of the engine starting and then idling.\"]", "time_sec": 44.219, "generation_time_seconds": 43.0107, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "154", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio whooshes as a woman speaks, followed by digital beeps and men talking, while a person stands on a boat in the ocean next to a logo for a technology company.", "pred": "The video shows a man in a store with a headset, then cuts to water sports, while the audio features a jingle, a male voice saying \"BB Talkin' Intercom connected,\" and a conversation between two men.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a man in a store with a headset, then cuts to water sports, while the audio features a jingle, a male voice saying \"BB Talkin' Intercom connected,\" and a conversation between two men.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a man in a store with a headset, then cuts to water sports, while the audio features a jingle, a male voice saying \\\"BB Talkin' Intercom connected,\\\" and a conversation between two men.\", \"The video opens with a logo and then shows an outdoor scene featuring a man in a white tank top with a headset, while a car engine starts and a male voice says, \\\"Let's talk BB talking.\\\"\", \"The video opens on a black screen with a white and blue 'Bb Talkin' logo. This transitions to a shot of a man in a white t-shirt standing behind a counter with two mannequin heads and walkie-talkies. Over this, a voice says, \\\"Let's talk BB Talkin'.\\\"\", \"The video opens with a pixelated Bluetooth logo, then cuts to a man in a store with a 'Bb TALKIN' sign. A voice announces 'Bb Talkin' intercom connected,' followed by a man saying, 'Let's talk Bb Talkin'.\"]", "time_sec": 52.252, "generation_time_seconds": 51.396, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.26, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "155", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man with a tattoo on his arm stirs a pan of sizzling green peppers and onions on the stove, creating a symphony of banging and cracking sounds.", "pred": "A person stirs chopped green bell peppers in a black cast-iron skillet on a white electric stove. The person's tattooed arm is visible as they move the wooden spoon. A male voice speaks, stating, \"you have to season your vegetables,\" and announces he will add \"some black pepper.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person stirs chopped green bell peppers in a black cast-iron skillet on a white electric stove. The person's tattooed arm is visible as they move the wooden spoon. A male voice speaks, stating, \"you have to season your vegetables,\" and announces he will add \"some black pepper.\"", "cot": "[\"A person stirs chopped green bell peppers in a black cast-iron skillet on a white electric stove. The person's tattooed arm is visible as they move the wooden spoon. A male voice speaks, stating, \\\"you have to season your vegetables,\\\" and announces he will add \\\"some black pepper.\\\"\", \"A person uses a wooden spoon to stir chopped green vegetables in a black skillet on a white electric stove. A tattooed arm reaches into the frame from the right as a man speaks, saying, \\\"with anything else, you have to season your vegetables. So I'm going to take some black pepper...\\\"\", \"A person with a tattooed arm uses a wooden spoon to stir chopped green bell peppers in a black cast-iron skillet, while a male speaker states the vegetables must be seasoned and he is about to add black pepper.\", \"A person stirs chopped green vegetables in a black cast-iron skillet on a white electric stove with a wooden spoon while speaking about seasoning them with black pepper.\"]", "time_sec": 49.696, "generation_time_seconds": 48.602, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.23, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "156", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice echoes as race cars speed and the engine humming sound through turns on the track.", "pred": "A black and blue stock car with the number 72 races on a dirt track, viewed through a chain-link fence, while the prominent sound of its high-performance engine accelerating fills the air.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black and blue stock car with the number 72 races on a dirt track, viewed through a chain-link fence, while the prominent sound of its high-performance engine accelerating fills the air.", "cot": "[\"A black and blue stock car with the number 72 races on a dirt track, viewed through a chain-link fence, while the prominent sound of its high-performance engine accelerating fills the air.\", \"A dark blue and black stock car with the number '72' on its side races on a dirt track, kicking up dust, while the loud, high-pitched roar of its engine dominates the soundscape.\", \"A dark-colored race car with the number '32' is seen driving on a dirt track, kicking up dust, while the loud, high-pitched roar of its engine is heard.\", \"A dark-colored race car with the number 72 on its side is driving on a dirt track.\\nThe sound of its engine is loud and high-pitched, characteristic of a race car accelerating.\\nThe car is moving at high speed, creating a dust trail behind it.\\n\\\\boxed{A race car with the number 72 speeds around a dirt track, its engine roaring loudly.}\"]", "time_sec": 50.897, "generation_time_seconds": 49.413, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "157", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man laughing while making a cloud of smoke on a table, as a man on a surfboard in a pool of water bottle with a table and chairs on the floor talks.", "pred": "A person kneels on a dark floor and throws a white, smoky object that erupts into a large cloud, accompanied by a loud bang, glass shattering, and a man laughing and saying \"Okay.\".", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person kneels on a dark floor and throws a white, smoky object that erupts into a large cloud, accompanied by a loud bang, glass shattering, and a man laughing and saying \"Okay.\".", "cot": "[\"A person kneels on a dark floor and throws a white, smoky object that erupts into a large cloud, accompanied by a loud bang, glass shattering, and a man laughing and saying \\\"Okay.\\\".\", \"A man kneels on a blue floor holding a white cup. He pours a substance into the cup, which reacts violently, producing a large plume of white smoke that rapidly expands. Simultaneously, a loud, explosive *pop* is heard, followed by a man laughing and saying, \\\"Okay.\\\"\", \"A person on a blue floor drops a white container, which instantly erupts into a large cloud of white powder. Simultaneously, a loud, sharp crack occurs, followed by a high-pitched whine and a person laughing.\", \"A person in a grey shirt kneels on a blue floor and drops a white bottle, which explodes with a loud bang and emits a large cloud of white smoke, after which a man laughs and speaks.\"]", "time_sec": 48.435, "generation_time_seconds": 47.9622, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "158", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a white tiled room, a small motor buzzes as a man speaks while a metal door closes, resembling a microwave oven.", "pred": "The video shows a close-up of a General Electric appliance's model and serial number label, followed by a shot of a stainless steel microwave oven with a digital keypad and blue illuminated buttons. A person's voice is heard saying, \"And see, I'll close this. Now it works actually,\" as the sound of a refrigerator door closing is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of a General Electric appliance's model and serial number label, followed by a shot of a stainless steel microwave oven with a digital keypad and blue illuminated buttons. A person's voice is heard saying, \"And see, I'll close this. Now it works actually,\" as the sound of a refrigerator door closing is heard.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a close-up of a General Electric appliance's model and serial number label, followed by a shot of a stainless steel microwave oven with a digital keypad and blue illuminated buttons. A person's voice is heard saying, \\\"And see, I'll close this. Now it works actually,\\\" as the sound of a refrigerator door closing is heard.\", \"A close-up of a General Electric microwave's model and serial number plate is shown. The camera then pans right to show the stainless steel exterior and control panel. A male voice speaks, stating, \\\"And, let's see, I'll close this. Now, it works, actually,\\\" as a mechanical click sound is heard, likely from a door closing.\", \"The inside of a microwave is shown, followed by a view of its black control panel with illuminated blue buttons, while a man speaks and a buzzer sounds.\", \"A close-up reveals a General Electric appliance's label, followed by a hand closing the door of a stainless steel microwave oven. A man speaks, saying, \\\"And see, I close this. Now, it works actually,\\\" as the appliance emits a continuous, high-pitched electronic tone.\"]", "time_sec": 55.631, "generation_time_seconds": 54.7665, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "159", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a building, a man stands in front of a large TV as a crowd of people laughs, applause, and claps in response to his speech.", "pred": "A man in a suit speaks on a stage, prompting laughter from a female audience member and loud, sustained audience laughter and applause.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a suit speaks on a stage, prompting laughter from a female audience member and loud, sustained audience laughter and applause.", "cot": "[\"A man in a suit speaks on a stage, prompting laughter from a female audience member and loud, sustained audience laughter and applause.\", \"The audience is laughing and applauding as a man in a suit stands on a stage in front of a screen.\", \"A man in a suit speaks on a stage, causing a large audience to react with loud, sustained laughter and applause, while a screen behind him displays a car and the words \\\"vitamin club\\\" and \\\"shantv.com\\\".\", \"A man in a suit speaks on a stage, prompting laughter from a live audience.\"]", "time_sec": 35.998, "generation_time_seconds": 35.3825, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "160", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The little girl is peacefully sleeping on the couch , while the sound of snoring fills the room.", "pred": "The video shows a young child with blonde hair sleeping, while the audio captures the distinct, rhythmic sound of their snoring.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a young child with blonde hair sleeping, while the audio captures the distinct, rhythmic sound of their snoring.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a young child with blonde hair sleeping, while the audio captures the distinct, rhythmic sound of their snoring.\", \"A young child with blonde hair sleeps peacefully, their face illuminated by dim light, while a loud, rhythmic snoring sound is heard.\", \"A young child with blonde hair sleeps with their eyes closed, wearing a dark zip-up hooded garment, while loud, wet snoring is heard in the background.\", \"A young child with blonde hair sleeps peacefully on a dark brown surface, while loud, deep, rhythmic snoring is heard in the audio.\"]", "time_sec": 36.55, "generation_time_seconds": 35.9094, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "161", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The  woman stood in front of the black and white mural, surrounded by paintings of skulls, skeletons, and a fox, as they heard the sound of spraying and hissing with light vibrations..", "pred": "A person in a black shirt sprays orange paint onto a large black canvas featuring a white skull and a silver skull outline. The continuous, high-pitched buzzing sound is characteristic of a power tool, likely a saw or grinder, in operation.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a black shirt sprays orange paint onto a large black canvas featuring a white skull and a silver skull outline. The continuous, high-pitched buzzing sound is characteristic of a power tool, likely a saw or grinder, in operation.", "cot": "[\"A person in a black shirt sprays orange paint onto a large black canvas featuring a white skull and a silver skull outline. The continuous, high-pitched buzzing sound is characteristic of a power tool, likely a saw or grinder, in operation.\", \"A person applies stencils to a large canvas featuring a Punisher skull and a skeleton while a power tool motor runs continuously and a high-pitched whine persists.\", \"A woman in a black t-shirt is spray painting a large black canvas, creating a Punisher skull logo, while a high-pitched, continuous mechanical whine is audible in the background.\", \"A woman in a black shirt sprays orange paint onto a large canvas featuring a Punisher skull, with the continuous hissing sound of spray paint being applied.\"]", "time_sec": 42.209, "generation_time_seconds": 41.6543, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "162", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The rhythmic tick-tock of a large clock with visible gears accompanies a man hanging a black and white clock on the wall in his house.", "pred": "The video displays a black, ornate wall clock with a visible internal gear mechanism and a pendulum swinging below it. This visual is accompanied by the continuous, rhythmic ticking sound of a mechanical clock.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a black, ornate wall clock with a visible internal gear mechanism and a pendulum swinging below it. This visual is accompanied by the continuous, rhythmic ticking sound of a mechanical clock.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a black, ornate wall clock with a visible internal gear mechanism and a pendulum swinging below it. This visual is accompanied by the continuous, rhythmic ticking sound of a mechanical clock.\", \"A large, black, ornate clock with Roman numerals hangs on a beige wall. The clock has a visible pendulum swinging back and forth and intricate gears inside its face. A person is walking in the background, their footsteps audible on the hard floor.\", \"A large, black, ornate wall clock with exposed gears hangs on a beige wall. Its pendulum swings back and forth. A person walks nearby, their footsteps audible.\", \"The video shows a large, black, ornate clock with Roman numerals hanging on a wall, its pendulum swinging and its minute hand moving forward. The accompanying audio consists of a continuous, low-pitched, rhythmic mechanical clicking sound, like a large clock's internal gears or a metronome.\"]", "time_sec": 48.8, "generation_time_seconds": 47.9418, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "163", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a man in a cap looks at the camera and makes a funny face and  speaking ,whistling sound.", "pred": "A man wearing a black baseball cap and a light-colored shirt speaks to the camera in a room with white ceiling beams, followed by a series of loud, high-pitched squeaking sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man wearing a black baseball cap and a light-colored shirt speaks to the camera in a room with white ceiling beams, followed by a series of loud, high-pitched squeaking sounds.", "cot": "[\"A man wearing a black baseball cap and a light-colored shirt speaks to the camera in a room with white ceiling beams, followed by a series of loud, high-pitched squeaking sounds.\", \"A man wearing a black baseball cap and a white shirt speaks directly to the camera in an indoor setting, followed by a sequence of loud, high-pitched, electronic beeping sounds.\", \"A man in a black baseball cap and white shirt speaks to the camera, followed by a series of loud, high-pitched, descending whistling sounds.\", \"A man wearing a black baseball cap and a white shirt speaks directly to the camera, followed by the distinct sound of a slide whistle.\"]", "time_sec": 39.57, "generation_time_seconds": 39.025, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "164", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the man talks, a swarm of insects buzz around him.", "pred": "The audio features a male voice speaking in Russian, stating that the device has been turned on, accompanied by the continuous hum of an electric motor or generator. Simultaneously, the video displays a blue screen with the yellow text \"Operation 'Zero Hornet'\", followed by a person in a green shirt crouching on dirt ground and using a circular net to catch a large, orange insect.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features a male voice speaking in Russian, stating that the device has been turned on, accompanied by the continuous hum of an electric motor or generator. Simultaneously, the video displays a blue screen with the yellow text \"Operation 'Zero Hornet'\", followed by a person in a green shirt crouching on dirt ground and using a circular net to catch a large, orange insect.", "cot": "[\"The audio features a male voice speaking in Russian, stating that the device has been turned on, accompanied by the continuous hum of an electric motor or generator. Simultaneously, the video displays a blue screen with the yellow text \\\"Operation 'Zero Hornet'\\\", followed by a person in a green shirt crouching on dirt ground and using a circular net to catch a large, orange insect.\", \"The video opens with a title card for \\\"Operation 'Zero Hornet'\\\" on a blue background. The scene then cuts to a man in a green shirt and blue jeans crouched on a dirt ground, manipulating an orange object inside a white circular frame. This visual is accompanied by the clear, distinct buzzing sound of a hornet or similar large bee.\", \"The video opens with a title card displaying the text \\\"Operation Zero Hornet\\\" on a blue background, followed by a scene of a person in a green shirt and blue jeans crouching on a dirt surface and handling a reddish-orange object inside a white, circular net. In the background, the sound of a vehicle engine idling and a male voice speaking in Russian can be heard.\", \"A title card displays \\\"Operation \\\"Zero Hornet\\\"\\\" in yellow text on a blue background. This is immediately followed by a scene showing a person in a green shirt and blue jeans kneeling on brown dirt and placing an orange object into a white net. Throughout the video, a continuous buzzing sound, characteristic of insects, is audible.\"]", "time_sec": 64.666, "generation_time_seconds": 64.1041, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "165", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of knocking followed by a machine sawing accompanies a man using a saw to cut a wooden board on a work bench.", "pred": "A person operates a table saw, cutting a piece of wood with a loud, high-pitched whirring sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person operates a table saw, cutting a piece of wood with a loud, high-pitched whirring sound.", "cot": "[\"A person operates a table saw, cutting a piece of wood with a loud, high-pitched whirring sound.\", \"A person pushes a rectangular piece of light-colored wood across a metal table saw, which then emits a loud, high-pitched whirring sound as it cuts the wood.\", \"A person operates a table saw, cutting a piece of light-colored wood; the high-pitched whine of the blade is audible as it passes through the material.\", \"A person operates a table saw in a cluttered workshop, cutting a piece of wood which produces a loud, high-pitched, continuous whirring sound.\"]", "time_sec": 38.363, "generation_time_seconds": 36.8007, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "166", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the kitchen, a woman fries food while talking, standing next to a white refrigerator.", "pred": "A person with dreadlocks, wearing a white top, is in a kitchen with peach-colored cabinets and a white refrigerator, stirring something in a pan on the stove, while the sound of sizzling food and a person speaking can be heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person with dreadlocks, wearing a white top, is in a kitchen with peach-colored cabinets and a white refrigerator, stirring something in a pan on the stove, while the sound of sizzling food and a person speaking can be heard.", "cot": "[\"A person with dreadlocks, wearing a white top, is in a kitchen with peach-colored cabinets and a white refrigerator, stirring something in a pan on the stove, while the sound of sizzling food and a person speaking can be heard.\", \"A woman stands in a kitchen, stirring food in a pan on the stove as a sizzling sound is heard, and she then speaks about adding oil to prevent sticking.\", \"A woman with dreadlocks stands in a kitchen, stirring food in a pan on the stove while speaking. The sound of sizzling food is audible as she gives instructions.\", \"A woman with dreadlocks stands in a kitchen, stirring food in a frying pan on a stove. The sound of sizzling food and clattering cookware is heard as she speaks.\"]", "time_sec": 43.021, "generation_time_seconds": 42.0986, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "167", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man speaks as a stream of water trickles in the background, while a young man rides a boat with a camera on board.", "pred": "A man is sitting on the back of a boat with an outboard motor, while a male voice describes the boat's \"Briggs & Stratton five horsepower four-stroke outboard motor.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man is sitting on the back of a boat with an outboard motor, while a male voice describes the boat's \"Briggs & Stratton five horsepower four-stroke outboard motor.\"", "cot": "[\"A man is sitting on the back of a boat with an outboard motor, while a male voice describes the boat's \\\"Briggs & Stratton five horsepower four-stroke outboard motor.\\\"\", \"A man wearing a white t-shirt and camouflage shorts sits on a light-colored boat. He is next to a black outboard motor in a wooded area with palm trees. A male voice describes the motor as a \\\"Briggs & Stratton five horsepower four-stroke outboard motor.\\\"\", \"A man sits on the back of a light-colored boat in a wooded area, touching the side while a male voice narrates that the boat is equipped with a Briggs and Stratton 5 horsepower outboard motor.\", \"A man sits on the back of a boat, touching its outboard motor as he describes it as a \\\"Brixton Stratton five horsepower four-stroke outboard motor\\\" amidst the sound of a buzzing insect.\"]", "time_sec": 47.811, "generation_time_seconds": 46.7265, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "168", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of rushing water fills the room, as a  wooden shelf surrounded by books and a clock on the wall.", "pred": "The camera moves past a wooden staircase and into a living room with a large entertainment center, all while the sound of a toilet flushing is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The camera moves past a wooden staircase and into a living room with a large entertainment center, all while the sound of a toilet flushing is heard.", "cot": "[\"The camera moves past a wooden staircase and into a living room with a large entertainment center, all while the sound of a toilet flushing is heard.\", \"The audio features the sound of water being poured, which is inconsistent with the visual of a person in a room with a fireplace and a television.\", \"The video shows an indoor room with wooden furniture and a staircase railing. Concurrently, the audio captures the sound of a toilet flushing.\", \"A person's left hand turns a silver faucet knob, causing water to flow from the tap into a sink.\"]", "time_sec": 34.664, "generation_time_seconds": 34.1053, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "169", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The car engine idles before revving loudly, as a young woman with blue hair stands next to a man with a dog on his head.", "pred": "The video displays a close-up of a car's engine bay, while the audio consists of a sustained, high-pitched electronic tone that is abruptly interrupted by a loud engine revving sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a close-up of a car's engine bay, while the audio consists of a sustained, high-pitched electronic tone that is abruptly interrupted by a loud engine revving sound.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a close-up of a car's engine bay, while the audio consists of a sustained, high-pitched electronic tone that is abruptly interrupted by a loud engine revving sound.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a black car engine with a yellow oil cap, accompanied by the sounds of a car's engine starting and revving loudly.\", \"The video displays the internal components of a car engine bay, while the audio features the distinct sound of a car engine being started and subsequently revved aggressively.\", \"The video displays a close-up of a car engine bay. A high-pitched whine is audible, followed by the sound of the engine being started and revved.\"]", "time_sec": 39.592, "generation_time_seconds": 38.9504, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "170", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A man speaks over an intercom as a muffled helicopter engine roars, followed by gunshots firing in a video game displayed on a laptop screen.", "pred": "The image shows a cockpit's digital displays with a tactical map, while the audio features a male voice reporting an AA threat and a neutralization, all underscored by loud, echoing explosions.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The image shows a cockpit's digital displays with a tactical map, while the audio features a male voice reporting an AA threat and a neutralization, all underscored by loud, echoing explosions.", "cot": "[\"The image shows a cockpit's digital displays with a tactical map, while the audio features a male voice reporting an AA threat and a neutralization, all underscored by loud, echoing explosions.\", \"Inside a dark military vehicle, a laptop displays a real-time tactical map with active icons, while a radio crackles with urgent English commands like \\\"AA west of your location\\\" and \\\"objective alpha has just been neutralized,\\\" accompanied by the sound of distant explosions.\", \"The video shows a cockpit computer screen displaying a tactical map with blue friendly icons and orange enemy icons moving through a forested area, while an audio feed reports \\\"AA West of your location\\\" followed by explosions and a voice stating, \\\"Objective Papa has just been neutralized.\\\"\", \"The video shows a first-person view from inside a military vehicle at night, with a laptop displaying a tactical map and a person speaking, while the audio captures a male voice giving an update about a neutralized objective amidst the sounds of gunfire and explosions.\"]", "time_sec": 50.532, "generation_time_seconds": 49.1316, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0008, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "171", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man wearing a blue glove washes dishes in a kitchen sink with running water as he talks to an elderly woman, accompanied by the sound of plastic clacks and water running down a drain.", "pred": "A person wearing a blue glove holds a yellow hose over a sink while two people talk, and then the sound of rushing water begins.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing a blue glove holds a yellow hose over a sink while two people talk, and then the sound of rushing water begins.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing a blue glove holds a yellow hose over a sink while two people talk, and then the sound of rushing water begins.\", \"A person wearing blue gloves holds a yellow hose over a kitchen sink, then turns on the faucet, causing water to spray from the hose into the sink while a man and a woman talk.\", \"A person wearing a blue glove turns on a faucet, causing a stream of yellowish liquid to flow into a sink, while two people speak and a toilet flushes.\", \"A person wearing a blue glove uses a yellow hose to spray a metal sink in a kitchen, while two people can be heard talking in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 38.455, "generation_time_seconds": 37.5243, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.58, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "172", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The microwave oven hums loudly as an adult male and a child chat, while a sudden beep interrupts the conversation, with a TV playing in the background.", "pred": "The video shows a black microwave oven with its door closed, which is turned on as indicated by the illuminated interior light and the active digital clock display on the right. Inside the microwave, a colorful, abstract pattern is visible on the glass door. The accompanying audio consists of a person speaking, who describes a \"cranking noise\" and says, \"Hi,\" while referencing having \"taken the parts out.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a black microwave oven with its door closed, which is turned on as indicated by the illuminated interior light and the active digital clock display on the right. Inside the microwave, a colorful, abstract pattern is visible on the glass door. The accompanying audio consists of a person speaking, who describes a \"cranking noise\" and says, \"Hi,\" while referencing having \"taken the parts out.\"", "cot": "[\"The video shows a black microwave oven with its door closed, which is turned on as indicated by the illuminated interior light and the active digital clock display on the right. Inside the microwave, a colorful, abstract pattern is visible on the glass door. The accompanying audio consists of a person speaking, who describes a \\\"cranking noise\\\" and says, \\\"Hi,\\\" while referencing having \\\"taken the parts out.\\\"\", \"A person's reflection is visible on the glass door of a black microwave oven that is running. Inside the microwave, a microwave-safe bowl containing what appears to be popcorn kernels is being heated. The bowl is rotating on the turntable, and a digital timer is counting down from 1:00. In the background, a person is speaking, saying, \\\"cranking noises. Hi. Cranking. See, you know, I've taken the parts out.\\\"\", \"The audio contains mechanical cranking noises, a male voice explaining that he has \\\"taken the parts out,\\\" and a female voice saying \\\"hi.\\\" The visual shows the inside of a microwave oven with a rotating turntable holding a red object, while the microwave door is closed and the digital display is illuminated.\", \"A black microwave oven with a digital display is shown, and the sound of a machine cranking is heard, followed by a male voice saying \\\"cranking noises\\\" and \\\"you know, I've taken the parts out,\\\" and a female voice saying \\\"Hi.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 64.629, "generation_time_seconds": 63.4145, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.02, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "173", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The cordless drill with a battery in it is being used to work on something, creating vibrations and humming as it starts and stops several times.", "pred": "A teal and black Makita cordless drill is held in a hand, and the audio consists of the sound of it being used to drill into a surface.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A teal and black Makita cordless drill is held in a hand, and the audio consists of the sound of it being used to drill into a surface.", "cot": "[\"A teal and black Makita cordless drill is held in a hand, and the audio consists of the sound of it being used to drill into a surface.\", \"The video shows a person holding a teal and black cordless drill, and the audio consists of the distinct whirring sound of a power tool being operated.\", \"A person holds a teal and black Makita power drill, and the audio consists of the drill's motor whirring as it is operated, followed by a series of loud, rapid beeps.\", \"A person holds a blue and black power drill, which is then shown from multiple angles, while the sound of the drill operating is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 40.271, "generation_time_seconds": 38.784, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.59, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "174", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a serene farm setting, a man's voice is heard speaking as goats and a cow make their sounds, while a little white lamb  stand near a wooden fence in the grass.", "pred": "A white lamb stands near a wooden fence in a dirt pen, and a person speaks in Japanese while a goat bleats nearby.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white lamb stands near a wooden fence in a dirt pen, and a person speaks in Japanese while a goat bleats nearby.", "cot": "[\"A white lamb stands near a wooden fence in a dirt pen, and a person speaks in Japanese while a goat bleats nearby.\", \"A small white goat walks through a grassy pen next to a wooden fence, and a person speaks in Japanese before a goat bleats.\", \"A small, white goat stands in a dirt pen next to a wooden fence, while a person speaks in Japanese and the goat bleats.\", \"A small white goat stands near a wooden fence, and a person speaks in Japanese before the goat bleats.\"]", "time_sec": 35.453, "generation_time_seconds": 33.7919, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "175", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a city parking lot, several fire trucks are parked next to a building as men speak in the distance while whistling and humming.", "pred": "The scene shows a fire station yard with multiple red fire trucks and personnel, while the audio captures the loud, sustained hiss of a pneumatic air brake system, characteristic of a large vehicle like a fire truck or bus.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The scene shows a fire station yard with multiple red fire trucks and personnel, while the audio captures the loud, sustained hiss of a pneumatic air brake system, characteristic of a large vehicle like a fire truck or bus.", "cot": "[\"The scene shows a fire station yard with multiple red fire trucks and personnel, while the audio captures the loud, sustained hiss of a pneumatic air brake system, characteristic of a large vehicle like a fire truck or bus.\", \"The scene is a fire station yard with multiple red fire trucks parked. A man is walking across the asphalt. A loud, sustained, high-pitched electronic tone, similar to a siren or alarm, is audible.\", \"The scene shows a fire station with multiple red fire trucks parked in a lot, while the audio captures the sound of a large vehicle, possibly a bus or truck, with its air brakes releasing.\", \"The audio features the prominent sound of a large vehicle, possibly a truck or bus, with a high-pitched squeal and a hiss, while the visual shows a fire station yard with multiple red fire trucks parked and people walking around.\"]", "time_sec": 46.548, "generation_time_seconds": 45.6917, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "176", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The church bells ring amidst audio static as a man stands under a wooden roof in the attic.", "pred": "A man lies on his back in a wooden attic, looking up at the ceiling rafters, while the deep, resonant sound of a large bell tolling is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man lies on his back in a wooden attic, looking up at the ceiling rafters, while the deep, resonant sound of a large bell tolling is heard.", "cot": "[\"A man lies on his back in a wooden attic, looking up at the ceiling rafters, while the deep, resonant sound of a large bell tolling is heard.\", \"The camera is positioned beneath a man lying on his back within a wooden structure, possibly an attic or ceiling, while a large bell tolls in the background.\", \"The video shows a person lying on their back on wooden beams, looking upwards towards a rope and a person above. This visual is accompanied by the loud, resonant sound of a large bell ringing in the background.\", \"The video shows a man lying on his back on a wooden structure, looking upwards. Simultaneously, a large bell is heard ringing repeatedly in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 41.16, "generation_time_seconds": 40.4728, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "177", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a cozy bedroom, a man talks while a person snores, and one man take a video.", "pred": "A man in a grey t-shirt is lying in bed with his eyes closed and mouth open, making loud snoring sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a grey t-shirt is lying in bed with his eyes closed and mouth open, making loud snoring sounds.", "cot": "[\"A man in a grey t-shirt is lying in bed with his eyes closed and mouth open, making loud snoring sounds.\", \"A man lies in bed with his mouth wide open, audibly snoring and making guttural grunting sounds.\", \"The video shows a man lying in bed, yawning widely with his mouth open. The audio consists of a male voice saying \\\"meth\\\" and \\\"oh yes,\\\" followed by the sound of a person snoring.\", \"A man in a grey t-shirt lies in bed with his mouth wide open, emitting loud, wet snoring sounds, while a male voice speaks in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 37.833, "generation_time_seconds": 37.2964, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "178", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red truck with its lights on driving down a dark street at dusk, accompanied by the wailing police sirens and the sound of heavy wind blowing into a microphone.", "pred": "A dark pickup truck with a bright white light on the roof and illuminated red taillights drives on a road.\nThe sound of a siren is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A dark pickup truck with a bright white light on the roof and illuminated red taillights drives on a road.\nThe sound of a siren is heard.", "cot": "[\"A dark pickup truck with a bright white light on the roof and illuminated red taillights drives on a road.\\nThe sound of a siren is heard.\", \"A red pickup truck is seen driving away from the camera at night, its brake lights illuminated, and its headlights shining forward, accompanied by the distinct wailing sound of a siren.\", \"A red pickup truck with its headlights and brake lights on is driving on a road in a wooded area during dusk or dawn, while a loud, multi-toned electronic siren, characteristic of an emergency vehicle, sounds in the background.\", \"The audio features the distinct sound of a two-tone emergency vehicle siren wailing, suggesting a police car, fire truck, or ambulance. Simultaneously, the visual shows a dark-colored pickup truck from a low, shaky camera angle, with its bright red taillights illuminated as it moves forward along a dirt road surrounded by trees.\"]", "time_sec": 47.909, "generation_time_seconds": 47.2226, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "179", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the bustling kitchen, a man grills hot dogs and chickens while women chat, accompanied by the distant hum of a motor.", "pred": "The audio features a person speaking in a foreign language while food is being fried in a large pan, and this is accompanied by the loud, continuous sizzling sound of the food cooking in hot oil.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features a person speaking in a foreign language while food is being fried in a large pan, and this is accompanied by the loud, continuous sizzling sound of the food cooking in hot oil.", "cot": "[\"The audio features a person speaking in a foreign language while food is being fried in a large pan, and this is accompanied by the loud, continuous sizzling sound of the food cooking in hot oil.\", \"A metal strainer lifts golden-brown fried food from hot oil in a wok, releasing a continuous sizzling sound, while a person speaks in the background.\", \"A metal strainer lifts browned meat pieces from a dark wok containing oil and spices, while sizzling sounds and a person speaking are heard.\", \"The audio features a person speaking in English, instructing someone on how to drain food, while the visual shows a metal strainer being used to remove cooked meat pieces from hot oil in a wok.\"]", "time_sec": 41.087, "generation_time_seconds": 40.3735, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "180", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A toy helicopter flies over a green field with trees and mountains in the background, as muffled plastic clacking is heard.", "pred": "A person wearing a camouflage cap stands in a green field and observes a white helicopter, which is audible as it flies and approaches.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing a camouflage cap stands in a green field and observes a white helicopter, which is audible as it flies and approaches.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing a camouflage cap stands in a green field and observes a white helicopter, which is audible as it flies and approaches.\", \"A man in a blue shirt and camouflage hat stands in a grassy field, watching a helicopter fly away over a distant tree-covered hill, while the loud, high-pitched whir of its rotors dominates the soundscape.\", \"The video displays a wide, green, rolling countryside under a partly cloudy sky, featuring a distant hillside with trees and a large white house. The audio is dominated by the loud, high-pitched whine of a small engine, like a chainsaw or leaf blower, which starts abruptly, runs for several seconds, and then cuts out.\", \"A person in a camouflage hat stands in a green field, watching a helicopter fly over a distant tree-covered hill while the loud, high-pitched whirring sound of the helicopter's rotors is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 47.812, "generation_time_seconds": 47.0787, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "181", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a cacophony of sounds, ducks quack and chirp while a rooster crows, as a crowd talks in the background, while a duck and a bird peer through the bars of their cages at the zoo.", "pred": "A brown duck is confined within a metal-barred cage, and the audio contains the distinct quacking sound of a duck.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A brown duck is confined within a metal-barred cage, and the audio contains the distinct quacking sound of a duck.", "cot": "[\"A brown duck is confined within a metal-barred cage, and the audio contains the distinct quacking sound of a duck.\", \"A brown duck is inside a metal cage, and it is making duck-like quacking sounds.\", \"A brown duck is inside a metal wire cage. The duck is looking up and to the right. There is a padlock on the cage door. The sound of the duck quacking can be heard.\", \"A brown duck is inside a metal cage, and the audio consists of a loud, low-frequency mechanical hum accompanied by a high-pitched whine.\"]", "time_sec": 36.58, "generation_time_seconds": 35.8763, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "182", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the immersive game world, thunder roars in the distance as rain lightly pours, while a man yells and another hums in a room captured.", "pred": "A first-person view of a military shooter video game shows a player aiming down sights, with a scoreboard visible, while a male voice speaks about rushing a location.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A first-person view of a military shooter video game shows a player aiming down sights, with a scoreboard visible, while a male voice speaks about rushing a location.", "cot": "[\"A first-person view of a military shooter video game shows a player aiming down sights, with a scoreboard visible, while a male voice speaks about rushing a location.\", \"The player aims a gun at a wooden building in a foggy outdoor environment while a teammate announces their position and strategy over a voice communication channel.\", \"A first-person shooter game is in progress, showing a player aiming a firearm at a wooden structure while a scoreboard is displayed on screen, all accompanied by the sound of a person speaking.\", \"A first-person shooter video game scene is displayed, showing a weapon with a red dot sight, a player scoreboard, and a yellow case on the ground, while a male voice speaks in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 40.507, "generation_time_seconds": 39.5082, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.06, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "183", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a crying baby sitting in a yellow high chair looks at the camera and makes a funny face, while in the background, a young woman talking.", "pred": "A baby with dark hair, wearing an orange and cream outfit, sits in a chair and cries loudly with its mouth wide open, while a female voice speaks in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A baby with dark hair, wearing an orange and cream outfit, sits in a chair and cries loudly with its mouth wide open, while a female voice speaks in the background.", "cot": "[\"A baby with dark hair, wearing an orange and cream outfit, sits in a chair and cries loudly with its mouth wide open, while a female voice speaks in the background.\", \"A baby with dark hair, wearing an orange and white outfit, sits in a yellow chair and cries loudly while a female voice speaks in Japanese in the background.\", \"A baby in an orange and white outfit cries loudly in a high-pitched wail while sitting in a chair, and a woman speaks in Japanese off-screen.\", \"A baby in an orange and white outfit sits in a yellow chair, crying loudly with its eyes squeezed shut and mouth wide open, while a woman speaks in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 39.558, "generation_time_seconds": 38.9216, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "184", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man inside the building rings a bell, while the church's bell tower chimes in unison.", "pred": "A church bell tower with a blue spire is shown, and the sound of multiple bells chiming in sequence is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A church bell tower with a blue spire is shown, and the sound of multiple bells chiming in sequence is heard.", "cot": "[\"A church bell tower with a blue spire is shown, and the sound of multiple bells chiming in sequence is heard.\", \"The video displays a church bell tower, with on-screen text identifying it as Holy Trinity Cathedral, while the audio features the loud, resonating sound of large bells being rung in a peal.\", \"A person's hand pulls a rope to ring a large bell inside a white bell tower with a blue roof, while multiple other church bells ring in a complex, pealing pattern.\", \"The video shows the exterior of Holy Trinity Cathedral and then cuts to a close-up of a large, dark metal bell inside a bell tower as it is struck by a clapper. Simultaneously, the audio captures the sound of a large bell ringing, followed by the resonant, pealing chimes of a full carillon.\"]", "time_sec": 45.616, "generation_time_seconds": 44.4667, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "185", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The train horn echoes as a train speeds by on the tracks near a building, with the railroad crossing signals ringing in the distance.", "pred": "The visual scene shows a train approaching on tracks beside a large beige building under a cloudy sky, while the audio consists of the train's horn sounding in a series of long and short blasts.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The visual scene shows a train approaching on tracks beside a large beige building under a cloudy sky, while the audio consists of the train's horn sounding in a series of long and short blasts.", "cot": "[\"The visual scene shows a train approaching on tracks beside a large beige building under a cloudy sky, while the audio consists of the train's horn sounding in a series of long and short blasts.\", \"A train approaches on tracks in front of a large tan building, accompanied by the loud, echoing blast of its air horn.\", \"I see a train approaching on tracks next to a large beige shed. The sound of the train's horn is loud and clear.\", \"A train blows its horn multiple times while approaching on tracks next to a large beige building and a line of freight cars, with a train visible in the far distance on the left.\"]", "time_sec": 39.539, "generation_time_seconds": 37.6905, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.86, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "186", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A large red and white plane takes off from the runway at an airport, accompanied by the sound of wind rushing past.", "pred": "A white airplane with a red tail is on a runway, while the loud roar of its jet engines dominates the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white airplane with a red tail is on a runway, while the loud roar of its jet engines dominates the audio.", "cot": "[\"A white airplane with a red tail is on a runway, while the loud roar of its jet engines dominates the audio.\", \"A white and red Turkish Airlines passenger airplane accelerates on a runway, its engines roaring as it takes off into a cloudy sky.\", \"This is a digital animation of a white and red Turkish Airlines passenger jet taking off from a runway. The powerful roar of its jet engines dominates the soundscape as the plane accelerates and lifts into a sky with scattered clouds.\", \"A white Turkish Airlines Boeing 737 accelerates down a runway for takeoff, its engines roaring with a high-pitched whine, while a crowd of people stands in the foreground observing the event.\"]", "time_sec": 39.785, "generation_time_seconds": 39.0092, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "187", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man sits on a bench near a silver car with its engine running idle, while a logo is visible on the vehicle's side. and in background a man was speacking.", "pred": "The video displays a close-up of an engine bay featuring a BMW emblem, while the audio captures the sound of a running engine and a person stating their intention to rev it a few times.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a close-up of an engine bay featuring a BMW emblem, while the audio captures the sound of a running engine and a person stating their intention to rev it a few times.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a close-up of an engine bay featuring a BMW emblem, while the audio captures the sound of a running engine and a person stating their intention to rev it a few times.\", \"A close-up of a silver BMW engine is shown while a person speaks over the sound of the engine idling.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a BMW car engine, which is running with a low, mechanical rumble, while a male speaker can be heard saying, \\\"I'll give it a few revs, but I'm not gonna probably rev it at all.\\\"\", \"The video displays a close-up of a silver BMW engine cover, while the audio captures the sound of a car engine being revved, accompanied by a person stating they will not rev it.\"]", "time_sec": 42.639, "generation_time_seconds": 41.355, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "188", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young boy talks as a duck quacks, with water trickling and frogs croaking in the background, against a sunset with clouds and a fence silhouette.", "pred": "The video displays a first-person view within a video game, showing a silhouetted hand holding a weapon, a mesh barrier, and a sunset sky, while a human voice narrates in Russian about playing the game 'Zachata'.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a first-person view within a video game, showing a silhouetted hand holding a weapon, a mesh barrier, and a sunset sky, while a human voice narrates in Russian about playing the game 'Zachata'.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a first-person view within a video game, showing a silhouetted hand holding a weapon, a mesh barrier, and a sunset sky, while a human voice narrates in Russian about playing the game 'Zachata'.\", \"This is a first-person video game scene showing a player's hand holding a rifle at sunset, with a wire fence and distant hills visible, while a male voice speaks in Russian.\", \"A first-person video game view shows a player's hand holding a rifle, looking out from behind a dark net at a sunset sky with orange clouds and distant silhouettes, while a person speaks in Russian and a duck quacks.\", \"A first-person video game perspective shows a player holding a gun, looking at a fence and a sunset sky, while a Russian-speaking narrator describes the game they are playing.\"]", "time_sec": 45.213, "generation_time_seconds": 43.6753, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.26, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "189", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The cart with wheels is pushed through the room, creating a symphony of digital beeping, rapid vibrations, and humming on the hard wood floor.", "pred": "The video shows a dark green, four-wheeled wagon on a wooden floor inside a room, while the audio captures the sound of footsteps followed by the distinct noise of a machine being operated.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a dark green, four-wheeled wagon on a wooden floor inside a room, while the audio captures the sound of footsteps followed by the distinct noise of a machine being operated.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a dark green, four-wheeled wagon on a wooden floor inside a room, while the audio captures the sound of footsteps followed by the distinct noise of a machine being operated.\", \"The image depicts a dark green, four-wheeled cart on a wooden floor, with a small brown dog lying in the background.\\n The audio consists of the sharp, metallic sound of a zipper being pulled open, followed by a loud, harsh tearing noise.\\n These sounds are incongruous with the visual scene, which shows a stationary object and animal in an indoor setting.\", \"The video shows a dark green toy cart with large wheels on a wooden floor, positioned in front of a grey door, while the audio captures a rustling sound followed by two sharp electronic beeps.\", \"A dark green toy cart rests on a wooden floor, while a distinct mechanical whirring and buzzing sound, like a small motor or fan, plays in the foreground.\"]", "time_sec": 48.922, "generation_time_seconds": 47.6077, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "190", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio-visual caption would be: A black and white dog growling and barking while playing with a ball on the floor in front of a door.", "pred": "A black and white dog is on a tiled floor, actively playing with a red ball and a grey stuffed toy.\n Simultaneously, a dog is barking aggressively and growling in the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black and white dog is on a tiled floor, actively playing with a red ball and a grey stuffed toy.\n Simultaneously, a dog is barking aggressively and growling in the audio.", "cot": "[\"A black and white dog is on a tiled floor, actively playing with a red ball and a grey stuffed toy.\\n Simultaneously, a dog is barking aggressively and growling in the audio.\", \"A black and white dog stands on a tiled floor, holding a red ball in its mouth. The dog barks and growls, then drops the ball and pushes it with its nose.\", \"A black and white dog is indoors, chewing on a red toy on a tiled floor. The dog barks and growls aggressively at the toy, with the sound of the toy being bitten and shaken.\", \"A black and white dog plays with a red ball indoors, accompanied by the loud barking of another dog.\"]", "time_sec": 40.837, "generation_time_seconds": 40.2134, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 50.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "191", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A large black dog sleeping on a green couch with a black dog laying on a pillow, by loud nearby snoring.", "pred": "A brindle dog wearing a collar is lying down on a green patterned couch. The dog lets out a soft, low-pitched whimper.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A brindle dog wearing a collar is lying down on a green patterned couch. The dog lets out a soft, low-pitched whimper.", "cot": "[\"A brindle dog wearing a collar is lying down on a green patterned couch. The dog lets out a soft, low-pitched whimper.\", \"A brindle dog is sleeping on a green couch while snoring.\", \"A brindle dog with a collar is lying down on a green couch, and a low, guttural growl is heard.\", \"A brindle dog is sleeping on a green couch, making a soft snoring sound.\"]", "time_sec": 31.82, "generation_time_seconds": 31.15, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "192", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A pigeon perched on a wooden wall with something in its beak coos softly as bird wings flap, while a construction machine operates in the background.", "pred": "A grey pigeon with iridescent green and purple feathers on its neck preens itself on a wooden surface, while the sound of a toilet flushing is heard in the background.\n\\boxed{A grey pigeon with iridescent green and purple neck feathers preens on wood, accompanied by a toilet flushing.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A grey pigeon with iridescent green and purple feathers on its neck preens itself on a wooden surface, while the sound of a toilet flushing is heard in the background.\n\\boxed{A grey pigeon with iridescent green and purple neck feathers preens on wood, accompanied by a toilet flushing.}", "cot": "[\"A grey pigeon with iridescent green and purple feathers on its neck preens itself on a wooden surface, while the sound of a toilet flushing is heard in the background.\\n\\\\boxed{A grey pigeon with iridescent green and purple neck feathers preens on wood, accompanied by a toilet flushing.}\", \"A grey and green pigeon stands on a wooden surface while the rhythmic clatter of a manual typewriter is heard in the background.\", \"A grey and green pigeon stands on a wooden surface, then flies off as the loud, metallic rumbling and clanking of a large sliding door opening is heard.\", \"A grey and green pigeon stands on a wooden surface, then flies off, accompanied by the flapping of wings and the metallic clanking of a gate.\"]", "time_sec": 42.517, "generation_time_seconds": 41.5609, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.39, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "193", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man quietly paints a white vase on various surfaces while a sprayer sprays with low machine noise in the background.", "pred": "A man in a white shirt uses a spray gun inside a booth, emitting a loud, sustained, high-pitched hissing sound as he sprays liquid onto a white vase.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a white shirt uses a spray gun inside a booth, emitting a loud, sustained, high-pitched hissing sound as he sprays liquid onto a white vase.", "cot": "[\"A man in a white shirt uses a spray gun inside a booth, emitting a loud, sustained, high-pitched hissing sound as he sprays liquid onto a white vase.\", \"A man in a white shirt operates a spray gun on a white vase inside a spray booth, as a continuous hissing sound emanates from the nozzle.\", \"A man sprays paint onto a white pottery vase inside a spray booth, accompanied by the loud hiss of the spray gun and the whirring of the ventilation system.\", \"A man in a white shirt sprays a white vase inside a spray booth, and the sound of the spray paint being applied is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 38.38, "generation_time_seconds": 37.6687, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.24, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "194", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A politician addressing a large crowd at an event, speaking into a microphone on stage.", "pred": "A man wearing a white shirt and glasses speaks into a microphone at an event. The sounds of a crowd cheering and a speaker giving a speech in Kannada can be heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man wearing a white shirt and glasses speaks into a microphone at an event. The sounds of a crowd cheering and a speaker giving a speech in Kannada can be heard.", "cot": "[\"A man wearing a white shirt and glasses speaks into a microphone at an event. The sounds of a crowd cheering and a speaker giving a speech in Kannada can be heard.\", \"A man wearing glasses and a white shirt speaks into a microphone at a large indoor event, addressing a seated audience and a stage backdrop, while a male voice narrates in Kannada.\", \"A man in a white shirt and glasses speaks into a microphone at a large, crowded event, while an announcer's voice narrates in Kannada over the scene.\", \"A man in a white shirt speaks into a microphone on a stage before a large crowd, his voice heard in Kannada, while others are seated at tables in front of him.\"]", "time_sec": 42.161, "generation_time_seconds": 40.1375, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "195", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a silver train passes by a platform at the train station, the honk echoes through the air accompanied by loud gusts of wind.", "pred": "A silver and red train approaches on an elevated track, with a yellow safety line on the platform, while the sound of a car engine revving and tires screeching is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A silver and red train approaches on an elevated track, with a yellow safety line on the platform, while the sound of a car engine revving and tires screeching is heard.", "cot": "[\"A silver and red train approaches on an elevated track, with a yellow safety line on the platform, while the sound of a car engine revving and tires screeching is heard.\", \"A silver train with a red stripe approaches on tracks at a station platform, passing a sign that reads \\\"158\\\", while a loud, high-pitched train horn sounds continuously.\", \"A silver train with a red stripe travels on tracks alongside a platform, passing under a railway bridge, as the distinct sound of a train whistle is heard followed by the rumbling of its wheels on the rails.\", \"A silver train with a blue and orange logo approaches and passes by on a track next to a platform, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched screeching of its wheels on the rails.\"]", "time_sec": 42.608, "generation_time_seconds": 41.8775, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "196", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of frogs chirping fills the night as men speak and bang, while a man plays guitar next to a campfire.", "pred": "A person in a boat at night shines a bright light, while a man speaks and a large animal grunts nearby.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a boat at night shines a bright light, while a man speaks and a large animal grunts nearby.", "cot": "[\"A person in a boat at night shines a bright light, while a man speaks and a large animal grunts nearby.\", \"A person in a boat at night is illuminated by a bright light while handling a dark, fibrous object, as a male voice speaks and a large, low-pitched animal, possibly a bull, bellowing is heard in the background.\", \"A person in camouflage waders and a hat is in a boat at night, shining a bright light into the dark water while a male voice speaks.\", \"A person in waders and a cap stands in a dark boat, holding a bright work light. The audio features a male voice speaking, followed by the sound of a vehicle engine starting and idling.\"]", "time_sec": 41.096, "generation_time_seconds": 40.2338, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "197", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the mid-size motor vehicle engine accelerates with a slight rattling sound, a driver wearing a helmet shifts gears downward inside the cockpit of the car.", "pred": "From an interior view, two helmeted individuals occupy a vehicle; the driver steers on a dirt track while the passenger holds a camera. The vehicle's engine revs loudly and accelerates rapidly throughout the clip.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "From an interior view, two helmeted individuals occupy a vehicle; the driver steers on a dirt track while the passenger holds a camera. The vehicle's engine revs loudly and accelerates rapidly throughout the clip.", "cot": "[\"From an interior view, two helmeted individuals occupy a vehicle; the driver steers on a dirt track while the passenger holds a camera. The vehicle's engine revs loudly and accelerates rapidly throughout the clip.\", \"Inside a racing vehicle, two helmeted occupants are visible as a loud, high-revving engine roars and accelerates intensely.\", \"Inside a rally car, two helmeted occupants are visible as the vehicle accelerates with a high-pitched engine whine and a subsequent loud crash.\", \"The video shows the interior of a racing car from the co-driver's perspective, featuring two helmeted occupants, while the audio consists of the loud, high-revving engine and mechanical clatter of a vehicle struggling to move.\"]", "time_sec": 42.642, "generation_time_seconds": 41.0151, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "198", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A blue and yellow train passes by on the tracks with loud hissing, a continuous horn, and brief clanking, traveling through the snowy landscape.", "pred": "I see a blue and yellow CSX locomotive, number 663, moving on snow-covered tracks. I hear the loud, rhythmic clatter of the train and a long, sustained blast from its horn.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "I see a blue and yellow CSX locomotive, number 663, moving on snow-covered tracks. I hear the loud, rhythmic clatter of the train and a long, sustained blast from its horn.", "cot": "[\"I see a blue and yellow CSX locomotive, number 663, moving on snow-covered tracks. I hear the loud, rhythmic clatter of the train and a long, sustained blast from its horn.\", \"A blue and yellow CSX locomotive with the number 663 is seen moving on a snow-covered track, accompanied by the loud, sustained blast of its air horn.\", \"A yellow and blue CSX locomotive with the number 663 pulls a long train of green and grey containers along a snow-covered track, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic clatter of the wheels and a distinct, loud train horn.\", \"A yellow and blue CSX locomotive numbered 663 pulls a freight train along snow-covered tracks, passing a railroad crossing signal in a rural, wooded area under a clear blue sky, while a loud, multi-toned train horn blasts.\"]", "time_sec": 47.959, "generation_time_seconds": 46.5182, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "199", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of an idle car engine running in a garage as wind blows into a microphone, while a man stands next to a black car.", "pred": "A close-up of a car engine is shown while the loud, high-pitched whine of a power tool, like a grinder, operates in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A close-up of a car engine is shown while the loud, high-pitched whine of a power tool, like a grinder, operates in the background.", "cot": "[\"A close-up of a car engine is shown while the loud, high-pitched whine of a power tool, like a grinder, operates in the background.\", \"The camera pans across the engine bay of a dark-colored car, revealing the intake manifold and other components, while the sound of a large, powerful engine starting and revving is heard.\", \"A person walks past a dark-colored car with its hood open in a garage. The sound of a powerful engine being revved loudly, with a high-pitched whine, is heard.\", \"A person walks in front of a dark car with its hood open in a garage. The camera pans to a close-up of the car's engine bay, then moves to show the front wheel. The sound of a loud, continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring is heard throughout the clip.\"]", "time_sec": 44.551, "generation_time_seconds": 43.8725, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "200", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The vehicle engine revs loudly as the camera shows the car's engine compartment with the hood up, revealing a cluttered engine bay.", "pred": "This is a close-up view of a car engine bay, which contains a silver engine block, a prominent red roll bar, and various hoses and components. The engine is being revved aggressively, producing a loud, deep, and guttural roar.\n\\boxed{A close-up view of a car engine bay is accompanied by the aggressive revving of a loud, deep, guttural engine.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "This is a close-up view of a car engine bay, which contains a silver engine block, a prominent red roll bar, and various hoses and components. The engine is being revved aggressively, producing a loud, deep, and guttural roar.\n\\boxed{A close-up view of a car engine bay is accompanied by the aggressive revving of a loud, deep, guttural engine.}", "cot": "[\"This is a close-up view of a car engine bay, which contains a silver engine block, a prominent red roll bar, and various hoses and components. The engine is being revved aggressively, producing a loud, deep, and guttural roar.\\n\\\\boxed{A close-up view of a car engine bay is accompanied by the aggressive revving of a loud, deep, guttural engine.}\", \"The image displays a detailed, close-up view of a car engine bay, including components like a serpentine belt, pulleys, and a prominent red strut bar. Overlaid on this visual is the powerful sound of a V-twin engine being revved aggressively, producing a deep, throaty roar with a signature \\\"potato-potato\\\" exhaust note, characteristic of a cruiser-style motorcycle. The engine sound is loud and dominant, suggesting a high-performance configuration.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A car engine bay is shown while a motorcycle engine is revved aggressively, producing a deep, throaty roar.}\", \"A close-up view of a car's engine bay, featuring a red strut bar and various hoses, is accompanied by the sound of a powerful V8 engine being revved aggressively.\", \"A close-up view of a disassembled car engine bay with a red roll bar is shown, while the audio features the loud, aggressive, and sputtering sound of a high-performance engine being revved.\"]", "time_sec": 63.104, "generation_time_seconds": 62.0526, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "201", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman's voice guides as she and a man work together on a sewing machine, stitching fabric with precision.", "pred": "A person's hands guide purple fabric under the presser foot of a white sewing machine with an illuminated needle area. The machine emits a high-pitched whirring and clattering sound as it operates, while a person speaks, explaining that it will create an overlock stitch and cut off excess fabric simultaneously.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands guide purple fabric under the presser foot of a white sewing machine with an illuminated needle area. The machine emits a high-pitched whirring and clattering sound as it operates, while a person speaks, explaining that it will create an overlock stitch and cut off excess fabric simultaneously.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands guide purple fabric under the presser foot of a white sewing machine with an illuminated needle area. The machine emits a high-pitched whirring and clattering sound as it operates, while a person speaks, explaining that it will create an overlock stitch and cut off excess fabric simultaneously.\", \"A person's hands guide a purple fabric under the needle of a white Singer sewing machine. The machine's light is on, and a voice explains its simultaneous overlock stitching and fabric cutting function as the machine begins to operate.\", \"A person's hands guide a piece of purple fabric through a white sewing machine, which is illuminated by a blue light and produces a rhythmic mechanical whirring sound as it operates.\", \"A person operates a white Singer sewing machine, guiding purple fabric under the needle while the machine's light illuminates the work area, and the sound of the machine operating is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 46.824, "generation_time_seconds": 45.8232, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "202", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man energetically shouting in a lush green rice field as ducks quack and chirp around him, with the wind adding to the lively atmosphere.", "pred": "A man in a white shirt and grey shorts walks along a path beside a lush green field, herding a long line of ducks.\n Simultaneously, the audio features the loud, chaotic sounds of many animals, predominantly the distinct, high-pitched bleating of goats.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a white shirt and grey shorts walks along a path beside a lush green field, herding a long line of ducks.\n Simultaneously, the audio features the loud, chaotic sounds of many animals, predominantly the distinct, high-pitched bleating of goats.", "cot": "[\"A man in a white shirt and grey shorts walks along a path beside a lush green field, herding a long line of ducks.\\n Simultaneously, the audio features the loud, chaotic sounds of many animals, predominantly the distinct, high-pitched bleating of goats.\", \"A man walks through a lush green rice paddy, herding a long line of ducks and geese that follow him on a narrow path. The animals emit loud, continuous quacking and honking sounds.\", \"I observe a man walking along a narrow path between lush green rice paddies, followed by a long line of small ducklings. In the background, there are thatched-roof huts and trees on a distant hill. I hear the loud, continuous quacking of a large flock of ducks, accompanied by the sounds of human speech and laughter.\", \"I see a man in a white shirt walking along a narrow path in a lush green rice paddy, leading a long line of small ducklings. I hear the distinct quacking of the ducks and the clear, high-pitched bleating of goats in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 53.802, "generation_time_seconds": 52.9293, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "203", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A yellow fire truck accelerates down a highway with emergency sirens blaring, passing by a crowd of people as a man speaks on an intercom.", "pred": "A yellow fire truck with flashing lights drives down a road, accompanied by a loud, wailing siren and the sound of its engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A yellow fire truck with flashing lights drives down a road, accompanied by a loud, wailing siren and the sound of its engine.", "cot": "[\"A yellow fire truck with flashing lights drives down a road, accompanied by a loud, wailing siren and the sound of its engine.\", \"A yellow fire truck with red emergency lights drives along a paved track, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched sound of its siren and the deep roar of its engine.\", \"A yellow fire truck with flashing red and blue lights is driving on a road. A loud, high-pitched electronic siren is sounding.\", \"A yellow fire truck with red emergency lights and a loud siren drives down a paved road, with hills and spectators visible in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 37.586, "generation_time_seconds": 36.0035, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "204", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a green hat holds a glass in his hands while speaking, with small birds chirping in the distance and his backside one car.", "pred": "A man wearing a green beanie and plaid shirt stands in a driveway next to a black truck and a wooden fence, holding up a blue and yellow slingshot. He states that his glasses are taped so he cannot see, and then a loud, sharp snapping sound is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man wearing a green beanie and plaid shirt stands in a driveway next to a black truck and a wooden fence, holding up a blue and yellow slingshot. He states that his glasses are taped so he cannot see, and then a loud, sharp snapping sound is heard.", "cot": "[\"A man wearing a green beanie and plaid shirt stands in a driveway next to a black truck and a wooden fence, holding up a blue and yellow slingshot. He states that his glasses are taped so he cannot see, and then a loud, sharp snapping sound is heard.\", \"A man in a green beanie and plaid shirt stands in a driveway next to a black truck and a wooden target. He holds a blue and yellow slingshot, then holds up a pair of glasses. As he speaks, a sharp snap is heard, followed by him saying, \\\"Got my glasses taped so I cannot see.\\\"\", \"A man in a green beanie and plaid shirt stands in a driveway next to a black truck, holding up two colorful objects while speaking. The audio consists of his speech, followed by the sound of a slap.\", \"A man in a plaid shirt and green beanie stands in a driveway, holding a colorful object while stating his glasses are taped and he cannot see, which is followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzzing tone.\"]", "time_sec": 52.338, "generation_time_seconds": 51.0275, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "205", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a helicopter with a flag flies in the sky as a man talks in the background it show on a television nwes.", "pred": "A military helicopter flies through a grey, overcast sky, its rotors producing a loud, powerful whirring sound that dominates the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A military helicopter flies through a grey, overcast sky, its rotors producing a loud, powerful whirring sound that dominates the audio.", "cot": "[\"A military helicopter flies through a grey, overcast sky, its rotors producing a loud, powerful whirring sound that dominates the audio.\", \"A dark helicopter with rotating blades flies against a grey sky, while the loud, high-pitched whir of its rotors dominates the soundscape.\", \"A military helicopter flies across a grey, overcast sky, its rotors beating a loud, rhythmic thumping that drowns out all other sounds.\\n\\\\boxed{A military helicopter flies across a grey sky, its loud, rhythmic rotor thumping dominating the audio.}\", \"A dark helicopter with a visible main rotor flies from left to right across a grey, overcast sky, while the loud, low-pitched roar of its turbine engine is the dominant sound.\"]", "time_sec": 42.864, "generation_time_seconds": 41.9468, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "206", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman cuts fabric with red scissors and a iron scale on a sewing machine while vibrations from the machine are heard with a woman speaking.", "pred": "A person's hands operate a white Singer sewing machine on patterned fabric, cutting the thread with scissors, while a loud sewing machine sound is heard followed by a female voice speaking in Spanish.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands operate a white Singer sewing machine on patterned fabric, cutting the thread with scissors, while a loud sewing machine sound is heard followed by a female voice speaking in Spanish.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands operate a white Singer sewing machine on patterned fabric, cutting the thread with scissors, while a loud sewing machine sound is heard followed by a female voice speaking in Spanish.\", \"A person's hands guide red and white patterned fabric through a white Singer sewing machine, which emits a loud, continuous mechanical whirring sound as it sews.\", \"A person's hands are shown operating a white Singer sewing machine, cutting fabric with scissors, and then speaking in Spanish while a sewing machine operates in the background.\", \"A person operates a white Singer sewing machine, cutting a red and white patterned fabric with scissors, while a woman speaks in Spanish.\"]", "time_sec": 38.727, "generation_time_seconds": 38.0386, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 37.84, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.2, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "207", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a woman speaking, a dog growls and barks, as a person holds a piece of paper next to an envelope, with a set of cards featuring a pattern and a card displaying a picture of a dog.", "pred": "A person's hands assemble a layered green card, while a dog barks sharply in the background, interrupting a woman's speech.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands assemble a layered green card, while a dog barks sharply in the background, interrupting a woman's speech.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands assemble a layered green card, while a dog barks sharply in the background, interrupting a woman's speech.\", \"A person's hands hold a piece of paper with an ornate green frame on a black gridded surface, while a dog barks and a person speaks.\", \"A person's hands are shown assembling a green and cream paper card, while a woman's voice describes using snail adhesive to attach panels, and a dog barks in the background.\", \"A pair of hands holds a layered teal and cream greeting card on a black gridded mat, while a beagle dog barks loudly in the foreground.\"]", "time_sec": 39.593, "generation_time_seconds": 38.4354, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "208", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The woman in the foreground speaks as bacon sizzles in a bowl of water on the stove, accompanied by the thumping of chicken leg piece.", "pred": "A person's hands add raw chicken drumsticks from a white plate into a silver pot on a black gas stovetop, accompanied by the sizzling sound of the meat hitting hot oil, while a female voice states, \"I'm adding our drumsticks.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands add raw chicken drumsticks from a white plate into a silver pot on a black gas stovetop, accompanied by the sizzling sound of the meat hitting hot oil, while a female voice states, \"I'm adding our drumsticks.\"", "cot": "[\"A person's hands add raw chicken drumsticks from a white plate into a silver pot on a black gas stovetop, accompanied by the sizzling sound of the meat hitting hot oil, while a female voice states, \\\"I'm adding our drumsticks.\\\"\", \"A person's hands place raw chicken drumsticks into a metal pot on a black gas stove. Simultaneously, a voice says, \\\"adding our drumsticks,\\\" while a continuous sizzling sound is heard.\", \"A person adds raw chicken drumsticks from a white plate into a stainless steel pot on a black gas stovetop, while a female voice says, \\\"I'm adding our drumsticks.\\\"\", \"A person's hands add raw chicken drumsticks from a white plate into a silver pot on a black gas stove. The distinct sizzling sound of the meat hitting hot oil is audible as a woman says, \\\"adding our drumsticks.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 47.575, "generation_time_seconds": 46.604, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.52, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "209", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A child and a man share a laugh while a frog gurgles, as a man speaks, with visuals of a person holding a small frog in their hand next to a dog and in grass one small cycle is there.", "pred": "A child holds a large green frog, which croaks loudly as the child reacts with a scream and then laughter.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A child holds a large green frog, which croaks loudly as the child reacts with a scream and then laughter.", "cot": "[\"A child holds a large green frog, which croaks loudly as the child reacts with a scream and then laughter.\", \"A hand holds a large green bullfrog in a grassy yard, while a child's voice, filled with disgust and excitement, repeatedly asks, \\\"Is he talking?\\\", exclaims \\\"Ew!\\\", and shouts \\\"Buddy, no!\\\", all as the frog emits a loud croak.\", \"A person holds a large green frog in their hand as a dog with its mouth open is visible below. In the background, a child speaks in a high-pitched voice, followed by a distinct frog croaking sound.\", \"A person holds a large green frog in their hand, while a dog is visible in the foreground and a child's voice is heard laughing and speaking in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 44.208, "generation_time_seconds": 42.8396, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 4.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "210", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of clanking plastic and a car engine revving, holding a white paper and a purple wire.", "pred": "A person's hands are shown near a car's open door, prying at a component with a tool while a voice instructs to use a flathead screwdriver to remove a plastic clip.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands are shown near a car's open door, prying at a component with a tool while a voice instructs to use a flathead screwdriver to remove a plastic clip.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands are shown near a car's open door, prying at a component with a tool while a voice instructs to use a flathead screwdriver to remove a plastic clip.\", \"A person's hands use a flathead screwdriver to pry a black plastic component from a car's interior panel, while a man's voice gives instructions to use a \\\"regular flat screwdriver\\\" to \\\"pry this out\\\" and \\\"flip it.\\\"\", \"A person's hand holds a flathead screwdriver and uses it to pry a plastic clip from a black dashboard surface, while a male voice explains the action and describes the tool as a \\\"flat screwdriver\\\" and the component as a \\\"plastic clip.\\\"\", \"The video shows a person's hands using a flat tool to pry open a dark plastic cover, while a male voice gives instructions, mentioning a \\\"plastic clip\\\" and \\\"flat screwdriver\\\" to \\\"pry this out\\\" and \\\"flip this.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 48.686, "generation_time_seconds": 47.7686, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "211", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The woman on the couch is seen blowing her nose into a napkin while repeatedly sneezing and coughing.", "pred": "A woman with brown hair, wrapped in a grey scarf and a beige blanket, is sitting on a couch, holding a white thermometer in one hand and a white tissue to her nose with the other, while coughing and sneezing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman with brown hair, wrapped in a grey scarf and a beige blanket, is sitting on a couch, holding a white thermometer in one hand and a white tissue to her nose with the other, while coughing and sneezing.", "cot": "[\"A woman with brown hair, wrapped in a grey scarf and a beige blanket, is sitting on a couch, holding a white thermometer in one hand and a white tissue to her nose with the other, while coughing and sneezing.\", \"A woman wrapped in a blanket and scarf sits on a couch, holding a thermometer in one hand and a tissue to her nose, while repeatedly coughing and sneezing.\", \"A woman wrapped in a blanket holds a thermometer and blows her nose into a tissue while coughing several times.\", \"A woman wrapped in a blanket and wearing a scarf is coughing and blowing her nose into a tissue while holding a thermometer; the audio consists solely of her repeated, forceful coughing.\"]", "time_sec": 41.194, "generation_time_seconds": 40.1841, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 36.36, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "212", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of whooshing and humming fills the air as a man speaks, accompanied by distant squeaks, while young men play basketball on the court, with a logo-adorned speaker nearby.", "pred": "The video opens with a 'rivals YAHOO! SPORTS' title card, followed by a young man in a basketball jersey speaking to the camera. He states, \"My name is Adman Guillermo from Dallas Mustangs and welcome to Texas Hoops Television.\" This is immediately followed by a loud, low-frequency impact sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video opens with a 'rivals YAHOO! SPORTS' title card, followed by a young man in a basketball jersey speaking to the camera. He states, \"My name is Adman Guillermo from Dallas Mustangs and welcome to Texas Hoops Television.\" This is immediately followed by a loud, low-frequency impact sound.", "cot": "[\"The video opens with a 'rivals YAHOO! SPORTS' title card, followed by a young man in a basketball jersey speaking to the camera. He states, \\\"My name is Adman Guillermo from Dallas Mustangs and welcome to Texas Hoops Television.\\\" This is immediately followed by a loud, low-frequency impact sound.\", \"A young man wearing a basketball jersey and a medal speaks to the camera in front of a \\\"TEXAS HOOPS TELEVISION\\\" sign. Simultaneously, an engine revs loudly, and a male voice introduces himself as \\\"Evan Geller from Dallas Mustangs\\\" and mentions \\\"Texas Hoop Television\\\" over the sound of a basketball bouncing.\", \"A young man in a basketball jersey speaks in front of a \\\"Texas Hoops Television\\\" backdrop, followed by a loud buzzer sound.\", \"The video opens with a \\\"rivals YAHOO! SPORTS\\\" logo. A young man in a black and blue basketball jersey with a medal speaks directly to the camera in a gymnasium. He introduces himself as Almond Guerra from Dallas Mustangs and states that he watches Texas Hoops television.\"]", "time_sec": 55.744, "generation_time_seconds": 54.4499, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "213", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a hat cooks food on a grill outside, accompanied by the sizzle of frying food and music as he speaks.", "pred": "A man wearing a hat and glasses stands by a portable stove, stirring food in a pan as upbeat electronic music plays and a voice asks someone named Adam what they are having for breakfast.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man wearing a hat and glasses stands by a portable stove, stirring food in a pan as upbeat electronic music plays and a voice asks someone named Adam what they are having for breakfast.", "cot": "[\"A man wearing a hat and glasses stands by a portable stove, stirring food in a pan as upbeat electronic music plays and a voice asks someone named Adam what they are having for breakfast.\", \"A man wearing a hat and glasses stirs food in a black pan on a portable stove, with a white truck visible behind him, while upbeat music plays and a man's voice asks about breakfast.\", \"A man wearing a hat and glasses stirs food in a pan on a portable stove, with the text \\\"We started off with a hearty breakfast.\\\" displayed on the screen, while upbeat electronic music plays and a male voice asks, \\\"So Adam, what's for breakfast this morning?\\\".\", \"An older man in a hat stirs food in a pan on a portable stove, while upbeat electronic music plays and a voice asks what's for breakfast.\"]", "time_sec": 45.635, "generation_time_seconds": 44.0318, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.86, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "214", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a dark night lighting with rain falling outside .", "pred": "This is a completely black screen with no discernible visual details.\n Simultaneously, the audio consists of an extremely loud, low-frequency, and rumbling mechanical sound, resembling the engine of a large vehicle or industrial machinery. There is no speech or music in the audio.\n Therefore, the scene is a black screen accompanied by the sound of a loud, rumbling engine.\n\n\\boxed{A black screen is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "This is a completely black screen with no discernible visual details.\n Simultaneously, the audio consists of an extremely loud, low-frequency, and rumbling mechanical sound, resembling the engine of a large vehicle or industrial machinery. There is no speech or music in the audio.\n Therefore, the scene is a black screen accompanied by the sound of a loud, rumbling engine.\n\n\\boxed{A black screen is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.}", "cot": "[\"This is a completely black screen with no discernible visual details.\\n Simultaneously, the audio consists of an extremely loud, low-frequency, and rumbling mechanical sound, resembling the engine of a large vehicle or industrial machinery. There is no speech or music in the audio.\\n Therefore, the scene is a black screen accompanied by the sound of a loud, rumbling engine.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A black screen is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.}\", \"The video image is entirely black and dark, with no discernible visual content. Simultaneously, a loud, continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumbling sound is heard.\", \"The screen is completely black, but a loud, roaring engine sound is heard.\", \"The video is completely black, showing no visual content, while the audio consists solely of the loud, continuous sound of a powerful waterfall or torrential water flow.\"]", "time_sec": 46.527, "generation_time_seconds": 46.0415, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "215", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the immersive  of the video game, a man's voice guides with thumps and clicks, accompanied by faint grunts, as the map unfolds in the campaign.", "pred": "The player character moves through a dark, cavernous environment with red and black textures, fighting an enemy named 'Fire Imp (19)' while a man speaks.\n\n\\boxed{The player character moves through a dark, cavernous environment with red and black textures, fighting an enemy named 'Fire Imp (19)' while a man speaks.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The player character moves through a dark, cavernous environment with red and black textures, fighting an enemy named 'Fire Imp (19)' while a man speaks.\n\n\\boxed{The player character moves through a dark, cavernous environment with red and black textures, fighting an enemy named 'Fire Imp (19)' while a man speaks.}", "cot": "[\"The player character moves through a dark, cavernous environment with red and black textures, fighting an enemy named 'Fire Imp (19)' while a man speaks.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{The player character moves through a dark, cavernous environment with red and black textures, fighting an enemy named 'Fire Imp (19)' while a man speaks.}\", \"The player character moves through a dark, lava-filled cavern while a man speaks, followed by a dog barking.\", \"Inside a dark, cavernous area of a video game, a player character moves left, releasing a projectile while the game's user interface is visible, accompanied by the sound of a man speaking and a dog barking.\", \"The player character moves through a dark, lava-filled cavern in the game Terraria, while a male voice asks, \\\"Is that a stone serpent?\\\", followed by the sound of a dog barking and the voice saying, \\\"And I'm just going to try and get...\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 48.59, "generation_time_seconds": 47.8042, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "216", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of rustling and scraping accompanies a person using a machine to drill a hole in a piece of wood.", "pred": "A person's hands use a chisel on a piece of wood spinning on a lathe, which produces a high-pitched whirring sound followed by a loud, sustained grinding noise as the tool contacts the wood.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands use a chisel on a piece of wood spinning on a lathe, which produces a high-pitched whirring sound followed by a loud, sustained grinding noise as the tool contacts the wood.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands use a chisel on a piece of wood spinning on a lathe, which produces a high-pitched whirring sound followed by a loud, sustained grinding noise as the tool contacts the wood.\", \"A person's hands use a chisel on a spinning piece of wood on a lathe, producing a high-pitched grinding sound and fine wood shavings.\", \"The high-pitched whine of a rotating lathe is heard as a person's hands guide a gouge tool, carving a piece of light-colored wood into a rounded, multi-faceted shape, with wood shavings flying off.\", \"A person's hands use a black chisel to shape a piece of light-colored wood spinning on a lathe, creating a thick, yellowish wood shavings and a loud, high-pitched grinding sound.\"]", "time_sec": 44.164, "generation_time_seconds": 43.1243, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "217", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The black car with its lights on in the garage emits a humming engine sound while sirens ring in the background car beside one firehydt is there.", "pred": "A black Volkswagen sedan with active blue and red emergency lights is parked indoors, while its siren emits a loud, oscillating two-tone wail.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black Volkswagen sedan with active blue and red emergency lights is parked indoors, while its siren emits a loud, oscillating two-tone wail.", "cot": "[\"A black Volkswagen sedan with active blue and red emergency lights is parked indoors, while its siren emits a loud, oscillating two-tone wail.\", \"A black Volkswagen sedan with blue and red emergency lights is parked in a garage. A loud electronic siren with a wailing tone is heard.\", \"A black Volkswagen sedan with a custom light bar displaying blue and red lights, a license plate reading '34 HZ 9682', and its headlights on is parked inside a garage with a fire extinguisher and a water jug visible, as the audio captures the distinct sound of a two-tone emergency siren.\\n\\\\boxed{A black Volkswagen sedan with a blue and red light bar and license plate '34 HZ 9682' is parked in a garage, while the audio features a two-tone emergency siren.}\", \"A black Volkswagen sedan with a blue and red light bar and a white auxiliary light is parked in a garage, illuminated by the flashing red and blue emergency lights of a vehicle, which are accompanied by the sound of a siren and a horn.\"]", "time_sec": 53.813, "generation_time_seconds": 52.332, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.24, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "218", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a dark night sky with the moon shining brightly, thunder rumbles as a gentle rain falls.", "pred": "The video displays a dark, grainy, and blurry visual field, while the audio captures the continuous sound of steady rainfall and intermittent thunder.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a dark, grainy, and blurry visual field, while the audio captures the continuous sound of steady rainfall and intermittent thunder.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a dark, grainy, and blurry visual field, while the audio captures the continuous sound of steady rainfall and intermittent thunder.\", \"A dark, blurry night sky with faint, distant lights is accompanied by the sound of a vehicle, possibly a train, moving on tracks.\", \"The video frames display a dark, blurry, and grainy scene, possibly of a night sky, while the audio consists of the sound of a vehicle's tires moving on a wet surface.\", \"The video shows a dark, blurry, and grainy night sky. The audio consists of the continuous, low rumble of thunder.\"]", "time_sec": 37.398, "generation_time_seconds": 36.7492, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "219", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man holding a baby in his arms while giving it a bottle, with the sound of rustling and a woman speaking in the background, as the baby cries.in the background tissu is there.", "pred": "A baby in a white onesie with orange patterns lies on a yellow towel on a dark surface and cries loudly while a person speaks to it in Mandarin, using a green and white cloth to wipe its face.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A baby in a white onesie with orange patterns lies on a yellow towel on a dark surface and cries loudly while a person speaks to it in Mandarin, using a green and white cloth to wipe its face.", "cot": "[\"A baby in a white onesie with orange patterns lies on a yellow towel on a dark surface and cries loudly while a person speaks to it in Mandarin, using a green and white cloth to wipe its face.\", \"A baby wearing a white, patterned onesie lies on its back on a yellow blanket, crying loudly as two adults hold its head and body. An adult female speaks in Mandarin, praising the baby and saying \\\"coughing.\\\"\", \"A baby wearing a white onesie with orange patterns and green socks lies on a yellow towel on a dark table, crying loudly while being held by two adults. One adult's hand is visible near the baby's arm, which has a green and white hospital ID band. Another adult's hand is visible near the baby's head. A box of wipes is on the table. A woman speaks in Mandarin Chinese, saying \\\"good job\\\" and \\\"thank you,\\\" and another woman speaks. The baby continues to cry.\", \"A baby in a white and orange patterned onesie lies on its back on a yellow towel, crying with its mouth open while two adults hold its head and chest. An adult hand rests on the baby's stomach. A green and white medical band is on the baby's wrist. A box of wipes is visible on the right. A person speaks in Mandarin, praising the baby and offering comfort, while the baby continues to cry loudly.\"]", "time_sec": 63.098, "generation_time_seconds": 62.1529, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.26, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "220", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The loud bustle and screech of traffic mix with the cheers of spectators as they watch cars and motorcycles racing on the track.", "pred": "A grey pickup truck performs a burnout on an asphalt track, emitting thick white smoke, as a crowd watches from the sidelines and bleachers, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched screech of its tires and engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A grey pickup truck performs a burnout on an asphalt track, emitting thick white smoke, as a crowd watches from the sidelines and bleachers, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched screech of its tires and engine.", "cot": "[\"A grey pickup truck performs a burnout on an asphalt track, emitting thick white smoke, as a crowd watches from the sidelines and bleachers, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched screech of its tires and engine.\", \"A dark pickup truck performs a burnout on an asphalt track, producing a large plume of white smoke, as the loud, high-revving roar of its engine dominates the outdoor soundscape, and spectators watch from behind a safety barrier.\", \"A large truck performs a burnout on a paved track, creating thick white smoke from its tires, while a crowd watches from the sidelines and bleachers, and the roar of its powerful engine dominates the soundscape.\", \"A dark pickup truck performs a burnout on a paved track, producing a large plume of white smoke. The deep, rumbling engine sound is accompanied by the high-pitched screech of tires spinning against the pavement, all within a large outdoor arena filled with spectators.\"]", "time_sec": 49.816, "generation_time_seconds": 48.6687, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "221", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling city square, conversations buzz as a train bell dings and a whistle blows, with cheers erupting in the background, all under the watchful gaze of a large clock mounted on the side of an old building.", "pred": "The video shows a close-up of the Prague Astronomical Clock, an ornate, multi-layered clock with gold hands and Roman numerals set in a blue face, mounted on a stone tower. Above the clock, two small figures are visible in an open window, while the audio features the sounds of a crowd and a loud, continuous horn.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of the Prague Astronomical Clock, an ornate, multi-layered clock with gold hands and Roman numerals set in a blue face, mounted on a stone tower. Above the clock, two small figures are visible in an open window, while the audio features the sounds of a crowd and a loud, continuous horn.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a close-up of the Prague Astronomical Clock, an ornate, multi-layered clock with gold hands and Roman numerals set in a blue face, mounted on a stone tower. Above the clock, two small figures are visible in an open window, while the audio features the sounds of a crowd and a loud, continuous horn.\", \"The video displays a large, ornate astronomical clock on a stone building, while the audio captures the sound of a moving train along with human conversation.\", \"The video shows the ornate astronomical clock of the Old Town Hall in Prague, where figures appear in the windows above the clock face. The audio features a loud, sustained musical chord, possibly from a church organ, accompanied by the indistinct murmur of a crowd.\", \"The video displays a large, ornate astronomical clock on a stone building, with animated figures visible in a small window above it. Simultaneously, the audio captures the sound of a large crowd, interspersed with the distinct calls of a rooster and a child speaking.\"]", "time_sec": 52.179, "generation_time_seconds": 51.3238, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.02, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "222", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man dressed as Santa Claus is standing next to a woman while a baby whimpers and a woman talks.", "pred": "A person in a Grinch costume poses with a woman in front of a blue wall while another person films them with a smartphone, as a man's voice yells at a crying baby.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a Grinch costume poses with a woman in front of a blue wall while another person films them with a smartphone, as a man's voice yells at a crying baby.", "cot": "[\"A person in a Grinch costume poses with a woman in front of a blue wall while another person films them with a smartphone, as a man's voice yells at a crying baby.\", \"A person in a green Grinch costume with a Santa hat poses for a photo with a woman against a blue wall, while a man's voice shouts at a crying baby, and a woman exclaims in surprise.\", \"A person in a Grinch costume stands next to a woman who is laughing, while another person takes their picture with a smartphone, all while an off-screen male voice speaks and a baby cries in the background.\", \"A person in a Grinch costume poses for a photo with a woman against a blue background, while a man off-camera shouts at someone to get back, a child begins to cry, and a woman exclaims \\\"Oh my G.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 45.169, "generation_time_seconds": 44.5585, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "223", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man cleaning his hands under the faucet of a kitchen sink while using a laptop. and drill sound came.", "pred": "A person's hands are shown on a stainless steel sink, using a screwdriver to remove a cap from a soap dispenser. A voice says, \"And then put the cap back on,\" followed by the sound of running water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands are shown on a stainless steel sink, using a screwdriver to remove a cap from a soap dispenser. A voice says, \"And then put the cap back on,\" followed by the sound of running water.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands are shown on a stainless steel sink, using a screwdriver to remove a cap from a soap dispenser. A voice says, \\\"And then put the cap back on,\\\" followed by the sound of running water.\", \"A person's hands assemble a chrome faucet on a red countertop. A male voice says, \\\"and then put the cap back on,\\\" followed by a clicking sound. He then says, \\\"and it should work,\\\" as the faucet is turned on, producing a loud, high-pitched squealing sound.\", \"A person's hands are shown putting a cap back onto a chrome soap dispenser; as they do, a male voice says, \\\"And then put the cap back on,\\\" followed by the sound of water beginning to flow from the fixture.\", \"A person's hands are shown using a screwdriver to remove a cap from a soap dispenser on a kitchen counter next to a laptop. A male voice instructs to \\\"put the cap back on,\\\" followed by the sound of the cap being placed and a plastic object being set down.\"]", "time_sec": 52.108, "generation_time_seconds": 51.5036, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.86, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "224", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A newborn baby with a hat on cries in the hospital as a woman mumbles softly.", "pred": "The video shows a close-up of a baby in a white hat and patterned onesie lying on a light green surface, while the audio captures the baby crying and making distressed sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of a baby in a white hat and patterned onesie lying on a light green surface, while the audio captures the baby crying and making distressed sounds.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a close-up of a baby in a white hat and patterned onesie lying on a light green surface, while the audio captures the baby crying and making distressed sounds.\", \"The video shows a baby's face as it begins to cry, with the accompanying audio capturing the baby's distressed crying and high-pitched wails.\", \"A baby wearing a white hat and a patterned shirt lies on a surface, crying with its mouth open as a high-pitched wail is heard.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a baby wearing a white hat and a white onesie with orange and blue patterns, lying on a green surface. The baby's face is contorted as it cries loudly, and the sound of its high-pitched wailing is clearly audible.\"]", "time_sec": 43.028, "generation_time_seconds": 42.1748, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "225", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The car engine roars as the vehicle accelerates down the road.", "pred": "The video shows a black engine cover with a silver Toyota logo and purple handwritten text, which is then accompanied by the loud, roaring sound of a powerful engine being revved.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a black engine cover with a silver Toyota logo and purple handwritten text, which is then accompanied by the loud, roaring sound of a powerful engine being revved.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a black engine cover with a silver Toyota logo and purple handwritten text, which is then accompanied by the loud, roaring sound of a powerful engine being revved.\", \"A black Toyota engine with a silver valve cover is shown under the hood, while the powerful roar of a high-performance engine revs loudly.\", \"I am analyzing the provided video and audio streams independently.\\n\\n**Visual Analysis (from the image):**\\nThe visual shows the engine bay of a car. The engine cover is black with a silver Toyota logo and a silver vented section. The surrounding engine bay has various components, including hoses, fluid reservoirs, and the car's frame. The overall appearance is clean and well-maintained.\\n\\n**Audio Analysis (from the audio):**\\nThe audio consists of a loud, high-revving internal combustion engine. The sound starts at a moderate speed and rapidly increases in pitch and volume, suggesting the car is accelerating hard, possibly in a racing context.\\n\\n**Synthesis:**\\nThe image shows a Toyota engine, while the audio captures the sound of a high-performance engine being pushed to its limits. These two modalities are inconsistent with each other.\\n\\nFinal Answer: The image displays a clean Toyota engine bay, while the audio features a loud, high-revving engine accelerating rapidly.\", \"The video displays a black Toyota engine bay while the audio features the continuous, high-revving sound of a powerful engine.\"]", "time_sec": 64.067, "generation_time_seconds": 63.2928, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "226", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "An old truck idles next to a barn, its engine humming and rattling, while bells ring in the background.", "pred": "A vintage hot rod with white-wall tires and 'CHELSEA No. 1' painted on the side idles in a snowy yard, its engine emitting a loud, rough, sputtering rumble.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A vintage hot rod with white-wall tires and 'CHELSEA No. 1' painted on the side idles in a snowy yard, its engine emitting a loud, rough, sputtering rumble.", "cot": "[\"A vintage hot rod with white-wall tires and 'CHELSEA No. 1' painted on the side idles in a snowy yard, its engine emitting a loud, rough, sputtering rumble.\", \"A vintage hot rod with green-rimmed wheels is shown outdoors as a loud, sputtering engine sound plays, suggesting the vehicle is being operated or demonstrated.\", \"A modified, open-frame hot rod with white-walled tires is parked in a snowy yard. The vehicle's engine is idling unevenly and sputtering.\", \"A vintage hot rod with green-rimmed, whitewall tires drives slowly on a snowy, gravel surface, while a loud, sputtering, and uneven engine idles, indicating it is running but not in optimal condition.\"]", "time_sec": 43.461, "generation_time_seconds": 42.5519, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.75, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "227", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice overlaps with laughter as a horse snorts and on the race track, while jockeys ride alongside.", "pred": "A jockey in a yellow cap rides a dark horse at a steady pace on a dirt racetrack, while a man's voice narrates in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A jockey in a yellow cap rides a dark horse at a steady pace on a dirt racetrack, while a man's voice narrates in the background.", "cot": "[\"A jockey in a yellow cap rides a dark horse at a steady pace on a dirt racetrack, while a man's voice narrates in the background.\", \"A jockey in a yellow helmet rides a dark horse at a canter on a muddy racetrack, with another horse and jockey visible in the background, while a male voice narrates about a horse he bought last August.\", \"A person in a yellow helmet and black jacket rides a dark horse on a dirt racetrack, passing a white rail, while a man speaks in the foreground about buying a horse named \\\"him\\\" last August, describing him as a \\\"session star\\\" who is \\\"filling out and growing up.\\\"\", \"A jockey in black attire and a yellow cap rides a dark-colored horse at a walk on a dirt racetrack, with another horse and rider visible in the background, while a man speaks conversationally.\"]", "time_sec": 48.023, "generation_time_seconds": 47.2635, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "228", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The car's engine idles smoothly before laboring and creaking under the hood.", "pred": "A close-up view shows a car engine bay with a silver intercooler featuring a red 'STI' logo, red hoses, and a silver turbocharger. The engine emits a loud, deep, and aggressive roar that fluctuates in pitch, creating a powerful and forceful sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A close-up view shows a car engine bay with a silver intercooler featuring a red 'STI' logo, red hoses, and a silver turbocharger. The engine emits a loud, deep, and aggressive roar that fluctuates in pitch, creating a powerful and forceful sound.", "cot": "[\"A close-up view shows a car engine bay with a silver intercooler featuring a red 'STI' logo, red hoses, and a silver turbocharger. The engine emits a loud, deep, and aggressive roar that fluctuates in pitch, creating a powerful and forceful sound.\", \"The video displays a close-up of a car's engine bay, featuring a silver intercooler with a red 'STI' logo and red hoses, while the audio captures the sound of an engine being revved.\", \"A red and silver STI-branded engine is shown, while the audio captures the distinct sound of a vehicle's engine being revved aggressively.\", \"A close-up view shows a car engine with a silver intercooler featuring a red \\\"STI\\\" logo; the engine is idling and then revs, producing a loud, powerful, and raspy mechanical sound.\"]", "time_sec": 46.698, "generation_time_seconds": 45.3328, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "229", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man talks on a small boat floating in the water near a dock in a marina, as a vehicle engine works in the background.", "pred": "A blue and yellow sailboat is being lowered into the water by a crane. The sound of the crane's machinery operating and a male voice saying \"Easy\" can be heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A blue and yellow sailboat is being lowered into the water by a crane. The sound of the crane's machinery operating and a male voice saying \"Easy\" can be heard.", "cot": "[\"A blue and yellow sailboat is being lowered into the water by a crane. The sound of the crane's machinery operating and a male voice saying \\\"Easy\\\" can be heard.\", \"A blue and yellow sailboat is being lifted by a crane over the water, accompanied by the loud, rumbling sound of the crane's hydraulics and engine, followed by a male voice saying 'Easy'.\", \"A blue and white sailboat, partially submerged and tilted, is being lifted by a yellow crane in a marina with other boats and buildings nearby. The loud, metallic grinding and clanking of the crane's mechanism is heard, followed by a male voice saying, \\\"Easy.\\\"\", \"The visual stream shows a blue and white sailboat being lifted vertically out of the water by a yellow crane at a marina, with buildings and other boats in the background. The audio stream contains the sounds of a heavy mechanical winch or crane operating, followed by a loud, low-pitched metallic creak, and then a male voice saying, \\\"Easy.\\\".\"]", "time_sec": 51.9, "generation_time_seconds": 51.0337, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "230", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman and a young girl chatting while on a bed with a red ball nearby.", "pred": "After placing the bucket on the bed, the little girl is shown with her head down, looking into the pink bucket, while a woman can be heard asking her what she got in there.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "After placing the bucket on the bed, the little girl is shown with her head down, looking into the pink bucket, while a woman can be heard asking her what she got in there.", "cot": "[\"After placing the bucket on the bed, the little girl is shown with her head down, looking into the pink bucket, while a woman can be heard asking her what she got in there.\", \"A young child in a pink shirt is bent over a pink plastic pumpkin bucket on a patterned surface.\\nAn adult female speaks off-screen, asking the child to show what they collected.\\nThe child responds with a babbling sound.\", \"A young girl in a pink shirt is shown from behind, leaning over a pink pumpkin-shaped bucket on a striped surface. A woman speaks, asking her to see what she got, and the girl replies that she has candy.\", \"A young child in a pink shirt leans over a pink pumpkin-shaped bucket on a bed, while a woman asks, \\\"Let's see how you did tonight. What do you got in there?\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 44.775, "generation_time_seconds": 44.114, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "231", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The motorcycle engine revving inconsistently sound.", "pred": "I observe a close-up of a black motorcycle's rear wheel and an Akrapovič exhaust pipe.\n Simultaneously, I hear the engine starting and then revving loudly.\n\\boxed{A close-up of a motorcycle's rear wheel and Akrapovič exhaust is accompanied by the sound of its engine starting and revving.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "I observe a close-up of a black motorcycle's rear wheel and an Akrapovič exhaust pipe.\n Simultaneously, I hear the engine starting and then revving loudly.\n\\boxed{A close-up of a motorcycle's rear wheel and Akrapovič exhaust is accompanied by the sound of its engine starting and revving.}", "cot": "[\"I observe a close-up of a black motorcycle's rear wheel and an Akrapovič exhaust pipe.\\n Simultaneously, I hear the engine starting and then revving loudly.\\n\\\\boxed{A close-up of a motorcycle's rear wheel and Akrapovič exhaust is accompanied by the sound of its engine starting and revving.}\", \"The video displays a close-up of a black motorcycle's rear wheel, featuring a disc brake and a silver Akrapovič exhaust pipe. The audio consists of the loud, aggressive, and sputtering sound of a high-performance engine being revved.\", \"A black motorcycle with a silver Akrapovič exhaust is shown in a close-up, while the sound of its engine starting and revving loudly is heard.\", \"The rear wheel of a black and silver motorcycle is shown, featuring a perforated disc brake and a black and silver Akrapovič exhaust pipe. The loud roar of its engine starts and revs aggressively.\"]", "time_sec": 48.084, "generation_time_seconds": 47.2931, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "232", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a field, a man holding a gun up to his face is startled by birds squeaking in the distance, followed by a shotgun blast.", "pred": "The video shows a person in camouflage clothing and a cap looking upwards. The audio contains the sound of a gun being cocked, followed by the report of a gunshot, which is then followed by the sound of a hunting dog barking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a person in camouflage clothing and a cap looking upwards. The audio contains the sound of a gun being cocked, followed by the report of a gunshot, which is then followed by the sound of a hunting dog barking.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a person in camouflage clothing and a cap looking upwards. The audio contains the sound of a gun being cocked, followed by the report of a gunshot, which is then followed by the sound of a hunting dog barking.\", \"A person wearing a camouflage hat and orange earplugs in a field of tall grass is shot at with a firearm, which produces a loud report and the sound of a shell casing hitting the ground.\", \"The video shows a man in camouflage clothing and an orange earplug looking upwards as a loud gunshot is heard, followed by the sound of a heavy object, possibly a game animal, thudding onto the ground.\\n\\\\boxed{A camouflaged man with an orange earplug looks up as a gunshot is fired and a heavy object thuds to the ground.}\", \"The video shows a man in camouflage aiming a rifle against a blue sky, which is immediately followed by the sharp report of a gunshot and the metallic sound of the rifle being cycled.\"]", "time_sec": 50.865, "generation_time_seconds": 49.4042, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "233", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man and his dog enjoy a game of frisbee on a green field, surrounded by trees, as distant barks and voices mix with the gentle wind.", "pred": "A small, light-brown dog runs across a grassy field towards a white pole, with trees and distant vehicles in the background, while a dog barks in the distance.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A small, light-brown dog runs across a grassy field towards a white pole, with trees and distant vehicles in the background, while a dog barks in the distance.", "cot": "[\"A small, light-brown dog runs across a grassy field towards a white pole, with trees and distant vehicles in the background, while a dog barks in the distance.\", \"A small, light-brown dog runs across a grassy field towards a distant ramp, while a dog barks and people talk in the background.\", \"A small, light-colored dog runs across a grassy field towards a low jump structure, while a dog barks in the background and a person speaks faintly.\", \"A light-colored dog runs on a grassy field towards a man standing near a green structure, while a dog barks repeatedly in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 38.88, "generation_time_seconds": 37.5689, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.3, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "234", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " In a game, a large fire emerging from a dark background, while a man speaks with a heartbeat in the background.", "pred": "The video opens with a black screen displaying yellow text, \"A bientôt\" and a website, before transitioning to first-person gameplay in a snowy, forested biome within the blocky video game Minecraft. The audio begins with a dramatic, low-frequency musical sting, followed by a man speaking in French.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video opens with a black screen displaying yellow text, \"A bientôt\" and a website, before transitioning to first-person gameplay in a snowy, forested biome within the blocky video game Minecraft. The audio begins with a dramatic, low-frequency musical sting, followed by a man speaking in French.", "cot": "[\"The video opens with a black screen displaying yellow text, \\\"A bientôt\\\" and a website, before transitioning to first-person gameplay in a snowy, forested biome within the blocky video game Minecraft. The audio begins with a dramatic, low-frequency musical sting, followed by a man speaking in French.\", \"The video opens with a dark screen featuring the text \\\"A bientôt\\\" and a website address in yellow, with a small flame animation at the bottom. This is immediately followed by a first-person view of a snowy, forested landscape in the game Minecraft, while a person speaks in French in the background.\", \"The video opens with a title card for \\\"A bientôt\\\" and a website, then shows first-person gameplay of a snowy forest in Minecraft, accompanied by a man speaking in French.\", \"The audio begins with a loud explosion, followed by dramatic music and a heartbeat sound effect. A man then speaks in French, while the video shows a first-person view of a snowy forest in the game Minecraft.\"]", "time_sec": 51.498, "generation_time_seconds": 50.2454, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.52, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "235", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The steak is sizzling in the skillet as the oil pops, creating a mouth-watering cooking symphony.", "pred": "A seasoned cut of meat sizzles and steams in a black cast iron pan, while the sound of a faucet running into a sink is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A seasoned cut of meat sizzles and steams in a black cast iron pan, while the sound of a faucet running into a sink is heard.", "cot": "[\"A seasoned cut of meat sizzles and steams in a black cast iron pan, while the sound of a faucet running into a sink is heard.\", \"A seasoned cut of meat is searing in a black cast iron pan, producing a continuous, loud sizzling and crackling sound from the high-heat cooking process.\", \"A seasoned steak is searing in a black cast iron skillet, producing visible steam, accompanied by a continuous sizzling sound.\", \"A seared piece of meat is in a black cast iron skillet on a stove, with the sound of sizzling and crackling from the cooking process.\"]", "time_sec": 37.443, "generation_time_seconds": 36.4424, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "236", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The woman in green playfully makes faces at the camera while taking a break from washing her face in the small bathroom with black and white photographs hanging above the wall", "pred": "A woman with dark hair in a green top speaks while a continuous hissing sound, similar to a spray, is audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman with dark hair in a green top speaks while a continuous hissing sound, similar to a spray, is audible.", "cot": "[\"A woman with dark hair in a green top speaks while a continuous hissing sound, similar to a spray, is audible.\", \"A woman in a green top speaks directly to the camera in a bathroom, then the scene cuts to her in a green blouse speaking in front of a black screen, while the sound of a spray bottle being used is heard.\", \"A woman in a green top wipes her face with a towel while a continuous hissing spray sound plays, and she speaks instructions about drying and continuing a night regimen.\", \"A woman in a green top speaks to the camera about a skincare routine, then the sound of a spray bottle being used is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 39.167, "generation_time_seconds": 38.4056, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "237", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man speaks while sharpening  with a red pencil on white paper.", "pred": "A person's hands are shown using a pink tool to scrape a black pen shaft on a white surface, accompanied by a scraping sound and a male voice describing the action.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands are shown using a pink tool to scrape a black pen shaft on a white surface, accompanied by a scraping sound and a male voice describing the action.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands are shown using a pink tool to scrape a black pen shaft on a white surface, accompanied by a scraping sound and a male voice describing the action.\", \"A person's hands use a pink tool to scrape a black shaft, creating small black debris, while a male voice describes the action and the sound of scraping is heard.\", \"A person's hand uses a red tool to scrape the end of a black shaft, causing red and black particles to scatter on a white surface, while a male voice speaks and the scraping sound is heard.\", \"A person's hands use a small pink tool to scrape black specks from a dark, cylindrical object against a white surface, while a male voice speaks and the scraping sound is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 41.844, "generation_time_seconds": 40.7635, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "238", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of fast and loud typing on a computer keyboard accompanies a person typing on a white keyboard with black keys in a bright setting.", "pred": "A pair of hands types rapidly on a beige, full-sized computer keyboard, the clatter of the mechanical keys audible.\n\\boxed{Hands type rapidly on a beige computer keyboard, producing a rhythmic clatter of mechanical key presses.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A pair of hands types rapidly on a beige, full-sized computer keyboard, the clatter of the mechanical keys audible.\n\\boxed{Hands type rapidly on a beige computer keyboard, producing a rhythmic clatter of mechanical key presses.}", "cot": "[\"A pair of hands types rapidly on a beige, full-sized computer keyboard, the clatter of the mechanical keys audible.\\n\\\\boxed{Hands type rapidly on a beige computer keyboard, producing a rhythmic clatter of mechanical key presses.}\", \"This is a top-down view of a person's hands rapidly typing on a beige, older-model computer keyboard. The distinct, rapid clicking sounds heard are the mechanical key presses.\", \"A pair of hands types rapidly on a beige computer keyboard, producing a fast, rhythmic clacking sound from the keys.\", \"A pair of hands types on a beige computer keyboard, producing rapid, rhythmic clicking sounds.\"]", "time_sec": 37.778, "generation_time_seconds": 36.7828, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.51, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "239", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a workshop, a man is seen drilling a hole in a table while a drilling sound is heard, followed by brief talking.", "pred": "A person wearing blue jeans and a dark shirt holds a large piece of light-colored plywood with a square cutout in a workshop, then walks away from the camera towards the back of the room where various woodworking machines and shelves are visible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing blue jeans and a dark shirt holds a large piece of light-colored plywood with a square cutout in a workshop, then walks away from the camera towards the back of the room where various woodworking machines and shelves are visible.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing blue jeans and a dark shirt holds a large piece of light-colored plywood with a square cutout in a workshop, then walks away from the camera towards the back of the room where various woodworking machines and shelves are visible.\", \"A man in a workshop holds a large piece of plywood with a square cutout, then walks away from the camera; a power saw starts up and cuts through the wood as the man begins to speak again.\", \"A person holds a piece of plywood with a rectangular cutout, and a power saw then makes a loud, buzzing cutting sound.\", \"A person wearing blue jeans and a dark shirt stands in a woodworking shop, holding a piece of light-colored plywood with a rectangular hole in it, while the high-pitched whirring of a power saw is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 43.681, "generation_time_seconds": 42.4798, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.13, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "240", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a man yelling in the background, a person skillfully sews garments on a sewing machine.", "pred": "A person operates a light green industrial sewing machine, guiding a piece of brown leather as it rapidly stitches a white thread. The sound is a loud, rhythmic, and metallic clattering from the machine's needle and presser foot.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person operates a light green industrial sewing machine, guiding a piece of brown leather as it rapidly stitches a white thread. The sound is a loud, rhythmic, and metallic clattering from the machine's needle and presser foot.", "cot": "[\"A person operates a light green industrial sewing machine, guiding a piece of brown leather as it rapidly stitches a white thread. The sound is a loud, rhythmic, and metallic clattering from the machine's needle and presser foot.\", \"A person operates a sewing machine, guiding a piece of brown leather under the needle, while a loud, rapid, mechanical rattling sound, like a typewriter or sewing machine, is heard.\", \"The audio features the rapid, mechanical clatter of a vintage typewriter, while the visual shows a person's hands guiding a piece of brown leather under the needle of a light green industrial sewing machine.\", \"A person's hands guide a piece of brown leather under the presser foot of a light green industrial sewing machine as the needle rapidly stitches white thread. Simultaneously, the loud, rapid, mechanical clatter of a sewing machine operating at high speed can be heard.\"]", "time_sec": 48.13, "generation_time_seconds": 47.1773, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "241", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man speaks while washing his hands under a running faucet in a kitchen sink.", "pred": "A person's hands rinse a small, dark object under a running faucet in a stainless steel sink, while a voice describes removing \"any remaining ink\" and using a \"piston.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands rinse a small, dark object under a running faucet in a stainless steel sink, while a voice describes removing \"any remaining ink\" and using a \"piston.\"", "cot": "[\"A person's hands rinse a small, dark object under a running faucet in a stainless steel sink, while a voice describes removing \\\"any remaining ink\\\" and using a \\\"piston.\\\"\", \"A person's hands are washing a small, dark object in a metal sink under a running faucet, while a male voice narrates the cleaning process.\", \"A person's hands scrub a small object under a running chrome faucet in a stainless steel sink, while a voice explains a process involving \\\"ink\\\" and a \\\"piston.\\\"\", \"A person's hands scrub a small object under a running faucet in a stainless steel sink, while a male voice speaks in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 39.471, "generation_time_seconds": 38.0267, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "242", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The accelerating engine hums as a person rides a motorcycle on the road seen through the car's windshield.", "pred": "From a driver's viewpoint inside a car, a small blue vehicle drives ahead on a paved road. The deep, roaring sound of a powerful engine is heard as the small vehicle accelerates rapidly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "From a driver's viewpoint inside a car, a small blue vehicle drives ahead on a paved road. The deep, roaring sound of a powerful engine is heard as the small vehicle accelerates rapidly.", "cot": "[\"From a driver's viewpoint inside a car, a small blue vehicle drives ahead on a paved road. The deep, roaring sound of a powerful engine is heard as the small vehicle accelerates rapidly.\", \"From a dashboard camera view, a blue go-kart drives down an asphalt track. The audio consists of the distinct, high-revving engine noise of the go-kart approaching, passing, and then moving away into the distance.\", \"From a vehicle's interior, a smaller vehicle is seen ahead on a paved track lined with orange cones. A loud, high-pitched engine revs and accelerates, accompanied by the sound of tires screeching on pavement.\", \"A view from inside a vehicle shows a paved track with orange cones, where a blue vehicle is driving away. Overlaid text reads \\\"Look For The Flames\\\". An engine revs loudly.\"]", "time_sec": 45.785, "generation_time_seconds": 44.8886, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "243", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling kitchen, a man speaks while the clinking of dishes fills the air, followed by the hiss of an oil mister spraying, as he takes a freshly baked loaf of bread out of the oven and places it on the counter.", "pred": "A person sprays oil from a can onto two loaves of bread on a baking sheet next to an open toaster oven, while a voice explains that the oil will protect the crust and that the crust is about 300 degrees.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person sprays oil from a can onto two loaves of bread on a baking sheet next to an open toaster oven, while a voice explains that the oil will protect the crust and that the crust is about 300 degrees.", "cot": "[\"A person sprays oil from a can onto two loaves of bread on a baking sheet next to an open toaster oven, while a voice explains that the oil will protect the crust and that the crust is about 300 degrees.\", \"A person sprays cooking oil from a yellow aerosol can onto two loaves of bread resting on a wire rack. A male voice narrates the action, explaining that the oil will protect the crust and that the crust is about 300 degrees.\", \"A person sprays oil onto two loaves of bread in a toaster oven, accompanied by the hissing sound of the spray can, while a person speaks in the background.\", \"A person sprays oil onto bread loaves on a baking sheet next to a toaster oven, then states they are giving it a mist of oil to protect the crust, followed by a beep.\"]", "time_sec": 46.583, "generation_time_seconds": 45.4808, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "244", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the serene ambiance of chirping birds and buzzing insects, a beekeeper carefully extracts a frame from a beehive to collect honey.", "pred": "A beekeeper in a blue suit lifts a honeycomb frame from a blue hive box, and a man's voice speaks in Russian, saying, \"The queen is walking, poor thing, looking for a place to lay eggs, there's little space.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A beekeeper in a blue suit lifts a honeycomb frame from a blue hive box, and a man's voice speaks in Russian, saying, \"The queen is walking, poor thing, looking for a place to lay eggs, there's little space.\"", "cot": "[\"A beekeeper in a blue suit lifts a honeycomb frame from a blue hive box, and a man's voice speaks in Russian, saying, \\\"The queen is walking, poor thing, looking for a place to lay eggs, there's little space.\\\"\", \"A person in a blue beekeeping suit lifts a honeycomb frame from a blue beehive, then uses a tool to pry it. A man speaks in Russian, saying the queen bee is walking around and looking for a place to lay eggs, but there is little space.\", \"A person in a blue suit removes a bee-covered wooden frame from a blue hive, then uses a tool to scrape the frame, all while a man speaks in Russian in the background.\", \"A person in a blue beekeeping suit lifts a wooden frame covered in bees from a blue hive, then places it back inside while a man speaks in Russian in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 47.013, "generation_time_seconds": 45.7035, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "245", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sustained and coarse drilling noise  through the room as a machine on the table works diligently.", "pred": "A large, white industrial milling machine with a silver base is shown, its drill bit is rapidly spinning and creating a loud, high-pitched whirring sound, and a green cloth is visible on the machine's table.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large, white industrial milling machine with a silver base is shown, its drill bit is rapidly spinning and creating a loud, high-pitched whirring sound, and a green cloth is visible on the machine's table.", "cot": "[\"A large, white industrial milling machine with a silver base is shown, its drill bit is rapidly spinning and creating a loud, high-pitched whirring sound, and a green cloth is visible on the machine's table.\", \"The video shows a white CNC milling machine with a silver gantry and black base, situated in a room with a wooden wall and shelves holding numerous items. The machine is actively operating, with the spindle spinning rapidly, producing a loud, high-pitched grinding or whirring sound.\", \"A large, silver milling machine is shown in a workshop setting. A loud, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound, characteristic of a power tool in operation, is heard.\", \"The video frames show a stationary milling machine in a workshop, while the audio consists of a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine, characteristic of a power tool in operation.\"]", "time_sec": 45.932, "generation_time_seconds": 45.1763, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "246", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a serene urban setting, a black pigeon coos softly while perched on a concrete floor,  as the soothing sound of crickets fills the background.", "pred": "A black and white pigeon stands on a concrete floor and flaps its wings. The audio contains the cooing of multiple pigeons and the sound of wing flapping.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black and white pigeon stands on a concrete floor and flaps its wings. The audio contains the cooing of multiple pigeons and the sound of wing flapping.", "cot": "[\"A black and white pigeon stands on a concrete floor and flaps its wings. The audio contains the cooing of multiple pigeons and the sound of wing flapping.\", \"A black and white pigeon stands in a concrete enclosure, then spreads its wings and flies away as a flock of pigeons coos and flaps its wings.\", \"A black and white pigeon stands on a concrete floor inside a small enclosure, while the sound of numerous pigeons cooing and flapping their wings can be heard.\", \"A black and white pigeon stands in a concrete enclosure, then walks forward as the sound of a bird cooing is followed by a loud clatter from a cage or wire mesh.\"]", "time_sec": 40.178, "generation_time_seconds": 39.4217, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.25, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "247", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The mechanic troubleshoots the stuttering engine of a red car in the garage as metal rattles rapidly.", "pred": "The sound of a car engine cranking and struggling to start is heard in a garage, where two men are working on an orange Volkswagen Beetle with its hood open.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The sound of a car engine cranking and struggling to start is heard in a garage, where two men are working on an orange Volkswagen Beetle with its hood open.", "cot": "[\"The sound of a car engine cranking and struggling to start is heard in a garage, where two men are working on an orange Volkswagen Beetle with its hood open.\", \"The video displays an orange Volkswagen Beetle with its hood open in a garage, as several people work on its engine, while the audio captures the sound of a car engine being cranked and then successfully starting.\", \"The audio captures the sound of a vehicle's engine attempting to start, which is then followed by the sound of a vehicle driving away. The visual shows a man working on the open engine compartment of an orange classic Volkswagen Beetle in a garage, while another person is visible inside the car.\", \"An orange Volkswagen Beetle is being worked on inside a cluttered garage, and the sound of a car engine starting and then running can be heard.\"]", "time_sec": 43.289, "generation_time_seconds": 42.5258, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "248", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of an engine idling softly as a blue and white moped is parked in a lot next to a red building.", "pred": "The audio features the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine starting and idling. Simultaneously, the visual shows a stationary blue, white, and black scooter parked on asphalt next to a brick wall with a red car in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine starting and idling. Simultaneously, the visual shows a stationary blue, white, and black scooter parked on asphalt next to a brick wall with a red car in the background.", "cot": "[\"The audio features the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine starting and idling. Simultaneously, the visual shows a stationary blue, white, and black scooter parked on asphalt next to a brick wall with a red car in the background.\", \"A blue, white, and black scooter is stationary on an asphalt surface, while a loud, rhythmic engine idles nearby.\", \"A blue, white, and black scooter is parked on asphalt next to a brick wall, while the loud, rhythmic clatter of a train on metal tracks is heard in the background.\", \"The audio contains the sound of a lawn mower engine. The visual shows a blue, white, and black scooter parked on asphalt next to a red brick building.\"]", "time_sec": 43.412, "generation_time_seconds": 41.026, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 37.84, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "249", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The wind blows as water splashes around a man in a blue hat and baseball cap paddling a kayak on a lake.", "pred": "The camera is positioned at the bow of a light blue kayak, showing the front of the boat and the head of the person paddling, which is covered by a blue baseball cap with white eyelets. The kayak is moving forward on a large body of grey, choppy water under an overcast sky, with a distant shoreline of trees and a white house visible. The sound of water lapping and the distinct splashing of a paddle are heard, accompanied by the sound of wind.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The camera is positioned at the bow of a light blue kayak, showing the front of the boat and the head of the person paddling, which is covered by a blue baseball cap with white eyelets. The kayak is moving forward on a large body of grey, choppy water under an overcast sky, with a distant shoreline of trees and a white house visible. The sound of water lapping and the distinct splashing of a paddle are heard, accompanied by the sound of wind.", "cot": "[\"The camera is positioned at the bow of a light blue kayak, showing the front of the boat and the head of the person paddling, which is covered by a blue baseball cap with white eyelets. The kayak is moving forward on a large body of grey, choppy water under an overcast sky, with a distant shoreline of trees and a white house visible. The sound of water lapping and the distinct splashing of a paddle are heard, accompanied by the sound of wind.\", \"The video shows a first-person view from a blue kayak on a choppy body of water, with a person wearing a blue cap paddling; the accompanying audio consists of the continuous lapping of water against the kayak and a persistent, strong wind blowing across the open surface.\\n\\\\boxed{A person in a blue cap paddles a blue kayak across choppy water, the sound of lapping waves and strong wind filling the air.}\", \"A person wearing a blue baseball cap is kayaking on choppy water, with the sound of paddling and wind in the background.\", \"A person wearing a blue baseball cap is paddling a blue kayak across choppy water, with the sound of the paddle dipping into the water and wind blowing.\"]", "time_sec": 57.545, "generation_time_seconds": 56.5801, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "250", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Ducks and swans swimming in a serene lake with a city in the background, accompanied by the soothing sounds of wind, quacking ducks, and chirping birds.", "pred": "A black swan swims in the foreground of a calm lake, while another is further away, the water reflecting trees and buildings on the far shore, accompanied by birdsong and the honking of a goose.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black swan swims in the foreground of a calm lake, while another is further away, the water reflecting trees and buildings on the far shore, accompanied by birdsong and the honking of a goose.", "cot": "[\"A black swan swims in the foreground of a calm lake, while another is further away, the water reflecting trees and buildings on the far shore, accompanied by birdsong and the honking of a goose.\", \"Two dark swans swim in a calm lake, creating ripples, while distant trees and buildings are reflected on the water's surface. The audio features the loud, braying call of a donkey and the high-pitched chirping of small birds.\", \"The video shows two black swans swimming on a lake, creating concentric ripples in the water, with a treeline and buildings visible in the background, while the audio features the distinct, resonant honking of geese nearby.\", \"I am analyzing the audio and video streams independently.\\n\\nFirst, I will analyze the visual stream.\\nThe video shows a body of water, likely a lake or pond, with several dark-colored birds swimming on its surface.\\nThe background consists of a treeline and some buildings on a distant shore.\\nThe water is calm, with ripples created by the birds' movement.\\n\\nNext, I will analyze the audio stream.\\nThe primary sound is the distinct, braying vocalization of a donkey.\\nThis vocalization has a characteristic \\\"hee-haw\\\" quality and occurs twice during the clip.\\n\\nNow, I will synthesize these two streams into a single, factual, and dense sentence.\\nI will include the key visual elements (lake, dark birds) and the key audio element (donkey braying), without inventing any connections between them.\\n\\nThe final description is a factual account of the sensory information presented, adhering to the principle of modality independence.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{On a lake, dark birds swim while a donkey brays.}\"]", "time_sec": 75.245, "generation_time_seconds": 73.3606, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "251", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The lively chatter of a crowd mixes with the clinking of dinnerware, as a white and gray bird stands on a ledge in front of a wooden door.", "pred": "A seagull stands before a wooden door, while indistinct human voices and the clatter of dishes are audible in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A seagull stands before a wooden door, while indistinct human voices and the clatter of dishes are audible in the background.", "cot": "[\"A seagull stands before a wooden door, while indistinct human voices and the clatter of dishes are audible in the background.\", \"A seagull with grey and white feathers and a yellow beak walks on a tiled floor in front of a brown wooden door. In the background, a crowd of people can be heard talking and laughing in a large, reverberant space.\", \"A seagull stands on a tiled floor in front of a wooden door, while the indistinct chatter of people and the clatter of dishes are heard in the background.\", \"A seagull stands on a light-colored floor in front of a brown wooden door. The audio consists of the distinct, high-pitched squeaking of a swing set in motion, accompanied by the low rumble of background human conversation.\"]", "time_sec": 43.89, "generation_time_seconds": 43.0089, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "252", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The muffled rock music plays as plastic clicks echo, amidst the audio static hiss, capturing the chaotic aftermath of a car accident scene with a white truck involved.", "pred": "The video displays a computer screen showing a game menu with options like 'Spawn Power-Up' and 'Teleport to Crosshair'. A red '501' is in the corner, and a user interface element labeled 'SUI' is present. The background of the game is a dark, abstract, and blurry scene. The audio consists of the continuous and clear sound of flowing water, like a stream or fountain.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a computer screen showing a game menu with options like 'Spawn Power-Up' and 'Teleport to Crosshair'. A red '501' is in the corner, and a user interface element labeled 'SUI' is present. The background of the game is a dark, abstract, and blurry scene. The audio consists of the continuous and clear sound of flowing water, like a stream or fountain.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a computer screen showing a game menu with options like 'Spawn Power-Up' and 'Teleport to Crosshair'. A red '501' is in the corner, and a user interface element labeled 'SUI' is present. The background of the game is a dark, abstract, and blurry scene. The audio consists of the continuous and clear sound of flowing water, like a stream or fountain.\", \"The video displays a split-screen, with a dark, blurry game environment on the left and a game menu on the right; simultaneously, the audio consists of the continuous, low-frequency hum of a large industrial machine.\", \"A video game menu overlay is visible on a screen, with a white car driving on a road in the background, while a loud, high-pitched whirring sound, like a power tool, is heard.\", \"This is a screen recording of a video game menu. The on-screen text displays a list of cheats or spawn options, including 'Spawn Power-Gloves' and 'Spawn Unbreakable Armor'. The background gameplay shows a first-person perspective in a dark, futuristic indoor environment, accompanied by a low, continuous hum or drone.\"]", "time_sec": 55.771, "generation_time_seconds": 55.1892, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "253", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a honking horn and a roaring truck engine accompany a large red truck towing a red car down the street.", "pred": "A large, multi-axle lowboy truck carrying a red and black mobile crane drives along a road. Simultaneously, a loud, sustained horn, characteristic of a large vehicle like a truck or train, sounds prominently in the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large, multi-axle lowboy truck carrying a red and black mobile crane drives along a road. Simultaneously, a loud, sustained horn, characteristic of a large vehicle like a truck or train, sounds prominently in the audio.", "cot": "[\"A large, multi-axle lowboy truck carrying a red and black mobile crane drives along a road. Simultaneously, a loud, sustained horn, characteristic of a large vehicle like a truck or train, sounds prominently in the audio.\", \"A large, multi-axle black and red transport truck carrying a heavy piece of machinery drives away from the camera on a paved road.\\nSimultaneously, the loud, sustained, low-pitched blast of a large vehicle's horn is heard.\\nThe truck passes a chain-link fence and some green trees under an overcast sky.\", \"A large, black and red heavy-duty truck with a long trailer is driving away on a paved road next to a grassy area and a chain-link fence.\\n As the truck passes, a loud truck horn is heard.\", \"A large black and red lowboy truck carrying a crane drives down a paved road. Simultaneously, the ambient sound consists of a low engine rumble that escalates into a loud, deep, and sustained horn blast, which then fades as the truck moves away.\"]", "time_sec": 52.185, "generation_time_seconds": 51.434, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "254", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On a one bus ride, the engine hums as passengers chat and a man stands in the doorway, surrounded by cars and other vehicles on the road.", "pred": "Inside a yellow and green bus, a man in a light blue shirt sits in the passenger seat looking forward, while another man sits in the driver's seat and is seen from behind. Through the front windshield, a grassy area with parked cars and people is visible. The distinct sound of a large vehicle engine is audible, accompanied by a male voice speaking in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Inside a yellow and green bus, a man in a light blue shirt sits in the passenger seat looking forward, while another man sits in the driver's seat and is seen from behind. Through the front windshield, a grassy area with parked cars and people is visible. The distinct sound of a large vehicle engine is audible, accompanied by a male voice speaking in the background.", "cot": "[\"Inside a yellow and green bus, a man in a light blue shirt sits in the passenger seat looking forward, while another man sits in the driver's seat and is seen from behind. Through the front windshield, a grassy area with parked cars and people is visible. The distinct sound of a large vehicle engine is audible, accompanied by a male voice speaking in the background.\", \"Inside a stationary yellow and green bus, a man in a light blue shirt sits in the passenger seat. Through the front windshield, a paved path leads away from the bus, bordered by a grassy area where several people are standing and walking among parked cars. A continuous, low-frequency rumble, characteristic of a large engine or heavy machinery, is audible in the background.\", \"This is a view from inside a vehicle, looking forward through the windshield. A man in a light-colored shirt is visible from behind, sitting in the driver's position. Outside, a paved path runs alongside a grassy area with several people and parked cars. The prominent sound is the low, continuous rumble of the vehicle's engine or heavy machinery.\", \"From inside a stationary yellow bus, a man in a light-colored shirt is seen from behind looking out the front. A large, dark, cylindrical object is visible in the foreground. The continuous, low-frequency rumble of a powerful engine is audible.\"]", "time_sec": 60.858, "generation_time_seconds": 60.03, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.55, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "255", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a cozy kitchen setting, a group of girls can be heard burping and laughing before engaging in conversation.", "pred": "A woman in a white tank top laughs while sitting at a table with a blue thermos, as another woman in a purple top laughs and speaks in Portuguese.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman in a white tank top laughs while sitting at a table with a blue thermos, as another woman in a purple top laughs and speaks in Portuguese.", "cot": "[\"A woman in a white tank top laughs while sitting at a table with a blue thermos, as another woman in a purple top laughs and speaks in Portuguese.\", \"A woman in a white tank top laughs hysterically while sitting at a table with a blue thermos and snack containers, her laughter echoing in the room as another person speaks in the background.\", \"A young woman in a white tank top laughs heartily, covering her mouth with her hand and pushing her hair back. The laughter continues as she leans forward, and a second woman in a purple top joins in, smiling and holding her chin. The sound of multiple people laughing is prominent, accompanied by a female voice speaking in Portuguese.\", \"Three young women are sitting at a table in a kitchen, talking and laughing together. One woman in a purple top laughs hard enough to cry, and the other two, one in a white tank top and one in a black top, are also laughing. A glass and a blue pitcher are on the table.\"]", "time_sec": 49.541, "generation_time_seconds": 48.9443, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "256", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The wind whispers through  as waves crash against the shore, revealing a row of wooden houses on stilts lining the sandy beach.", "pred": "A series of blurred beach houses on stilts are visible on a sandy shore under a cloudy sky, while the sound of strong wind is audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A series of blurred beach houses on stilts are visible on a sandy shore under a cloudy sky, while the sound of strong wind is audible.", "cot": "[\"A series of blurred beach houses on stilts are visible on a sandy shore under a cloudy sky, while the sound of strong wind is audible.\", \"The video displays a low-resolution view of a beachfront with numerous beach houses on stilts, while the audio captures the sound of strong, rushing wind.\", \"The audio captures the sound of strong, gusting wind. The video displays a blurry view of several beach houses on stilts situated on a sandy shore.\", \"The video shows a blurry, low-angle view of multiple houses on stilts along a sandy shore, while the audio captures the sound of strong, rushing wind.\"]", "time_sec": 37.474, "generation_time_seconds": 36.5545, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 41.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "257", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man is cutting wood with an axe outside, while a chainsaw is cutting down a tree stump.there are small small grass there.", "pred": "A mechanical log splitter with a silver hydraulic ram and black handle forcefully splits a thick wooden log on a dirt and grass surface, while a loud, continuous mechanical whirring sound is audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A mechanical log splitter with a silver hydraulic ram and black handle forcefully splits a thick wooden log on a dirt and grass surface, while a loud, continuous mechanical whirring sound is audible.", "cot": "[\"A mechanical log splitter with a silver hydraulic ram and black handle forcefully splits a thick wooden log on a dirt and grass surface, while a loud, continuous mechanical whirring sound is audible.\", \"A hydraulic wood splitter presses a steel wedge into a log, splitting it apart on a dirt surface, while a loud, continuous engine idles in the background.\", \"A hydraulic log splitter with a metallic ram forcefully compresses a section of a log, producing a loud, rhythmic cracking and splintering sound as the wood breaks apart on a dirt and grass surface.\", \"A hydraulic log splitter powers through a log on the ground, while the sound of a vehicle's engine and its distinct gear shifting are audible in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 41.24, "generation_time_seconds": 40.2847, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "258", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a car a man engine hums as a high whistle joins the dashboard with a GPS and a Bluetooth speaker.", "pred": "The interior of a car is shown, featuring a steering wheel with a logo, a dashboard with gauges, and a stereo system with illuminated blue displays. A high-pitched, continuous electronic beep sounds from within the vehicle.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The interior of a car is shown, featuring a steering wheel with a logo, a dashboard with gauges, and a stereo system with illuminated blue displays. A high-pitched, continuous electronic beep sounds from within the vehicle.", "cot": "[\"The interior of a car is shown, featuring a steering wheel with a logo, a dashboard with gauges, and a stereo system with illuminated blue displays. A high-pitched, continuous electronic beep sounds from within the vehicle.\", \"The interior of a car is shown, featuring a dashboard with active gauges, a Pioneer car stereo, and a fabric air freshener hanging from the vent. A loud, high-pitched, continuous electronic tone, similar to an alarm, is heard as the stereo plays music.\", \"The audio captures the powerful, low-frequency rumble of a large engine as it starts and accelerates, accompanied by a high-pitched whine that rises in pitch. Simultaneously, the visual shows the interior of a car, focusing on a Pioneer car stereo with its display illuminated, controls visible, and a remote control on the dash, with a fuzzy air freshener hanging from the air vent above.\", \"The interior of a vehicle is shown, featuring a dashboard with a Pioneer stereo and blue-lit gauges. The primary sound is the loud, continuous roar of a powerful engine, which is then interrupted by a very loud, high-pitched, and sustained electronic beep.\"]", "time_sec": 55.91, "generation_time_seconds": 55.1975, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "259", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A race car accelerates on the track at night, accompanied by the sound of plastic clicks.", "pred": "From a first-person perspective, a black race car with a blue and white logo on the hood drives at night on a track illuminated by bright overhead lights, navigating through other race cars and clouds of dust, while a loud, high-revving engine dominates the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "From a first-person perspective, a black race car with a blue and white logo on the hood drives at night on a track illuminated by bright overhead lights, navigating through other race cars and clouds of dust, while a loud, high-revving engine dominates the audio.", "cot": "[\"From a first-person perspective, a black race car with a blue and white logo on the hood drives at night on a track illuminated by bright overhead lights, navigating through other race cars and clouds of dust, while a loud, high-revving engine dominates the audio.\", \"From a first-person perspective inside a car, several race cars are visible on a wet racetrack at night under bright lights, while the loud, roaring sound of the vehicle's engine dominates the audio.\", \"1. **Visuals**: The video displays a first-person perspective from inside a race car. The car is on a brightly lit racetrack at night, surrounded by other race cars. The view is shaky, indicating high speed, and the windshield has a sticker of a blue and white fish.\\n2. **Audio**: The dominant sound is a very loud, high-revving engine, characteristic of a race car. The engine note is high-pitched and fluctuates with acceleration and deceleration, consistent with the chaotic visual movement.\\n3. **Synthesis**: Combining these observations, the scene is a first-person view from a race car driven at high speed on a racetrack at night, with the intense sound of its own engine providing the auditory backdrop.\\n\\\\boxed{From a first-person perspective inside a race car, a high-speed chase unfolds on a brightly lit racetrack at night, accompanied by the deafening roar of a high-revving engine.}\", \"The first-person perspective from a car shows a high-speed nighttime race on a wet track, with multiple competitors and heavy fog or smoke partially obscuring the view; this visual is accompanied by the loud, roaring sound of a powerful engine accelerating.\"]", "time_sec": 74.285, "generation_time_seconds": 72.5982, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.2, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "260", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a garden, a person speaks with the buzzing of nearby insects while a wooden box with bees on top of it sits nearby.", "pred": "The video shows a wooden beehive with bees crawling on its top, while a person speaks in Polish, saying, \"I'll calm down, it will be fine.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a wooden beehive with bees crawling on its top, while a person speaks in Polish, saying, \"I'll calm down, it will be fine.\"", "cot": "[\"The video shows a wooden beehive with bees crawling on its top, while a person speaks in Polish, saying, \\\"I'll calm down, it will be fine.\\\"\", \"A wooden beehive sits outdoors, surrounded by green foliage, with numerous bees crawling on its surface. A person speaks in Polish, saying, \\\"They are settling down calmly, everything will be fine.\\\"\", \"The video shows a wooden beehive with bees crawling on its top surface, which is covered with a grid of horizontal slats. The audio features a man speaking calmly in Polish, saying, \\\"they are settling down calmly, everything will be fine,\\\" while the continuous buzzing of bees is audible in the background.\", \"A wooden beehive, covered in crawling bees, sits in a grassy area. A person's voice speaks calmly in Polish, saying, \\\"They're calming down, it will be fine.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 46.691, "generation_time_seconds": 45.8831, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "261", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the audio-visual scene, a child is scooping sand into a container for a dog, accompanied by clicking and rattling sounds, while a person stands nearby scooping sand out of a container.", "pred": "A hand pours dry, brown material into a clear plastic container on a concrete floor, while the distinct, rhythmic sound of a hammer striking metal is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand pours dry, brown material into a clear plastic container on a concrete floor, while the distinct, rhythmic sound of a hammer striking metal is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A hand pours dry, brown material into a clear plastic container on a concrete floor, while the distinct, rhythmic sound of a hammer striking metal is heard in the background.\", \"A person places a brown, dry leaf into a clear plastic container with sand on a concrete floor, while a loud, sustained, high-pitched electronic beep, similar to a smoke alarm, sounds in the background.\", \"A person's hands manipulate brown, granular material inside a clear plastic container. The container is placed on a concrete floor, and a dark insect is visible within the granular material. The sound of a knife striking a cutting board is heard in the background.\", \"A person's hands place a small, dark object into a clear plastic container filled with brown sand, while the sharp, rhythmic clatter of a manual typewriter is heard in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 44.851, "generation_time_seconds": 44.1384, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "262", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man vigorously operates a jackhammer to clear rocks and rubble from his driveway, creating a loud and continuous drilling and vibrating sound.", "pred": "A man operates a jackhammer on a concrete surface, the tool's repetitive impact creating a chaotic, metallic clatter that fills the air.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man operates a jackhammer on a concrete surface, the tool's repetitive impact creating a chaotic, metallic clatter that fills the air.", "cot": "[\"A man operates a jackhammer on a concrete surface, the tool's repetitive impact creating a chaotic, metallic clatter that fills the air.\", \"A man in a black t-shirt and jeans uses a yellow jackhammer to break up a concrete surface, creating a loud, high-pitched, rapid drilling and shattering sound.\", \"A person wearing a mask and gloves uses a yellow jackhammer to break apart concrete on a driveway, the loud, continuous, and rhythmic metallic clanking and grinding of the tool filling the air.\", \"A man wearing a black shirt and gloves operates a yellow jackhammer on a concrete surface, breaking it into rubble, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic, percussive sound of the tool impacting the ground.\"]", "time_sec": 41.741, "generation_time_seconds": 40.9012, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "263", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A person with painted nails holding a bottle prays with mechanical noise in the background.", "pred": "The video displays a light blue plastic spray bottle held by a hand with henna designs. Text overlays state \"Price:Rs 900 for 200ml\" and \"nozzle pump dispenser.\" The primary sound is the loud roar of a powerful engine, like a jet or a race car.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a light blue plastic spray bottle held by a hand with henna designs. Text overlays state \"Price:Rs 900 for 200ml\" and \"nozzle pump dispenser.\" The primary sound is the loud roar of a powerful engine, like a jet or a race car.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a light blue plastic spray bottle held by a hand with henna designs. Text overlays state \\\"Price:Rs 900 for 200ml\\\" and \\\"nozzle pump dispenser.\\\" The primary sound is the loud roar of a powerful engine, like a jet or a race car.\", \"A close-up shows a hand holding a light blue spray bottle with a floral design on the nozzle, while a loud, deep, continuous mechanical rumbling sound is heard in the background.\", \"A person's hands are shown holding and manipulating a light green plastic spray bottle with a nozzle pump dispenser against a patterned fabric background. The audio consists of a loud, deep, and continuous low-frequency rumble, similar to the sound of a large engine or heavy machinery.\", \"A person holds a light green plastic spray bottle with a pump nozzle. In the background, the continuous, low-frequency rumble of a large vehicle engine is audible.\"]", "time_sec": 48.635, "generation_time_seconds": 48.0131, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.13, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "264", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a tropical rainforest, a small hut stands surrounded by lush trees as rain falls gently, accompanied by the distant hums of traffic.", "pred": "The video displays a small, open-sided hut with a tiled roof nestled within a lush, green forest. Rain is visibly falling heavily throughout the scene. The audio consists of the continuous, loud sound of heavy rain accompanied by the distinct, high-pitched chirping of insects.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a small, open-sided hut with a tiled roof nestled within a lush, green forest. Rain is visibly falling heavily throughout the scene. The audio consists of the continuous, loud sound of heavy rain accompanied by the distinct, high-pitched chirping of insects.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a small, open-sided hut with a tiled roof nestled within a lush, green forest. Rain is visibly falling heavily throughout the scene. The audio consists of the continuous, loud sound of heavy rain accompanied by the distinct, high-pitched chirping of insects.\", \"The audio captures the loud, continuous sound of heavy rain. The visual shows a dense, green forest with a small, open-sided wooden structure featuring a brown tiled roof, all under the conditions of a heavy downpour.\", \"The video displays a lush, tropical rainforest during a downpour, featuring a large tree covered in vines and a small, traditional tiled-roof structure. The accompanying audio consists of the loud, continuous sound of heavy rainfall and a sudden, loud truck horn.\", \"The audio contains the sound of heavy rainfall, which is visually confirmed by the falling raindrops seen in the video. The scene is set in a dense, green forest with a small, brown-roofed wooden gazebo visible on the right side of the frame.\"]", "time_sec": 51.98, "generation_time_seconds": 50.0163, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.74, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "265", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The power tool drill is cutting holes in both metal and wood, with compressed air releasing and steam hissing in the background.", "pred": "A plasma torch cuts through a rectangular metal plate, producing bright orange sparks and a loud, high-pitched whirring sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A plasma torch cuts through a rectangular metal plate, producing bright orange sparks and a loud, high-pitched whirring sound.", "cot": "[\"A plasma torch cuts through a rectangular metal plate, producing bright orange sparks and a loud, high-pitched whirring sound.\", \"A high-pressure stream of water cuts through a rectangular metal plate, causing sparks to fly, while a loud hissing and spraying sound is heard.\", \"A CNC plasma cutter with a metallic arm moves precisely over a rusty metal sheet, emitting a loud, high-pitched buzzing and sizzling sound as it cuts through the material, sending sparks flying.\", \"The video shows a CNC plasma cutter actively cutting a flat, rust-colored metal plate, which produces a shower of bright orange sparks and intense light at the cut point, accompanied by a loud, high-pitched, and abrasive buzzing sound.\"]", "time_sec": 40.375, "generation_time_seconds": 39.7774, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "266", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the backyard, a man whistles as pigeons, ducks, chickens, and birds chirp and flap their wings, with a cat on the roof and a black and white dog chasing a white duck.", "pred": "A person in an orange shirt and black pants walks on grass beside a wooden coop, where several black and white chickens are visible. The ambient sound is dominated by loud, repetitive electronic beeping, characteristic of a reversing vehicle, with faint background bird chirps.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in an orange shirt and black pants walks on grass beside a wooden coop, where several black and white chickens are visible. The ambient sound is dominated by loud, repetitive electronic beeping, characteristic of a reversing vehicle, with faint background bird chirps.", "cot": "[\"A person in an orange shirt and black pants walks on grass beside a wooden coop, where several black and white chickens are visible. The ambient sound is dominated by loud, repetitive electronic beeping, characteristic of a reversing vehicle, with faint background bird chirps.\", \"A flock of pigeons perches on a wooden coop attached to a house while a person walks nearby; simultaneously, the distinct cooing of a pigeon and the clucking of a chicken are audible.\", \"The video displays a wooden pigeon coop with several pigeons inside and on its roof, while a person stands nearby on the grass. The accompanying audio captures the distinct cooing of pigeons and the sound of numerous birds fluttering their wings simultaneously.\", \"The video shows a wooden structure with pigeons on its roof, followed by a grassy yard with several small black and white birds on the ground. The accompanying audio features a high-pitched whistle, the cooing of pigeons, and the rustling of wings.\"]", "time_sec": 49.809, "generation_time_seconds": 48.9184, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.24, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "267", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "An airplane taxis down the runway as muddled speech fills the background, captured through a blurry image from a car window with buildings and the plane in the distance.and in the ground its greeny", "pred": "From a passenger's perspective, the video shows a plane with an orange engine accelerating down a runway. The audio consists of the loud, powerful roar of the jet engine and the low rumble of the aircraft moving on the tarmac.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "From a passenger's perspective, the video shows a plane with an orange engine accelerating down a runway. The audio consists of the loud, powerful roar of the jet engine and the low rumble of the aircraft moving on the tarmac.", "cot": "[\"From a passenger's perspective, the video shows a plane with an orange engine accelerating down a runway. The audio consists of the loud, powerful roar of the jet engine and the low rumble of the aircraft moving on the tarmac.\", \"The view from an airplane window shows a grassy field and grey sky during takeoff, accompanied by the loud roar of the jet engine and the sound of the landing gear retracting.\", \"The view from an airplane window shows a large orange and silver jet engine, the wing, and a grassy airfield with other aircraft under an overcast sky, while the loud, deep roar of the engine dominates the audio.\", \"I observe a view from an airplane window during taxiing or takeoff, featuring a large orange and white jet engine in the foreground and a runway with grassy areas in the background. The audio consists of the loud, continuous roar of the jet engine combined with a low-frequency rumble, consistent with the vehicle's motion.\"]", "time_sec": 49.302, "generation_time_seconds": 48.6642, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.6, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "268", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man's voice narrates as a blue motorcycle idles in a garage.", "pred": "A person is working on a blue and white dirt bike in a garage while the motorcycle's engine is idling.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person is working on a blue and white dirt bike in a garage while the motorcycle's engine is idling.", "cot": "[\"A person is working on a blue and white dirt bike in a garage while the motorcycle's engine is idling.\", \"A person is working on a blue and white dirt bike with the engine running. A male voice explains that he is about to add an automatic start to the vehicle, which already has its turn signals and headlight.\", \"A person is working on a blue and white dirt bike inside a garage, with a large air compressor visible in the background. The sound of a loud, rumbling engine is present, and a male voice discusses adding an automatic start to the vehicle.\", \"A person's hand rests on the handlebar of a blue and white motorcycle as a loud engine runs and the person speaks about adding an automatic start.\"]", "time_sec": 41.505, "generation_time_seconds": 40.7485, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "269", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A large truck with lights on, parked on the side of the road at night, as a crowd of people and a fire truck gather nearby, creating a scene filled with vibrations and humming sounds.", "pred": "The audio captures the loud, multi-tonal horn of a large vehicle, such as a train or truck, accompanied by a prominent engine rumble.\n The visual shows a brightly lit, large truck driving down a street at night, illuminated by numerous yellow and red lights.\n The truck is moving from right to left in the frame.\n The horn sound is consistent with the large vehicle seen in the video.\n Therefore, the audio and visual content are synchronized, depicting a large, illuminated truck with a loud horn moving through a city street at night.\n\\boxed{A large, brightly lit truck with a prominent horn drives down a street at night.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio captures the loud, multi-tonal horn of a large vehicle, such as a train or truck, accompanied by a prominent engine rumble.\n The visual shows a brightly lit, large truck driving down a street at night, illuminated by numerous yellow and red lights.\n The truck is moving from right to left in the frame.\n The horn sound is consistent with the large vehicle seen in the video.\n Therefore, the audio and visual content are synchronized, depicting a large, illuminated truck with a loud horn moving through a city street at night.\n\\boxed{A large, brightly lit truck with a prominent horn drives down a street at night.}", "cot": "[\"The audio captures the loud, multi-tonal horn of a large vehicle, such as a train or truck, accompanied by a prominent engine rumble.\\n The visual shows a brightly lit, large truck driving down a street at night, illuminated by numerous yellow and red lights.\\n The truck is moving from right to left in the frame.\\n The horn sound is consistent with the large vehicle seen in the video.\\n Therefore, the audio and visual content are synchronized, depicting a large, illuminated truck with a loud horn moving through a city street at night.\\n\\\\boxed{A large, brightly lit truck with a prominent horn drives down a street at night.}\", \"A large, brightly lit truck decorated with string lights is the main subject of a low-resolution, blurry night scene. The truck is moving forward, with its red taillights glowing and flashing, while a crowd of people stands on the sidewalk on the right. The audio consists of the deep rumble of a large engine, loud, prolonged horn blasts, and the ambient sounds of a crowd at what sounds like a parade or public event.\", \"At night, a parade floats down a street, with a large, brightly lit truck in the foreground, while the sound of a loud, blaring train horn is heard.\", \"A large, brightly lit truck decorated with string lights drives down a crowded street at night, while a loud, multi-tone train horn sounds in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 65.071, "generation_time_seconds": 62.7421, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.63, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "270", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The  mountain road is enveloped in fog, with moss-covered rocks and a gentle stream flowing alongside, as a waterfall cascades in the distant valley, accompanied .", "pred": "A narrow, wet, moss-covered path winds down a steep mountainside, with a dense evergreen forest and mist-filled valley visible below, accompanied by the continuous, loud rushing and gurgling of a large volume of flowing water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A narrow, wet, moss-covered path winds down a steep mountainside, with a dense evergreen forest and mist-filled valley visible below, accompanied by the continuous, loud rushing and gurgling of a large volume of flowing water.", "cot": "[\"A narrow, wet, moss-covered path winds down a steep mountainside, with a dense evergreen forest and mist-filled valley visible below, accompanied by the continuous, loud rushing and gurgling of a large volume of flowing water.\", \"The image displays a mossy, rocky mountainside with a dense evergreen forest below and mist in the valley, while the audio consists of a continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble, suggesting a heavy vehicle or engine is operating nearby.\", \"The image shows a moss-covered, rocky mountainside next to a dense, foggy pine forest. The audio consists of the continuous, loud sound of rushing and splashing water.\", \"A narrow, moss-covered path runs along a steep, verdant mountainside under an overcast sky, while the continuous, gentle sound of flowing water is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 48.754, "generation_time_seconds": 43.4589, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.51, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "271", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman laughs and talks as a horse clip-clops through a grassy field, with a brown horse standing in front of a barn in the background.", "pred": "The video shows a close-up of a brown horse's head in a grassy field, while the audio captures the sound of a person laughing and speaking affectionately, saying \"Good boy.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of a brown horse's head in a grassy field, while the audio captures the sound of a person laughing and speaking affectionately, saying \"Good boy.\"", "cot": "[\"The video shows a close-up of a brown horse's head in a grassy field, while the audio captures the sound of a person laughing and speaking affectionately, saying \\\"Good boy.\\\"\", \"A light-colored horse runs across a grassy field next to a white fence, while a person speaks and laughs in the background.\", \"The camera follows a light-colored horse galloping across a grassy field, with a dog briefly visible in the background, while a person laughs and speaks off-screen.\", \"A light-colored horse is running on a grassy field with a dog. A person is laughing and speaking, saying \\\"Good boy.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 38.167, "generation_time_seconds": 37.3899, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "272", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man riding a motorcycle on a dirt road with the engine running loudly, drowning out muffled speech.", "pred": "A person wearing a helmet is riding a blue and white dirt bike on a brown dirt track. The dirt bike's engine is loud and revving. A male voice is heard speaking over the engine noise.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing a helmet is riding a blue and white dirt bike on a brown dirt track. The dirt bike's engine is loud and revving. A male voice is heard speaking over the engine noise.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing a helmet is riding a blue and white dirt bike on a brown dirt track. The dirt bike's engine is loud and revving. A male voice is heard speaking over the engine noise.\", \"A person wearing a helmet rides a white and blue dirt bike on a brown dirt track, kicking up dust, while the loud, roaring engine of the motorcycle dominates the audio.\\n\\\\boxed{A dirt biker in a helmet rides a white and blue motorcycle on a dirt track, the loud roar of its engine filling the air.}\", \"A motocross rider on a blue and white bike speeds around a dirt track, kicking up dust, while a loud, rumbling engine is heard and a person shouts.\", \"A person wearing a helmet and protective gear is riding a motorcycle on a dirt track, kicking up dust as the engine revs loudly, while a person in a yellow shirt stands near a red and white barrier.\"]", "time_sec": 48.806, "generation_time_seconds": 47.5431, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "273", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a fenced grassy field, a man speaks as a distant dog barks, while the wind rustles through the microphone, capturing the peaceful scene of sheep grazing nearby.", "pred": "A black and white dog herds three white sheep across a green lawn towards a large metal gate, while a person in the background repeatedly shouts encouragement like \"Go, go!\" and \"Bring them up!\".", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black and white dog herds three white sheep across a green lawn towards a large metal gate, while a person in the background repeatedly shouts encouragement like \"Go, go!\" and \"Bring them up!\".", "cot": "[\"A black and white dog herds three white sheep across a green lawn towards a large metal gate, while a person in the background repeatedly shouts encouragement like \\\"Go, go!\\\" and \\\"Bring them up!\\\".\", \"A black-and-white dog herds three sheep across a green lawn towards a large metal gate, while a person shouts commands and the sheep bleat in response.\", \"A black and white dog herds three sheep across a green lawn towards a large metal gate, while a person repeatedly encourages them with the words, \\\"Let's go, go, go, go, go, come on, come on, let's go, come on.\\\"\", \"A black and white dog herds three white sheep across a green lawn toward a large metal gate, while a male voice repeatedly encourages them with the phrase \\\"Good girl, good girl, good girl.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 45.654, "generation_time_seconds": 44.1613, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.52, "GAVIE-Rel": 4.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "274", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the backyard, a young woman in a red shirt holds  a frog croaks, and a girl and boy speak, as a snake lurks in the grass with a shovel nearby.", "pred": "A coiled snake is on the grass. A person uses a shovel to move the snake while several people talk and laugh.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A coiled snake is on the grass. A person uses a shovel to move the snake while several people talk and laugh.", "cot": "[\"A coiled snake is on the grass. A person uses a shovel to move the snake while several people talk and laugh.\", \"A woman in a red shirt is shown, followed by a snake on the grass as a shovel is brought near it. A person then uses the shovel to move the snake. In the background, a pop song plays while women speak and a child cries.\", \"1.  **Visuals:** A large, dark-colored snake is coiled in green grass. A person wearing black shorts uses a shovel to interact with the snake, attempting to lift or move it.\\n2.  **Audio:** Overlapping human voices express strong emotion. A female voice exclaims \\\"Ew!\\\" and \\\"No, what are you doing?\\\", indicating distress or disgust. Another voice says \\\"You don't know where its head is.\\\"\\n3.  **Synthesis:** The scene depicts a person using a shovel on a snake while others nearby react with fear and concern, suggesting a tense wildlife removal or handling situation.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A person uses a shovel to handle a large snake while others nearby express fear and exclaim \\\"Ew!\\\" and \\\"No, what are you doing?\\\".}\", \"A person uses a shovel to move a snake on the grass, while a woman speaks and a child exclaims in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 61.64, "generation_time_seconds": 60.1011, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0007, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "275", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a toilet flushing accompanies a blurry image of a white toilet with a black seat next to a trash can.", "pred": "A toilet flushes, followed by the sound of a door opening and closing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A toilet flushes, followed by the sound of a door opening and closing.", "cot": "[\"A toilet flushes, followed by the sound of a door opening and closing.\", \"The video displays a white toilet bowl, a tiled floor, and a urinal partition, while the audio captures the sound of a toilet flushing followed by a door closing.\", \"The video shows a bathroom with multiple white urinals and a toilet against tiled walls. A toilet is flushed, followed by the sound of a door closing and a low, continuous hum.\", \"The sequence of shots, starting with a toilet and then a urinal, is accompanied by the sound of a toilet flushing and a subsequent squeaky door closing.\"]", "time_sec": 36.808, "generation_time_seconds": 36.0762, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "276", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Emergency vehicle sirens blare as two adult males converse on a dark city street at night, with cars and fire trucks driving down the road past a gas station with red lights.", "pred": "A view from inside a car at night shows red taillights ahead, a green traffic light, and a white car on the right. Simultaneously, a loud, high-pitched siren approaches and passes, followed by a man speaking in Japanese over a public address system.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A view from inside a car at night shows red taillights ahead, a green traffic light, and a white car on the right. Simultaneously, a loud, high-pitched siren approaches and passes, followed by a man speaking in Japanese over a public address system.", "cot": "[\"A view from inside a car at night shows red taillights ahead, a green traffic light, and a white car on the right. Simultaneously, a loud, high-pitched siren approaches and passes, followed by a man speaking in Japanese over a public address system.\", \"From a dashcam perspective at night, a white car is stopped at a red light, while a loud, wailing siren approaches from the right and passes by.\\n\\\\boxed{A white car waits at a red light at night as a loud, wailing siren approaches and passes from the right.}\", \"From a dashcam perspective at night, a vehicle is stopped behind another car at a red light. Simultaneously, a loud, wailing siren from an emergency vehicle approaches from the right and passes by the scene.\", \"The video shows a nighttime urban street scene from a vehicle's dashcam perspective, featuring a red traffic light, illuminated buildings, and a white car stopped ahead. Simultaneously, the audio captures a loud, wailing emergency vehicle siren approaching and then passing by, indicating the presence of a police car, fire truck, or ambulance. The siren's pitch drops as it passes the stationary recording vehicle.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A nighttime dashcam view of a city street with a red light and stopped traffic is accompanied by the sound of a rapidly approaching and then receding emergency vehicle siren.}\"]", "time_sec": 63.627, "generation_time_seconds": 62.4719, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "277", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a serene setting, a man in a blue boat floats on the water, laughing joyfully as distant hums and birds chirp in the background.and water waves came", "pred": "A blue catamaran with a motor is moving across the water, and the sound of a boat engine is audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A blue catamaran with a motor is moving across the water, and the sound of a boat engine is audible.", "cot": "[\"A blue catamaran with a motor is moving across the water, and the sound of a boat engine is audible.\", \"A blue, motorized canoe with a person in it moves across a body of water, creating a wake, while the distinct squeaking of a swing set is heard in the background.\", \"A blue racing canoe with two occupants moves across the water, creating splashes, while the sound of a car is heard in the background.\", \"A blue racing shell with two people is on a lake, and a person is laughing.\"]", "time_sec": 35.874, "generation_time_seconds": 34.6399, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "278", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "An adult male is speaking while crinkling plastic, with soft music playing in the background, as a person holds a small package of headphones in their hands next to a camera and a blue case.", "pred": "A person's hands open a blue and white box to remove a headset with a mini-USB adapter, while a male voice narrates the unboxing process.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands open a blue and white box to remove a headset with a mini-USB adapter, while a male voice narrates the unboxing process.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands open a blue and white box to remove a headset with a mini-USB adapter, while a male voice narrates the unboxing process.\", \"A person's hands unbox a teal and white retail box, removing a headset in a clear plastic bag. While a male speaker identifies the item as a \\\"headset with the mini USB adapter,\\\" the distinct sound of crinkling plastic is heard as he handles the packaging.\", \"A person unboxes a headset with a mini USB adapter, speaking as they remove the item from its packaging.\", \"A person's hands remove a black headset from its clear plastic packaging and a white box. As the plastic is crinkled, the person identifies it as a headset with a mini-USB adapter.\"]", "time_sec": 41.67, "generation_time_seconds": 40.7856, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "279", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The vehicle horn beeps as it approaches the light at the end of the dark tunnel.", "pred": "A dark, narrow corridor with a metal roller shutter on the left and a dark vehicle with a bright headlight on the right is accompanied by the sound of a vehicle horn.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A dark, narrow corridor with a metal roller shutter on the left and a dark vehicle with a bright headlight on the right is accompanied by the sound of a vehicle horn.", "cot": "[\"A dark, narrow corridor with a metal roller shutter on the left and a dark vehicle with a bright headlight on the right is accompanied by the sound of a vehicle horn.\", \"A dark, narrow alleyway illuminated by a single bright light features a large, dark vehicle on the right. The sound of a vehicle's horn is heard twice.\", \"A dark, narrow corridor with a bright light source on the right is shown. The sound of a train horn is heard, followed by a series of beeps.\", \"A dark, narrow alleyway is illuminated by a bright, vertical light source against a corrugated metal wall, when a loud, sustained, low-pitched horn blast is heard.\\n\\\\boxed{A bright vertical light illuminates a dark alleyway with a corrugated wall, as a loud, sustained horn blast is heard.}\"]", "time_sec": 45.204, "generation_time_seconds": 44.2091, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "280", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a telephone dialing tone and a plastic switch flipping on and off, set against a blue background with a logo featuring the earth, a man and a woman in blue bathrobes, and a serene blue sky.", "pred": "The video displays a hand holding a silver flip phone next to a breadboard with a lit lightbulb, followed by a blue screen with white text credits for \"Jeffrey MacNeill,\" \"Chris Matthe,\" and a logo design credit to \"Eric @ www.soloman.com.\" The audio consists of a single, sustained, low-pitched electronic tone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a hand holding a silver flip phone next to a breadboard with a lit lightbulb, followed by a blue screen with white text credits for \"Jeffrey MacNeill,\" \"Chris Matthe,\" and a logo design credit to \"Eric @ www.soloman.com.\" The audio consists of a single, sustained, low-pitched electronic tone.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a hand holding a silver flip phone next to a breadboard with a lit lightbulb, followed by a blue screen with white text credits for \\\"Jeffrey MacNeill,\\\" \\\"Chris Matthe,\\\" and a logo design credit to \\\"Eric @ www.soloman.com.\\\" The audio consists of a single, sustained, low-pitched electronic tone.\", \"A hand holds a silver flip phone in front of a circuit board, which activates a light bulb, followed by a blue screen displaying white text for credits and a logo.\", \"A person holds a silver flip phone over a breadboard with an illuminated lightbulb, while a low-frequency buzzer sounds. The scene cuts to a blue screen with white text, including the name \\\"Jeffrey MacNeill\\\" and a website address for a logo design.\", \"A hand holds a silver flip phone over a cluttered electronics workbench with a breadboard, wires, and a lit light bulb, while a low, continuous electronic hum is audible.\"]", "time_sec": 50.061, "generation_time_seconds": 49.3786, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.91, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "281", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a motor revving up accompanies a close-up of a motorcycle engine being inspected.", "pred": "The camera moves around a car's engine bay, showing the radiator and engine block. A person holds up a black Mercedes-Benz key fob. A male voice explains the engine has been off for days, but the fan is still running, which is confirmed by the loud, continuous whirring sound of the fan.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The camera moves around a car's engine bay, showing the radiator and engine block. A person holds up a black Mercedes-Benz key fob. A male voice explains the engine has been off for days, but the fan is still running, which is confirmed by the loud, continuous whirring sound of the fan.", "cot": "[\"The camera moves around a car's engine bay, showing the radiator and engine block. A person holds up a black Mercedes-Benz key fob. A male voice explains the engine has been off for days, but the fan is still running, which is confirmed by the loud, continuous whirring sound of the fan.\", \"A hand holds a Mercedes-Benz key fob over a car engine bay. A man speaks about the engine not running for days, but the fan continues to run. The audio ends with a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine.\", \"A hand holds a Mercedes-Benz key fob next to a car with its hood open. An engine is idling and the fan is running, accompanied by a person speaking.\", \"A shaky camera shows a car engine bay, where a hand holds a Mercedes-Benz key fob. A man states the engine hasn't run in days, but the fan is still running. The loud, high-pitched whine of the fan is the dominant sound.\"]", "time_sec": 50.268, "generation_time_seconds": 49.5866, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.64, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "282", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a dimly lit cave, a man with a knife in hand laughs with a group of men as metal clacks and bangs echo, while debris floats in the water nearby.", "pred": "The audio features the sound of a shovel digging in dirt, followed by a man speaking in Hindi and then laughing. The visual shows a person's feet and hands using a shovel to dig a hole in the ground at night, with a flashlight illuminating the scene.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features the sound of a shovel digging in dirt, followed by a man speaking in Hindi and then laughing. The visual shows a person's feet and hands using a shovel to dig a hole in the ground at night, with a flashlight illuminating the scene.", "cot": "[\"The audio features the sound of a shovel digging in dirt, followed by a man speaking in Hindi and then laughing. The visual shows a person's feet and hands using a shovel to dig a hole in the ground at night, with a flashlight illuminating the scene.\", \"The video shows a person's hands and legs on a wet, muddy ground at night, using a red flashlight and a stick. A goat is heard bleating, followed by a man speaking, another man laughing, and a final loud, distorted electronic buzzer sound.\", \"A person wearing sandals is digging in dirt with a hoe, and another person is holding a red flashlight. The sound of digging is heard, followed by a man speaking in a foreign language, then a loud slap sound, and finally laughter.\", \"A person is digging in the ground with a hoe, which produces a scraping sound.\\n A male voice speaks, followed by the sound of something breaking.\\n A female voice then laughs.\"]", "time_sec": 48.469, "generation_time_seconds": 47.4946, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "283", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a motorbike revving echoes as a man in a blue helmet rides a motorcycle on a race track, thrilling a crowd of spectators.", "pred": "A motorcycle rider in blue and yellow gear starts a race from a drag strip, the engine roaring loudly as he accelerates down the track past a person in a black uniform, with spectators watching from bleachers in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A motorcycle rider in blue and yellow gear starts a race from a drag strip, the engine roaring loudly as he accelerates down the track past a person in a black uniform, with spectators watching from bleachers in the background.", "cot": "[\"A motorcycle rider in blue and yellow gear starts a race from a drag strip, the engine roaring loudly as he accelerates down the track past a person in a black uniform, with spectators watching from bleachers in the background.\", \"A motorcyclist in a blue and yellow suit sits on a black racing motorcycle at a starting line, with a crowd in bleachers behind them, while the powerful, deep roar of a large engine is heard.\", \"A motorcycle racer in blue and yellow gear sits on a black Suzuki Hayabusa at a drag strip, then accelerates rapidly down the track as the deep roar of its powerful engine fills the air.\", \"A man in a blue and yellow racing suit sits on a black and silver sport motorcycle at a starting line, with a crowd watching from bleachers, as the powerful engine roars loudly and revs up at the beginning of a race.\\n\\\\boxed{A man in a blue and yellow racing suit sits on a black and silver sport motorcycle at a starting line, with a crowd watching from bleachers, as the powerful engine roars loudly and revs up at the beginning of a race.}\"]", "time_sec": 54.568, "generation_time_seconds": 53.4254, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "284", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a cacophony of sound and sight, a man speaks amidst hissing, cooing pigeons, and flapping bird wings, as several planes and flocks of birds soar through the sky.", "pred": "A flock of birds flies across a pale, overcast sky while a man speaks in Greek, his voice calm and conversational.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A flock of birds flies across a pale, overcast sky while a man speaks in Greek, his voice calm and conversational.", "cot": "[\"A flock of birds flies across a pale, overcast sky while a man speaks in Greek, his voice calm and conversational.\", \"The visual shows multiple dark birds in flight against a grey sky. The accompanying audio features a person speaking in Greek, followed by a continuous, low-pitched buzzing sound that may be from an insect.\", \"Multiple dark birds fly across a uniform grey sky while a man speaks in Greek and faint bird cooing is audible in the background.\", \"Multiple dark birds fly in a V-formation across a pale, overcast sky, while a person speaks in Greek and the sound of flapping wings is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 39.091, "generation_time_seconds": 37.3082, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "285", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "During a storm, high waves crash against a sea wall as wind howls .", "pred": "A long, dark concrete pier extends into a choppy, grey-green sea under an overcast sky.\n Powerful waves crash against the pier, sending white spray high into the air.\n The sound of the ocean is constant, accompanied by strong, gusting wind.\n\\boxed{A concrete pier extends into a choppy sea where powerful waves crash, creating loud splashing and sustained wind sounds.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A long, dark concrete pier extends into a choppy, grey-green sea under an overcast sky.\n Powerful waves crash against the pier, sending white spray high into the air.\n The sound of the ocean is constant, accompanied by strong, gusting wind.\n\\boxed{A concrete pier extends into a choppy sea where powerful waves crash, creating loud splashing and sustained wind sounds.}", "cot": "[\"A long, dark concrete pier extends into a choppy, grey-green sea under an overcast sky.\\n Powerful waves crash against the pier, sending white spray high into the air.\\n The sound of the ocean is constant, accompanied by strong, gusting wind.\\n\\\\boxed{A concrete pier extends into a choppy sea where powerful waves crash, creating loud splashing and sustained wind sounds.}\", \"The video displays a stormy coastline with large, white-capped waves crashing against a long, dark concrete breakwater under an overcast sky.\\n Simultaneously, the audio captures the intense, roaring wind and the continuous, powerful crashing of these large waves.\\n\\\\boxed{A long concrete breakwater endures crashing waves under a stormy sky, accompanied by the roaring wind and the thunderous sound of surf.}\", \"The audio captures the loud, roaring sound of strong wind. Simultaneously, the video shows powerful, turbulent waves crashing against a long concrete pier under a grey sky.\", \"Strong, gusting wind blows across a concrete sea wall, causing large waves with whitecaps to break violently against its side.\"]", "time_sec": 53.493, "generation_time_seconds": 52.8758, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "286", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black dog standing in the snow looking at a bear, while squealing from a pig,and in the video car visible.", "pred": "The video shows a red and black all-terrain vehicle moving across a dirt or sandy terrain. The audio consists of a continuous, high-pitched electronic beep, reminiscent of a warning signal, starting at 00:02 and continuing throughout the clip. There is no audible engine or environmental noise.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a red and black all-terrain vehicle moving across a dirt or sandy terrain. The audio consists of a continuous, high-pitched electronic beep, reminiscent of a warning signal, starting at 00:02 and continuing throughout the clip. There is no audible engine or environmental noise.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a red and black all-terrain vehicle moving across a dirt or sandy terrain. The audio consists of a continuous, high-pitched electronic beep, reminiscent of a warning signal, starting at 00:02 and continuing throughout the clip. There is no audible engine or environmental noise.\", \"The video shows a red and black all-terrain vehicle (ATV) in motion on a dirt path, viewed from a low, shaky angle. The audio consists of loud, high-pitched squealing and squeaking sounds, characteristic of tires losing traction on a dry surface, accompanied by the low rumble of the engine.\", \"The video shows a red and black all-terrain vehicle (ATV) driving on a dirt path, while the audio consists of loud, aggressive pig grunts and snorts.\", \"The video opens with a shaky, close-up view of a muddy surface and a person's dark shoe. The camera then pans erratically to reveal a red all-terrain vehicle (ATV) parked on a dirt path, with trees forming the background. The audio consists of a series of high-pitched, drawn-out squeals or whines, which are the dominant sound throughout the clip.\"]", "time_sec": 56.319, "generation_time_seconds": 55.6741, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.52, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "287", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A white goat with horns stands in the grass next to a kid, as the goat baas and footsteps shuffle on foliage, followed by a series of licking.", "pred": "A white goat with horns is licking a newborn, pink goat lying on its side on the grass; the newborn makes soft bleating sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white goat with horns is licking a newborn, pink goat lying on its side on the grass; the newborn makes soft bleating sounds.", "cot": "[\"A white goat with horns is licking a newborn, pink goat lying on its side on the grass; the newborn makes soft bleating sounds.\", \"A white goat with horns is licking a newborn, pale-colored goat lying on its back on green grass, while a high-pitched, repeated bleating sound is heard.\", \"A white goat with horns stands over a newborn, pale kid lying on the ground covered in a translucent birth membrane, while the newborn bleats repeatedly.\", \"The video shows a mother goat with horns licking a newborn, pale-colored kid that is lying on the grass with its umbilical cord still attached. The audio consists of the newborn kid's continuous, high-pitched bleating.\"]", "time_sec": 41.11, "generation_time_seconds": 39.9036, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 38.71, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "288", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the dark of night, two small green frogs croak on a branch as plastic flutters in the background.", "pred": "\\boxed{Two bright green tree frogs are illuminated on a wet, textured surface at night, while a loud, continuous, high-pitched buzzing sound, like a power tool, is heard.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "This is a night scene featuring two bright green tree frogs perched on a wet, textured surface, likely a tree or rock, with out-of-focus foliage in the background. The frogs are illuminated by an artificial light source, possibly a flashlight, which causes their skin to appear yellowish-green and creates a dark, wet sheen on the surface. The frog on the right is slightly more forward and appears to be blinking or moving its head, while the one on the left is more still. A continuous, high-pitched, electronic buzzing or whining sound is audible throughout the clip. This sound is characteristic of a mechanical device, such as a drill, sander, or saw, in operation.\n\n\\boxed{Two bright green tree frogs are illuminated on a wet, textured surface at night, while a loud, continuous, high-pitched buzzing sound, like a power tool, is heard.}", "cot": "[\"This is a night scene featuring two bright green tree frogs perched on a wet, textured surface, likely a tree or rock, with out-of-focus foliage in the background. The frogs are illuminated by an artificial light source, possibly a flashlight, which causes their skin to appear yellowish-green and creates a dark, wet sheen on the surface. The frog on the right is slightly more forward and appears to be blinking or moving its head, while the one on the left is more still. A continuous, high-pitched, electronic buzzing or whining sound is audible throughout the clip. This sound is characteristic of a mechanical device, such as a drill, sander, or saw, in operation.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{Two bright green tree frogs are illuminated on a wet, textured surface at night, while a loud, continuous, high-pitched buzzing sound, like a power tool, is heard.}\", \"This is a nighttime shot of two small, bright green frogs on a wet, dark log. One frog on the right is stationary, while the frog on the left is actively moving its legs. The scene is illuminated by a direct light source, possibly a flashlight. The audio consists of a loud, high-pitched, continuous electronic tone that starts abruptly and stops at the end.\", \"Two bright green frogs are positioned on a wet, dark rock. One frog on the right suddenly extends its long, sticky tongue. The distinct, high-pitched croaking of a frog is heard in the audio.\", \"Two small, bright green frogs are perched on a wet, dark log at night. One frog remains still while the other makes small movements. The primary audio is a loud, rhythmic croaking, consistent with a frog chorus, which is layered with a high-pitched, continuous electronic tone.\"]", "time_sec": 75.431, "generation_time_seconds": 74.797, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "289", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of chirping birds, a man secures a piece of wood to the roof of a home using a chain they are two mens.", "pred": "An outdoor scene shows two men near a shed and a wooden structure, with one man holding a chain. A man's voice suggests they might be able to take off a shelf.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "An outdoor scene shows two men near a shed and a wooden structure, with one man holding a chain. A man's voice suggests they might be able to take off a shelf.", "cot": "[\"An outdoor scene shows two men near a shed and a wooden structure, with one man holding a chain. A man's voice suggests they might be able to take off a shelf.\", \"Two men work on a wooden structure in front of a grey shed. One man, wearing a black cap and sunglasses, handles a chain while the other man, in a red shirt, stands behind him. A man's voice is heard speaking conversationally, saying, \\\"Yeah, we might be able to get right to take off the bottom shelf.\\\" This is followed by another man replying, \\\"Oh yeah,\\\" and then a series of beeps.\", \"A man in a baseball cap and sunglasses pulls on a heavy chain attached to a wooden beam, while another man in a red shirt stands under the structure; a male voice discusses removing a shelf.\", \"Two men are working on a wooden structure; one in a black hat pulls a metal chain, while the other in a red shirt observes. An off-screen voice discusses removing a bottom shelf, accompanied by a thud and a high-pitched squeak.\"]", "time_sec": 53.469, "generation_time_seconds": 51.7804, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "290", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a green car, a young man accelerates the mid-size engine, as random knocks and whizzes occur, ready to be installed.", "pred": "The video displays a detailed view of a complex, green-painted car engine with numerous hoses and parts. This visual is accompanied by the loud, high-revving sound of a powerful engine being started and aggressively revved repeatedly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a detailed view of a complex, green-painted car engine with numerous hoses and parts. This visual is accompanied by the loud, high-revving sound of a powerful engine being started and aggressively revved repeatedly.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a detailed view of a complex, green-painted car engine with numerous hoses and parts. This visual is accompanied by the loud, high-revving sound of a powerful engine being started and aggressively revved repeatedly.\", \"A person in a green shirt is shown inside a car with a green engine bay, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched mechanical whine of a supercharger.\", \"A close-up reveals a green car's engine bay filled with hoses and wires, then the view shifts to a person in a green shirt sitting in the driver's seat as the car's engine starts and revs loudly.\", \"A man in a green shirt sits in the driver's seat of a black car with lime green engine components. The audio captures the sounds of a car engine starting, then revving aggressively.\"]", "time_sec": 43.394, "generation_time_seconds": 42.5917, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "291", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman in blue delivers a speech in front of a large screen with a television on.", "pred": "A young woman stands in front of a screen displaying a red background with the text \"Vietnamese New Years\" in yellow and \"Tet By Claudia Phan\" in white. She is speaking, and her voice is accompanied by the distinct, rhythmic sound of a didgeridoo playing in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young woman stands in front of a screen displaying a red background with the text \"Vietnamese New Years\" in yellow and \"Tet By Claudia Phan\" in white. She is speaking, and her voice is accompanied by the distinct, rhythmic sound of a didgeridoo playing in the background.", "cot": "[\"A young woman stands in front of a screen displaying a red background with the text \\\"Vietnamese New Years\\\" in yellow and \\\"Tet By Claudia Phan\\\" in white. She is speaking, and her voice is accompanied by the distinct, rhythmic sound of a didgeridoo playing in the background.\", \"The audio features a woman speaking in English, explaining the meaning of the Vietnamese New Year (Tet), while the visual shows her standing next to a screen displaying the words \\\"Vietnamese New Years\\\" in large, stylized yellow text on a red background.\", \"A young woman in a blue shirt stands to the left of a television screen, which displays a red background with the yellow text \\\"Vietnamese New Years.\\\" She speaks, explaining that the term \\\"Tet\\\" means the first morning of the first day of a new period, marking the beginning of a new year on the lunar calendar.\", \"A young woman in a blue shirt stands in front of a large screen displaying a red background with yellow text that reads \\\"Vietnamese New Years\\\" and \\\"TEST By Claudia Phan\\\". She speaks clearly, defining the term \\\"Tết\\\" as the first morning of the first day of a new period, marking the beginning of a new year on a lunar calendar.\"]", "time_sec": 59.438, "generation_time_seconds": 58.696, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "292", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The idling engine hums and rattles like a boat with a yellow and blue engine parked on a trailer, reminiscent of a race car.", "pred": "A yellow and white speedboat with a large, exposed chrome engine on its trailer is shown, while the loud, rhythmic chugging of a large, old engine is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A yellow and white speedboat with a large, exposed chrome engine on its trailer is shown, while the loud, rhythmic chugging of a large, old engine is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A yellow and white speedboat with a large, exposed chrome engine on its trailer is shown, while the loud, rhythmic chugging of a large, old engine is heard in the background.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a custom yellow and white boat with a large, exposed chrome engine on its trailer, while an audio recording captures the sound of a vehicle's engine starting and sputtering.\", \"The video provides a close-up view of a custom yellow and white hot rod engine with chrome components, while the audio captures the loud, deep, and rough sound of its powerful engine idling.\", \"The video shows the engine compartment of a yellow and blue boat, revealing a large, silver, V8 engine with chrome components, while the audio consists of a loud, low-pitched engine running at an idle.\"]", "time_sec": 45.402, "generation_time_seconds": 43.909, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "293", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a serene black and white setting, a small white bird in a cage receives two loud wolf whistles, while another white bird perched on a branch has a small parrot sitting on top of it.", "pred": "A black and white close-up shows a cockatiel perched on a branch. The bird emits a high-pitched, whistling sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black and white close-up shows a cockatiel perched on a branch. The bird emits a high-pitched, whistling sound.", "cot": "[\"A black and white close-up shows a cockatiel perched on a branch. The bird emits a high-pitched, whistling sound.\", \"A black and white image displays a cockatiel perched on a bar, while a high-pitched, descending whistle is heard.\", \"The video displays a black-and-white, close-up view of a cockatiel with its crest raised, perched on a branch. Concurrently, the audio features a series of high-pitched, descending \\\"wheee\\\" sounds, characteristic of a bird call, which are repeated twice. The visual provides a static, monochrome image of the bird, while the audio is a distinct, mechanical-sounding bird vocalization, likely from a toy or an unrelated animal, not the cockatiel in the frame.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A black-and-white close-up shows a cockatiel on a branch, accompanied by two descending, high-pitched \\\"wheee\\\" sounds.}\", \"A black and white video shows a cockatiel perched on a horizontal bar, its crest feathers raised, while the distinct sound of a two-tone electronic whistle is heard repeatedly.\"]", "time_sec": 54.924, "generation_time_seconds": 54.0089, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "294", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man speaks with a small motor buzzing and wind blowing as a yellow helicopter flies low over a green field.", "pred": "A red and yellow helicopter flies over a green, hilly landscape under a cloudy sky, while the loud, continuous buzzing of a power tool is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red and yellow helicopter flies over a green, hilly landscape under a cloudy sky, while the loud, continuous buzzing of a power tool is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A red and yellow helicopter flies over a green, hilly landscape under a cloudy sky, while the loud, continuous buzzing of a power tool is heard in the background.\", \"The audio contains the sound of a helicopter, but the visual shows a small red and yellow airplane flying over a green, tree-covered hillside.\", \"A red and yellow helicopter flies through a cloudy sky over a green, hilly landscape, while a loud, high-pitched whirring sound is heard.\", \"A red and yellow helicopter flies through a cloudy sky above a green, rolling landscape. Simultaneously, a loud, high-pitched mechanical buzzing sound, like a chainsaw or electric drill, is heard, along with a person speaking in German.\"]", "time_sec": 41.324, "generation_time_seconds": 40.2523, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 37.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "295", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio of a woman crying is followed by a women talking, as a woman covers her face with her hand while looking at a phone, conveying a sense of emotional distress and communication.", "pred": "A woman is crying and speaking, followed by a second woman speaking, while a baby is held in a room.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman is crying and speaking, followed by a second woman speaking, while a baby is held in a room.", "cot": "[\"A woman is crying and speaking, followed by a second woman speaking, while a baby is held in a room.\", \"A woman is crying and speaking emotionally while holding a baby wrapped in a white blanket, and another woman is heard speaking consolingly in the background.\", \"A woman is on a video call, crying and covering her face while saying she needs to feed her child.\", \"A woman's face is shown close-up, her hand covering her mouth as she cries. She asks, \\\"Where's my formula?\\\" and says she has to feed her child.\"]", "time_sec": 36.281, "generation_time_seconds": 35.3652, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.59, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "296", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Amidst the rustling noises, a woman in a cowboy hat stands in an arena with a horse, cow, and other people, creating a lively scene of animal interactions and community engagement.", "pred": "Inside a sandy livestock show ring, people hold sheep while a crowd watches from behind a fence; simultaneously, loud bleating from the animals is audible, and a person shouts, \"Come on, baby!\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Inside a sandy livestock show ring, people hold sheep while a crowd watches from behind a fence; simultaneously, loud bleating from the animals is audible, and a person shouts, \"Come on, baby!\"", "cot": "[\"Inside a sandy livestock show ring, people hold sheep while a crowd watches from behind a fence; simultaneously, loud bleating from the animals is audible, and a person shouts, \\\"Come on, baby!\\\"\", \"A young person in a white shirt and jeans stands in a sandy arena, holding a small black and white goat by the neck. The goat is actively struggling and bleating loudly, while other people watch from behind a fence.\", \"In a sandy arena, a person holds a black-faced sheep while another person holds a goat, with a crowd watching behind a fence, all accompanied by the bleating of the animals.\", \"Inside a sandy arena, a person in a white shirt holds a small, white and black goat while another person stands nearby; the goat is heard bleating loudly, and the sound of a crowd is audible in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 44.916, "generation_time_seconds": 44.1248, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "297", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man working on an old sewing machine with a red needle, creating a quick burst of vibrations with clicking and rattling sounds.", "pred": "A person's hands operate a white sewing machine, guiding a piece of red fabric under the needle. The machine's motor produces a rapid, rhythmic, mechanical whirring and clicking sound as it stitches the material.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands operate a white sewing machine, guiding a piece of red fabric under the needle. The machine's motor produces a rapid, rhythmic, mechanical whirring and clicking sound as it stitches the material.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands operate a white sewing machine, guiding a piece of red fabric under the needle. The machine's motor produces a rapid, rhythmic, mechanical whirring and clicking sound as it stitches the material.\", \"A person's hands guide a red fabric under the needle of a white sewing machine, which is actively stitching with a loud, rhythmic clattering sound.\", \"A person's hands guide red fabric under the needle of a sewing machine. The machine starts with a whirring sound and then the needle begins to rapidly move up and down, creating a rhythmic clacking noise.\", \"A person's hands guide a piece of red fabric under the needle of a white sewing machine, which is actively stitching it with white thread, the sound of the machine's motor and rhythmic clatter filling the air.\"]", "time_sec": 44.224, "generation_time_seconds": 43.218, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.03, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "298", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A man talks as pigeons coo and flap, while a pigeon interact in various settings including a bathroom and near a table with food.", "pred": "The video shows a close-up of a white pigeon with black markings inside a wooden coop, which then cuts to a wider view of several white young geese walking in a dusty enclosure with a large feeder. Overlapping this visual is the sound of a male voice speaking in Dutch, asking, \"Zijn dat jonge gieren misschien?\" (Are those young giers maybe?), accompanied by the continuous cooing of pigeons and the sound of footsteps on gravel.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of a white pigeon with black markings inside a wooden coop, which then cuts to a wider view of several white young geese walking in a dusty enclosure with a large feeder. Overlapping this visual is the sound of a male voice speaking in Dutch, asking, \"Zijn dat jonge gieren misschien?\" (Are those young giers maybe?), accompanied by the continuous cooing of pigeons and the sound of footsteps on gravel.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a close-up of a white pigeon with black markings inside a wooden coop, which then cuts to a wider view of several white young geese walking in a dusty enclosure with a large feeder. Overlapping this visual is the sound of a male voice speaking in Dutch, asking, \\\"Zijn dat jonge gieren misschien?\\\" (Are those young giers maybe?), accompanied by the continuous cooing of pigeons and the sound of footsteps on gravel.\", \"The audio contains the sound of a chicken clucking and a person speaking in Dutch, while the video shows several young chickens, including white and speckled ones, in a wire cage and on a concrete floor next to a large white feeder.\", \"A small, dark-colored bird with white markings is in a cage with yellow feed. The scene then changes to a room where several white ducks are walking around and pecking at the ground, with a white hat resting on a bowl nearby. The distinct sound of a pigeon cooing is audible throughout the entire audio clip.\", \"In a cluttered indoor space, several white birds, resembling pigeons or doves, walk around and eat from a long feeder. One bird stands near a cone-shaped feeder. The sound of birds cooing is audible, and a person can be heard speaking in Dutch.\"]", "time_sec": 60.706, "generation_time_seconds": 59.9874, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.78, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "299", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a chainsaw cutting through wood echoes in the forest as a man works on a tree stump under the tall trees against a blue sky.and one man was moving", "pred": "A man wearing a red cap sits on a large tree stump and operates a chainsaw on a standing tree, while the loud, high-pitched, and buzzing sound of the chainsaw operating fills the air.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man wearing a red cap sits on a large tree stump and operates a chainsaw on a standing tree, while the loud, high-pitched, and buzzing sound of the chainsaw operating fills the air.", "cot": "[\"A man wearing a red cap sits on a large tree stump and operates a chainsaw on a standing tree, while the loud, high-pitched, and buzzing sound of the chainsaw operating fills the air.\", \"A man in a red helmet uses a chainsaw to cut down a tree on a grassy hill, while the loud, high-pitched buzzing of a chainsaw is heard.\", \"A man operates a chainsaw, cutting into a large tree trunk while the high-pitched, rhythmic buzzing of the engine fills the air.\", \"A person wearing a red helmet and blue jeans operates a red chainsaw to cut through a thick tree trunk on a grassy slope.\\nThe powerful, high-pitched whine of the chainsaw engine is the dominant sound.\\nThe person is actively cutting the tree, which is positioned at a stump.\\nThe background includes a green, grassy hill with scattered trees under a cloudy sky.\\nThe camera pans upward, showing the full height of the tree against the sky.\\nThe audio consists of the deep, resonant sound of the chainsaw cutting through wood.\\nThe scene takes place outdoors in what appears to be a rural or forested area.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A person uses a red chainsaw to cut down a large tree on a grassy hill, the sound of the engine prominent in the outdoor setting.}\"]", "time_sec": 61.021, "generation_time_seconds": 60.2093, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.64, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "300", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio-visual caption is: Gun shooting in the video", "pred": "A first-person shooter video game shows a player aiming a rifle down a narrow alley, with a 'Skype: allforyou1144' watermark and a heads-up display present, all while a hip-hop song with a heavy bassline and a male vocalist rapping plays in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A first-person shooter video game shows a player aiming a rifle down a narrow alley, with a 'Skype: allforyou1144' watermark and a heads-up display present, all while a hip-hop song with a heavy bassline and a male vocalist rapping plays in the background.", "cot": "[\"A first-person shooter video game shows a player aiming a rifle down a narrow alley, with a 'Skype: allforyou1144' watermark and a heads-up display present, all while a hip-hop song with a heavy bassline and a male vocalist rapping plays in the background.\", \"This is a first-person video game perspective showing a character aiming a firearm down a sunlit, narrow alleyway between buildings, with a heads-up display indicating a Skype username and ammunition count, all while a hip-hop song with a strong beat and male vocals plays in the background.\", \"A player in a first-person shooter game aims down the sights of a rifle in a war-torn urban environment, while a hip-hop track with a heavy beat and a male vocalist plays in the background.\", \"The video displays first-person shooter gameplay with a visible heads-up display, while the audio features an upbeat hip-hop track with a male vocalist rapping over a prominent, repetitive synth melody and a strong electronic beat.\"]", "time_sec": 50.821, "generation_time_seconds": 49.8238, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "301", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The room was filled with laughter as a woman sat at her desk in front of a laptop, with a man behind her, and others looking on.", "pred": "A woman sits at a desk with a laptop, while a smaller video in the upper right corner plays a chaotic scene of people laughing hysterically inside what appears to be a crowded subway car.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman sits at a desk with a laptop, while a smaller video in the upper right corner plays a chaotic scene of people laughing hysterically inside what appears to be a crowded subway car.", "cot": "[\"A woman sits at a desk with a laptop, while a smaller video in the upper right corner plays a chaotic scene of people laughing hysterically inside what appears to be a crowded subway car.\", \"A woman sits at a desk in front of a laptop, while a split-screen video on the laptop shows a crowded subway car with people laughing; this is accompanied by loud, chaotic, overlapping laughter from multiple people in the audio.\", \"The video presents a split-screen view of a woman in a classroom watching a chaotic subway scene, which is accompanied by the sound of a crowd laughing and shouting.\", \"A woman sits at a desk with a laptop, watching a video on its screen that shows a crowded train car where people are laughing and talking.\"]", "time_sec": 41.516, "generation_time_seconds": 40.4265, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "302", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The soothing sound of trickling water accompanies a woman carrying a yellow bucket filled with water.", "pred": "A person wearing a white shirt and blue jeans pours liquid from a yellow bucket into a clear plastic container on the ground. The sound of the liquid being poured is audible, followed by a single, high-pitched electronic beep.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing a white shirt and blue jeans pours liquid from a yellow bucket into a clear plastic container on the ground. The sound of the liquid being poured is audible, followed by a single, high-pitched electronic beep.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing a white shirt and blue jeans pours liquid from a yellow bucket into a clear plastic container on the ground. The sound of the liquid being poured is audible, followed by a single, high-pitched electronic beep.\", \"A person bends over and pours liquid from a yellow bucket into a smaller, clear plastic bucket on the ground. The distinct sound of a liquid being poured is heard, followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzzer.\", \"A person in a grassy area next to green beehives lifts a yellow bucket and pours its liquid contents into a clear plastic bottle, with the sound of the liquid pouring clearly audible.\", \"A person wearing a white shirt and blue jeans bends over next to several green beehives and pours a yellow liquid from a yellow bucket into a clear plastic jug, while the sound of liquid being poured is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 46.357, "generation_time_seconds": 44.3291, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "303", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man speaking while clicking on a keyboard is seen on the website, with a game running on the operating system software in the background.", "pred": "A screen recording displays a 3D fantasy game window on the left and a web browser on the right, while a person speaks and types the words \"claim web\" on a keyboard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A screen recording displays a 3D fantasy game window on the left and a web browser on the right, while a person speaks and types the words \"claim web\" on a keyboard.", "cot": "[\"A screen recording displays a 3D fantasy game window on the left and a web browser on the right, while a person speaks and types the words \\\"claim web\\\" on a keyboard.\", \"A computer screen displays a windowed video game with a character in a village, while a web browser and a text editor are open on the desktop. A person speaks and types on a keyboard, giving instructions to type \\\"claim web\\\" and mentioning a \\\"process\\\".\", \"The screen displays a computer desktop with a window for the game RuneScape and a web browser open to a forum post, while a person speaks instructions over the sound of keyboard typing.\", \"A screen recording displays a dark, medieval-themed MMORPG overlaid on a webpage with a text box, while a speaker gives instructions to type 'claim web', followed by the sound of keyboard typing.\"]", "time_sec": 45.357, "generation_time_seconds": 44.2243, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "304", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman's voice is heard as a group laughs, while a young boy in a red shirt plays a video game next to a small child surrounded by piles of presents and around a lot of toys.", "pred": "The video shows a young boy in a red shirt sitting on a carpeted floor, surrounded by numerous wrapped gifts, actively unwrapping a present and looking down at the item he is opening. Simultaneously, the audio captures the sound of a person speaking in Arabic, followed by the distinct bleating of a goat.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a young boy in a red shirt sitting on a carpeted floor, surrounded by numerous wrapped gifts, actively unwrapping a present and looking down at the item he is opening. Simultaneously, the audio captures the sound of a person speaking in Arabic, followed by the distinct bleating of a goat.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a young boy in a red shirt sitting on a carpeted floor, surrounded by numerous wrapped gifts, actively unwrapping a present and looking down at the item he is opening. Simultaneously, the audio captures the sound of a person speaking in Arabic, followed by the distinct bleating of a goat.\", \"A young boy in a red shirt sits on a carpeted floor surrounded by wrapped gifts, actively unwrapping a present with a tool. In the background, a bicycle is visible. The sound of multiple people laughing and talking in the background can be heard.\", \"A young boy in a red shirt sits on a dark carpet, actively unwrapping a gift with silver wrapping paper. The sounds of people talking and laughing in the background suggest a social gathering.\", \"A young boy in a red shirt sits on a carpeted floor, surrounded by many wrapped presents, and pulls shiny silver wrapping paper from a gift. Overlapping the scene, multiple people are heard laughing and speaking in a high-pitched, playful manner, creating a festive atmosphere.\"]", "time_sec": 52.364, "generation_time_seconds": 51.572, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.64, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "305", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man's voice is drowned out by the banging and rattling as he pours a drink into a pot of food in a bowl of water, while someone else pours liquid from a blender into a blow filled with milk, ice, and other foods on the counter.", "pred": "A person is making a frozen drink with liquid nitrogen, which is creating a large amount of white vapor. The person then pours the resulting thick, pale green mixture from a blender jar into a large metal bowl. Throughout the scene, the sounds of clattering metal utensils and a person talking can be heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person is making a frozen drink with liquid nitrogen, which is creating a large amount of white vapor. The person then pours the resulting thick, pale green mixture from a blender jar into a large metal bowl. Throughout the scene, the sounds of clattering metal utensils and a person talking can be heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A person is making a frozen drink with liquid nitrogen, which is creating a large amount of white vapor. The person then pours the resulting thick, pale green mixture from a blender jar into a large metal bowl. Throughout the scene, the sounds of clattering metal utensils and a person talking can be heard in the background.\", \"A person pours a steaming, pale yellow liquid from a pitcher into a large glass bowl. The sound of a metal utensil clanging against the bowl is heard, followed by a male voice saying, \\\"Focus there.\\\"\", \"A person uses tongs to place a white, foamy substance into a glass pitcher, which is overflowing and emitting vapor, while the sound of a metallic object clattering and a drawer being pulled open is heard.\", \"A person uses a spoon to transfer a thick, pale yellow substance from a pitcher to a white plate, then pours the remainder into a glass bowl; the pitcher emits visible steam, and a person speaks off-screen while handling kitchen utensils.\"]", "time_sec": 50.939, "generation_time_seconds": 49.8326, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.54, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "306", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio-visual caption is: ", "pred": "A red and a green plush toy race along a blue track decorated with cartoon pigs and the word \"BACON\", while a person's voice announces, \"Pretty tightly contested race here.\", accompanied by the sound of an engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red and a green plush toy race along a blue track decorated with cartoon pigs and the word \"BACON\", while a person's voice announces, \"Pretty tightly contested race here.\", accompanied by the sound of an engine.", "cot": "[\"A red and a green plush toy race along a blue track decorated with cartoon pigs and the word \\\"BACON\\\", while a person's voice announces, \\\"Pretty tightly contested race here.\\\", accompanied by the sound of an engine.\", \"Two small, plush toy pigs, one red and one green, are positioned on a white track alongside a long, blue toy train engine. The engine, featuring the text \\\"Mr. Bacon\\\" and Peppa Pig characters, is moving forward, accompanied by the sound of a small engine and an announcer's voice declaring, \\\"Pretty tightly contested race here.\\\"\", \"A blurry image shows a red and a green plush toy on a white surface next to a blue train-themed toy, while the audio features the sound of a dog panting and a person speaking.\", \"The visual shows a blue train track with red and green plush pigs, while the audio features the sound of a duck quacking, accompanied by a person stating, \\\"pretty tightly contested race here.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 49.777, "generation_time_seconds": 48.5502, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "307", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The metal rattling, door slamming, and plastic clacking were followed by the sound of a toilet flushing in a white-tiled bathroom with a white toilet bowl.", "pred": "The video shows a toilet being flushed, accompanied by the sound of rushing water and the toilet tank refilling.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a toilet being flushed, accompanied by the sound of rushing water and the toilet tank refilling.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a toilet being flushed, accompanied by the sound of rushing water and the toilet tank refilling.\", \"A person flushes a toilet, which produces a loud gurgling sound as it begins to refill.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a white toilet bowl before it is flushed, accompanied by the sounds of a toilet lid closing and the subsequent rush of water from the flush.\", \"A person flushes a toilet, the sound of rushing water filling the small room, followed by the clatter of the lid closing and the mechanical sound of the toilet's internal tank refilling.\"]", "time_sec": 36.478, "generation_time_seconds": 35.8074, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "308", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man talking inside a car on a highway in the rain and clouds, followed by a vehicle accelerating, then two men talking as rain falls on a surface.", "pred": "The video displays a large, rotating tornado funnel cloud in a dark, overcast sky above a flat, rural landscape, while the audio captures the intense, roaring wind and a person speculating that the storm is forming a wedge.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a large, rotating tornado funnel cloud in a dark, overcast sky above a flat, rural landscape, while the audio captures the intense, roaring wind and a person speculating that the storm is forming a wedge.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a large, rotating tornado funnel cloud in a dark, overcast sky above a flat, rural landscape, while the audio captures the intense, roaring wind and a person speculating that the storm is forming a wedge.\", \"The video shows a large, dark tornado funnel cloud moving across a flat, rural landscape under an overcast sky. Inside a vehicle, two men comment on the storm, with one stating, \\\"I think it's turning into a wedge,\\\" as the sound of heavy wind buffets the car.\", \"I observe a massive, funnel-shaped tornado descending from a dark, greenish sky over flat terrain. Inside a vehicle, a person shouts over the roar of wind and rain that the storm is becoming a wedge.\", \"The video shows a view from inside a vehicle approaching a large, rotating tornado in a flat, rural landscape under dark, stormy skies, while the audio captures a conversation between men discussing the storm's structure as the sound of the vehicle's engine and heavy rain on the windshield are audible.\"]", "time_sec": 51.122, "generation_time_seconds": 50.2588, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "309", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The vehicle motor running as a person holds a chain on a fire hydrant spraying water on the street, with a car and a truck nearby.", "pred": "The video shows a close-up of the front of a silver Ford truck, then a hand holding a metal hook attached to a chain on the ground, while the sound of a power tool is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of the front of a silver Ford truck, then a hand holding a metal hook attached to a chain on the ground, while the sound of a power tool is heard.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a close-up of the front of a silver Ford truck, then a hand holding a metal hook attached to a chain on the ground, while the sound of a power tool is heard.\", \"A close-up of a silver Ford truck's front grille and license plate is shown, followed by a hand holding a silver, U-shaped metal hook, all while a loud, sustained, high-pitched electronic tone plays in the background.\", \"A close-up shows the front of a silver Ford truck with a chain attached to its bumper. A hand then holds the metal hook of the chain. The sound of a small engine, like a lawnmower, is audible.\", \"The video displays the front of a silver Ford pickup truck with its headlights on, a chain attached to the front bumper, and a hand holding a large metal hook connected to the chain, while the audio captures the sound of a large engine running.\"]", "time_sec": 47.124, "generation_time_seconds": 46.36, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "310", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The loud and forceful bang echoed through the dark room with white walls, next to a door and a black suitcase, disrupting the silence of the poetic line written on the floor.", "pred": "This is a video of a doorway with a black door sweep, a warning text about burglary in the United States, and the sound of a door slamming shut.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "This is a video of a doorway with a black door sweep, a warning text about burglary in the United States, and the sound of a door slamming shut.", "cot": "[\"This is a video of a doorway with a black door sweep, a warning text about burglary in the United States, and the sound of a door slamming shut.\", \"The video displays text on a gray gradient background stating that a burglary occurs every 15 seconds in the United States and that one in five families will experience a typically violent home invasion, followed by the sound of a door slamming shut.\", \"A static shot shows a black door sweep against a white door. A text overlay appears, stating that every 15 seconds a burglary occurs in the United States. This is followed by a loud, sharp slam sound.\", \"A text slide states that \\\"Every 15 seconds a burglary occurs in the United States.\\\" This is followed by a loud crashing sound, like a heavy object breaking a door or window.\"]", "time_sec": 44.009, "generation_time_seconds": 43.3001, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "311", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of shuffling footsteps, a cat meowing, and a toilet flushing in a bathroom with a white toilet and urinal.", "pred": "The video shows a top-down view of a white toilet bowl as the toilet is flushed, creating a vortex of water. This action is audibly confirmed by the sound of the toilet's cistern emptying, followed by the distinct gurgling and swirling of water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a top-down view of a white toilet bowl as the toilet is flushed, creating a vortex of water. This action is audibly confirmed by the sound of the toilet's cistern emptying, followed by the distinct gurgling and swirling of water.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a top-down view of a white toilet bowl as the toilet is flushed, creating a vortex of water. This action is audibly confirmed by the sound of the toilet's cistern emptying, followed by the distinct gurgling and swirling of water.\", \"The audio captures the distinct sound of a toilet flushing, which is synchronized with the visual of the toilet bowl's water agitating and swirling after being flushed.\", \"A white toilet bowl is shown from above as the toilet is flushed, creating a large swirling vortex in the water. The accompanying audio consists of a loud, forceful mechanical flush sound, followed by the sound of water filling the tank.\", \"A toilet is flushed, causing the water inside to swirl violently, which is accompanied by the distinct sound of the toilet flushing.\"]", "time_sec": 44.495, "generation_time_seconds": 43.1243, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.86, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "312", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a  field of grass, a woman speaks followed by a man talking on the phone in a cartoon illustration.", "pred": "A cartoon image of a uniformed man holding a red telephone appears, with the text \"Fun Prank Calls\" beneath it. The audio features a conversation in Hindi, including the phrases \"Hello?\", \"Salam aleikum?\", \"Bilkul salaam\", and \"Who is this?\".", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A cartoon image of a uniformed man holding a red telephone appears, with the text \"Fun Prank Calls\" beneath it. The audio features a conversation in Hindi, including the phrases \"Hello?\", \"Salam aleikum?\", \"Bilkul salaam\", and \"Who is this?\".", "cot": "[\"A cartoon image of a uniformed man holding a red telephone appears, with the text \\\"Fun Prank Calls\\\" beneath it. The audio features a conversation in Hindi, including the phrases \\\"Hello?\\\", \\\"Salam aleikum?\\\", \\\"Bilkul salaam\\\", and \\\"Who is this?\\\".\", \"A woman with long dark hair stands outdoors in a grassy field with trees, looking toward the camera, while a man and a woman have a phone conversation in the background with a faint mechanical hum.\", \"A cartoon depicts a man in a khaki uniform holding a red telephone receiver to his ear. Simultaneously, an audio conversation occurs where a woman says \\\"Hello\\\" in English and \\\"Assalamualaikum\\\" in Arabic, followed by a man asking, \\\"Who is this?\\\".\", \"I see a young woman with long dark hair looking at the camera in a grassy area with trees. I hear a phone conversation where a male voice asks \\\"Who is this?\\\".\"]", "time_sec": 49.348, "generation_time_seconds": 48.7764, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "313", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman in a suit speaks with a man in a suit and tie on a red carpet at an event, amidst the sound of others speaking in the distance and the wind blowing. a women giving a autograph.", "pred": "A woman with long dark hair smiles while interacting with a crowd, as a man in a white shirt and tie stands behind her and a person holds up a photo for her to see, all while people talk and laugh in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman with long dark hair smiles while interacting with a crowd, as a man in a white shirt and tie stands behind her and a person holds up a photo for her to see, all while people talk and laugh in the background.", "cot": "[\"A woman with long dark hair smiles while interacting with a crowd, as a man in a white shirt and tie stands behind her and a person holds up a photo for her to see, all while people talk and laugh in the background.\", \"A woman with long dark hair smiles while signing an autograph in a crowded outdoor setting, with a man in a white shirt and tie standing nearby, as the sound of a crowd and a person speaking are audible.\", \"A woman with long dark hair smiles while signing an autograph for a fan in a crowd, as an off-screen person exclaims, \\\"I knew it!\\\" amidst the background noise of a large gathering.\", \"A woman with long, dark hair, wearing a black top, smiles and appears to be signing autographs for a crowd of people. In the background, a man in a white shirt and black tie is visible. The audio contains the sounds of a crowd and a person speaking.\"]", "time_sec": 48.627, "generation_time_seconds": 47.6188, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.64, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "314", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the woman talks and food sizzles, a wooden spoon stirs a pot of ingredients on the stove, while a person holds a bowl of water over the pot beside a cutting leaves.", "pred": "The audio describes the speaker browning 80/20 ground beef in a pan and boiling water in a pot. The video visually confirms the ground beef being stirred in a pan and shows a pot of vigorously boiling water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio describes the speaker browning 80/20 ground beef in a pan and boiling water in a pot. The video visually confirms the ground beef being stirred in a pan and shows a pot of vigorously boiling water.", "cot": "[\"The audio describes the speaker browning 80/20 ground beef in a pan and boiling water in a pot. The video visually confirms the ground beef being stirred in a pan and shows a pot of vigorously boiling water.\", \"A person is browning 80/20 ground beef in a pan, while water is boiling in a separate pot, as confirmed by the sounds of sizzling meat and a bubbling pot.\", \"The video shows a person browning 80/20 ground beef in a pan while simultaneously boiling water in a pot.\", \"A person is cooking ground beef in a pan, causing it to sizzle, while water boils in a separate pot.\"]", "time_sec": 39.566, "generation_time_seconds": 38.9665, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.95, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "315", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man and woman in bikinis stand on a boat in the water, surrounded by a large body of water next to a forest of trees, as ducks quack and men speak with distant humming children's are also speaking.", "pred": "A white motorboat with a black canopy speeds across a body of water, creating a large wake, while dogs bark and people talk in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white motorboat with a black canopy speeds across a body of water, creating a large wake, while dogs bark and people talk in the background.", "cot": "[\"A white motorboat with a black canopy speeds across a body of water, creating a large wake, while dogs bark and people talk in the background.\", \"A white pontoon boat with a black canopy moves across a body of water, creating a wake, while the sound of a dog barking and a person speaking are heard.\", \"A black canopy-covered boat is visible on the water, while the audio captures the loud, overlapping barks of multiple dogs.\", \"A white motorboat with a black canopy speeds across a lake, leaving a large wake, while the sounds of a dog barking and a crowd speaking are heard.\"]", "time_sec": 37.941, "generation_time_seconds": 37.004, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "316", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man paints a wooden surfboard red and blue in a garage while compressed air sprays and wood clanks in the background.", "pred": "A person's hand holds a spray can and applies a substance to a red and black surface covered with brown paper and blue tape, producing a hissing sound, while a male voice speaks in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hand holds a spray can and applies a substance to a red and black surface covered with brown paper and blue tape, producing a hissing sound, while a male voice speaks in the background.", "cot": "[\"A person's hand holds a spray can and applies a substance to a red and black surface covered with brown paper and blue tape, producing a hissing sound, while a male voice speaks in the background.\", \"A hand holds a spray can and applies a substance to a red surface, which is covered with brown paper and blue tape, while a person speaks and a faint mechanical hum is audible in the background.\", \"A hand sprays a red surface, the sound of the aerosol can's hiss prominent as a person speaks.\", \"A person sprays a red surface covered with brown paper and blue tape while a male voice speaks, saying, \\\"And as you can see here, hopefully you guys can see this, but...\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 41.079, "generation_time_seconds": 40.1019, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "317", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A large truck with a trailer is moved on the side of the road, idling as a horn honks.", "pred": "A semi-truck with a flatbed trailer carrying construction equipment is driving on a dirt road next to a grassy area with trees. The sound of its engine is audible, followed by a loud horn blast.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A semi-truck with a flatbed trailer carrying construction equipment is driving on a dirt road next to a grassy area with trees. The sound of its engine is audible, followed by a loud horn blast.", "cot": "[\"A semi-truck with a flatbed trailer carrying construction equipment is driving on a dirt road next to a grassy area with trees. The sound of its engine is audible, followed by a loud horn blast.\", \"A large semi-truck with a trailer is stopped on a grassy area next to a dirt road, while its engine idles and a loud air horn blares.\", \"A large semi-truck carrying yellow construction equipment drives along a dirt road next to a grassy area, and the loud, rhythmic chugging of its engine is suddenly interrupted by a sharp, high-pitched horn blast.\", \"A large semi-truck with a yellow excavator on its flatbed drives along a road next to a grassy area; the truck's deep engine rumbles as it passes, followed by a loud, long horn blast.\"]", "time_sec": 44.447, "generation_time_seconds": 43.7031, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "318", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man speaks with others in the background as a young girl gets her hair cut at a salon with her family, while a group of kids sit around a table.", "pred": "A group of people, including a woman in a wheelchair and several men in \"Ole Miss\" shirts, gather in a room. A man speaks, followed by a young child saying \"Hi Daddy,\" which is met with laughter from the group.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A group of people, including a woman in a wheelchair and several men in \"Ole Miss\" shirts, gather in a room. A man speaks, followed by a young child saying \"Hi Daddy,\" which is met with laughter from the group.", "cot": "[\"A group of people, including a woman in a wheelchair and several men in \\\"Ole Miss\\\" shirts, gather in a room. A man speaks, followed by a young child saying \\\"Hi Daddy,\\\" which is met with laughter from the group.\", \"A man in a white t-shirt speaks to the camera, then the scene shifts to a woman in a wheelchair being photographed with several men, while a child says \\\"Hi Daddy\\\" and a man responds with a \\\"Thank you.\\\".\", \"A man in a white shirt speaks to the camera, then a group of people, including a young girl in a wheelchair, pose for a photo with a man in a red shirt, during which a child says \\\"Hi Daddy\\\" and the group laughs.\", \"A man in a white t-shirt speaks to the camera, then the scene cuts to a group of five people, including a young girl in a wheelchair and two men in red and white shirts, smiling together. As the man thanks someone, a child's voice says, \\\"Hi, Daddy,\\\" prompting laughter from the group.\"]", "time_sec": 52.009, "generation_time_seconds": 51.045, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.05, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "319", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a video game, a man crosses the street amidst traffic chaos with fire igniting, electronic beeps, and vehicle engines running idle in the background.", "pred": "This is a video game scene showing a character running on a city street past white limousines, while the audio features the sound of a vehicle engine and a person speaking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "This is a video game scene showing a character running on a city street past white limousines, while the audio features the sound of a vehicle engine and a person speaking.", "cot": "[\"This is a video game scene showing a character running on a city street past white limousines, while the audio features the sound of a vehicle engine and a person speaking.\", \"A character in a video game is launched into the air by an explosion, followed by a loud boom and the sound of crashing debris.\", \"The video displays a third-person perspective of a video game character flying with a jetpack over an urban street, while the audio consists of the continuous, low-frequency rumbling of a large vehicle engine and the rhythmic clatter of its wheels on a track.\", \"A character in a video game runs down a street lined with white limousines as a loud explosion occurs nearby.\"]", "time_sec": 39.786, "generation_time_seconds": 38.8674, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "320", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man standing next to a yellow truck with a wooden table on its trailer, and a grinding machine.", "pred": "A large yellow tractor trailer transports a heavy piece of machinery across a gravel lot, accompanied by the sound of a wood saw cutting wood.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large yellow tractor trailer transports a heavy piece of machinery across a gravel lot, accompanied by the sound of a wood saw cutting wood.", "cot": "[\"A large yellow tractor trailer transports a heavy piece of machinery across a gravel lot, accompanied by the sound of a wood saw cutting wood.\", \"A worker operates a large, yellow, tracked portable sawmill on a trailer to cut a large log, and the loud, high-pitched whine of the saw blade is audible.\", \"A large yellow tractor with a log loader attachment is being unloaded from a trailer, while in the background, a circular saw cuts through a long piece of lumber, producing a high-pitched whirring sound.\", \"I observe a large yellow Caterpillar machine on a trailer, and a man operating a red belt sander on a long piece of wood, while the audio captures the sounds of a power tool and a vehicle engine.\"]", "time_sec": 42.658, "generation_time_seconds": 42.0059, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "321", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In his workshop, a man is heard scraping and banging while cutting and sanding wood on a wooden table.", "pred": "The visual shows a man using a hand plane on wood, while the audio features the distinct sound of a manual typewriter being used, creating a contradiction between the two sensory modalities.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The visual shows a man using a hand plane on wood, while the audio features the distinct sound of a manual typewriter being used, creating a contradiction between the two sensory modalities.", "cot": "[\"The visual shows a man using a hand plane on wood, while the audio features the distinct sound of a manual typewriter being used, creating a contradiction between the two sensory modalities.\", \"An elderly man in a workshop uses a hand plane on a wooden board, creating a loud, rhythmic, scraping sound as the tool moves.\", \"A man in overalls uses a hand plane on a piece of wood, creating a loud, rhythmic scraping sound that occurs in two separate bursts.\", \"A senior man wearing a blue shirt and overalls is using a hand plane to smooth a piece of wood on a workbench in a workshop, producing the distinct, rhythmic sound of the tool's blade scraping across the wood.\"]", "time_sec": 41.543, "generation_time_seconds": 39.9361, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "322", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A large fire truck blaring its siren and honking its horn drives down a street lined with cars and buildings.", "pred": "A red fire engine with an extended aerial ladder is driving down a city street, accompanied by the sound of its engine, a loud air horn, and a siren.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red fire engine with an extended aerial ladder is driving down a city street, accompanied by the sound of its engine, a loud air horn, and a siren.", "cot": "[\"A red fire engine with an extended aerial ladder is driving down a city street, accompanied by the sound of its engine, a loud air horn, and a siren.\", \"A large, red fire truck with an extended ladder is driving down a city street, accompanied by the sound of its siren and a person speaking.\", \"A red fire truck with \\\"FIRE RESCUE\\\" markings is seen driving on a city street, its large white ladder extended, while a loud, high-pitched siren blares and a deep air horn sounds.\", \"A red fire truck with a large white ladder is driving away on a paved road. The sound of its engine is accompanied by a loud, wailing siren and a series of air horn blasts.\"]", "time_sec": 43.253, "generation_time_seconds": 41.5341, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 36.36, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "323", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a horn beeping rapidly followed by a long loud beep as a blue and white bus drives.", "pred": "A blue and white bus with the text \"Translago\" and the number \"5003\" on its side drives forward through a large archway while its horn sounds repeatedly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A blue and white bus with the text \"Translago\" and the number \"5003\" on its side drives forward through a large archway while its horn sounds repeatedly.", "cot": "[\"A blue and white bus with the text \\\"Translago\\\" and the number \\\"5003\\\" on its side drives forward through a large archway while its horn sounds repeatedly.\", \"A white and blue bus with the word \\\"Empolagio\\\" and the number \\\"5003\\\" on its side drives through a large, arched gateway. As the bus passes, its horn sounds repeatedly, followed by the sound of its tires on the pavement.\", \"A bus with blue and white livery drives out from under a large, arched gateway, while its horn blares loudly.\", \"A white and blue bus with the number 5003 and the name \\\"Evangélico\\\" on its side is seen driving through a large, arched gateway. The loud, multi-tone horn of the bus is heard as it passes through the archway.\"]", "time_sec": 46.505, "generation_time_seconds": 45.3934, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 34.48, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "324", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a black hat speaks with the wind as he tends to coffee plants, with leaves rustling in the background talking to a another man.", "pred": "A man in a hat, identified as Harald López López, an expert in coffee, stands in a coffee plantation and discusses the application of a mixture to a tall coffee plant.\n\\boxed{Harald López López, an expert in coffee, discusses applying a mixture to a tall coffee plant in a plantation.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a hat, identified as Harald López López, an expert in coffee, stands in a coffee plantation and discusses the application of a mixture to a tall coffee plant.\n\\boxed{Harald López López, an expert in coffee, discusses applying a mixture to a tall coffee plant in a plantation.}", "cot": "[\"A man in a hat, identified as Harald López López, an expert in coffee, stands in a coffee plantation and discusses the application of a mixture to a tall coffee plant.\\n\\\\boxed{Harald López López, an expert in coffee, discusses applying a mixture to a tall coffee plant in a plantation.}\", \"A man in a yellow shirt and black hat stands in a coffee plantation, gesturing towards the plants as he speaks, while the sound of wind rustling through the coffee trees is audible.\", \"A man in a hat stands in a coffee plantation, touching the leaves as he speaks, with the audio of his speech in Spanish being recorded.\", \"A man in a yellow shirt and black hat stands before a coffee plantation, speaking in Spanish about an application and a plant.\"]", "time_sec": 43.184, "generation_time_seconds": 42.0234, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.64, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "325", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The serene night is filled with the symphony of frogs croaking, insects humming, and a full moon shining brightly in the dark sky.", "pred": "This is a night scene showing a bright crescent moon partially hidden by moving dark clouds, accompanied by the high-pitched, rhythmic chirping of insects.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "This is a night scene showing a bright crescent moon partially hidden by moving dark clouds, accompanied by the high-pitched, rhythmic chirping of insects.", "cot": "[\"This is a night scene showing a bright crescent moon partially hidden by moving dark clouds, accompanied by the high-pitched, rhythmic chirping of insects.\", \"A waxing gibbous moon is partially obscured by dark, fast-moving clouds in a night sky, while the distinct, rhythmic chirping of insects, likely crickets, is heard in the audio.\", \"The video displays a crescent moon in a dark night sky, partially obscured by drifting clouds. Overlaid on this visual is a continuous, high-pitched, electronic buzzing sound, similar to a synthesized tone or a malfunctioning device.\", \"A crescent moon is visible in a dark sky, partially obscured by drifting clouds, while a continuous, low-frequency electronic tone plays.\"]", "time_sec": 41.484, "generation_time_seconds": 40.8973, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "326", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young girl engages in conversation with an infant, as they sit together in a high chair next to a girl reading a book.", "pred": "A baby sits in a green-patterned car seat, laughing while a woman's voice speaks in Spanish in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A baby sits in a green-patterned car seat, laughing while a woman's voice speaks in Spanish in the background.", "cot": "[\"A baby sits in a green-patterned car seat, laughing while a woman's voice speaks in Spanish in the background.\", \"A baby in a car seat laughs while a child in a pink shirt interacts with it. A woman speaks in Spanish, and the baby laughs in response.\", \"A baby in a green and white plaid car seat laughs while an off-screen person speaks in Spanish, and the baby responds with continuous gurgling and cooing.\", \"A baby in a car seat laughs and cries as a young girl in pink holds up a book and speaks to the baby.\"]", "time_sec": 37.048, "generation_time_seconds": 36.2919, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "327", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A car is driving into a tunnel with horn honking sound.", "pred": "A red car drives down a wet road past a stone tunnel wall while a train horn sounds and a vehicle passes by.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red car drives down a wet road past a stone tunnel wall while a train horn sounds and a vehicle passes by.", "cot": "[\"A red car drives down a wet road past a stone tunnel wall while a train horn sounds and a vehicle passes by.\", \"A red car drives along a wet road next to a stone wall. The sound of a very loud train horn is heard, followed by the sound of the car's engine.\", \"A red car drives toward the camera on a wet road next to a stone wall. The car stops and then sounds a loud, multi-chime air horn that echoes off the wall.\", \"A red car drives on a wet road next to a stone wall when a loud, multi-tone train horn sounds.\\n\\\\boxed{A red car drives on a wet road next to a stone wall as a loud, multi-tone train horn sounds.}\"]", "time_sec": 42.199, "generation_time_seconds": 41.3041, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.27, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "328", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The aircraft engine hums to life, then gradually slows down with a plastic click, as you gaze out the airplane window at the wing.", "pred": "The audio consists of the loud, deep roar of a large engine, likely from a jet, which is synchronized with the visual of an airplane's wing and engine as it taxis on an airport runway.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio consists of the loud, deep roar of a large engine, likely from a jet, which is synchronized with the visual of an airplane's wing and engine as it taxis on an airport runway.", "cot": "[\"The audio consists of the loud, deep roar of a large engine, likely from a jet, which is synchronized with the visual of an airplane's wing and engine as it taxis on an airport runway.\", \"The video shows a view from an airplane window, with the wing and landing gear visible, while the audio captures the loud, sustained roar of a jet engine.\", \"The view from an airplane window shows the white wing and the airport tarmac under a cloudy sky, while the sound of a large aircraft engine is heard.\", \"The video shows a view from an airplane window, with the wing and ground visible, while the audio consists of the loud, continuous roar of the aircraft's jet engines.\"]", "time_sec": 40.024, "generation_time_seconds": 39.229, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "329", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The soothing sound of water trickling accompanies the sight of a bathtub filled with soapy bubbles and a sink with bubbles, set in a serene bathroom with a mirror and lights on the ceiling.", "pred": "The audio captures the sound of a toilet flushing, while the visual shows a white bathtub with water being sprayed from a silver hose, causing the water to become frothy and agitated.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio captures the sound of a toilet flushing, while the visual shows a white bathtub with water being sprayed from a silver hose, causing the water to become frothy and agitated.", "cot": "[\"The audio captures the sound of a toilet flushing, while the visual shows a white bathtub with water being sprayed from a silver hose, causing the water to become frothy and agitated.\", \"The video shows a white bathtub with light green, aerated water and multiple jets bubbling. The tub has chrome fixtures, a glass shelf, and an internal light. A watermark \\\"dush.nnov.ru\\\" is visible. The audio consists of the loud, continuous sound of rushing and splashing water, characteristic of a hydromassage system operating in a bathroom.\", \"A white bathtub contains light green water with numerous bubbles rising from multiple jets. The loud, high-pitched roar of a powerful water spray, like from a shower head, is heard continuously.\", \"This is a close-up view of a white bathtub filled with swirling, light-green water, with a shower head spraying water into it. The audio consists of the continuous, powerful sound of a large volume of water being sprayed and moving forcefully, characteristic of a jacuzzi or whirlpool tub in operation.\"]", "time_sec": 51.432, "generation_time_seconds": 50.6518, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "330", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "An older man in a yellow jacket standing next to a motorcycle speaks over engine sounds outside a building.", "pred": "A man wearing a high-visibility yellow and black motorcycle jacket stands in front of a black motorcycle, introducing himself as Leo Doverspike from Hope, Pennsylvania, while a loud, continuous engine sound is audible in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man wearing a high-visibility yellow and black motorcycle jacket stands in front of a black motorcycle, introducing himself as Leo Doverspike from Hope, Pennsylvania, while a loud, continuous engine sound is audible in the background.", "cot": "[\"A man wearing a high-visibility yellow and black motorcycle jacket stands in front of a black motorcycle, introducing himself as Leo Doverspike from Hope, Pennsylvania, while a loud, continuous engine sound is audible in the background.\", \"An elderly man in a black and yellow motorcycle jacket stands next to a black motorcycle, speaking to the camera about bike riding and lodging. The audio consists of his speech and the ambient sound of a large vehicle engine.\", \"A man in a bright yellow and black motorcycle jacket stands next to a black motorcycle and speaks to the camera, introducing himself as Ohio Dover and stating he is from Hope, Pennsylvania, while the low rumble of an engine idles in the background.\", \"An older man with white hair, wearing a yellow and black motorcycle jacket, stands next to a black motorcycle and speaks to the camera. He states, \\\"Hi, I'm Lionel Delmer.\\\" The sound of a motorcycle engine is audible in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 48.245, "generation_time_seconds": 47.4094, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.03, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "331", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The aircraft motor hums rhythmically as a helicopter flies over a speed boat speeding through the water, then the wind roars.", "pred": "Four speedboats race across a large body of water, leaving white wakes, while a helicopter flies overhead. The sound is a loud, roaring engine, characteristic of a high-performance speedboat.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Four speedboats race across a large body of water, leaving white wakes, while a helicopter flies overhead. The sound is a loud, roaring engine, characteristic of a high-performance speedboat.", "cot": "[\"Four speedboats race across a large body of water, leaving white wakes, while a helicopter flies overhead. The sound is a loud, roaring engine, characteristic of a high-performance speedboat.\", \"Aerial footage shows multiple speedboats racing across a large body of water, leaving white wakes behind them, while the loud, high-pitched roar of their powerful engines dominates the audio.\", \"Multiple speedboats race across a large body of water, creating expansive white wakes as a helicopter flies overhead, all accompanied by the loud, high-pitched whine of powerful jet engines.\", \"A helicopter flies over a body of water where multiple speedboats are racing, creating large wakes, while the loud, powerful roar of a jet engine is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 42.64, "generation_time_seconds": 41.1667, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "332", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the dark night, lightning strikes illuminate the sky as rain and thunder fill the air,  candlelight glow.", "pred": "A dark, blurry scene is intermittently illuminated by a bright, jagged flash of lightning, accompanied by the deep, rolling sound of thunder.\n\\boxed{A bright lightning flash illuminates a dark scene, accompanied by the sound of thunder.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A dark, blurry scene is intermittently illuminated by a bright, jagged flash of lightning, accompanied by the deep, rolling sound of thunder.\n\\boxed{A bright lightning flash illuminates a dark scene, accompanied by the sound of thunder.}", "cot": "[\"A dark, blurry scene is intermittently illuminated by a bright, jagged flash of lightning, accompanied by the deep, rolling sound of thunder.\\n\\\\boxed{A bright lightning flash illuminates a dark scene, accompanied by the sound of thunder.}\", \"The video displays a dark, indistinct scene illuminated by a single, jagged lightning bolt. The audio consists of a low, ambient sound and a clear, repeating electronic beep.\", \"The video shows a dark night sky that is suddenly illuminated by a bright, jagged lightning strike. This visual is accompanied by the sound of a loud clap of thunder, followed by a low, sustained rumble.\", \"The video shows a dark night sky where a bright, jagged lightning bolt flashes, illuminating the clouds below, all while the audio captures the deep, rolling thunder of a storm.\"]", "time_sec": 43.877, "generation_time_seconds": 43.3994, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "333", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The forest echoes with the humming of engines as people ride through on various vehicles,  dirt bikes, and motorcycles.", "pred": "Two people on ATVs drive on a dirt trail in a forest. One person on a blue ATV is in the foreground, and another person on a yellow ATV is ahead of them. A male voice can be heard speaking over the loud engine noise.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Two people on ATVs drive on a dirt trail in a forest. One person on a blue ATV is in the foreground, and another person on a yellow ATV is ahead of them. A male voice can be heard speaking over the loud engine noise.", "cot": "[\"Two people on ATVs drive on a dirt trail in a forest. One person on a blue ATV is in the foreground, and another person on a yellow ATV is ahead of them. A male voice can be heard speaking over the loud engine noise.\", \"This is a first-person perspective from an off-road vehicle chasing another rider on a dirt path. The primary sound is the loud, high-pitched engine of the pursuing vehicle, accompanied by a male voice shouting encouragement, \\\"Whoo! You have to get past him!\\\"\", \"The audio features a person speaking in Spanish over the loud, continuous roar of a powerful engine, which is not from a motorcycle as suggested by the visual scene. The visuals depict a person riding a blue four-wheeler and another person riding a yellow ATV on a dirt track through a forest.\", \"Two people ride ATVs on a dirt path through a forest. The engine of the blue ATV is loud, and a person speaks excitedly over it.\"]", "time_sec": 50.26, "generation_time_seconds": 48.6737, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "334", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The soothing sound of a toilet flushing harmonizes with the sight of a white toilet bowl filled with dirty water in a small bathroom.", "pred": "A hand flushes a white toilet, which then gurgles and fills with water, accompanied by the sound of a flushing mechanism and splashing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand flushes a white toilet, which then gurgles and fills with water, accompanied by the sound of a flushing mechanism and splashing.", "cot": "[\"A hand flushes a white toilet, which then gurgles and fills with water, accompanied by the sound of a flushing mechanism and splashing.\", \"A hand flushes a toilet, and the sound of the water flushing and refilling the tank is heard.\", \"A hand flushes a toilet, causing the water inside to swirl violently and create a gurgling sound.\", \"A hand presses a chrome flush lever on a white toilet. The toilet bowl flushes, creating a swirling vortex in the water, and the sound of the water refilling the tank is audible.\"]", "time_sec": 36.205, "generation_time_seconds": 35.3194, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 38.46, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "335", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two men discussing on the phone while a small white lamb stands next to a fence.", "pred": "A young, white goat stands on a dirt surface and eats hay, while a man speaks in Hindi in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young, white goat stands on a dirt surface and eats hay, while a man speaks in Hindi in the background.", "cot": "[\"A young, white goat stands on a dirt surface and eats hay, while a man speaks in Hindi in the background.\", \"A white lamb is seen grazing in a pen with dirt and straw on the ground, while a man speaks in Hindi in the background.\", \"A small, white goat stands in a dirt pen with a wooden fence, its head lowered to sniff the ground, while a man speaks in Hindi in the background.\", \"A white lamb stands on dark, straw-covered ground in front of a wooden fence, while a male voice speaks in Hindi.\"]", "time_sec": 35.607, "generation_time_seconds": 35.047, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "336", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The blue sports car revs its engine and accelerates rapidly on the street, while a truck sprays water on a car and splashes through a puddle on the road.", "pred": "A dark blue sports car, possibly a Corvette, aggressively drifts through a paved parking lot, its tires producing a loud, high-pitched screech.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A dark blue sports car, possibly a Corvette, aggressively drifts through a paved parking lot, its tires producing a loud, high-pitched screech.", "cot": "[\"A dark blue sports car, possibly a Corvette, aggressively drifts through a paved parking lot, its tires producing a loud, high-pitched screech.\", \"A dark sports car starts its engine and accelerates rapidly, creating a loud roaring sound and a large cloud of white tire smoke as it speeds away on a paved surface.\", \"The audio features a loud, roaring engine accelerating rapidly, while the video shows a dark sports car drifting in a parking lot, kicking up a cloud of white smoke from its tires.\", \"A dark blue sports car performs a burnout in a parking lot, producing a loud, roaring engine sound as white smoke billows from its spinning tires.\"]", "time_sec": 39.147, "generation_time_seconds": 38.2683, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.24, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "337", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bathroom, a man breathes loudly as water hisses, followed by a toilet flushing in a white toilet bowl on a tiled floor", "pred": "A toilet with a white seat and lid is shown from above on a mosaic-tiled floor. The toilet is flushed, and the sound of the powerful flush and water filling the tank is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A toilet with a white seat and lid is shown from above on a mosaic-tiled floor. The toilet is flushed, and the sound of the powerful flush and water filling the tank is heard.", "cot": "[\"A toilet with a white seat and lid is shown from above on a mosaic-tiled floor. The toilet is flushed, and the sound of the powerful flush and water filling the tank is heard.\", \"The video shows a white toilet bowl with a mosaic tile floor, and the audio captures the sound of a toilet being flushed.\", \"The video shows a toilet with a closed seat, then the seat is lifted, and the toilet is flushed, creating a large swirling vortex in the water. Simultaneously, the audio captures the sound of a toilet seat being lifted, followed by the loud, powerful rush of water as the toilet is flushed.\", \"The video shows a toilet bowl with a swirling vortex of water. The audio begins with a person breathing, followed by the distinct sound of a toilet flushing.\"]", "time_sec": 43.093, "generation_time_seconds": 42.3297, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.25, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "338", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two men communicating with each other while one drills a hole in a piece of wood and the other drills a hole in a toilet, with the sound of plastic clacking and a power tool drilling in the background.", "pred": "The sound of a power tool operating is heard as a person uses a teal and black cordless drill on a white surface, with another person in a striped shirt standing nearby.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The sound of a power tool operating is heard as a person uses a teal and black cordless drill on a white surface, with another person in a striped shirt standing nearby.", "cot": "[\"The sound of a power tool operating is heard as a person uses a teal and black cordless drill on a white surface, with another person in a striped shirt standing nearby.\", \"A person wearing a striped shirt holds a black and teal power drill and operates it on a white surface. As the drill starts, a man speaks in Arabic, and the sound of the drill bit grinding against a hard surface is heard.\", \"A person is using a power drill to work on a white object on a table, while several men talk nearby.\", \"A person uses a power drill on a white surface, with another person standing nearby, while a man speaks in Arabic in the background and the sound of a drill bit starting is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 41.306, "generation_time_seconds": 40.4194, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "339", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of bustling city sounds, a young boy in a yellow shirt and green hat stands by a bus while a man and a woman geeting into the bus", "pred": "The interior of a vehicle is shown, with a person in a yellow shirt visible through the windshield. The loud, high-pitched screech of tires and a sudden, sharp impact are heard, followed by a loud, sustained electronic alarm.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The interior of a vehicle is shown, with a person in a yellow shirt visible through the windshield. The loud, high-pitched screech of tires and a sudden, sharp impact are heard, followed by a loud, sustained electronic alarm.", "cot": "[\"The interior of a vehicle is shown, with a person in a yellow shirt visible through the windshield. The loud, high-pitched screech of tires and a sudden, sharp impact are heard, followed by a loud, sustained electronic alarm.\", \"A person in a green head covering boards a red bus, followed by a woman in a patterned top, as a loud, high-pitched, and wailing siren approaches and then passes by.\\n\\\\boxed{A person boards a red bus as a loud, high-pitched siren approaches and then passes by.}\", \"A red bus is shown from the inside, with passengers boarding, while the sound of a train horn blasts loudly in the background.\", \"A red bus is visible through the front windshield of another vehicle, while a person in a yellow shirt and green turban walks past inside. Simultaneously, the distinct, high-pitched wail of an emergency vehicle siren is heard approaching, followed by the sound of a vehicle's engine and tires on pavement.\"]", "time_sec": 51.525, "generation_time_seconds": 50.0914, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "340", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man standing on a boat in the water speaks as the wind blows into the microphone, capturing the sound of an idle motorboat engine running.", "pred": "A man wearing a white button-down shirt and sunglasses stands on a boat, speaking about a GPS fixation option that keeps the boat within a few feet of its location while the sound of a boat engine is audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man wearing a white button-down shirt and sunglasses stands on a boat, speaking about a GPS fixation option that keeps the boat within a few feet of its location while the sound of a boat engine is audible.", "cot": "[\"A man wearing a white button-down shirt and sunglasses stands on a boat, speaking about a GPS fixation option that keeps the boat within a few feet of its location while the sound of a boat engine is audible.\", \"A man in a plaid shirt and sunglasses stands on a boat with two white outboard motors, speaking to the camera about a GPS system while the sound of a boat engine running is heard in the background.\", \"A man wearing sunglasses and a plaid shirt stands on a boat with twin outboard motors, speaking to the camera about the boat's GPS fixation system.\", \"A man wearing sunglasses and a patterned shirt stands on a boat with two white outboard motors, talking to the camera about a GPS feature that keeps the boat within a few feet of its location, with a marina visible in the background under a sunny sky.\"]", "time_sec": 46.074, "generation_time_seconds": 44.5878, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.05, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "341", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the background, a child's voice can be heard as a toilet flushes, while a white toilet with the lid up and water in the bowl is shown visually.", "pred": "A white toilet bowl is shown from above as its water flushes down the drain, accompanied by the sound of rushing water and the toilet's mechanical flush mechanism.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white toilet bowl is shown from above as its water flushes down the drain, accompanied by the sound of rushing water and the toilet's mechanical flush mechanism.", "cot": "[\"A white toilet bowl is shown from above as its water flushes down the drain, accompanied by the sound of rushing water and the toilet's mechanical flush mechanism.\", \"A white toilet bowl is shown in a close-up, static shot. The toilet is flushed, causing the water inside to swirl and drain. The distinct sound of the toilet flushing and water gurgling is heard.\", \"A white toilet is shown in a close-up, high-angle view as water flushes into its bowl, creating a swirling vortex. The sound of the toilet flushing is heard, followed by the sound of the tank refilling with water.\", \"A white toilet bowl is shown from a high angle as its flush mechanism activates, producing a loud, gurgling rush of water sound.\"]", "time_sec": 42.445, "generation_time_seconds": 41.3842, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 34.29, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "342", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two men communicate as a motorcycle engine idles, one riding with a helmet on and the other standing behind, ready to go.", "pred": "A man in a black tank top and sunglasses sits on a large chrome motorcycle in an alleyway, while another man in a bandana stands behind him. In a separate outdoor scene, the man with the bandana stands next to a woman as multiple male voices speak in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a black tank top and sunglasses sits on a large chrome motorcycle in an alleyway, while another man in a bandana stands behind him. In a separate outdoor scene, the man with the bandana stands next to a woman as multiple male voices speak in the background.", "cot": "[\"A man in a black tank top and sunglasses sits on a large chrome motorcycle in an alleyway, while another man in a bandana stands behind him. In a separate outdoor scene, the man with the bandana stands next to a woman as multiple male voices speak in the background.\", \"A muscular man in a black tank top and sunglasses sits on a motorcycle on a paved surface, while a man with a bandana and tattoos stands behind him, as multiple male speakers converse nearby.\", \"A man wearing a black tank top and bandana sits on a motorcycle while another man in a bandana sits on a wall, as a male voice speaks.\", \"A man with a bandana and sunglasses sits on a motorcycle while another man with tattoos and a bandana stands behind him talking. The second man says, \\\"This is this is this is junior.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 44.576, "generation_time_seconds": 43.845, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.3, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "343", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As rain falls, a motor engine idles while a man talks, alongside a silver train pulling into an empty train station.", "pred": "A silver train is stopped at a wet, tiled station platform under a foggy sky, while the sound of heavy rain is audible and a male voice states, \"Little bit of bad weather.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A silver train is stopped at a wet, tiled station platform under a foggy sky, while the sound of heavy rain is audible and a male voice states, \"Little bit of bad weather.\"", "cot": "[\"A silver train is stopped at a wet, tiled station platform under a foggy sky, while the sound of heavy rain is audible and a male voice states, \\\"Little bit of bad weather.\\\"\", \"A silver double-decker train is stopped at a wet, tiled platform under an overcast sky, with a male voice speaking over the loud, continuous sound of flowing water.\", \"The audio captures the sound of rushing water, while the visual shows a silver train at a wet, tiled station platform under an overcast sky.\", \"The scene shows a silver train stopped at a tiled platform in a foggy, rainy environment, with the sound of a person speaking briefly at the beginning, followed by the loud, constant roar of heavy rain.\"]", "time_sec": 41.623, "generation_time_seconds": 40.5184, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "344", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio of an idle vehicle engine running and bird cawing is paired with the visual of a red car with the hood up revealing a car engine and battery underneath, captured by a plastic camera click.", "pred": "A red car's engine is running, showing a silver Volkswagen valve cover, a black battery, and a red coolant reservoir, while a low-frequency engine hum is audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red car's engine is running, showing a silver Volkswagen valve cover, a black battery, and a red coolant reservoir, while a low-frequency engine hum is audible.", "cot": "[\"A red car's engine is running, showing a silver Volkswagen valve cover, a black battery, and a red coolant reservoir, while a low-frequency engine hum is audible.\", \"The audio features the loud, mechanical sound of a large engine, which is visually confirmed to be the engine of a red car with its hood open and battery terminals exposed.\", \"The audio features the loud, steady roar of a large engine idling, while the visual shows the engine bay of a red car, with a prominent silver engine cover and various hoses and components visible.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A red car's engine bay is shown as a large engine idles loudly.}\", \"The video shows a close-up of a red car's engine bay, then zooms out to reveal the front of the red car, while the audio features the continuous sound of an engine idling.\"]", "time_sec": 45.452, "generation_time_seconds": 44.5176, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "345", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man stands on a wall by the water's edge as a boat sails in the distance, surrounded by a crowd of onlookers.", "pred": "A group of people, including men in vests and a woman in a patterned shirt, stand outdoors by a body of water. The sound of continuous, rhythmic splashing is heard, as if something is repeatedly being thrown into the water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A group of people, including men in vests and a woman in a patterned shirt, stand outdoors by a body of water. The sound of continuous, rhythmic splashing is heard, as if something is repeatedly being thrown into the water.", "cot": "[\"A group of people, including men in vests and a woman in a patterned shirt, stand outdoors by a body of water. The sound of continuous, rhythmic splashing is heard, as if something is repeatedly being thrown into the water.\", \"A group of people, including officials and a cameraman, stands on a concrete pier beside a body of water. The sound of the sea is audible, accompanied by the murmur of human speech.\", \"The video opens with a group of people, including a man in a grey shirt and a woman in a black top, standing on a concrete pier next to the ocean. The scene then cuts to a wide, hazy view of the choppy sea under an overcast sky, with several small, dark, indistinct objects visible on the horizon. The sound of gentle, continuous lapping waves is heard throughout the clip.\", \"A group of people, including a cameraman and a man in a vest, stand on a concrete pier overlooking the ocean, where the sound of lapping water is heard, and the camera then pans to show several boats floating in the distance under an overcast sky.\"]", "time_sec": 54.685, "generation_time_seconds": 53.9973, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "346", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a ripcord being pulled mingles with a motorboat engine starting up as a man navigates a white boat through the tranquil waters.", "pred": "A hand adjusts the tilt of a white Johnson 15 outboard motor on a boat as the engine starts and idles, with the sound of water sloshing nearby.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand adjusts the tilt of a white Johnson 15 outboard motor on a boat as the engine starts and idles, with the sound of water sloshing nearby.", "cot": "[\"A hand adjusts the tilt of a white Johnson 15 outboard motor on a boat as the engine starts and idles, with the sound of water sloshing nearby.\", \"A white Johnson 5 outboard motor is attached to a boat on the water. A hand turns the key in the ignition, and the engine starts with a loud, rumbling sound.\", \"A hand turns the key on a white Johnson 5 horsepower outboard motor, and the sound of the engine cranking and then successfully starting is heard as it sits at the stern of a boat on the water.\", \"A hand pulls the starter cord of a white Johnson 5 horsepower outboard motor, and the engine begins to rumble to life with a low, sputtering idle.\"]", "time_sec": 42.805, "generation_time_seconds": 41.9788, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "347", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A person types on the keyboard of a black computer while pointing their finger at it and drinking a coffee.", "pred": "A person's hands type on a black keyboard in a cubicle, while the distinct clicking of a computer mouse is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands type on a black keyboard in a cubicle, while the distinct clicking of a computer mouse is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands type on a black keyboard in a cubicle, while the distinct clicking of a computer mouse is heard in the background.\", \"A person's hands are shown typing on a black mechanical keyboard, and the audio consists of the distinct, rhythmic clicking sounds of the keys being pressed.\", \"A person's hands are visible typing on a black keyboard, accompanied by the continuous sound of keyboard typing.\", \"A person's hands type on a black keyboard, with a computer monitor visible on the left and a beige cubicle wall in the background, while the distinct sound of a typewriter being used is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 38.22, "generation_time_seconds": 36.8948, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.27, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "348", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the bustling night street, a man joyfully rides a motorcycle past cars, roaring engine.", "pred": "A motorcycle with a rider is seen driving down a dark road at night, its engine revving loudly as it accelerates away from the camera.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A motorcycle with a rider is seen driving down a dark road at night, its engine revving loudly as it accelerates away from the camera.", "cot": "[\"A motorcycle with a rider is seen driving down a dark road at night, its engine revving loudly as it accelerates away from the camera.\", \"A person wearing a helmet rides a dark motorcycle at night. The motorcycle's red taillight is visible as it moves from left to right across the frame. Simultaneously, the loud, high-pitched roar of a vehicle engine, likely a race car, dominates the audio, suggesting a nearby high-speed event.\", \"A motorcycle with its taillight on drives away from the camera down a dark road at night, while the deep, loud, and rising roar of its engine is heard.\", \"The audio contains the sound of a vehicle engine revving, but the visual shows a person on a motorcycle on a dark road, which contradicts the audio.\"]", "time_sec": 43.301, "generation_time_seconds": 42.7497, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "349", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young man whooshes through a rushing stream, holding a fish he caught while fishing.", "pred": "A person in waders stands in a rocky river, casting a fishing line as flowing water creates a loud rushing sound, followed by a male voice saying \"push\".", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in waders stands in a rocky river, casting a fishing line as flowing water creates a loud rushing sound, followed by a male voice saying \"push\".", "cot": "[\"A person in waders stands in a rocky river, casting a fishing line as flowing water creates a loud rushing sound, followed by a male voice saying \\\"push\\\".\", \"A person in waders and a hat is fly fishing in a shallow, rocky stream, while loud rushing water and a male voice exclaiming \\\"Oosh!\\\" are heard.\", \"A person in waders stands in a stream, casting a fishing line into the water amidst a forest of green trees, while the continuous, low-frequency sound of a large volume of rushing water is heard, culminating in a sharp, high-pitched \\\"shush\\\" at 0:05.\", \"A person in waders stands in a rocky stream, casting a fishing line, while the loud, continuous roar of the flowing water is heard, followed by a man exclaiming \\\"Ouch!\\\".\"]", "time_sec": 46.091, "generation_time_seconds": 44.8295, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "350", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The young woman in blue is speaking in slow motion while sitting on a couch in a living room, making faces at the camer.", "pred": "A young woman with dark braided hair, wearing a dark blue top, sits on a couch and laughs heartily, covering her mouth, while an off-screen person speaks in a high-pitched, theatrical voice.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young woman with dark braided hair, wearing a dark blue top, sits on a couch and laughs heartily, covering her mouth, while an off-screen person speaks in a high-pitched, theatrical voice.", "cot": "[\"A young woman with dark braided hair, wearing a dark blue top, sits on a couch and laughs heartily, covering her mouth, while an off-screen person speaks in a high-pitched, theatrical voice.\", \"A young woman with dark hair, wearing a dark blue shirt, is sitting on a couch and talking while gesturing with her hands. The audio consists of a person making a series of high-pitched, strained, and guttural vocalizations, including sounds resembling crying, screaming, and a drawn-out, wavering hum.\", \"A young woman with dark hair in pigtails sits on a couch, laughing and covering her mouth while pointing at the camera, as a deep, guttural, and distorted voice speaks incoherently in the background.\", \"A young woman with dark hair in pigtails, wearing a dark blue shirt, sits on a couch in a living room and speaks while gesturing with her hands. Overlapping her speech, a deep, guttural, and sustained vocalization is heard, resembling a monstrous roar or growl.\"]", "time_sec": 52.635, "generation_time_seconds": 51.9665, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.86, "GAVIE-Rel": 4.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "351", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The old-fashioned telephone ring echoes as a black cellphone sits on top of a round table, with a subtle buzzing in the background.", "pred": "A black Samsung feature phone rests on a red and white patterned surface, its screen dark, as a loud, repetitive electronic alarm sound plays.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black Samsung feature phone rests on a red and white patterned surface, its screen dark, as a loud, repetitive electronic alarm sound plays.", "cot": "[\"A black Samsung feature phone rests on a red and white patterned surface, its screen dark, as a loud, repetitive electronic alarm sound plays.\", \"A black Samsung feature phone with a physical keypad is resting on a circular surface patterned with orange and white. A small, dark insect is crawling on the surface near the phone. The phone repeatedly emits a high-pitched, electronic, and repetitive ringing sound.\", \"A black Samsung feature phone is lying on a surface with concentric red and orange circles. A high-pitched, continuous electronic alarm sounds, suggesting the phone is ringing or has activated a siren alert.\\n\\\\boxed{A black Samsung mobile phone rests on a patterned surface as a loud, high-pitched electronic alarm beeps repeatedly.}\", \"A black Samsung feature phone rests on a multi-colored circular surface.\\n Simultaneously, a loud, high-pitched, electronic alarm sound begins and continues to play.\"]", "time_sec": 47.63, "generation_time_seconds": 46.9878, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.45, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "352", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The steam engine hisses and puffs steam as a black train travels down tracks near a forest, creating a nostalgic symphony of sound and sight.", "pred": "A black steam locomotive with the number 46117 on its front pulls red and cream-colored passenger carriages along a track. The train emits a large plume of white steam and is accompanied by the rhythmic, mechanical chuffing sound of its steam engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black steam locomotive with the number 46117 on its front pulls red and cream-colored passenger carriages along a track. The train emits a large plume of white steam and is accompanied by the rhythmic, mechanical chuffing sound of its steam engine.", "cot": "[\"A black steam locomotive with the number 46117 on its front pulls red and cream-colored passenger carriages along a track. The train emits a large plume of white steam and is accompanied by the rhythmic, mechanical chuffing sound of its steam engine.\", \"A black steam locomotive, emitting white steam and smoke, travels on a track, pulling passenger carriages, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic chugging of its engine and the clatter of wheels on the rails.\", \"A black steam locomotive with red trim, emitting white steam, travels on a set of tracks next to trees, while the audio features the distinct rhythmic chuffing of its engine and the clatter of the wheels.\", \"A black steam locomotive with the number 46112 approaches on the tracks, emitting white steam, while a rhythmic metallic clatter from its wheels and a sharp hiss from its steam engine are heard.\"]", "time_sec": 48.765, "generation_time_seconds": 47.6959, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "353", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A yellow ambulance with flashing lights speeds down a rain-soaked street, its siren blaring as it passes other vehicles.", "pred": "A bright yellow Dutch ambulance, marked with '112' and a red cross, drives on a wet city road while its siren wails loudly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A bright yellow Dutch ambulance, marked with '112' and a red cross, drives on a wet city road while its siren wails loudly.", "cot": "[\"A bright yellow Dutch ambulance, marked with '112' and a red cross, drives on a wet city road while its siren wails loudly.\", \"The scene is a wet city road where a yellow ambulance with flashing blue and red lights and a siren is driving towards the camera, followed by other vehicles.\", \"I see a yellow emergency vehicle with flashing blue lights driving on a wet road during the day.\\nI hear a loud, high-pitched two-tone siren, indicating an emergency vehicle moving at speed.\\n\\\\boxed{A yellow emergency vehicle with flashing blue lights drives on a wet road, accompanied by a loud, high-pitched two-tone siren.}\", \"A yellow ambulance with flashing blue and red lights and a siren approaches on a wet road, followed by a silver car, as the sound of the siren grows louder.\"]", "time_sec": 45.82, "generation_time_seconds": 44.66, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "354", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the dimly lit room, a wooden clock with a key on it ticks softly as a hand holds a mirror up to a picture of a clock on the wall, capturing the essence of time passing by.", "pred": "A hand reaches towards a wooden grandfather clock as the distinct sound of a clock ticking is heard, accompanied by a final electronic beep.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand reaches towards a wooden grandfather clock as the distinct sound of a clock ticking is heard, accompanied by a final electronic beep.", "cot": "[\"A hand reaches towards a wooden grandfather clock as the distinct sound of a clock ticking is heard, accompanied by a final electronic beep.\", \"A close-up view of a wooden grandfather clock's pendulum and side panel is accompanied by the sound of a mechanical clock's steady, rhythmic ticking.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a wooden grandfather clock, and the accompanying audio is the distinct, rhythmic 'tick-tock' of its internal mechanism.\", \"A hand reaches for a grandfather clock. The audio consists of a continuous, rhythmic ticking sound.\"]", "time_sec": 36.478, "generation_time_seconds": 34.7688, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "355", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a man spoke, a kitten in a red hat rolled and the kitten screaming sound ,ending with a letter on the red screen.", "pred": "A grey tabby cat wearing a red and white Santa hat sits on a red surface next to wrapped presents. A male voice speaks, followed by the cat meowing. A title card then appears on a red background, stating the video is titled \"Christmas Cat\" and is brought to you by CutePicturesOfCats.com.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A grey tabby cat wearing a red and white Santa hat sits on a red surface next to wrapped presents. A male voice speaks, followed by the cat meowing. A title card then appears on a red background, stating the video is titled \"Christmas Cat\" and is brought to you by CutePicturesOfCats.com.", "cot": "[\"A grey tabby cat wearing a red and white Santa hat sits on a red surface next to wrapped presents. A male voice speaks, followed by the cat meowing. A title card then appears on a red background, stating the video is titled \\\"Christmas Cat\\\" and is brought to you by CutePicturesOfCats.com.\", \"A grey tabby cat wearing a red Santa hat sits on a red surface next to wrapped presents, then shakes its head as on-screen text appears. A male voiceover says, \\\"I'll show you some claws, Santa,\\\" followed by a loud meow and the announcement, \\\"This cute cat comedy clip is brought to you by CutePicturesOfCats.com.\\\"\", \"The video shows a grey tabby cat wearing a red and white Santa hat, sitting on a red background with small gifts, as a man speaks and the cat meows.\", \"A gray tabby cat wearing a Santa hat is shown, followed by a title card. A man's voice speaks, then a cat meows, followed by a narrator's voice.\"]", "time_sec": 51.613, "generation_time_seconds": 50.9366, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.04, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "356", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The dark environment is accompanied by the voice of the camera constantly changing and leaking in room one laptop is there.", "pred": "The scene is dark, containing a white cake with a silver bow, a black camera with a large lens, and other indistinct objects. A man speaks, asking if the items are useful, and another voice responds by saying, \"You have offended white noise.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The scene is dark, containing a white cake with a silver bow, a black camera with a large lens, and other indistinct objects. A man speaks, asking if the items are useful, and another voice responds by saying, \"You have offended white noise.\"", "cot": "[\"The scene is dark, containing a white cake with a silver bow, a black camera with a large lens, and other indistinct objects. A man speaks, asking if the items are useful, and another voice responds by saying, \\\"You have offended white noise.\\\"\", \"In a dark setting, a collection of electronic devices including a camera and a laptop is shown, accompanied by the sound of an engine, a male voice, and a loud crash.\", \"The video shows a dark, cluttered room with a cake, gifts, and a laptop. A man speaks, questioning the usefulness of unseen items before a loud, low-frequency hum starts, accompanied by a second voice stating, \\\"You have offended white noise.\\\"\", \"The video displays a series of dark, low-resolution images showing a white cake with a silver bow, a black camera with a lens, and a black laptop with a small gold bow. Simultaneously, a male voice speaks, followed by a loud, distorted buzzing sound effect.\"]", "time_sec": 49.785, "generation_time_seconds": 49.3122, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "357", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The video shows the girl singing a Korean song, and the male judge picks up the microphone and hum the Korean song.", "pred": "The audio contains a female voice singing a pop song, followed by a male voice singing the same phrase in a different style, and then a female voice singing a phrase in Korean. The visual shows a young girl singing on a stage, then cuts to three judges sitting at a table, and then focuses on two of the male judges.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio contains a female voice singing a pop song, followed by a male voice singing the same phrase in a different style, and then a female voice singing a phrase in Korean. The visual shows a young girl singing on a stage, then cuts to three judges sitting at a table, and then focuses on two of the male judges.", "cot": "[\"The audio contains a female voice singing a pop song, followed by a male voice singing the same phrase in a different style, and then a female voice singing a phrase in Korean. The visual shows a young girl singing on a stage, then cuts to three judges sitting at a table, and then focuses on two of the male judges.\", \"A young girl sings into a microphone on a stage with a purple pixelated background, followed by a man speaking into a microphone while another man listens, and a female speaker is also heard.\", \"A young girl sings into a microphone on a stage with a purple LED background, while a male judge sings a phrase in harmony with her, which is then echoed by a male voice in the background.\", \"A young girl sings into a microphone on a stage with a purple LED background, which then cuts to a panel of three judges at a desk. Simultaneously, a female voice sings, followed by a male voice singing the same phrase in a lower pitch, and then a male voice speaks.\"]", "time_sec": 50.279, "generation_time_seconds": 49.729, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.49, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "358", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On the sofa ,a person touches a cat and cat making sound.", "pred": "A person pets a white cat with blue eyes that is sitting on a patterned cushion. The cat meows, and a person speaks.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person pets a white cat with blue eyes that is sitting on a patterned cushion. The cat meows, and a person speaks.", "cot": "[\"A person pets a white cat with blue eyes that is sitting on a patterned cushion. The cat meows, and a person speaks.\", \"A person pets a white and gray cat on a couch, and the cat meows.\", \"A person pets a white and grey cat on a textured surface, which then meows loudly as the person speaks.\", \"A white and grey cat with blue eyes is being petted on a textured surface, and it meows.\"]", "time_sec": 32.131, "generation_time_seconds": 31.2036, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "359", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two dogs were shouting in the room, and a man was watching and laughing .", "pred": "A large brown dog plays with a smaller black-and-white dog on a carpeted floor, while a man kneels and watches them, and a dog barks and growls nearby.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large brown dog plays with a smaller black-and-white dog on a carpeted floor, while a man kneels and watches them, and a dog barks and growls nearby.", "cot": "[\"A large brown dog plays with a smaller black-and-white dog on a carpeted floor, while a man kneels and watches them, and a dog barks and growls nearby.\", \"A man kneels on a carpeted floor as a large brown dog and a smaller tricolor dog play-fight; the larger dog rolls onto its back while the smaller dog jumps on it, accompanied by the sounds of panting, growling, and the smaller dog barking.\", \"Two dogs play on a carpeted floor while a man kneels nearby; the larger dog rolls onto its back, and both dogs vocalize with excited barks and high-pitched whines.\", \"A large brown and white dog and a smaller black and white dog play on a carpeted floor, with the larger dog rolling onto its back, as a person kneels nearby observing them and dogs bark and growl in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 45.951, "generation_time_seconds": 45.4087, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "360", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man explained that the window of the car was up and down while the window was running, and the sound of the Weng sounded as it was running.", "pred": "The interior of a vehicle is shown, followed by a view of a white truck's rear passenger window, where a person's reflection is visible. A male voice states, \"and rear passenger window,\" immediately before a sharp click and the sound of a window rolling down.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The interior of a vehicle is shown, followed by a view of a white truck's rear passenger window, where a person's reflection is visible. A male voice states, \"and rear passenger window,\" immediately before a sharp click and the sound of a window rolling down.", "cot": "[\"The interior of a vehicle is shown, followed by a view of a white truck's rear passenger window, where a person's reflection is visible. A male voice states, \\\"and rear passenger window,\\\" immediately before a sharp click and the sound of a window rolling down.\", \"The audio captures a person speaking about a \\\"rear passenger window\\\" just before a car door is closed, while the visual shows the interior of a white truck with beige seats and a view of trees outside the side window.\", \"The camera pans across the beige leather interior of a vehicle, showing the front seats and a view of a grassy area with a blue fence through the windows, while a person speaks and a zipper is heard being pulled.\", \"The interior of a vehicle with light-colored seats is shown, followed by a view of the vehicle's side window, while a person speaks and a car door is heard closing.\"]", "time_sec": 46.314, "generation_time_seconds": 44.9548, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "361", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the music, the three men played instruments in different places and  appeared in a dark room.", "pred": "The video presents a sequence of distinct scenes: a concert performance with a drummer and guitarist under red and green stage lights, followed by a dimly lit indoor setting where a person with long dark hair is visible, and finally a scene featuring a person with long dark hair and a beard in a dark room. Overlaid on these visuals is the sound of a fast-paced, aggressive heavy metal song, featuring heavily distorted electric guitars, a driving drum beat, and guttural, screamed vocals.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video presents a sequence of distinct scenes: a concert performance with a drummer and guitarist under red and green stage lights, followed by a dimly lit indoor setting where a person with long dark hair is visible, and finally a scene featuring a person with long dark hair and a beard in a dark room. Overlaid on these visuals is the sound of a fast-paced, aggressive heavy metal song, featuring heavily distorted electric guitars, a driving drum beat, and guttural, screamed vocals.", "cot": "[\"The video presents a sequence of distinct scenes: a concert performance with a drummer and guitarist under red and green stage lights, followed by a dimly lit indoor setting where a person with long dark hair is visible, and finally a scene featuring a person with long dark hair and a beard in a dark room. Overlaid on these visuals is the sound of a fast-paced, aggressive heavy metal song, featuring heavily distorted electric guitars, a driving drum beat, and guttural, screamed vocals.\", \"The video opens with a band performing on an outdoor stage bathed in golden sunlight, then cuts to a drummer playing under intense red and green concert lights, followed by a shot of the band members in a dimly lit room, all while loud, distorted heavy metal music with aggressive drumming and electric guitar is heard.\", \"The audio contains an aggressive, distorted heavy metal song with a male vocalist singing in English, while the visual shows a band performing on a stage with green and red lights.\", \"The video contains multiple, disconnected scenes: an outdoor forest at sunset, a dark scene with a person holding a guitar, a band performing under colored stage lights, a person with long hair in a dimly lit room, and a person with long hair in a dark room with a bright light source. The audio consists of a loud, energetic heavy metal song with a male vocalist, distorted guitars, and a fast tempo.\\n\\\\boxed{Diverse, disconnected scenes including a forest, a person with a guitar, a band on stage, and people in dim rooms, are accompanied by a loud heavy metal song.}\"]", "time_sec": 67.922, "generation_time_seconds": 67.4219, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "362", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in black, playing guitar in his arms, was very sweet talking about the music.", "pred": "A man wearing a black t-shirt and a black beanie is playing a brown acoustic guitar. In the top right corner, a close-up of the guitar's neck and hands is shown. A red banner with the text \"Natural harmonics\" is visible at the bottom. The audio contains the sound of the acoustic guitar being played with a rhythmic percussive strumming technique.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man wearing a black t-shirt and a black beanie is playing a brown acoustic guitar. In the top right corner, a close-up of the guitar's neck and hands is shown. A red banner with the text \"Natural harmonics\" is visible at the bottom. The audio contains the sound of the acoustic guitar being played with a rhythmic percussive strumming technique.", "cot": "[\"A man wearing a black t-shirt and a black beanie is playing a brown acoustic guitar. In the top right corner, a close-up of the guitar's neck and hands is shown. A red banner with the text \\\"Natural harmonics\\\" is visible at the bottom. The audio contains the sound of the acoustic guitar being played with a rhythmic percussive strumming technique.\", \"A man wearing a black t-shirt and baseball cap is seated and playing a sunburst electric guitar. A smaller inset video in the upper right corner provides a close-up of his hands strumming the instrument. An on-screen graphic displays the text 'Strumming' and 'Natural harmonics'. The audio features the man playing a slow, melodic, and reverberant chord progression on the guitar.\", \"A man in a black t-shirt and black beanie plays a sunburst 12-string acoustic guitar while looking at the camera, with a split-screen showing a close-up of his hands; on-screen text first reads \\\"Strumming\\\" then changes to \\\"Natural harmonics\\\", all accompanied by the clean, melodic sound of the guitar being played.\", \"A musician strums a sunburst electric guitar while a split-screen displays a close-up of the fretboard; the audio features a mellow, jazzy instrumental with a smooth bassline and soft percussion.\"]", "time_sec": 61.339, "generation_time_seconds": 60.4082, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.39, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "363", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A water pump runs beside the water with a beep and beside a tree.", "pred": "A wooden waterwheel with attached paddles rotates in a pond, splashing water, while a continuous, low-frequency mechanical grinding sound is heard, suggesting an internal mechanism is in operation.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A wooden waterwheel with attached paddles rotates in a pond, splashing water, while a continuous, low-frequency mechanical grinding sound is heard, suggesting an internal mechanism is in operation.", "cot": "[\"A wooden waterwheel with attached paddles rotates in a pond, splashing water, while a continuous, low-frequency mechanical grinding sound is heard, suggesting an internal mechanism is in operation.\", \"A wooden water mill with a waterwheel and a scoop wheel operates by a pond, with the sound of flowing water audible.\", \"A wooden waterwheel with a pulley system spins, causing water to splash into a pond, while a continuous mechanical clicking sound is heard.\", \"A wooden water wheel rotates in a pond, splashing water, while birds chirp in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 35.13, "generation_time_seconds": 34.4191, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "364", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "At a lively concert, a man sings into a microphone while a band plays on stage, eliciting cheers and laughter from the enthusiastic crowd.", "pred": "A band performs on a dark stage with red lighting, featuring male guitarists and a large choir of women in the background, while a male voice speaks into a microphone over the sound of the audience cheering.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A band performs on a dark stage with red lighting, featuring male guitarists and a large choir of women in the background, while a male voice speaks into a microphone over the sound of the audience cheering.", "cot": "[\"A band performs on a dark stage with red lighting, featuring male guitarists and a large choir of women in the background, while a male voice speaks into a microphone over the sound of the audience cheering.\", \"A male musician sings into a microphone on a dimly lit stage, with a band and a large choir of women in the background. The crowd cheers loudly as he speaks and points to the band.\", \"A band performs on a stage under red lights in front of a large, cheering crowd, while a male voice addresses them from the audience.\", \"A live band consisting of guitarists and a drummer performs on a red-lit stage before a large, cheering audience. A male voice in the foreground comments on the music, saying, \\\"That bass is so much bigger than you do. I mean, it's so huge. Huge. It's just... it's... Hey, Jamie, I got one thing to tell you. Don't be jealous.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 48.704, "generation_time_seconds": 47.2725, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "365", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A cat screamed in the room and beat up the dog beside it.and a women is laughing.", "pred": "A light-colored dog and a Siamese cat are on a bed; the dog growls and barks at the cat, which responds with a hiss.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A light-colored dog and a Siamese cat are on a bed; the dog growls and barks at the cat, which responds with a hiss.", "cot": "[\"A light-colored dog and a Siamese cat are on a bed; the dog growls and barks at the cat, which responds with a hiss.\", \"A large, tan-colored dog sits on a bed next to a Siamese cat, both facing forward, while a loud, wet sniffling sound is heard from the dog.\", \"A large, light-colored dog with a dark muzzle is seen on a bed next to a Siamese cat. The dog is growling and snarling aggressively at the cat, which is sitting up and facing the dog. The dog then lunges forward and bites at the cat's back.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A large dog growls and lunges at a seated Siamese cat on a bed.}\", \"A light-colored dog sits on a bed next to a Siamese cat, both making loud, aggressive snarling and growling sounds at each other.\"]", "time_sec": 46.931, "generation_time_seconds": 46.2316, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.05, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "366", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Between the birds and the chickens, the two turkeys lay on a pile of sawdust in their nest and made a sound.", "pred": "Two young turkeys peck at grain inside a metal container while a rooster crows and a turkey gobbles in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Two young turkeys peck at grain inside a metal container while a rooster crows and a turkey gobbles in the background.", "cot": "[\"Two young turkeys peck at grain inside a metal container while a rooster crows and a turkey gobbles in the background.\", \"Two young turkeys, one with brown and white feathers and another with dark feathers, are eating grain from a large metal container, while a turkey gobbles loudly in the background.\", \"At least two turkeys are visible in a rustic metal container, pecking at grain on the ground, while the distinct gobbling sound of a turkey is heard in the audio.\", \"I am observing two juvenile turkeys with mottled brown and black feathers eating grain from the bottom of a large, round, metallic container. I can hear the crisp, dry sound of their beaks pecking at the feed, accompanied by the distinct gobbling vocalization of a turkey.\"]", "time_sec": 43.199, "generation_time_seconds": 42.473, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "367", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "It was dark all around, and several white letters gradually appeared in the sound of the running water and background text appears.", "pred": "\\boxed{Animated white 3D text reading \"D HONEY MUSIC\" is displayed on a tiered wooden platform against a black background, accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency pulsing sound.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "1.  Visuals: The video shows the animated text \"D HONEY MUSIC\" in white, three-dimensional letters against a black background. The letters emerge from a dark, tiered, circular wooden platform.\n2.  Audio: A continuous, low-frequency, rhythmic pulsing sound, similar to a heartbeat, is audible throughout the clip.\n3.  Synthesis: The visual is a static logo animation, while the audio consists of a single, persistent ambient sound effect.\n\n\\boxed{Animated white 3D text reading \"D HONEY MUSIC\" is displayed on a tiered wooden platform against a black background, accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency pulsing sound.}", "cot": "[\"1.  Visuals: The video shows the animated text \\\"D HONEY MUSIC\\\" in white, three-dimensional letters against a black background. The letters emerge from a dark, tiered, circular wooden platform.\\n2.  Audio: A continuous, low-frequency, rhythmic pulsing sound, similar to a heartbeat, is audible throughout the clip.\\n3.  Synthesis: The visual is a static logo animation, while the audio consists of a single, persistent ambient sound effect.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{Animated white 3D text reading \\\"D HONEY MUSIC\\\" is displayed on a tiered wooden platform against a black background, accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency pulsing sound.}\", \"A stylized 3D logo reading \\\"DHONEY MUSIC\\\" in white block letters on a wooden podium is illuminated against a black background, accompanied by a continuous low-frequency electronic hum.\", \"First, I observed the visual content of the image. It shows a logo with the text \\\"D HONEY MUSIC\\\" in a stylized, three-dimensional font. The logo is illuminated and appears to be on a wooden, tiered pedestal against a dark background.\\n\\nNext, I analyzed the audio component of the media. The audio consists of the distinct sound of a vehicle's turn signal blinking, accompanied by a low, constant hum, possibly from an engine.\\n\\nBased on the prompt to describe both what is seen and heard in a single sentence, I combined these two separate modalities into one factual statement.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A \\\"D HONEY MUSIC\\\" logo is displayed while the sound of a turn signal and a vehicle's hum are heard.}\", \"A wooden, tiered platform is illuminated in a dark room, with a dark rectangular object on top. The words 'D HONEY MUSIC' in a light-colored, stylized font appear on the platform. This visual is accompanied by a high-pitched, continuous electronic tone.\"]", "time_sec": 77.704, "generation_time_seconds": 77.1474, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 4.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "368", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Inside, a person holds an electric appliance in hand, the vibration after turning on the appliance collides with the board, and. the man produces a thump sound, the background has a voice.", "pred": "A hand holds a black object, which is then placed on a wooden surface, producing a series of loud, mechanical, grinding sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand holds a black object, which is then placed on a wooden surface, producing a series of loud, mechanical, grinding sounds.", "cot": "[\"A hand holds a black object, which is then placed on a wooden surface, producing a series of loud, mechanical, grinding sounds.\", \"A hand holds a black object against a wooden surface. The loud, rhythmic clatter of a manual typewriter is heard. A male voice says, \\\"Yeah, so it's pretty...\\\"\", \"A hand holds a black object, then a person uses a power tool to cut a piece of wood, and a man speaks.\\n\\\\boxed{A hand holds a black object, then a person uses a power tool to cut a piece of wood, and a man speaks.}\", \"A hand holds a black, oval-shaped object. A loud, deep, guttural growl, like an engine starting, is heard, followed by the sound of a machine being activated.\"]", "time_sec": 42.856, "generation_time_seconds": 42.1193, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "369", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The chef whisks the chocolate in a red blender, which makes a buzzing sound and adds white flour to the mix, while the chef explains the steps in detail.", "pred": "A person uses a red electric mixer in a bowl of dark batter, then adds a white powdery substance while a male voice says, \"Alright. Now we'll put in another cup. I'm using a half cup measure here.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person uses a red electric mixer in a bowl of dark batter, then adds a white powdery substance while a male voice says, \"Alright. Now we'll put in another cup. I'm using a half cup measure here.\"", "cot": "[\"A person uses a red electric mixer in a bowl of dark batter, then adds a white powdery substance while a male voice says, \\\"Alright. Now we'll put in another cup. I'm using a half cup measure here.\\\"\", \"A person uses a red electric hand mixer to blend chocolate batter in a glass bowl, then adds a white powdery ingredient from a half-cup measure while speaking.\", \"A red electric mixer whirs loudly as it blends dark chocolate batter in a glass bowl, and then a person pours white powder from a measuring cup into the bowl, while a male voice narrates the baking process.\", \"A hand uses a red electric mixer to blend chocolate batter in a glass bowl, while another hand pours white powder from a measuring cup, accompanied by the sound of the mixer and a person explaining the addition of another cup of an ingredient.\"]", "time_sec": 44.892, "generation_time_seconds": 43.7631, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.95, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "370", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On the stage, a female singer followed the accompaniment in singing the song.", "pred": "The video shows a band performing on a stage with blue lighting. The lead singer, a woman in a red dress, sings into a microphone while a male guitarist plays and a drummer in a top hat performs on a drum kit. The music is an upbeat pop song with a female vocalist singing in English.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a band performing on a stage with blue lighting. The lead singer, a woman in a red dress, sings into a microphone while a male guitarist plays and a drummer in a top hat performs on a drum kit. The music is an upbeat pop song with a female vocalist singing in English.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a band performing on a stage with blue lighting. The lead singer, a woman in a red dress, sings into a microphone while a male guitarist plays and a drummer in a top hat performs on a drum kit. The music is an upbeat pop song with a female vocalist singing in English.\", \"A band performs on a stage with blue lighting; a female singer in a red dress sings while a man plays guitar and another plays drums, accompanied by the sounds of an electric guitar, bass, and drums.\", \"A woman in a red dress sings into a microphone on a stage lit with blue lights, accompanied by a band including a guitarist and a drummer playing a rhythmic beat.\", \"A woman in a red dress sings into a microphone on a stage with blue lighting, accompanied by a band featuring a guitarist and a drummer, while the sound of a fast-paced, rhythmic drumbeat and the singer's voice are heard.\"]", "time_sec": 46.533, "generation_time_seconds": 46.0114, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.64, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "371", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the box, two mice played with the singing and a man was laughing.", "pred": "A small grey hamster runs on a white exercise wheel inside a cage with bedding, a water bottle, and a food bowl, while the background audio contains the indistinct murmur of multiple people talking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A small grey hamster runs on a white exercise wheel inside a cage with bedding, a water bottle, and a food bowl, while the background audio contains the indistinct murmur of multiple people talking.", "cot": "[\"A small grey hamster runs on a white exercise wheel inside a cage with bedding, a water bottle, and a food bowl, while the background audio contains the indistinct murmur of multiple people talking.\", \"A grey mouse runs in a white exercise wheel as a child speaks in the background.\", \"A gray hamster runs on a white exercise wheel inside a cage filled with wood shavings, a red food bowl, a water bottle, and a yellow and purple toy, while the sounds of a bustling crowd and a vehicle engine are audible in the background.\", \"A gray hamster runs in a white exercise wheel inside a pet enclosure filled with bedding, a water bottle, and a food bowl, while the distinct sound of a high-pitched, metallic grinding or drilling is heard in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 42.302, "generation_time_seconds": 41.7451, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "372", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a messy clearing, someone took something and shot a door glass, making a clattering sound, and someone introduced it.", "pred": "A white car door is propped upright in a wooded area. A man speaks, followed by the sharp, percussive sounds of a hammer striking a metal surface.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white car door is propped upright in a wooded area. A man speaks, followed by the sharp, percussive sounds of a hammer striking a metal surface.", "cot": "[\"A white car door is propped upright in a wooded area. A man speaks, followed by the sharp, percussive sounds of a hammer striking a metal surface.\", \"I see a damaged white car door on the ground, and I hear a person speaking followed by the sound of a glass window breaking.\", \"A white car door is propped upright outdoors. A male voice speaks, followed by the loud crashing and shattering of breaking glass.\", \"A white car door is propped up outdoors. A person speaks, followed by the sound of a metallic object being struck multiple times.\"]", "time_sec": 35.97, "generation_time_seconds": 35.0395, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "373", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Outside a white cage, a group of pigeons crept into the cage with the sound of a rumble and a man's whistling.", "pred": "A white chicken coop with wire mesh doors and a broken plywood panel is shown. Inside, several pigeons are visible. A white pigeon flaps its wings and flies out of a small opening at the top of the coop. The sound of cooing pigeons is heard, followed by a person whistling a tune.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white chicken coop with wire mesh doors and a broken plywood panel is shown. Inside, several pigeons are visible. A white pigeon flaps its wings and flies out of a small opening at the top of the coop. The sound of cooing pigeons is heard, followed by a person whistling a tune.", "cot": "[\"A white chicken coop with wire mesh doors and a broken plywood panel is shown. Inside, several pigeons are visible. A white pigeon flaps its wings and flies out of a small opening at the top of the coop. The sound of cooing pigeons is heard, followed by a person whistling a tune.\", \"The scene shows a white chicken coop with a bird flying out of a top opening, while the sound of fluttering wings is heard, followed by a person whistling a tune.\", \"A white wooden chicken coop with wire mesh doors contains several active chickens. A white chicken flaps its wings as it jumps out of a small square opening in the coop. The sound of multiple chickens clucking and flapping their wings is heard, followed by a single high-pitched whistle.\", \"A white wooden pigeon coop with wire mesh doors contains several pigeons. A white pigeon with black markings on its wings flies out of an open top hatch, and the sound of its wings flapping is heard, followed by a person whistling.\"]", "time_sec": 51.795, "generation_time_seconds": 50.6735, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.78, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "374", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A white puppy kept barking on the pet rack, and a black puppy lay on the ground.", "pred": "A small, brown and white dog is inside a blue and silver wire cage. The dog then jumps out of the cage and runs across a light-colored floor. The video is accompanied by the sound of a cat meowing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A small, brown and white dog is inside a blue and silver wire cage. The dog then jumps out of the cage and runs across a light-colored floor. The video is accompanied by the sound of a cat meowing.", "cot": "[\"A small, brown and white dog is inside a blue and silver wire cage. The dog then jumps out of the cage and runs across a light-colored floor. The video is accompanied by the sound of a cat meowing.\", \"A small white and brown dog is inside a blue and white wire cage. The dog jumps out of the cage and runs across a light-colored floor. A dark-colored cat walks nearby. A cat is heard meowing loudly and repeatedly.\", \"The visual shows a small puppy in a blue and white wire cage, which is then lifted and dropped onto a light-colored floor, causing the puppy to fall out and run away. Overlapping with the visual, the audio features the high-pitched, distressed meowing of a cat. The final answer is:\\n\\\\boxed{A puppy is dropped from a cage onto a floor and runs away while a cat meows loudly.}\", \"A black cat runs across a floor with a blue cage visible, accompanied by a high-pitched, continuous meowing sound.\"]", "time_sec": 49.512, "generation_time_seconds": 48.8167, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "375", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Outside, a red car accompanied by the roar of the engine drove forward, met a black car, the red car backward, while a man spoke beside.", "pred": "The audio features the distinct sound of a manual transmission truck shifting gears, accompanied by the squeal of air brakes, while the visual shows a large, vintage-style red Mack truck parked on a gravel surface in front of a wooden barn.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features the distinct sound of a manual transmission truck shifting gears, accompanied by the squeal of air brakes, while the visual shows a large, vintage-style red Mack truck parked on a gravel surface in front of a wooden barn.", "cot": "[\"The audio features the distinct sound of a manual transmission truck shifting gears, accompanied by the squeal of air brakes, while the visual shows a large, vintage-style red Mack truck parked on a gravel surface in front of a wooden barn.\", \"A large, red, vintage semi-truck with prominent white-rimmed wheels is parked on a gravel surface in front of a red barn. The truck's powerful engine is heard revving loudly and then idling, accompanied by the sharp hiss of its air brakes.\", \"A large, red, vintage Mack flatbed truck is shown parked on a gravel road next to a large, weathered wooden barn, while the sound of a very loud engine is heard, followed by the sound of a person speaking.\", \"A large, red, vintage truck with prominent chrome and white-walled tires is parked on a gravel surface, while the loud, deep rumble of its powerful engine idles and then revs.\"]", "time_sec": 47.426, "generation_time_seconds": 46.7564, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.3, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "376", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the sea sky, there was a rainbow, someone singing to the accompaniment, and the subtitles were rolling.", "pred": "The video displays a landscape with a double rainbow while a person sings the lyrics, \"double rainbow across the sky, what does this mean?\", over a backdrop of electronic music.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a landscape with a double rainbow while a person sings the lyrics, \"double rainbow across the sky, what does this mean?\", over a backdrop of electronic music.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a landscape with a double rainbow while a person sings the lyrics, \\\"double rainbow across the sky, what does this mean?\\\", over a backdrop of electronic music.\", \"The video displays a natural double rainbow over a hilly landscape. Overlaid on this scene are multiple text captions in different styles and colors, including phrases like \\\"DOUBLE RAINBOW ACROSS THE SKY\\\", \\\"WHAT DOES THIS MEAN\\\", and \\\"OH MY GOD ITS FULL\\\". Simultaneously, a person speaks in an excited, high-pitched voice, repeating the phrase \\\"Double rainbow across the sky\\\" and exclaiming \\\"Oh my god it's full\\\", accompanied by upbeat electronic dance music with a prominent synth bassline and a driving beat.\", \"A double rainbow is visible in a cloudy sky over a rocky landscape. Overlaid text changes from \\\"DOUBLE RAINBOW ACROSS THE SKY\\\" to \\\"WHAT DOES THIS MEAN\\\" and then to \\\"OH MY GOD ITS FULL\\\". The audio consists of a male voice singing these phrases over a fast-paced electronic music track.\", \"The video displays a landscape with a prominent double rainbow in the sky, accompanied by a song that includes synthesized music and a male voice singing the lyrics \\\"double rainbow across the sky, what does this mean?\\\".\"]", "time_sec": 58.031, "generation_time_seconds": 57.4068, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "377", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In one house, a dog was on the ground and yelling loudly, and the people next to him were yelling.", "pred": "A dog with grey, black, and white fur is lying on a wooden floor next to a glass door, and it is howling.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A dog with grey, black, and white fur is lying on a wooden floor next to a glass door, and it is howling.", "cot": "[\"A dog with grey, black, and white fur is lying on a wooden floor next to a glass door, and it is howling.\", \"A wolf-like dog with grey and brown fur lies on a wooden floor next to a glass door, looking outside and then up as it lets out a series of long, mournful howls.\", \"A wolf-like dog with grey and tan fur lies on a wooden floor next to a glass door, repeatedly howling with a deep, mournful sound.\", \"A wolf-like dog with grey and white fur lies on a wooden floor next to a glass door, then lifts its head and howls loudly.\"]", "time_sec": 37.072, "generation_time_seconds": 36.4213, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "378", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Cartoon characters dancing on a white background, black English letters. The picture of the diner people eating, the little girl eating and watching. There was a man talking and a wonderful music in the background.", "pred": "A cartoon avatar with the name 'RICHIE LE' appears, followed by a scene with a blackboard menu and a person eating, all while a person says \"What's up?\" over a hip-hop music track.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A cartoon avatar is displayed, followed by a person eating in front of a blackboard menu, as a person says \"What's up?\" over hip-hop music.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A cartoon avatar with the name 'RICHIE LE' appears, followed by a scene with a blackboard menu and a person eating, all while a person says \"What's up?\" over a hip-hop music track.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A cartoon avatar is displayed, followed by a person eating in front of a blackboard menu, as a person says \"What's up?\" over hip-hop music.}}", "cot": "[\"A cartoon avatar with the name 'RICHIE LE' appears, followed by a scene with a blackboard menu and a person eating, all while a person says \\\"What's up?\\\" over a hip-hop music track.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{\\\\text{A cartoon avatar is displayed, followed by a person eating in front of a blackboard menu, as a person says \\\"What's up?\\\" over hip-hop music.}}\", \"1.  **Visuals:** The video opens with a cartoon avatar of a man named 'RICHIE LE'. It then cuts to a real-world scene of a crowded indoor event, decorated with red lanterns and a banner that says 'Chúc Mừng Năm Mới' (Happy New Year).\\n2.  **Audio:** The audio begins with a series of cartoonish sound effects (boings, clicks). This is followed by a male voice saying, \\\"What's up?\\\". Finally, an upbeat hip-hop track with a strong bassline and a keyboard melody starts playing.\\n3.  **Synthesis:** The final description must combine the initial animated character with the subsequent live-action scene and the transition from sound effects to a hip-hop music track.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A cartoon avatar of Richie Le appears before a crowded indoor event with red lanterns, accompanied by cartoon sound effects before a hip-hop track begins playing.}\", \"The video opens with a cartoon caricature of a man named Richie Le, followed by a scene of a bustling hall decorated with red Chinese lanterns and a banner promoting 'Chúc Mừng Năm Mới' (Happy New Year). This is accompanied by upbeat, rhythmic music that begins after a male voice says 'What's up?' and a brief electronic sound effect.\", \"The audio begins with a cartoonish spring sound effect, followed by a male voice saying \\\"What's up?\\\", and then a hip-hop music track with a prominent bassline and a repeating melodic sample. Simultaneously, the video displays a cartoon avatar of a man, then transitions to an indoor space decorated with red lanterns and a sign with Vietnamese text.\"]", "time_sec": 83.875, "generation_time_seconds": 83.1186, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.56, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "379", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man narrates food frying in a frying pan, and the surroundings are so crude, with the sound of frying in the background.", "pred": "The video shows a dark pot on a surface with a light-colored, bubbling substance inside, while a voice describes heat hitting the pot, accompanied by the sound of a crackling fire.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a dark pot on a surface with a light-colored, bubbling substance inside, while a voice describes heat hitting the pot, accompanied by the sound of a crackling fire.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a dark pot on a surface with a light-colored, bubbling substance inside, while a voice describes heat hitting the pot, accompanied by the sound of a crackling fire.\", \"A close-up shows food being fried in bubbling oil within a black pot on the ground. A male voice narrates, explaining that the square tube is directing heat to the pot, with the heat concentrated about six inches from the pot.\", \"A dark, round pot containing a bubbling, light-colored substance is shown from a top-down perspective. Overlaid text reads, \\\"This is what 750 to 850 degrees looks like.\\\" A male voice speaks, saying, \\\"Uh, square two, and you can see where the heat is is hitting that pot, right at six inches right there.\\\"\", \"This is a close-up, top-down view of food being fried in a dark pot on a portable gas stove; the liquid is actively bubbling and steaming, and a man narrates that the heat from the square tube burner is hitting the pot.\"]", "time_sec": 51.807, "generation_time_seconds": 50.757, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "380", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a dimly lit bar, a man and a woman danced to music, with the lights lit.", "pred": "The video displays a man and woman dancing in a dimly lit, crowded room, while the audio features upbeat, festive Latin music with a prominent brass section and a male vocalist singing in Spanish.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a man and woman dancing in a dimly lit, crowded room, while the audio features upbeat, festive Latin music with a prominent brass section and a male vocalist singing in Spanish.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a man and woman dancing in a dimly lit, crowded room, while the audio features upbeat, festive Latin music with a prominent brass section and a male vocalist singing in Spanish.\", \"The visual shows a man and a woman dancing in a dimly lit, crowded venue with flashing colored lights. The audio consists of upbeat, festive folk music, featuring a prominent accordion, and a male voice singing in Spanish.\", \"The scene opens with a man and a woman dancing on a dimly lit floor. A man in a green vest and black hat dances with a woman in a red dress. The couple dances together, then the man dances with a woman in a pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The couple dances together, then the man dances with a woman in a pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the pink dress. The man in the green vest dances with the woman in the red dress. The man in the green vest dances with\", \"A man and a woman are dancing closely in a dimly lit, crowded room, with a bright light source visible on the left, while loud, upbeat Latin music with prominent trumpets and a male vocalist plays.\"]", "time_sec": 118.069, "generation_time_seconds": 117.5125, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.26, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "381", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A magician, holding a coin in his hand, shows the audience a tense background music in the video.", "pred": "The video opens with text reading \"COMPLETELY EXAMINABLE BEFORE AND AFTER\" over a wooden chair. A person wearing a black tracksuit with white stripes on the sleeves and pants is shown in a close-up, performing a series of rapid hand gestures and manipulations with their fingers against a dark background. The audio consists of dramatic, suspenseful orchestral music featuring prominent strings and brass.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video opens with text reading \"COMPLETELY EXAMINABLE BEFORE AND AFTER\" over a wooden chair. A person wearing a black tracksuit with white stripes on the sleeves and pants is shown in a close-up, performing a series of rapid hand gestures and manipulations with their fingers against a dark background. The audio consists of dramatic, suspenseful orchestral music featuring prominent strings and brass.", "cot": "[\"The video opens with text reading \\\"COMPLETELY EXAMINABLE BEFORE AND AFTER\\\" over a wooden chair. A person wearing a black tracksuit with white stripes on the sleeves and pants is shown in a close-up, performing a series of rapid hand gestures and manipulations with their fingers against a dark background. The audio consists of dramatic, suspenseful orchestral music featuring prominent strings and brass.\", \"A man in a black tracksuit manipulates a small, round object with his fingers against a black background, while dramatic, rhythmic percussion music plays.\", \"The video opens with a title card reading \\\"COMPLETELY EXAMINABLE BEFORE AND AFTER\\\". A man in a black tracksuit with white stripes is then shown against a black background, manipulating a small, silver, circular object between his fingers as dramatic, suspenseful music plays.\", \"A person in a black tracksuit with white stripes is shown from the chest up against a black background, manipulating a small, light-colored object with their hands while a dramatic, epic orchestral piece with prominent strings and percussion plays.\"]", "time_sec": 50.955, "generation_time_seconds": 50.3288, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "382", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a black-and-white video, a conductor directs the orchestra around him, and a string of English appears on the screen.", "pred": "The video displays a black and white concert scene with an orchestra and a conductor. Subtitles identify the piece as 'The 50 Greatest Pieces of Classical Music' by the London Philharmonic Orchestra. The audio features a grand, sweeping, and dramatic classical orchestral piece.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a black and white concert scene with an orchestra and a conductor. Subtitles identify the piece as 'The 50 Greatest Pieces of Classical Music' by the London Philharmonic Orchestra. The audio features a grand, sweeping, and dramatic classical orchestral piece.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a black and white concert scene with an orchestra and a conductor. Subtitles identify the piece as 'The 50 Greatest Pieces of Classical Music' by the London Philharmonic Orchestra. The audio features a grand, sweeping, and dramatic classical orchestral piece.\", \"I see a conductor leading an orchestra, with a title card identifying the music as \\\"THE 50 GREATEST PIECES OF CLASSICAL MUSIC\\\" by the \\\"LONDON PHILHARMONIC ORCHESTRA\\\". I hear a grand, dramatic, and powerful orchestral piece being performed.\", \"The video shows a conductor leading an orchestra in a large, reverberant hall, synchronized with the sound of a full orchestra playing a dramatic, powerful piece of classical music.\", \"A black and white video shows a conductor leading an orchestra, with text overlay identifying the performance as \\\"THE 50 GREATEST PIECES OF CLASSICAL MUSIC\\\" by the \\\"LONDON PHILHARMONIC ORCHESTRA\\\", while the audio consists of powerful, dramatic orchestral music featuring a full string section.\"]", "time_sec": 52.701, "generation_time_seconds": 51.8036, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "383", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a person is practicing playing table tennis, the table tennis is played out bouncing on the board to make a rattle.", "pred": "A person hits a yellow ping pong ball with a paddle on a dark blue table, while a rapid, rhythmic knocking sound is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person hits a yellow ping pong ball with a paddle on a dark blue table, while a rapid, rhythmic knocking sound is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A person hits a yellow ping pong ball with a paddle on a dark blue table, while a rapid, rhythmic knocking sound is heard in the background.\", \"A table tennis ball is struck by a paddle, bouncing on a dark blue table as a rapid, rhythmic knocking sound is heard.\", \"This is a table tennis game, with a dark blue table and a net. An orange ball is in motion, and the sound of the ball being struck by paddles is heard.\", \"A ping pong ball rests on a table, while a person on the other side of the net hits another ball with a paddle, creating a sequence of sharp, rhythmic impacts that grow progressively faster.\"]", "time_sec": 38.848, "generation_time_seconds": 38.0218, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "384", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On the grass, a large chicken nest in the chicken farm, all kinds of chickens sing together.", "pred": "The audio features the distinct crowing of a rooster, while the visual shows a grassy farmyard with numerous chickens and several A-frame chicken coops.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features the distinct crowing of a rooster, while the visual shows a grassy farmyard with numerous chickens and several A-frame chicken coops.", "cot": "[\"The audio features the distinct crowing of a rooster, while the visual shows a grassy farmyard with numerous chickens and several A-frame chicken coops.\", \"The video displays a rural, grassy area filled with numerous chicken coops where chickens are active, and this visual is accompanied by the distinct crowing sound of a rooster.\", \"I am observing a scene in a rural, grassy area with chickens roaming freely near wooden A-frame structures. In the background, there is a dark blue pickup truck parked near a chain-link fence, and a rooster is seen in a cage.\\nI am hearing the distinct sound of a rooster crowing.\\nWhen combining the visual and auditory information, I can describe the scene as follows.\\n\\\\boxed{A rooster crows amidst chickens in a grassy enclosure containing wooden A-frame structures and a parked blue pickup truck.}\", \"The visual shows a grassy area with numerous chickens and ducklings near wooden A-frame structures, with a blue pickup truck parked in the background. The audio consists of the loud, prominent crowing of a rooster, with the distinct quacking of ducks also audible in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 53.943, "generation_time_seconds": 53.3083, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "385", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man stood on the grass, pulling the line in the air, The background is the sound of a man talking.", "pred": "A person in a red shirt holds a blue rope, pulling it taut as the camera pans to reveal a tall black pole against a backdrop of a cloudy sky, green trees, and distant red rock formations, while a man's voice speaks in the foreground.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a red shirt holds a blue rope, pulling it taut as the camera pans to reveal a tall black pole against a backdrop of a cloudy sky, green trees, and distant red rock formations, while a man's voice speaks in the foreground.", "cot": "[\"A person in a red shirt holds a blue rope, pulling it taut as the camera pans to reveal a tall black pole against a backdrop of a cloudy sky, green trees, and distant red rock formations, while a man's voice speaks in the foreground.\", \"A person in a red shirt holds a blue rope attached to a tall pole against a backdrop of red rock formations, while a male voice comments on the effort involved in the activity.\", \"A person in a red shirt holds a blue rope, which is attached to a tall, dark object extending into a cloudy sky above a grassy field with red rock formations in the background. A male voice is heard speaking, commenting on someone working one-handed and addressing an audience.\", \"The camera pans from a person holding a blue rope to a tall, thin structure against a cloudy sky, while a man speaks nearby, followed by the sound of a vehicle's engine starting and then a loud horn.\"]", "time_sec": 47.35, "generation_time_seconds": 46.6864, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.26, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "386", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In one room, a woman on a table explained in English that she clicked with scissors cutting the wool ball.", "pred": "A person's hand uses green-handled scissors to cut a pile of multicolored, shredded paper on a white surface, accompanied by the sound of the scissors snipping and a person speaking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hand uses green-handled scissors to cut a pile of multicolored, shredded paper on a white surface, accompanied by the sound of the scissors snipping and a person speaking.", "cot": "[\"A person's hand uses green-handled scissors to cut a pile of multicolored, shredded paper on a white surface, accompanied by the sound of the scissors snipping and a person speaking.\", \"A hand holds green-handled scissors, cutting a pile of colorful, shredded paper on a white surface, while a person speaks and the crisp sound of the scissors cutting is heard.\", \"A pair of hands uses scissors to cut a pile of colorful, shredded paper on a white surface, accompanied by the crisp snipping sound of the blades and a person giving verbal instructions.\", \"A hand uses a green-handled pair of scissors to cut a pile of multi-colored, stringy material on a white surface, while a person speaks.\"]", "time_sec": 40.434, "generation_time_seconds": 39.5285, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "387", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A samurai took a knife and turned the table over. Two women hugged, and gentle music played in the background.", "pred": "A person in dark traditional clothing walks through a dim, wooden structure with light rays piercing the dust, followed by a woman in a blue and white robe with a shocked expression, while the scene is accompanied by a slow, melancholic instrumental melody.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in dark traditional clothing walks through a dim, wooden structure with light rays piercing the dust, followed by a woman in a blue and white robe with a shocked expression, while the scene is accompanied by a slow, melancholic instrumental melody.", "cot": "[\"A person in dark traditional clothing walks through a dim, wooden structure with light rays piercing the dust, followed by a woman in a blue and white robe with a shocked expression, while the scene is accompanied by a slow, melancholic instrumental melody.\", \"A man in a dark robe stands in a dim, wooden room as a woman in a blue and white garment embraces him from behind, all while a mellow electric guitar plays a slow melody.\", \"A man in dark traditional clothing walks through a dim, wooden room as beams of light cut through the dust in the air, while a woman in blue traditional clothing reacts with shock to a man embracing her from behind, all accompanied by upbeat, synthesized instrumental music.\", \"The audio consists of slow-tempo instrumental music featuring a prominent, expressive electric guitar melody. Concurrently, the video displays a woman in a blue and white traditional garment with a shocked or surprised expression on her face, as if she is reacting to something off-screen.\"]", "time_sec": 47.778, "generation_time_seconds": 47.1065, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "388", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A person is demonstrating a pink blue children's cash register, with playful music in the background and a cash register beep.", "pred": "A hand uses a pink toy scanner on a pink and blue toy cash register, which emits a digital chime and a receipt, all accompanied by upbeat electronic music.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand uses a pink toy scanner on a pink and blue toy cash register, which emits a digital chime and a receipt, all accompanied by upbeat electronic music.", "cot": "[\"A hand uses a pink toy scanner on a pink and blue toy cash register, which emits a digital chime and a receipt, all accompanied by upbeat electronic music.\", \"A hand uses a pink toy cash register with a digital display, while upbeat electronic music plays in the background.\", \"A hand presses buttons on a pink and blue toy cash register, which emits a digital beep.\", \"A hand operates a pink and white toy cash register, pressing buttons on the keypad and placing a pink scanner on the machine, while a female voice narrates in Spanish over upbeat background music.\"]", "time_sec": 35.747, "generation_time_seconds": 34.7084, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.25, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "389", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man in the suit walked straight ahead with the flower pushing the door, the man in the hat went out, the woman in her pajamas was ready to open the door, and the music was playing in the background.", "pred": "A person in a dark suit walks through a doorway into a building, followed by another person, as dramatic, suspenseful orchestral music plays.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a dark suit walks through a doorway into a building, followed by another person, as dramatic, suspenseful orchestral music plays.", "cot": "[\"A person in a dark suit walks through a doorway into a building, followed by another person, as dramatic, suspenseful orchestral music plays.\", \"A person with short black hair, seen from the side, walks through a doorway into a building as a dramatic, synthesized musical score begins.\", \"The video shows a person entering a building, followed by a woman walking down a hallway, all while a somber, synthesized string melody plays in the background.\", \"A person in a black jacket walks through a doorway into a sunlit hallway, followed by the sound of a dramatic, synthesized string melody and a high-pitched electronic tone.\"]", "time_sec": 37.383, "generation_time_seconds": 36.649, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "390", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The red characters flickered against a green background, the fire alarm sounded, and the background was filled with the sound of music, the voice of people and the alarm of fire.", "pred": "The video displays the red, stylized text \"Dump The House\" on a black screen, which then transitions to show the text \"[34] Apt Fire 1921 Metz\" as a loud, high-pitched emergency siren blares, accompanied by a male voice saying, \"First to fire.\".", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays the red, stylized text \"Dump The House\" on a black screen, which then transitions to show the text \"[34] Apt Fire 1921 Metz\" as a loud, high-pitched emergency siren blares, accompanied by a male voice saying, \"First to fire.\".", "cot": "[\"The video displays the red, stylized text \\\"Dump The House\\\" on a black screen, which then transitions to show the text \\\"[34] Apt Fire 1921 Metz\\\" as a loud, high-pitched emergency siren blares, accompanied by a male voice saying, \\\"First to fire.\\\".\", \"The video displays red, pixelated text on a black background, reading 'Dump the House' followed by '[34] Apt Fire 1924 Metz'. Simultaneously, the audio features a retro video game melody, a loud electronic alarm, and a male voice urgently announcing 'First to fire'.\", \"The audio begins with electronic music and a digital countdown. A male voice then announces, \\\"First to fire.\\\" This is immediately followed by the sound of a large engine revving loudly and a high-pitched alarm siren. The video consists of black screens with red text, displaying the number \\\"[34]\\\" and the phrase \\\"Apt Fire 1921 Metz\\\".\", \"The video displays red text 'Fire 1924 Metz' on a black screen, accompanied by electronic music, a digital alarm, and a voice announcing 'first to fire' before a loud, sustained siren begins.\"]", "time_sec": 57.434, "generation_time_seconds": 56.9415, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.78, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "391", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two white subtitles were cast on the black screen, and images of flames appeared, red forbidden signs and black three-line fonts, with a bluish fast-paced music background.", "pred": "The video displays text instructions on creating green fire using borax and methanol, accompanied by a prominent \"DANGER Corrosive Liquids\" warning sign, while a loud, repetitive electronic dance music beat plays.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays text instructions on creating green fire using borax and methanol, accompanied by a prominent \"DANGER Corrosive Liquids\" warning sign, while a loud, repetitive electronic dance music beat plays.", "cot": "[\"The video displays text instructions on creating green fire using borax and methanol, accompanied by a prominent \\\"DANGER Corrosive Liquids\\\" warning sign, while a loud, repetitive electronic dance music beat plays.\", \"The video displays text explaining how to create green fire using borax or boric acid mixed with methanol, accompanied by a prominent, rhythmic electronic dance music track with a driving beat.\", \"Visually, the video displays text instructions for creating green fire alongside a red and white \\\"DANGER\\\" warning sign for corrosive liquids, all against a black background. Audibly, a fast-paced, electronic dance music track with a driving beat and synth melody plays.\", \"The video displays a text overlay explaining how to create green fire using borax or boric acid with methanol, while a prominent \\\"DANGER\\\" sign warns of corrosive liquids and the need for protective equipment; simultaneously, the audio features a loud, rhythmic electronic dance music track with a heavy bassline and a repetitive synth melody.\"]", "time_sec": 49.93, "generation_time_seconds": 49.1828, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.65, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "392", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A group of stars sang on stage, the light was so cool, the audience below was shouting and dancing to the music. The background was a burst of electronic dance.", "pred": "A large crowd of people at a concert waves their hands in the air under a dark sky, illuminated by sweeping green and blue laser beams and bright spotlights, as loud, rhythmic electronic dance music with a prominent 'wub wub' bassline plays.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large crowd of people at a concert waves their hands in the air under a dark sky, illuminated by sweeping green and blue laser beams and bright spotlights, as loud, rhythmic electronic dance music with a prominent 'wub wub' bassline plays.", "cot": "[\"A large crowd of people at a concert waves their hands in the air under a dark sky, illuminated by sweeping green and blue laser beams and bright spotlights, as loud, rhythmic electronic dance music with a prominent 'wub wub' bassline plays.\", \"The video shows a DJ performing on a stage with a massive, illuminated circular structure and a large crowd. The audio consists of very loud, fast, electronic dance music with a distorted, repetitive vocal sample that sounds like \\\"Oh, oh, oh.\\\"\", \"The video displays a bald DJ in a dark, patterned shirt performing on a stage, viewed from behind with arms raised, under dynamic green, red, and blue laser lights and a large, intricate backdrop, while the audio features a fast, synthesized electronic music track with a repetitive vocal sample.\", \"A bald DJ with glasses is shown from behind with arms raised on a stage, while a large crowd is visible in front of him. The scene is dominated by flashing green and red laser lights and a large central screen. This visual of a concert is accompanied by a loud, high-energy electronic music track featuring a fast beat and a repetitive male vocal sample.\"]", "time_sec": 54.486, "generation_time_seconds": 53.7787, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.64, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "393", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The rain poured down from the roof, and five yellow monks, wearing hats, stood side by side in the rain, their eyes fixed, the sound of the rain thunder rumbling in the background.", "pred": "A group of five figures in conical hats and robes stand in a line on a wet surface, illuminated by a strong backlight, as heavy rain falls and a continuous low-frequency mechanical rumble is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A group of five figures in conical hats and robes stand in a line on a wet surface, illuminated by a strong backlight, as heavy rain falls and a continuous low-frequency mechanical rumble is heard.", "cot": "[\"A group of five figures in conical hats and robes stand in a line on a wet surface, illuminated by a strong backlight, as heavy rain falls and a continuous low-frequency mechanical rumble is heard.\", \"A group of five robed figures stand in a line in a dark, wet alleyway during a thunderstorm, as a loud clap of thunder is heard.\", \"A low-angle shot shows a waterfall cascading down a rocky cliff.\\n Simultaneously, the audio captures the powerful and continuous roar of a large volume of rushing water.\\n The scene and sound together create the impression of a massive waterfall or rapids.\\n\\\\boxed{A waterfall cascades down a cliff, accompanied by the powerful roar of rushing water.}\", \"The audio contains the sound of a large wave crashing. Simultaneously, the video shows a group of people in conical hats and yellow robes standing in a line on a wet surface, with water dripping from their hats.\"]", "time_sec": 47.277, "generation_time_seconds": 46.8018, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.95, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "394", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The machine is stirring the flour, the woman holds a small bowl and uses a spoon to stir the eggs, the background is the machine turns and the woman speaks.", "pred": "A hand pours a yellow liquid from a glass bowl into a red stand mixer containing white powder while the mixer runs, and a person speaks in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand pours a yellow liquid from a glass bowl into a red stand mixer containing white powder while the mixer runs, and a person speaks in the background.", "cot": "[\"A hand pours a yellow liquid from a glass bowl into a red stand mixer containing white powder while the mixer runs, and a person speaks in the background.\", \"A person's hand pours a yellow liquid into a red stand mixer's bowl while an electric mixer runs and a woman says she is adding two eggs.\", \"A person pours eggs from a glass measuring cup into a silver bowl of a running orange stand mixer as a woman speaks, saying, \\\"We're gonna put our uh eggs, two eggs.\\\"\", \"A red stand mixer is blending ingredients in a metal bowl while a person pours a yellow liquid from a glass bowl into it, accompanied by the continuous whirring of the mixer and a person speaking.\"]", "time_sec": 39.387, "generation_time_seconds": 38.7131, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "395", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the wild, two people walk slowly on the ground, and the sound of the birds comes from the side and one lady was pregnant.", "pred": "Several people in primitive animal-skin clothing are running through a dry, wooded area, accompanied by the sounds of a crow cawing and various birds chirping.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Several people in primitive animal-skin clothing are running through a dry, wooded area, accompanied by the sounds of a crow cawing and various birds chirping.", "cot": "[\"Several people in primitive animal-skin clothing are running through a dry, wooded area, accompanied by the sounds of a crow cawing and various birds chirping.\", \"A deer walks from left to right across a forest floor, while the distinct cawing of a crow is heard in the background.\", \"The audio captures prominent, rhythmic bird calls, specifically the cooing of doves or pigeons, set against a backdrop of general outdoor ambience. Simultaneously, the video shows three individuals in rustic, historical-style clothing—two men and a woman—moving through a wooded area. The man on the right carries a bundle on his back, while the other two carry long sticks or poles.\", \"In a dry, wooded area, two figures in primitive clothing run away from the camera through tall, dry grass, accompanied by prominent bird vocalizations.\"]", "time_sec": 44.991, "generation_time_seconds": 44.2967, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "396", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "At an indoor party, a man in a white dress teased a crowd of people around him, then a woman lifted a glass and sipped coffee in the background of laughter and speech.", "pred": "A man in a white shirt stands up from a table, while a woman beside him laughs and covers her mouth, as loud, overlapping laughter from an unseen crowd fills the room.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a white shirt stands up from a table, while a woman beside him laughs and covers her mouth, as loud, overlapping laughter from an unseen crowd fills the room.", "cot": "[\"A man in a white shirt stands up from a table, while a woman beside him laughs and covers her mouth, as loud, overlapping laughter from an unseen crowd fills the room.\", \"The audio captures the sound of a crowd laughing, while the visual shows a man standing and a woman sitting at a table with glasses and candles.\", \"I observe a man in a white shirt and tie standing beside a seated woman at a dining table, while the audio captures the loud, overlapping sounds of a group of people laughing and talking.\", \"A man in a white shirt stands and bends over a table, while a woman beside him laughs and covers her face with her hand, as the sound of loud, overlapping laughter from multiple people fills the room.\"]", "time_sec": 40.752, "generation_time_seconds": 40.199, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "397", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The picture shows two images, one an abstract five-colour painting and one a pure lotus, the music of the long-lasting bell .", "pred": "The image displays a close-up of a purple water lily on green lily pads, overlaid with a translucent image of an abalone shell and the text 'Meditation von Bienen' and 'Kerstin Elsäßer'. The audio consists of a series of clear, resonant chimes.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The image displays a close-up of a purple water lily on green lily pads, overlaid with a translucent image of an abalone shell and the text 'Meditation von Bienen' and 'Kerstin Elsäßer'. The audio consists of a series of clear, resonant chimes.", "cot": "[\"The image displays a close-up of a purple water lily on green lily pads, overlaid with a translucent image of an abalone shell and the text 'Meditation von Bienen' and 'Kerstin Elsäßer'. The audio consists of a series of clear, resonant chimes.\", \"A close-up shot displays a light purple water lily with a yellow center. Overlaid on the flower are translucent, iridescent, shell-like textures. The scene is accompanied by the resonant, sustained tones of a singing bowl.\", \"A close-up reveals a purple lotus flower with a yellow center, superimposed over an iridescent, textured surface. The audio consists of a single, sustained, high-pitched electronic tone.\", \"A close-up shows a light purple lotus flower with yellow stamens. A high-pitched, sustained tone plays, followed by a lower, resonant tone.\"]", "time_sec": 48.075, "generation_time_seconds": 46.679, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "398", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A picture of the woods shows green text that changes with the sound of the music.", "pred": "The video displays a static forest scene with a large tree trunk and a body of water. Animated green text sequentially appears, first showing \"With you in my life I'll never think twice,\" and then changing to \"It's you I've been waiting to call.\" Overlaid on this visual is a female voice singing a slow, melancholic pop song accompanied by a piano melody.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a static forest scene with a large tree trunk and a body of water. Animated green text sequentially appears, first showing \"With you in my life I'll never think twice,\" and then changing to \"It's you I've been waiting to call.\" Overlaid on this visual is a female voice singing a slow, melancholic pop song accompanied by a piano melody.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a static forest scene with a large tree trunk and a body of water. Animated green text sequentially appears, first showing \\\"With you in my life I'll never think twice,\\\" and then changing to \\\"It's you I've been waiting to call.\\\" Overlaid on this visual is a female voice singing a slow, melancholic pop song accompanied by a piano melody.\", \"The visual is a static image of a tree by a pond with green text overlaying the scene. The audio is a female vocalist singing a slow, emotional song with piano accompaniment. The sung lyrics are \\\"never think twice, it's you I've been waiting to call.\\\"\", \"A female vocalist sings a slow, emotional pop ballad. The background is a static, slightly blurry image of a large tree trunk next to a body of water in a forest. Green text overlays the image, displaying the lyrics: 'With you in my life I'll never think twice' followed by 'It's you I've been waiting to call'.\", \"A static forest landscape with a large tree and a reflective pond is shown, while green text sequentially appears with the lyrics 'With you in my life I'll never think twice' and 'It's you I've been waiting to call', accompanied by a female vocalist singing these exact lyrics.\"]", "time_sec": 58.529, "generation_time_seconds": 57.8932, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.84, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "399", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Outside, a man holding a knife to the wood on the cutting board, there was a sound of talking, the sound of cutting wood and the sound of breaking wood and in front of man car is visible.", "pred": "A hand repeatedly swings a large, curved blade to split a wooden plank. The sharp impacts are accompanied by the rustling of a plastic bag and a male voice making a joking comment.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand repeatedly swings a large, curved blade to split a wooden plank. The sharp impacts are accompanied by the rustling of a plastic bag and a male voice making a joking comment.", "cot": "[\"A hand repeatedly swings a large, curved blade to split a wooden plank. The sharp impacts are accompanied by the rustling of a plastic bag and a male voice making a joking comment.\", \"A person uses a large curved blade to chop a wooden plank supported by a block, producing sharp chopping sounds, while a red car is parked nearby and a man speaks in the background.\", \"A person's hands use a large knife to chop a piece of light-colored wood on a wooden block. This action is accompanied by the sharp, percussive sound of the blade striking the wood, along with the faint sound of male voices in the background.\", \"A person uses a large knife to chop a piece of wood on a wooden block, while the sound of chopping is heard alongside a man speaking.\"]", "time_sec": 43.013, "generation_time_seconds": 41.939, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "400", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A girl in a black vest teased a dog with snacks, music in the background and a man clearing his throat.", "pred": "A woman sits on a couch eating chips from a bag, while a dog with a red collar looks at her and a cat meows nearby.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman sits on a couch eating chips from a bag, while a dog with a red collar looks at her and a cat meows nearby.", "cot": "[\"A woman sits on a couch eating chips from a bag, while a dog with a red collar looks at her and a cat meows nearby.\", \"A woman sits on a floral couch eating from a bag of chips while a dog with an orange collar looks on and eats a chip from her hand, all while continuous classical piano music plays in the background.\", \"A woman sits on a couch with a dog, holding a piece of food, while slow, melancholic piano music plays in the background.\", \"This is a static, close-up shot of a woman with dark hair sitting on a couch, eating from a bag of chips. She is feeding a small, short-haired brown dog with a red collar that is nuzzling her hand. The audio consists of a slow, melancholic instrumental piece featuring a piano and a cello.\\n\\\\boxed{A woman feeds a small brown dog while sitting on a couch, accompanied by slow, melancholic piano and cello music.}\"]", "time_sec": 47.778, "generation_time_seconds": 47.1688, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "401", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man cooks and talks, then prepares to put the contents of the bowl in, and the pan hisses in they kitchen so many items is there.", "pred": "A man in a kitchen speaks while a food processor runs, explaining how to make a \"bloc\" by cutting cold butter.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a kitchen speaks while a food processor runs, explaining how to make a \"bloc\" by cutting cold butter.", "cot": "[\"A man in a kitchen speaks while a food processor runs, explaining how to make a \\\"bloc\\\" by cutting cold butter.\", \"A man in a kitchen stirs food in a pan on a stove, then picks up a knife to cut butter, while a male voice describes the process of making a \\\"bouquet garni\\\" and emphasizes the need for cold butter.\", \"A man in a light-colored shirt stands at a kitchen counter, stirring food in a pan on a stovetop. He then picks up a small bowl and adds its contents to the pan, all while speaking instructions over the prominent sizzling sound of the cooking food.\", \"A man in a kitchen stands at a counter, cutting cold butter with a knife while a loud sizzling sound emanates from a pan on the stove; simultaneously, a male voice narrates the cooking process, instructing to cut butter to make a \\\"beurre blanc.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 47.471, "generation_time_seconds": 46.3226, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "402", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A car on a congested city road, surrounded by a variety of cars, accompanied by different car horns.", "pred": "A dashboard camera captures a multi-lane city street with vehicles moving under green traffic lights, while the sound of a loud, sustained horn from a large vehicle, likely a bus or truck, is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A dashboard camera captures a multi-lane city street with vehicles moving under green traffic lights, while the sound of a loud, sustained horn from a large vehicle, likely a bus or truck, is heard.", "cot": "[\"A dashboard camera captures a multi-lane city street with vehicles moving under green traffic lights, while the sound of a loud, sustained horn from a large vehicle, likely a bus or truck, is heard.\", \"A city street intersection is viewed from inside a car, with multiple vehicles and pedestrians on a multi-lane road under a hazy sky, while the sound of a vehicle horn is heard.\", \"The video shows a first-person view from a car stopped at a city intersection with multiple lanes of traffic and tall buildings in the background. The audio consists of the ambient sounds of city traffic, including a loud, high-pitched car horn.\", \"A vehicle drives through a city intersection during the day, with traffic lights, other cars, and tall buildings visible, while the loud and continuous sound of a train horn is heard in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 44.005, "generation_time_seconds": 42.8275, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "403", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A clock rang in the glass, making a sweet sound.", "pred": "I see a mechanical clock with a glass case, a black base, and a golden dial with Roman numerals, while I hear a continuous, high-pitched electronic beep.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "I see a mechanical clock with a glass case, a black base, and a golden dial with Roman numerals, while I hear a continuous, high-pitched electronic beep.", "cot": "[\"I see a mechanical clock with a glass case, a black base, and a golden dial with Roman numerals, while I hear a continuous, high-pitched electronic beep.\", \"A decorative mantel clock with a glass case and black base is displayed, emitting a continuous, high-pitched electronic buzzer sound.\", \"A grandfather clock's pendulum is visible inside a glass case, while the audio is dominated by a loud, sustained, high-pitched electronic tone.\", \"A glass-enclosed mantel clock with a cream-colored dial, Roman numerals, and a visible pendulum is shown. The sound of a continuous, high-pitched electronic buzzer is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 38.365, "generation_time_seconds": 37.8138, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "404", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the dark, two men in the driving car listening to music talking, headlights on the road, wipers constantly swinging.", "pred": "The video shows a dark, snowy road at night from a first-person perspective, illuminated by headlights showing tire tracks, while an off-screen speaker describes the hazardous conditions as \"snowing like fuck,\" \"frozen,\" \"icy,\" and \"treacherous.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a dark, snowy road at night from a first-person perspective, illuminated by headlights showing tire tracks, while an off-screen speaker describes the hazardous conditions as \"snowing like fuck,\" \"frozen,\" \"icy,\" and \"treacherous.\"", "cot": "[\"The video shows a dark, snowy road at night from a first-person perspective, illuminated by headlights showing tire tracks, while an off-screen speaker describes the hazardous conditions as \\\"snowing like fuck,\\\" \\\"frozen,\\\" \\\"icy,\\\" and \\\"treacherous.\\\"\", \"A vehicle's headlights illuminate a dark, snow-covered road at night, creating a path of white light ahead as a person speaks, describing the treacherous, icy, and snowy conditions.\", \"A vehicle drives along a dark, snow-covered road at night, its headlights cutting through the darkness. The gravel road is visibly wet and reflective, and the sound of the tires crunching on the loose surface is audible as a man describes the treacherous, icy road conditions.\", \"The audio describes the road conditions as snowy, frozen, icy, and treacherous, but the visual shows a dark, wet road with tire tracks illuminated by headlights, which contradicts the audio.\"]", "time_sec": 47.029, "generation_time_seconds": 46.5068, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "405", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Amid the noise, the man in black opened the door and looked at the damaged windshield, surrounded by many onlookers talking.", "pred": "The audio contains loud human speech and a deep, resonant bass sound. The visual shows a red car with a completely shattered windshield, with a person leaning into the driver's side from outside, and a crowd visible in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio contains loud human speech and a deep, resonant bass sound. The visual shows a red car with a completely shattered windshield, with a person leaning into the driver's side from outside, and a crowd visible in the background.", "cot": "[\"The audio contains loud human speech and a deep, resonant bass sound. The visual shows a red car with a completely shattered windshield, with a person leaning into the driver's side from outside, and a crowd visible in the background.\", \"A damaged red car with a cracked windshield is surrounded by a crowd of people, while a loud, low-frequency rumble and the sound of an engine are heard.\", \"A red car with a shattered windshield is surrounded by a crowd of people, while the sound of a loud, low-frequency engine revs in the background.\", \"A red car with a shattered windshield is surrounded by a crowd of people, while a loud, deep, and distorted horn blares over the indistinct chatter of the people.\\n\\\\boxed{A red car with a shattered windshield is surrounded by a crowd as a loud, distorted horn blares over their indistinct chatter.}\"]", "time_sec": 45.892, "generation_time_seconds": 45.0548, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.13, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "406", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman was singing on stage and the audience shouted to the music.", "pred": "A woman sings into a microphone on a brightly lit stage, her arm raised, while a choir sings harmoniously in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman sings into a microphone on a brightly lit stage, her arm raised, while a choir sings harmoniously in the background.", "cot": "[\"A woman sings into a microphone on a brightly lit stage, her arm raised, while a choir sings harmoniously in the background.\", \"A female singer in a dark top and light pants performs on a stage lit with purple and green lights, holding a microphone and gesturing. She is singing over a loud, energetic rock/metal song featuring distorted electric guitars, a driving drum beat, and a choir. The audio has a high volume and a slight echo, consistent with a live performance.\", \"A woman sings into a microphone on a brightly lit stage, accompanied by backup singers and music, as the audience cheers and sings along loudly.\", \"A woman sings into a microphone on a stage with green and purple lighting, accompanied by a band and backing singers, while a loud, distorted rock music track with a prominent electric guitar plays.\"]", "time_sec": 43.408, "generation_time_seconds": 42.4638, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "407", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The video shows two opera actors performing on stage, humming songs.", "pred": "A man and a woman in period costumes are on a stage with furniture and a plaque. The man raises his hand to his head, then points at the woman, who places her hand on his chest. A male opera singer is heard singing in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man and a woman in period costumes are on a stage with furniture and a plaque. The man raises his hand to his head, then points at the woman, who places her hand on his chest. A male opera singer is heard singing in the background.", "cot": "[\"A man and a woman in period costumes are on a stage with furniture and a plaque. The man raises his hand to his head, then points at the woman, who places her hand on his chest. A male opera singer is heard singing in the background.\", \"A woman in a white period gown and a man in a grey coat and kilt are on a stage, holding hands and swaying as if dancing. The sound of a male operatic voice singing is heard over orchestral music.\", \"A man and a woman in historical costumes stand on a stage, with the man pointing at the woman, while a male opera singer performs a dramatic aria.\", \"A man and a woman in historical costumes stand on a stage with theatrical props, while a male opera singer performs with orchestral music in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 42.875, "generation_time_seconds": 42.2901, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "408", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the cloudy sky, a plane flew in the sky, the propeller roaring.", "pred": "A silhouetted, dark-colored tiltrotor aircraft with twin engines and rotating propellers moves from left to right across a cloudy sky, accompanied by the loud, powerful roar of its jet engines.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A silhouetted, dark-colored tiltrotor aircraft with twin engines and rotating propellers moves from left to right across a cloudy sky, accompanied by the loud, powerful roar of its jet engines.", "cot": "[\"A silhouetted, dark-colored tiltrotor aircraft with twin engines and rotating propellers moves from left to right across a cloudy sky, accompanied by the loud, powerful roar of its jet engines.\", \"A dark-colored tiltrotor aircraft with red accents is silhouetted against a grey, overcast sky as it flies, its engines producing a loud, deep, and continuous rumbling sound.\", \"A dark, twin-rotor tiltrotor aircraft flies against a cloudy gray sky, accompanied by the loud, low-frequency roar of its powerful engines.\", \"A grey and red tiltrotor aircraft with rotating nacelles flies through a cloudy sky, accompanied by the sound of its powerful engine and the rushing of wind.\"]", "time_sec": 40.673, "generation_time_seconds": 40.1314, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "409", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the music goes a woman enters the door and then walks up the stairs, the picture turns and the woman looks out the door in an enclosed room.", "pred": "A woman in a dark blue dress walks down a dimly lit wooden staircase in a house, then the scene cuts to a person walking down a dark institutional hallway with a vending machine, all while an upbeat pop song with a male vocalist plays.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman in a dark blue dress walks down a dimly lit wooden staircase in a house, then the scene cuts to a person walking down a dark institutional hallway with a vending machine, all while an upbeat pop song with a male vocalist plays.", "cot": "[\"A woman in a dark blue dress walks down a dimly lit wooden staircase in a house, then the scene cuts to a person walking down a dark institutional hallway with a vending machine, all while an upbeat pop song with a male vocalist plays.\", \"A person walks up a staircase in a dimly lit house, then walks down a dark hallway towards a vending machine, all while an upbeat rock song with a male vocalist plays.\", \"A woman in a blue dress and white boots stands at a door, then walks down a staircase in a dimly lit house as upbeat rock music with male vocals plays.\", \"In a dimly lit interior, a woman in a blue dress walks up a wooden staircase, while a rock song with a male vocalist plays in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 41.519, "generation_time_seconds": 40.8911, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "410", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the winter, a yellow bus was driving along the road, and people next to it were excited to see and greet it, and road was fully covered with snow.", "pred": "A yellow school bus approaches on a snowy road, passing a child who points and laughs as a man speaks, all while the loud engine and screeching tires of the bus dominate the soundscape.\n\\boxed{A yellow school bus approaches on a snowy road, passing a child who points and laughs as a man speaks, all while the loud engine and screeching tires of the bus dominate the soundscape.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A yellow school bus approaches on a snowy road, passing a child who points and laughs as a man speaks, all while the loud engine and screeching tires of the bus dominate the soundscape.\n\\boxed{A yellow school bus approaches on a snowy road, passing a child who points and laughs as a man speaks, all while the loud engine and screeching tires of the bus dominate the soundscape.}", "cot": "[\"A yellow school bus approaches on a snowy road, passing a child who points and laughs as a man speaks, all while the loud engine and screeching tires of the bus dominate the soundscape.\\n\\\\boxed{A yellow school bus approaches on a snowy road, passing a child who points and laughs as a man speaks, all while the loud engine and screeching tires of the bus dominate the soundscape.}\", \"A yellow school bus with flashing lights drives on a snow-lined road. A person points at it and exclaims, \\\"Okay, there's a bus coming,\\\" as the loud engine and rumbling road noise of the bus dominate the audio, with a child laughing and another person speaking in the background.\", \"A yellow school bus is seen driving on a wet, snowy road while a person speaks, followed by the loud rumbling and hissing sound of a large diesel engine.\", \"A yellow school bus with \\\"SAFE ROUTES 90\\\" on its side drives on a wet, snow-lined road. A person with blonde hair and a white baseball cap points at the bus as it passes. A male voice says, \\\"Okay, there's a bus coming,\\\" followed by the loud rumble of the bus's engine and more speech.\"]", "time_sec": 57.213, "generation_time_seconds": 56.6418, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "411", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the alarm rang, a model white police car was placed on a blue model drawbridge, and a man was heard in the video. and a background a man was voice also came.", "pred": "A white toy police car drives across a blue toy bridge over a wooden track. Simultaneously, a loud, high-pitched siren wails, followed by a male voice on a radio reporting, \"Chopper 5, this is Chopper 5. We have a big accident here. Police car just hit the bridge and uh we got full coverage here.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white toy police car drives across a blue toy bridge over a wooden track. Simultaneously, a loud, high-pitched siren wails, followed by a male voice on a radio reporting, \"Chopper 5, this is Chopper 5. We have a big accident here. Police car just hit the bridge and uh we got full coverage here.\"", "cot": "[\"A white toy police car drives across a blue toy bridge over a wooden track. Simultaneously, a loud, high-pitched siren wails, followed by a male voice on a radio reporting, \\\"Chopper 5, this is Chopper 5. We have a big accident here. Police car just hit the bridge and uh we got full coverage here.\\\"\", \"A white toy police car drives over a blue toy bridge on a wooden track, while a loud siren is heard, followed by a male voice reporting over a radio that a police car has hit a bridge and they have full coverage.\", \"A white toy police car sits on a blue plastic bridge over a wooden track. A person's leg is visible in the background. An emergency siren wails, followed by a male voice on a radio reporting, \\\"Chopper five, this is Chopper five. We have a big accident here. A police car just hit the bridge, and we got full coverage here.\\\"\", \"A white toy police car is positioned on a blue bridge, and a person's hand is visible near the structure. Simultaneously, emergency siren sounds are audible, followed by a male voice identifying himself as 'Chopper 5' and reporting that a 'police car just hit the bridge'.\"]", "time_sec": 59.274, "generation_time_seconds": 58.2093, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.95, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "412", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On a computer screen, a game character walks in the dark and stops under a candle. As the man explains it, a row of English subtitles appears in bule colour.", "pred": "A pixelated character stands on a brick floor in a dark, ruined room with barred windows, while a male voice narrates the title of the game, Strange But True: Stories of the Occult, Chasing Down the Hidden Past of the Cursed School Building - Part 3.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A pixelated character stands on a brick floor in a dark, ruined room with barred windows, while a male voice narrates the title of the game, Strange But True: Stories of the Occult, Chasing Down the Hidden Past of the Cursed School Building - Part 3.", "cot": "[\"A pixelated character stands on a brick floor in a dark, ruined room with barred windows, while a male voice narrates the title of the game, Strange But True: Stories of the Occult, Chasing Down the Hidden Past of the Cursed School Building - Part 3.\", \"The audio presents a male voice reading the title 'Strange But True: Stories of the Occult, Chasing Down the Hidden Past of the Cursed School Building - part 3' over a static 2D pixel art image of a character in a dark, ruined building with a red symbol on the floor.\", \"A pixelated girl stands in a dark, ruined room with a lit torch and a red pentagram. A narrator reads the title of this video game: '[Strange But True: Stories of the Occult] Chasing Down the Hidden Past of the Cursed School Building - part 3'.\", \"The audio describes a video game titled 'Strange But True: Stories of the Occult,' specifically 'Chasing Down the Hidden Past of the Cursed School, Part 3.' Simultaneously, the visual displays a pixel-art scene featuring a young girl in a blue and white dress standing on a brick floor inside a dark, dilapidated building with barred windows, a flickering lantern, and a red symbol on the ground.\"]", "time_sec": 59.639, "generation_time_seconds": 58.7682, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "413", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the music looked down from the sky, lights flickered, followed by colorful fireworks in midair.", "pred": "This is a night aerial view of a large, brightly lit resort complex with a central lake. Simultaneously, there is a loud, percussive, rhythmic drum beat playing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "This is a night aerial view of a large, brightly lit resort complex with a central lake. Simultaneously, there is a loud, percussive, rhythmic drum beat playing.", "cot": "[\"This is a night aerial view of a large, brightly lit resort complex with a central lake. Simultaneously, there is a loud, percussive, rhythmic drum beat playing.\", \"The video displays a nighttime, aerial, 3D rendering of a sprawling, illuminated resort or cityscape. Simultaneously, the audio features a dramatic, rhythmic percussion score with a powerful, booming sound effect.\", \"An aerial night view shows a large, illuminated, island-like development with a central lake and pathways, as a fast-paced, percussive electronic music track with a strong beat plays.\", \"An aerial night view shows a brightly lit, island-like urban development with a central lake, where fireworks explode in the sky above it, accompanied by a dramatic, percussive music track.\"]", "time_sec": 43.266, "generation_time_seconds": 42.1416, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "414", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A big cat lay on the blanket and stomped back and forth with its paws, grunting from time to time backside some sounds are came.", "pred": "A calico cat is lying on a brown blanket and purring.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A calico cat is lying on a brown blanket and purring.", "cot": "[\"A calico cat is lying on a brown blanket and purring.\", \"A calico cat sits on a tan blanket while a person's foot is visible nearby; the entire scene is accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency electronic buzzing sound.\", \"A calico cat lies on a tan blanket and purrs softly.\", \"A calico cat with white, brown, and black fur is lying on a beige, textured blanket. The cat is looking towards the right of the frame. A rhythmic, mechanical whirring sound is audible.\"]", "time_sec": 34.005, "generation_time_seconds": 33.3506, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.39, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "415", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "One woman closed her eyes in the room and held a bell. Another man, with a short stick, struck the outside wall and began to speak, while the bowl made a crisp noise.", "pred": "A man and a woman stand in a shop filled with singing bowls; the man speaks in Hindi about 'natural therapy' as a deep, resonant bowl tone is heard, and the woman holds a bowl.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man and a woman stand in a shop filled with singing bowls; the man speaks in Hindi about 'natural therapy' as a deep, resonant bowl tone is heard, and the woman holds a bowl.", "cot": "[\"A man and a woman stand in a shop filled with singing bowls; the man speaks in Hindi about 'natural therapy' as a deep, resonant bowl tone is heard, and the woman holds a bowl.\", \"A woman holds a singing bowl, and an older man speaks while a high-pitched, sustained ringing sound is audible in the background.\", \"Inside a shop filled with singing bowls, a man in a red shirt and orange dhoti speaks to a woman in a white shirt holding a bowl in her lap, as a loud, high-pitched metallic ringing sound is heard.\", \"In a shop filled with metallic bowls, an older man in a red shirt talks to a younger woman holding a bowl, while a sustained, high-pitched ringing sound is heard in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 41.647, "generation_time_seconds": 41.0553, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.63, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "416", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the ding-dong sound, the strings of tuning forks vibrate together.", "pred": "A static, close-up shot shows a rack of silver tuned pipes hanging from a wooden bar. A list of services is visible on a sign behind the pipes. A single, sustained, high-pitched tone from the pipes is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A static, close-up shot shows a rack of silver tuned pipes hanging from a wooden bar. A list of services is visible on a sign behind the pipes. A single, sustained, high-pitched tone from the pipes is heard.", "cot": "[\"A static, close-up shot shows a rack of silver tuned pipes hanging from a wooden bar. A list of services is visible on a sign behind the pipes. A single, sustained, high-pitched tone from the pipes is heard.\", \"A person strikes a set of metal wind chimes, producing a high-pitched, resonant sound that fades slowly.\", \"A set of large silver chimes hangs in front of a poster advertising 'DNA Repair,' while a single, sustained, high-pitched electronic tone plays.\", \"A hand strikes a hanging set of silver, tuned metal pipes, producing a high-pitched, sustained, chime-like tone.\"]", "time_sec": 38.028, "generation_time_seconds": 37.3886, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "417", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the dim corner of the bar, two men stood playing guitar, one of them in a red shirt playing and singing in the microphone.", "pred": "Two men are performing music on a dimly lit stage. The man in the foreground, wearing an orange shirt, sings into a microphone while playing an acoustic guitar. The man behind him, wearing a light-colored shirt, also plays an acoustic guitar. The audio consists of the male lead singing and the sound of both acoustic guitars being played.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Two men are performing music on a dimly lit stage. The man in the foreground, wearing an orange shirt, sings into a microphone while playing an acoustic guitar. The man behind him, wearing a light-colored shirt, also plays an acoustic guitar. The audio consists of the male lead singing and the sound of both acoustic guitars being played.", "cot": "[\"Two men are performing music on a dimly lit stage. The man in the foreground, wearing an orange shirt, sings into a microphone while playing an acoustic guitar. The man behind him, wearing a light-colored shirt, also plays an acoustic guitar. The audio consists of the male lead singing and the sound of both acoustic guitars being played.\", \"Two men stand and play acoustic guitars. One sings into a microphone while the other plays a guitar and sings backup vocals.\", \"Two men in a dimly lit room are performing music. The man in the orange shirt is singing into a microphone while the man in the light green shirt plays an acoustic guitar. A rhythmic, repetitive sound of a hand drum, like a djembe, is also audible.\", \"Two men are playing acoustic guitars and singing into microphones in a dimly lit indoor space.\\n The man in the foreground wears an orange shirt, and the man behind him wears a light blue polo shirt.\\n They are performing a song together, with the man in the foreground singing a high-pitched, powerful vocal line while the other man accompanies him on guitar.\"]", "time_sec": 52.675, "generation_time_seconds": 52.1218, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.42, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "418", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man typed on a typewriter, making a crackling sound.", "pred": "A person's hands operate a light blue Olivetti Lettera 32 manual typewriter, which produces the characteristic metallic, rhythmic clatter of its keys and the carriage return, while red text overlays the scene.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands operate a light blue Olivetti Lettera 32 manual typewriter, which produces the characteristic metallic, rhythmic clatter of its keys and the carriage return, while red text overlays the scene.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands operate a light blue Olivetti Lettera 32 manual typewriter, which produces the characteristic metallic, rhythmic clatter of its keys and the carriage return, while red text overlays the scene.\", \"A person's hands type on a light blue Olivetti Lettera 32 typewriter, which produces the loud, mechanical clatter of its keys and carriage return, accompanied by red text overlays.\", \"A person's hands are typing on a light blue Olivetti Lettera 32 typewriter, with red text overlaid on the screen reading \\\"Featuring...\\\" and \\\"An Olivetti Lettera 32\\\", while the distinct, rhythmic clacking of the typewriter's keys and carriage return can be heard.\", \"A person's hands are shown typing on a vintage blue Olivetti Lettera 32 typewriter, which is producing the distinct, rhythmic clacking sounds of its keys and mechanisms.\\n\\\\boxed{Hands type on a blue Olivetti Lettera 32 typewriter, producing rhythmic mechanical clacking sounds.}\"]", "time_sec": 51.101, "generation_time_seconds": 50.4793, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "419", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black machine was placed on a white table, and a man was holding the desiccant and explaining how to use it.", "pred": "A person's hands hold a black camera and a white SIM card while a male voice describes the card, mentioning a 'C' on it.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands hold a black camera and a white SIM card while a male voice describes the card, mentioning a 'C' on it.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands hold a black camera and a white SIM card while a male voice describes the card, mentioning a 'C' on it.\", \"A person holds up a small, white memory card with a black symbol, a green light is illuminated on a gray DMP machine, and a voice describes a card with a 'C' on it.\", \"A hand holds up a small, black, rectangular memory card with a white label. A male voice states, \\\"Here's the other card, and it's got a C on it. See it up in the left hand corner?\\\"\", \"A person holds a black camera and then shows a white memory card with a 'C' printed on it, while a male voice narrates the action.\"]", "time_sec": 41.284, "generation_time_seconds": 40.4577, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "420", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "At a lake, a man in a white coat and a red hat caught a fish in a fishing net on the shore and said a word, and the sound of the water.", "pred": "A man in a red cap on a boat catches a fish, which creates a splash, and he then says, \"Come here, hooks.\".", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a red cap on a boat catches a fish, which creates a splash, and he then says, \"Come here, hooks.\".", "cot": "[\"A man in a red cap on a boat catches a fish, which creates a splash, and he then says, \\\"Come here, hooks.\\\".\", \"A man in a red cap on a boat pulls a fishing rod, then uses a net to scoop a fish from the water while a male voice says, \\\"Ooh, come here, hooks.\\\".\", \"A person in a red cap on a boat casts a fishing rod into a lake, then uses a net to scoop something from the water as a dog pants and barks nearby.\", \"A person wearing a red cap stands on a boat, pulls a fishing rod, and uses a net to bring a fish from the water, while saying, \\\"Got my hooks.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 39.944, "generation_time_seconds": 39.0659, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "421", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A machine was left in the clearing, said the man next to it. The machine was running without stopping.", "pred": "A red engine cover is visible as a person attempts to start a small engine, which backfires once before the attempt fails.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red engine cover is visible as a person attempts to start a small engine, which backfires once before the attempt fails.", "cot": "[\"A red engine cover is visible as a person attempts to start a small engine, which backfires once before the attempt fails.\", \"A person's hand holds a spark plug above a red lawnmower engine, which then sputters and backfires loudly with a hissing sound as the person speaks.\", \"A person attempts to start a red lawnmower engine, which backfires once before starting, while the person comments on the sound.\", \"A person's hand holds a spark plug near a red engine, which sputters and backfires.\"]", "time_sec": 35.599, "generation_time_seconds": 34.8342, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "422", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "One women, while speaking, held a red zipper with two hands that linked two wicked white cloths with different colors of love, making a zipper sound and turning it around.", "pred": "A person's hands are shown pinning a red fabric strip to a white fabric piece on a wooden surface. A woman speaks in Turkish, explaining that she will now demonstrate the sewing process she has just pinned.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands are shown pinning a red fabric strip to a white fabric piece on a wooden surface. A woman speaks in Turkish, explaining that she will now demonstrate the sewing process she has just pinned.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands are shown pinning a red fabric strip to a white fabric piece on a wooden surface. A woman speaks in Turkish, explaining that she will now demonstrate the sewing process she has just pinned.\", \"The audio contains a person speaking in Turkish about sewing, while the video shows a pair of hands pinning a red fabric strip to a piece of white fabric on a wooden surface.\", \"A person's hands are shown folding a red fabric strip over a white fabric piece, pinning them together with colorful pins. This is accompanied by the distinct sound of a sewing machine executing a zigzag stitch, while a female voice narrates instructions in Turkish about the process.\", \"A person's hands are shown pinning a red fabric strip onto a larger piece of white fabric. The person then folds the white fabric over the pinned strip. A female voice speaks in Turkish, explaining a sewing process.\"]", "time_sec": 45.812, "generation_time_seconds": 45.2997, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.04, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "423", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a forest, a man sat in the cab of a tool car talking while manipulating the machine to cut down trees and make a buzzing sound.", "pred": "Inside a green forestry machine's cabin, a person's hand manipulates a joystick while a monitor displays a forest, as a male voice instructs about preventing high stumps from impeding travel.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Inside a green forestry machine's cabin, a person's hand manipulates a joystick while a monitor displays a forest, as a male voice instructs about preventing high stumps from impeding travel.", "cot": "[\"Inside a green forestry machine's cabin, a person's hand manipulates a joystick while a monitor displays a forest, as a male voice instructs about preventing high stumps from impeding travel.\", \"Inside a vehicle, a person's hand operates a joystick on a control panel with a screen, while a large black mechanical arm is visible outside the window. The sound of a heavy engine is audible, and a male voice says, \\\"Gotta make sure that the stumps aren't too high 'cause you can't really travel over them.\\\"\", \"A person's hand operates a joystick for a large piece of forestry machinery, with a screen nearby and a forest visible outside the cab; simultaneously, the deep rumble of the engine and a male voice discussing stump height can be heard.\", \"Inside a green forestry machine cabin, a person's hand operates a joystick to control a large black mechanical arm outside, while a male voice states the need to ensure stumps are not too high.\"]", "time_sec": 49.314, "generation_time_seconds": 47.8655, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.56, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "424", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With a bell ringing, a purple flashing disk on the screen moves from far to near, followed by a woman's prayer.", "pred": "I see a purple kaleidoscopic background with Polish text, and I hear a low, sustained, and resonant chant.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "I see a purple kaleidoscopic background with Polish text, and I hear a low, sustained, and resonant chant.", "cot": "[\"I see a purple kaleidoscopic background with Polish text, and I hear a low, sustained, and resonant chant.\", \"A psychedelic purple spiral with white light bursts contains Polish text, while a low, sustained, and reverberating chant is heard.\", \"The video shows a purple kaleidoscopic pattern with Polish text, while the audio features a low, sustained, and resonant chanting sound.\", \"The video displays a purple, symmetrical mandala-like pattern with a central light source and radiating beams. Overlaid on this image is white Polish text. The audio consists of a low, sustained, electronic drone accompanied by a high-pitched, breathy, and wordless female vocalization.\"]", "time_sec": 40.366, "generation_time_seconds": 39.7577, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "425", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman lay on the bed, talking with a gasp, beside the sound of the baby.", "pred": "A person wearing glasses is seen up close with their eyes closed. The audio consists of a person speaking and a cat meowing in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing glasses is seen up close with their eyes closed. The audio consists of a person speaking and a cat meowing in the background.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing glasses is seen up close with their eyes closed. The audio consists of a person speaking and a cat meowing in the background.\", \"A close-up shows a person's face with glasses, while the audio captures them speaking and a dog growling and whimpering.\", \"A person is seen lying down with their eyes closed, wearing black-rimmed glasses, while a deep, guttural growling sound plays, followed by a female voice stating, \\\"That's after I took my inhaler.\\\"\", \"A person wearing glasses is shown in close-up as they talk, explaining that the sound they are making is from after they took their inhaler.\"]", "time_sec": 38.216, "generation_time_seconds": 37.3331, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "426", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The car alarm was ringing, and then a person was pressing the car alarm, making different noises from different buttons.", "pred": "A hand presses a button on a black Remote Control for a Genie garage door opener, which has glowing green and red buttons for functions like 'OPEN', 'CLOSE', 'ALERT', and 'YELP'.\nThe device emits a loud, continuous electronic siren tone, similar to a car alarm or emergency vehicle siren.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand presses a button on a black Remote Control for a Genie garage door opener, which has glowing green and red buttons for functions like 'OPEN', 'CLOSE', 'ALERT', and 'YELP'.\nThe device emits a loud, continuous electronic siren tone, similar to a car alarm or emergency vehicle siren.", "cot": "[\"A hand presses a button on a black Remote Control for a Genie garage door opener, which has glowing green and red buttons for functions like 'OPEN', 'CLOSE', 'ALERT', and 'YELP'.\\nThe device emits a loud, continuous electronic siren tone, similar to a car alarm or emergency vehicle siren.\", \"A person presses a button on a black, illuminated remote control, which then emits a loud, electronic siren sound.\", \"A person's hand presses buttons on a black remote control with glowing green and red lights, while a loud emergency siren wails and then cuts off abruptly.\", \"A hand presses the red 'PULSE' button on a remote control with glowing green and red labels, while an emergency vehicle siren with a dual-tone wail and a loud air horn sound plays in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 43.758, "generation_time_seconds": 43.1235, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "427", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the music came to mind, with a red bulge on a black background appeared and a piece of brown pipe hung on the wall.", "pred": "A black rectangular control box with a red button and yellow text reading \"AMERICAN FLYER CONTROL BUTTON\" is shown, followed by a view of a large instrument with many vertical brass tubes. The instrument plays a complex, melodic tune composed of chimes and bell-like notes.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black rectangular control box with a red button and yellow text reading \"AMERICAN FLYER CONTROL BUTTON\" is shown, followed by a view of a large instrument with many vertical brass tubes. The instrument plays a complex, melodic tune composed of chimes and bell-like notes.", "cot": "[\"A black rectangular control box with a red button and yellow text reading \\\"AMERICAN FLYER CONTROL BUTTON\\\" is shown, followed by a view of a large instrument with many vertical brass tubes. The instrument plays a complex, melodic tune composed of chimes and bell-like notes.\", \"A close-up shows a black, rectangular object with a red button and a yellow label that reads \\\"AMERICAN FLYER CONTROL BUTTON,\\\" which is mounted above a set of vertical, gold-colored metal rods.\\nThe audio consists of the loud, resonant ringing of multiple bells, similar to a carillon or a large clock chime.\\nThe visual of a control button for a mechanism is consistent with the sound of a bell system being activated.\\nThe final answer is: A control button for a bell system is shown above a set of vertical rods, accompanied by the sound of multiple bells chiming in a melodic sequence.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a black, rectangular \\\"AMERICAN FLYER CONTROL BUTTON\\\" with a red knob, which is then followed by a shot of a set of wooden chimes. The audio consists of a single, sustained, high-pitched electronic beep.\", \"I see a close-up of a black control box with a red button and a gold label that reads \\\"AMERICAN FLYER CONTROL BUTTON\\\". The scene then changes to a wall-mounted apparatus with numerous vertical brass rods. Simultaneously, I hear a complex, chime-like melody being played on a carillon or bell tower.\"]", "time_sec": 65.47, "generation_time_seconds": 64.8598, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "428", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the background of a prairie morning, with soothing musical recollections, a yellow plane and different English letters gradually appeared.", "pred": "The video displays a yellow cartoon airplane flying across a green hillscape under a blue sky, while clouds sequentially form the letters A through G. Simultaneously, a female voice sings the alphabet to the melody of an acoustic guitar.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a yellow cartoon airplane flying across a green hillscape under a blue sky, while clouds sequentially form the letters A through G. Simultaneously, a female voice sings the alphabet to the melody of an acoustic guitar.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a yellow cartoon airplane flying across a green hillscape under a blue sky, while clouds sequentially form the letters A through G. Simultaneously, a female voice sings the alphabet to the melody of an acoustic guitar.\", \"A yellow cartoon airplane flies across a green, rolling hill landscape under a blue sky as a female voice sings the alphabet over gentle acoustic guitar music, with letters A through G appearing sequentially on clouds.\", \"A yellow airplane flies past green hills and a yellow sun. White clouds shaped like letters appear in the sky, spelling A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H. A female voice sings the alphabet to the sound of a guitar.\", \"A yellow airplane flies over green hills under a blue sky as clouds sequentially display the letters A through H. A female voice sings the alphabet while a guitar plays in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 44.604, "generation_time_seconds": 43.9438, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "429", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A group of soldiers slowly ascended the high platform with flags, and the audience saluted to the sound of the majestic song.", "pred": "A group of men in white uniforms walks down steps in a formal procession, while a male choir sings in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A group of men in white uniforms walks down steps in a formal procession, while a male choir sings in the background.", "cot": "[\"A group of men in white uniforms walks down steps in a formal procession, while a male choir sings in the background.\", \"A group of sailors in white uniforms walks down stone steps while carrying a red flag, as a male choir sings a cappella in Spanish in the background.\", \"The audio features a male choir singing in Spanish, while the visual shows several men in white uniforms carrying a red flag down steps in front of a building with archways.\", \"A group of people in white uniforms carry a red flag up steps in front of a building with arched doorways, while a male choir sings in Spanish with instrumental accompaniment.\"]", "time_sec": 38.701, "generation_time_seconds": 37.5367, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "430", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a patch of grass, a small flower swayed in the wind with music.", "pred": "This is a close-up shot of pink and peach-colored roses in a garden. One rose is fully bloomed while others are buds. White text reading \"MUSIC BY SR CHANVOY\" is overlaid on the image. A female voice sings a cappella in a high, sustained, and melodic tone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "This is a close-up shot of pink and peach-colored roses in a garden. One rose is fully bloomed while others are buds. White text reading \"MUSIC BY SR CHANVOY\" is overlaid on the image. A female voice sings a cappella in a high, sustained, and melodic tone.", "cot": "[\"This is a close-up shot of pink and peach-colored roses in a garden. One rose is fully bloomed while others are buds. White text reading \\\"MUSIC BY SR CHANVOY\\\" is overlaid on the image. A female voice sings a cappella in a high, sustained, and melodic tone.\", \"A close-up shows a light pink rosebud surrounded by other out-of-focus rosebuds, while a female choir sings a cappella.\", \"The video displays a series of close-up, softly focused shots of pink and peach-colored roses in a garden setting, with the text \\\"*MUSIC BY SR CHANDOLY*\\\" visible on screen, while the audio consists of a woman singing a cappella in a reverberant space.\", \"The video presents a close-up of pink and peach-colored roses with green foliage, overlaid with the text 'MUSIC BY SR CHANDROY'. The audio consists of a female choir singing a cappella, with the primary melody sung in a non-English language.\"]", "time_sec": 51.213, "generation_time_seconds": 50.3105, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "431", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A cartoon character swings his fist and chases a yellow pencil in the light music, then sits happily on the floor playing with his phone.", "pred": "A cartoon drawing shows a stick figure running on lined paper, then stopping to look up at a drawing of a power pole with wires, while cartoonish grunts, a 'boing', and an electric buzz are heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A cartoon drawing shows a stick figure running on lined paper, then stopping to look up at a drawing of a power pole with wires, while cartoonish grunts, a 'boing', and an electric buzz are heard.", "cot": "[\"A cartoon drawing shows a stick figure running on lined paper, then stopping to look up at a drawing of a power pole with wires, while cartoonish grunts, a 'boing', and an electric buzz are heard.\", \"A hand-drawn, animated scene on lined paper depicts a stick figure running from a larger figure and then smiling while holding a small object. This is accompanied by a sequence of distinct, non-diegetic sounds: a sharp percussive hit, a high-pitched wailing vocalization, a low groan, plucked string music, and a final descending electronic tone.\", \"A stick figure is drawn on lined paper, then it runs, jumps, and lands with a thud. Simultaneously, a distorted male voice yells, a high-pitched scream is heard, and a simple electronic melody plays.\", \"A crude, childlike drawing of a stick figure and a utility pole with wires is shown on lined notebook paper, while a cacophony of a distorted electric guitar plays alongside a person's strained grunts and groans.\"]", "time_sec": 51.466, "generation_time_seconds": 50.4578, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "432", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a purple vest paddles a boat in the water and soon enters a gorge in a beautiful place.", "pred": "A person in a yellow kayak wearing a purple life vest paddles through dark water towards a large, green, overhanging rock formation, while a male voice speaks and the sound of water lapping is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a yellow kayak wearing a purple life vest paddles through dark water towards a large, green, overhanging rock formation, while a male voice speaks and the sound of water lapping is heard.", "cot": "[\"A person in a yellow kayak wearing a purple life vest paddles through dark water towards a large, green, overhanging rock formation, while a male voice speaks and the sound of water lapping is heard.\", \"I see a person in a yellow kayak wearing a purple life vest, paddling through calm, greenish water towards a dark cave entrance in a rocky cliff. I hear the rhythmic sound of the paddle dipping into the water and a male voice speaking in the background.\", \"A person in a purple vest paddles a yellow kayak through a narrow waterway between dark, mossy cliffs. The sound of the paddle dipping into the water and the gentle lapping of waves can be heard, accompanied by a man speaking in the background.\", \"A person in a purple life vest paddles a yellow kayak through dark water towards a large, shadowy cave entrance formed in a rock face. A male voice speaks, followed by the continuous, rhythmic sound of a paddle moving through the water.\"]", "time_sec": 49.162, "generation_time_seconds": 48.5665, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "433", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A old man sat beside the corner, playing the strings with his hands to a melodious sound.", "pred": "A man with grey hair and a grey t-shirt sits on a stool and plays a steel guitar, which produces a melodic, twangy sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man with grey hair and a grey t-shirt sits on a stool and plays a steel guitar, which produces a melodic, twangy sound.", "cot": "[\"A man with grey hair and a grey t-shirt sits on a stool and plays a steel guitar, which produces a melodic, twangy sound.\", \"A man plays a pedal steel guitar, and the sound of the steel guitar is heard.\", \"A man with grey hair plays a lap steel guitar. The distinct sound of the steel guitar is accompanied by a keyboard and drums, creating a country music piece.\", \"A man with gray hair sits on a stool, playing a steel guitar with a slide. The instrument produces a twangy, melodic country music tune.\"]", "time_sec": 35.678, "generation_time_seconds": 35.0195, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "434", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a man speaks with a mouse clicking on a computer file.", "pred": "The screen displays a computer desktop with multiple open windows, including a file manager and a command-line interface, while a person speaks in Vietnamese and a continuous electronic beep is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The screen displays a computer desktop with multiple open windows, including a file manager and a command-line interface, while a person speaks in Vietnamese and a continuous electronic beep is heard.", "cot": "[\"The screen displays a computer desktop with multiple open windows, including a file manager and a command-line interface, while a person speaks in Vietnamese and a continuous electronic beep is heard.\", \"A user deletes a file named 'update' from the 'mods' folder within the 'Minecraft' directory using a file manager.\", \"A computer desktop displays a file manager with two windows open. A system error dialog appears stating that a file is in use, and a user attempts to delete a file named 'mod', while a speaker gives instructions in Vietnamese to remove the 'mod' and reinstall the 'old' one.\", \"The screen displays a computer desktop with open file explorer windows, while a person speaks Vietnamese, instructing to delete a file and then run an application called 'EditMod'.\"]", "time_sec": 41.596, "generation_time_seconds": 41.0631, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "435", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, the picture is constantly shaking with the music of the disco.", "pred": "The video displays a static image of an anime-style character with long orange hair, a red coat, and black thigh-high boots, holding a parasol on a rooftop as pink birds and petals float around her, while the audio features a modern electronic music track with a driving beat and synth melodies.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a static image of an anime-style character with long orange hair, a red coat, and black thigh-high boots, holding a parasol on a rooftop as pink birds and petals float around her, while the audio features a modern electronic music track with a driving beat and synth melodies.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a static image of an anime-style character with long orange hair, a red coat, and black thigh-high boots, holding a parasol on a rooftop as pink birds and petals float around her, while the audio features a modern electronic music track with a driving beat and synth melodies.\", \"This is a static image of an anime-style woman with long red hair holding a large parasol, sitting on a roof with pigeons and cherry blossom petals around her; the audio is an instrumental electronic dance music track with a driving beat and a synthesized melody.\", \"This is an anime-style illustration of a red-haired woman in a flowing red cloak and black stockings, crouching on a dark roof while holding a purple parasol. White birds and pink petals float in the air around her, and a circular logo is visible in the lower-left corner. The accompanying audio is upbeat electronic dance music with a driving beat and synthesized melodies.\", \"The audio features upbeat electronic dance music, while the visual displays a static anime-style illustration of a woman with long orange hair on a rooftop, holding a parasol and wearing a red cloak.\"]", "time_sec": 53.281, "generation_time_seconds": 52.0116, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.26, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "436", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Rows of English letters  in black background, making strange noises and the music sounds from time to time.", "pred": "The video displays the text '97 REX2 Files' and 'Undeniably Australian Aborigine Sound' against a black background, while the audio features a low, droning didgeridoo-like instrument with a rhythmic, percussive beat.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays the text '97 REX2 Files' and 'Undeniably Australian Aborigine Sound' against a black background, while the audio features a low, droning didgeridoo-like instrument with a rhythmic, percussive beat.", "cot": "[\"The video displays the text '97 REX2 Files' and 'Undeniably Australian Aborigine Sound' against a black background, while the audio features a low, droning didgeridoo-like instrument with a rhythmic, percussive beat.\", \"The video displays a sequence of text overlays on a black background, first showing \\\"97 REX2 Files\\\" and then \\\"Undeniably Australian Aborigine Sound.\\\" Simultaneously, the audio features a deep, resonant didgeridoo playing a continuous, low-pitched drone.\", \"A static black screen displays the text \\\"97 REX2 Files\\\" in orange, then transitions to the text \\\"Undeniably Australian Aborigine Sound,\\\" all while a low-frequency, resonant didgeridoo plays.\", \"A static title card displays the text '97 REX2 Files' in orange font against a black background, which then transitions to show 'Undeniably Australian Aboriginal Sound' in the same font style. Simultaneously, a low, rhythmic didgeridoo melody is heard, accompanied by steady, percussive beat sounds.\"]", "time_sec": 54.054, "generation_time_seconds": 53.5442, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "437", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the forest, a mouse clutches a wooden box with its front paws, and the mouse's head gets in every.", "pred": "A red squirrel is seen climbing a wooden structure while the distinct, high-pitched, repetitive cawing of a crow is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red squirrel is seen climbing a wooden structure while the distinct, high-pitched, repetitive cawing of a crow is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A red squirrel is seen climbing a wooden structure while the distinct, high-pitched, repetitive cawing of a crow is heard in the background.\", \"A red squirrel climbs a wooden post while birds chirp and caw in the background.\", \"A red squirrel climbs a wooden pole, while various birds chirp and caw in the background.\", \"A red squirrel climbs a wooden post while birds chirp and caw in the surrounding outdoor environment.\"]", "time_sec": 31.061, "generation_time_seconds": 30.5124, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "438", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Several people were coughing , and a group of people came out of the room and coughed with their hands over their mouths, followed by a woman's voice.", "pred": "The video displays a split-screen of people coughing, followed by a scene of people coughing into their sleeves. A female voice instructs viewers to cough into their sleeves instead of their hands to avoid getting sick.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a split-screen of people coughing, followed by a scene of people coughing into their sleeves. A female voice instructs viewers to cough into their sleeves instead of their hands to avoid getting sick.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a split-screen of people coughing, followed by a scene of people coughing into their sleeves. A female voice instructs viewers to cough into their sleeves instead of their hands to avoid getting sick.\", \"First, a grid of nine people is shown; four of them are coughing, and a voice says, \\\"A simple way to avoid getting sick, try coughing into your sleeve instead of your hand.\\\" Then, the scene cuts to three people in a hallway who are coughing; one person coughs into their sleeve while a text overlay reads \\\"No Hands Use Sleeve.\\\"\", \"A person coughs, followed by a narrator explaining that coughing into one's sleeve is a better way to avoid getting sick than coughing into one's hand.\", \"A person coughs, and a narrator explains the importance of coughing into one's sleeve to avoid illness.\"]", "time_sec": 44.347, "generation_time_seconds": 43.7969, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 37.21, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "439", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a zoo, a man is narrating a tiger with its teeth bared, and a roar comes from beside it.", "pred": "The video opens with a tiger roaring, followed by a shot of a house and a \"Single Vision\" truck, then cuts to a lion behind a fence, all while a narrator describes a man named Carl and his non-profit organization.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video opens with a tiger roaring, followed by a shot of a house and a \"Single Vision\" truck, then cuts to a lion behind a fence, all while a narrator describes a man named Carl and his non-profit organization.", "cot": "[\"The video opens with a tiger roaring, followed by a shot of a house and a \\\"Single Vision\\\" truck, then cuts to a lion behind a fence, all while a narrator describes a man named Carl and his non-profit organization.\", \"The audio describes a man named Kyle who established a non-profit called Single Vision nine years ago at his home in Florida. This narration is paired with a montage of visuals showing a roaring tiger, a pickup truck with \\\"Single Vision\\\" branding, a person on a swing, and a lion behind a wire fence.\", \"The audio features a narrator stating that \\\"Nine years ago, Kyle set up Single Vision, an educational non-profit organization at his home in Florida,\\\" immediately followed by a loud, low-frequency electronic buzz.\", \"The video displays a sequence of animal scenes: a roaring tiger, a white van with \\\"SINGLE VISION\\\" branding, a lush green yard, and a lion with a cub behind a fence. Over this, a narrator describes the founding of a non-profit organization, while an animal growls and a man begins to speak.\"]", "time_sec": 51.806, "generation_time_seconds": 50.85, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "440", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "An electric fan whirled in the white room, making a buzzing sound.", "pred": "A stationary ceiling fan with a light fixture is attached to a white paneled ceiling next to a wall-mounted air conditioning unit; the fan's blades are spinning rapidly, creating a blur, while a continuous low-frequency hum is audible in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A stationary ceiling fan with a light fixture is attached to a white paneled ceiling next to a wall-mounted air conditioning unit; the fan's blades are spinning rapidly, creating a blur, while a continuous low-frequency hum is audible in the background.", "cot": "[\"A stationary ceiling fan with a light fixture is attached to a white paneled ceiling next to a wall-mounted air conditioning unit; the fan's blades are spinning rapidly, creating a blur, while a continuous low-frequency hum is audible in the background.\", \"A ceiling fan with a light fixture spins rapidly beneath a white paneled ceiling, next to a wall-mounted air conditioning unit, all while a continuous, low-frequency buzzing sound is heard.\", \"A ceiling fan with a light fixture spins on a white ceiling next to a wall-mounted air conditioning unit, accompanied by the continuous, low-frequency hum of an operating machine.\", \"A ceiling fan with a light fixture spins rapidly, and its blades create a continuous, low-frequency humming sound.\"]", "time_sec": 40.335, "generation_time_seconds": 39.643, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "441", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "After a film, four men sit behind a desk and do self-presentations, and the sound and music go to one night, a woman and two men talking.", "pred": "A static title card with the words \"Part 1\" in purple is shown. The scene then cuts to four young men sitting side-by-side at a dark table, each introducing themselves by name while upbeat music plays. The video then cuts to a dimly lit, grainy shot of two young women, one of whom is laughing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A static title card with the words \"Part 1\" in purple is shown. The scene then cuts to four young men sitting side-by-side at a dark table, each introducing themselves by name while upbeat music plays. The video then cuts to a dimly lit, grainy shot of two young women, one of whom is laughing.", "cot": "[\"A static title card with the words \\\"Part 1\\\" in purple is shown. The scene then cuts to four young men sitting side-by-side at a dark table, each introducing themselves by name while upbeat music plays. The video then cuts to a dimly lit, grainy shot of two young women, one of whom is laughing.\", \"Four men sit at a table and introduce themselves as JB, Marvin, Tariq, and Aston, stating they are JLS, before a loud slap sound is heard.\", \"The audio contains a group of young men introducing themselves as \\\"JLS\\\" over a musical track, followed by a woman's voice exclaiming \\\"They kidnapped us!\\\" and a loud crashing sound, all while the visuals show two different scenes: four men sitting at a table and a close-up of two women in a dimly lit setting.\", \"Four young men sit at a table, introducing themselves as JB, Marvin, Tariq, and Aston, stating they are JLS. The scene cuts to a young woman screaming in fear as a man attempts to tie her up.\"]", "time_sec": 52.17, "generation_time_seconds": 51.6569, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.52, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "442", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man with a beard played his guitar skillfully with his fingers in the room and played beautiful music.", "pred": "A bearded man wearing glasses plays a Spanish guitar, accompanied by the rhythmic sound of hand claps and castanets, while promotional text for a guitar school and a \"Comprehensive Picado Package\" is overlaid on the image.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A bearded man wearing glasses plays a Spanish guitar, accompanied by the rhythmic sound of hand claps and castanets, while promotional text for a guitar school and a \"Comprehensive Picado Package\" is overlaid on the image.", "cot": "[\"A bearded man wearing glasses plays a Spanish guitar, accompanied by the rhythmic sound of hand claps and castanets, while promotional text for a guitar school and a \\\"Comprehensive Picado Package\\\" is overlaid on the image.\", \"The video displays a black and white image of a man with glasses playing a classical guitar. The audio consists of the distinct sound of a Spanish-style acoustic guitar being played, creating a musical atmosphere.\", \"The video displays a black and white image of a man playing a classical guitar, accompanied by the distinct sounds of a Spanish guitar and rhythmic hand claps.\", \"This is a composite image of a man playing a classical guitar, with overlaid text and logos, accompanied by the sound of flamenco guitar music featuring strumming and percussive tapping.\"]", "time_sec": 42.776, "generation_time_seconds": 41.7444, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "443", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "One hand left the clock with the pines pattern, tinkling and musical.", "pred": "A hand adjusts the pendulum of a wooden cuckoo clock as a synthesized melody plays.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand adjusts the pendulum of a wooden cuckoo clock as a synthesized melody plays.", "cot": "[\"A hand adjusts the pendulum of a wooden cuckoo clock as a synthesized melody plays.\", \"A hand adjusts the hands of a wooden cuckoo clock, which then chimes a melodic tune from its bell mechanism.\", \"A hand adjusts the minute hand on a wooden cuckoo clock. The clock chimes, and a melodic tune from a music box begins to play.\", \"A hand adjusts the minute hand of a wooden cuckoo clock, which then chimes and plays a melody as its pendulum swings.\"]", "time_sec": 34.416, "generation_time_seconds": 33.3219, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "444", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red-and-white helicopter slowly flew along an empty roadside, as it spoke and buzzed and beside greeny.", "pred": "A red and white helicopter with the number 3 and 'N00FD' on its side hovers low over an asphalt runway, its main rotor blades spinning rapidly, while a male voice speaks in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red and white helicopter with the number 3 and 'N00FD' on its side hovers low over an asphalt runway, its main rotor blades spinning rapidly, while a male voice speaks in the background.", "cot": "[\"A red and white helicopter with the number 3 and 'N00FD' on its side hovers low over an asphalt runway, its main rotor blades spinning rapidly, while a male voice speaks in the background.\", \"A red and white helicopter, marked with the number '3', performs a low hover over a paved runway, while a male voice speaks in German in the background.\", \"A red and white helicopter with the number 3 on its side is on a runway, its rotors spinning. In the background, a person is speaking in German, and the low-frequency sound of the helicopter's engines is audible.\", \"A red and white helicopter with the number 3 on its side hovers low over a paved surface, with its main rotor blades blurred by motion, while a male voice speaks in German in the background, stating that the helicopter looks good.\"]", "time_sec": 45.147, "generation_time_seconds": 44.1039, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "445", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On the gray floor lay a crowd of people, who laughed from time to time.", "pred": "The audio captures a group of people laughing together. The visual shows a group of people lying in a circle on the floor, all looking upwards with smiles and open mouths.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio captures a group of people laughing together. The visual shows a group of people lying in a circle on the floor, all looking upwards with smiles and open mouths.", "cot": "[\"The audio captures a group of people laughing together. The visual shows a group of people lying in a circle on the floor, all looking upwards with smiles and open mouths.\", \"A high-angle view shows a circle of about ten women lying on their backs on a grey carpet, looking up and laughing together, which produces the distinct sound of multiple people laughing in unison.\", \"A group of people are lying on the floor in a circle, looking upwards and laughing.\", \"A group of people lie on a carpet forming a circle, laughing together as their shared laughter creates a continuous, collective sound.\"]", "time_sec": 36.265, "generation_time_seconds": 35.2497, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "446", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On the dark indoor stage, music was heard and the band's lead singer sang.", "pred": "A band performs on a dark stage with text overlays, while an acoustic guitar plays a chord progression and a male voice sings in Japanese.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A band performs on a dark stage with text overlays, while an acoustic guitar plays a chord progression and a male voice sings in Japanese.", "cot": "[\"A band performs on a dark stage with text overlays, while an acoustic guitar plays a chord progression and a male voice sings in Japanese.\", \"The video opens on a dark stage with a person playing an electric guitar, which produces a clean, melodic riff. As the person begins to sing, the on-screen text 'Happy 20th the pillows!' is visible.\", \"A dark, blurry concert scene shows a band performing on a stage with spotlights, while a male vocalist sings over a distorted electric guitar melody.\", \"The video shows a dark concert stage with faint silhouettes of performers and instruments, accompanied by the sound of an electric guitar playing a melody, followed by a male voice singing in Japanese, and the on-screen text \\\"Happy 20th the pillows!\\\" and \\\"Black Sheep\\\".\"]", "time_sec": 42.764, "generation_time_seconds": 42.2175, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "447", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "There was music in the picture, and on the grass a man in a white suit circled around a woman in a long white dress.", "pred": "A silver car drives down a street while a gentle, melodic tune plays on a music box.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A silver car drives down a street while a gentle, melodic tune plays on a music box.", "cot": "[\"A silver car drives down a street while a gentle, melodic tune plays on a music box.\", \"The visual shows a man and a woman in a white dress dancing in a grassy field with a bicycle and buildings in the background, then cuts to a silver Chevrolet Camaro driving on a road. The audio consists of instrumental music followed by a phone ringtone.\", \"A couple embraces in a field of tall grass with an apartment complex in the background, as a synthesizer plays a slow, romantic melody.\", \"A silver Chevrolet Camaro drives down a city street, with a keyboard playing a melodic tune in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 36.973, "generation_time_seconds": 36.3053, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.7, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "448", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in blue and glasses sneezed at a yellow bird standing on his shoulder.", "pred": "A person in a blue shirt has a yellow and orange bird on their shoulder, which is looking towards the camera as the person repeatedly sneezes, accompanied by the sound of a sneeze.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a blue shirt has a yellow and orange bird on their shoulder, which is looking towards the camera as the person repeatedly sneezes, accompanied by the sound of a sneeze.", "cot": "[\"A person in a blue shirt has a yellow and orange bird on their shoulder, which is looking towards the camera as the person repeatedly sneezes, accompanied by the sound of a sneeze.\", \"A yellow and orange lovebird perches on a man's shoulder as he repeatedly sneezes, followed by a woman speaking in Spanish.\", \"A yellow and orange parrot preens on a person's blue shoulder as a person sneezes three times, followed by a dog barking.\", \"A person wearing a blue shirt has a yellow and orange lovebird on their shoulder. The person then sneezes multiple times, followed by a loud buzzer sound.\"]", "time_sec": 38.848, "generation_time_seconds": 38.3047, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.63, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "449", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two men in protective clothing spoke, shoveling the hives of the house with tools as a swarm of bees buzzed.", "pred": "A person in a white beekeeping suit manipulates a beehive while bees swarm around their hands and the hive. The constant buzzing of the bees is audible, and a man's voice can be heard speaking, \"They're in there with me\" and \"Gotta fill this up for ya.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a white beekeeping suit manipulates a beehive while bees swarm around their hands and the hive. The constant buzzing of the bees is audible, and a man's voice can be heard speaking, \"They're in there with me\" and \"Gotta fill this up for ya.\"", "cot": "[\"A person in a white beekeeping suit manipulates a beehive while bees swarm around their hands and the hive. The constant buzzing of the bees is audible, and a man's voice can be heard speaking, \\\"They're in there with me\\\" and \\\"Gotta fill this up for ya.\\\"\", \"A person in a white beekeeper suit with a veil uses a white smoker to release a cloud of smoke, while numerous bees fly around them; simultaneously, the buzzing of the bees' wings is heard, followed by a person speaking and the sound of a lighter flicking.\", \"First, I will analyze the visual content of the frames provided. The frames show a person wearing a white beekeeping suit and a hat with a veil. The person is reaching into a dark, irregular opening in a white, ornately molded wall. Numerous small, dark insects are visible on the person's suit, the white wall, and flying in the air. The person's hand is inside the opening, and the insects appear to be bees.\\n\\nNext, I will analyze the audio. The audio contains a persistent, dense buzzing sound, characteristic of a large swarm of insects like bees. Over this buzzing, a male voice speaks, saying, \\\"...they're in there with me. Gotta kill 'em before we get... Really? Yeah...\\\"\\n\\nFinally, I will synthesize the visual and audio information into a single, factual sentence, following the formatting rules. The sentence must be under 30 words and describe what is seen and heard objectively, without assumptions or smoothing.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A beekeeper in a white suit reaches into a wall cavity, surrounded by a swarm of buzzing bees, as a man's voice says they are in there with him.}\", \"A person in a white beekeeper suit has many bees crawling on them and the surrounding white wall. A buzzing sound is audible as a man speaks.\"]", "time_sec": 77.747, "generation_time_seconds": 77.1081, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "450", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the music rang, a man with headphones opened the glass door and walked out, and a woman in black tried to open it before food wrapped in chocolate appeared.", "pred": "The audio features a series of sharp, percussive impacts, followed by a musical flourish. The visual shows a young woman in a dark cardigan and jeans walking through a modern interior with wood-paneled walls, approaching a glass door, as a Snickers advertisement with the slogan \"INILAH JADINYA KALAU LAPAR\" is displayed.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features a series of sharp, percussive impacts, followed by a musical flourish. The visual shows a young woman in a dark cardigan and jeans walking through a modern interior with wood-paneled walls, approaching a glass door, as a Snickers advertisement with the slogan \"INILAH JADINYA KALAU LAPAR\" is displayed.", "cot": "[\"The audio features a series of sharp, percussive impacts, followed by a musical flourish. The visual shows a young woman in a dark cardigan and jeans walking through a modern interior with wood-paneled walls, approaching a glass door, as a Snickers advertisement with the slogan \\\"INILAH JADINYA KALAU LAPAR\\\" is displayed.\", \"A woman walks through a modern interior as a loud crash and a \\\"swoosh\\\" sound effect occur, followed by upbeat music.\", \"A woman walks through a modern interior in a Snickers advertisement, and the sound of a door slamming is followed by a loud crash and the beginning of an upbeat rock music track.\", \"The audio begins with the sound of a skateboard on a hard surface, which is abruptly cut off by a loud, jarring electronic buzzer.\"]", "time_sec": 44.059, "generation_time_seconds": 43.291, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "451", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, one hand is holding the fan, the other hand is swinging on the fan surface, there is a man voice in the picture.", "pred": "A person holds a computer fan that is spinning, making noise, while a power supply unit displays a voltage reading.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person holds a computer fan that is spinning, making noise, while a power supply unit displays a voltage reading.", "cot": "[\"A person holds a computer fan that is spinning, making noise, while a power supply unit displays a voltage reading.\", \"A person holds a computer fan connected to a power supply, which is then activated. The fan produces a high-pitched whirring sound as it spins, and the person comments that it makes a little bit of noise and pushes a decent amount of air.\", \"A person holds a black computer fan connected to a power supply displaying \\\"3.91 1.25\\\", which is running and producing a high-pitched whirring sound while the person speaks.\", \"A person holds a computer fan that is powered by a bench power supply, causing the fan blades to spin rapidly and produce a loud, high-pitched whirring noise while a male voice comments on the amount of air it is producing.\"]", "time_sec": 43.554, "generation_time_seconds": 42.9538, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "452", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two hands with wooden sticks were hammering on the black and red drum to make a wonderful music.", "pred": "From a top-down perspective, a person's hands and drumsticks are shown actively playing an electronic drum kit, which produces the distinct sounds of a snare drum, kick drum, and cymbals.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "From a top-down perspective, a person's hands and drumsticks are shown actively playing an electronic drum kit, which produces the distinct sounds of a snare drum, kick drum, and cymbals.", "cot": "[\"From a top-down perspective, a person's hands and drumsticks are shown actively playing an electronic drum kit, which produces the distinct sounds of a snare drum, kick drum, and cymbals.\", \"From a top-down perspective, a person's hands and feet are seen playing an electronic drum kit, which produces a continuous, rhythmic drum beat.\", \"From a top-down perspective, a person's hands and arms play an electronic drum kit with black pads and orange rims, accompanied by the distinct sounds of a drum kit being played.\", \"From a top-down perspective, a person's hands and feet operate an electronic drum kit, striking pads and pedals in time with an energetic, complex drum and percussion rhythm.\"]", "time_sec": 39.746, "generation_time_seconds": 38.8912, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "453", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On the open green lawn, a child drives a red car. and background something is there.", "pred": "A young child drives a red, tracked, toy tractor across a grassy lawn, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic, mechanical chugging of its engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young child drives a red, tracked, toy tractor across a grassy lawn, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic, mechanical chugging of its engine.", "cot": "[\"A young child drives a red, tracked, toy tractor across a grassy lawn, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic, mechanical chugging of its engine.\", \"A child drives a red toy tractor across a grassy yard, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic chugging of a mechanical engine.\", \"A young child drives a red toy tractor across a grassy lawn, and the loud, continuous, low-pitched rumble of a heavy engine is heard in the background.\", \"A small child operates a red, tracked, toy tractor across a grassy lawn, while the loud, continuous, mechanical whirring of the machine's engine is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 38.141, "generation_time_seconds": 37.5058, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "454", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A white pig snorted and stood by the stairs in the room, and a man in white came to him with a white plate.", "pred": "The video shows a carpeted staircase leading to a brightly lit doorway, where a person is briefly visible. A pig is heard oinking nearby, and a male voice says, \"Oh, meow.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a carpeted staircase leading to a brightly lit doorway, where a person is briefly visible. A pig is heard oinking nearby, and a male voice says, \"Oh, meow.\"", "cot": "[\"The video shows a carpeted staircase leading to a brightly lit doorway, where a person is briefly visible. A pig is heard oinking nearby, and a male voice says, \\\"Oh, meow.\\\"\", \"A person in a white shirt runs up a carpeted staircase with a wooden banister. In the background, a dog is barking, and a male voice says, \\\"Help me out.\\\"\", \"A person in a white shirt and dark pants runs down a carpeted staircase, passing a wooden banister, while a dog barks and a male voice speaks in the background.\", \"A person in a white shirt runs down a carpeted staircase as a pig oinks repeatedly, and a person says, \\\"Ooh, meow.\\\".\"]", "time_sec": 40.824, "generation_time_seconds": 40.2515, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.06, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "455", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two fire engines drove on the road after crossing the intersection in an alarm and one person is watching a fire trucks.", "pred": "The video shows a red MAN fire truck, with \"FIRE & RESCUE\" written on the front and a flashing blue light on top, driving down a tree-lined city street. Following it is a white Mercedes-Benz fire engine, also with flashing lights, driving on the same road with other vehicles. The audio consists of the loud, high-pitched wailing of an emergency vehicle siren, indicating that the fire trucks are responding to an emergency call.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a red MAN fire truck, with \"FIRE & RESCUE\" written on the front and a flashing blue light on top, driving down a tree-lined city street. Following it is a white Mercedes-Benz fire engine, also with flashing lights, driving on the same road with other vehicles. The audio consists of the loud, high-pitched wailing of an emergency vehicle siren, indicating that the fire trucks are responding to an emergency call.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a red MAN fire truck, with \\\"FIRE & RESCUE\\\" written on the front and a flashing blue light on top, driving down a tree-lined city street. Following it is a white Mercedes-Benz fire engine, also with flashing lights, driving on the same road with other vehicles. The audio consists of the loud, high-pitched wailing of an emergency vehicle siren, indicating that the fire trucks are responding to an emergency call.\", \"The audio features the loud, wailing siren of an emergency vehicle. The visual shows a red fire engine with blue flashing lights, marked \\\"FIRE & RESCUE\\\" and \\\"LONDON FIRE BRIGADE\\\", driving down a tree-lined city street.\", \"A red fire engine with flashing blue and red lights drives down a city street lined with trees, accompanied by the loud, wailing siren of an emergency vehicle.\", \"A red and white fire engine with flashing blue and red lights, labeled 'FIRE & RESCUE', drives down a city street past trees and other vehicles, its high-pitched electronic siren wailing.\"]", "time_sec": 53.346, "generation_time_seconds": 52.2597, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "456", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in white short-sleeves speaks to a man in black short-sleeves, who hands a piece of clothing to a white short-sleeved man who puts it over his head its a one cloth shop.", "pred": "Two men stand in a clothing store, looking at garments on racks and a mannequin, while one of them speaks in Arabic.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Two men stand in a clothing store, looking at garments on racks and a mannequin, while one of them speaks in Arabic.", "cot": "[\"Two men stand in a clothing store, looking at garments on racks and a mannequin, while one of them speaks in Arabic.\", \"Two men are talking in a clothing store.\\nOne man in a grey shirt is asking the other man in a black t-shirt about a price.\\nThe man in the grey shirt says \\\"seven, right?\\\", and the other man replies \\\"yes, seven\\\".\\nThe man in the grey shirt then asks \\\"what does it cost?\\\", and the other man replies \\\"seven, right?\\\".\\nThe man in the grey shirt then says \\\"seven, right?\\\" again.\\nThe audio ends with a loud electronic buzzer sound.\", \"Two men stand in a clothing store, talking and looking at garments on display; one man holds a black garment while they converse in Arabic, and a male voice speaks in English before a sharp, high-pitched electronic tone sounds.\", \"Inside a clothing store with racks and a mannequin, two men converse in Arabic.\\nOne man, wearing a grey t-shirt, gestures with his hands while speaking.\"]", "time_sec": 50.773, "generation_time_seconds": 50.1805, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "457", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A pair of hands sandpaper the wood on the table, the picture turns, one hand is held the wood by the moving chainsaw saw into two sections, the picture has the man's voice.", "pred": "A person sands a segmented wooden ring on a metal workbench, then cuts a piece of redwood with a table saw, explaining they are removing a burr and that the cut is the same as one previously made.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person sands a segmented wooden ring on a metal workbench, then cuts a piece of redwood with a table saw, explaining they are removing a burr and that the cut is the same as one previously made.", "cot": "[\"A person sands a segmented wooden ring on a metal workbench, then cuts a piece of redwood with a table saw, explaining they are removing a burr and that the cut is the same as one previously made.\", \"A person's hands sand a segmented wooden ring on a metal surface, then cut a piece of red wood with a table saw, as a male voice explains he is sanding off a burr and that the red heart wood can be cut in the same way.\", \"A person's hands sand a curved wooden object on a metal surface, while a voice explains the process; the scene then cuts to a hand pushing a piece of red wood through a table saw, with the voice continuing to narrate the cutting process.\", \"A person is sanding a curved wooden object on a metal workbench, followed by a shot of a hand feeding a piece of red wood through a table saw blade, as a male speaker describes his woodworking process.\"]", "time_sec": 47.717, "generation_time_seconds": 46.7728, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "458", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the endless sea, blue sky and white clouds, with the sound of the clattering sea waves, a white boat is moving, the picture changes the bow of the boat can see the sunset, followed by a melodious music.", "pred": "The video shows a sailboat's bow moving across a choppy sea towards distant islands under a cloudy sky at dusk, while the audio captures the sounds of a large vehicle passing by.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a sailboat's bow moving across a choppy sea towards distant islands under a cloudy sky at dusk, while the audio captures the sounds of a large vehicle passing by.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a sailboat's bow moving across a choppy sea towards distant islands under a cloudy sky at dusk, while the audio captures the sounds of a large vehicle passing by.\", \"The video shows a sailboat moving across the ocean at sunrise or sunset, with islands visible in the distance, while the audio captures the loud, continuous rumbling of a large engine, possibly from a nearby truck or heavy machinery.\", \"A boat's bow cuts through choppy water under a sunset sky, while the sound of a large vehicle's engine and tires on pavement is heard.\", \"A sailboat's white bow is seen cutting through blue ocean water under a sky of scattered clouds with pink and orange hues. The sound of a large vehicle, possibly a truck or bus, is heard driving on a nearby road, creating a contrast between the serene marine scene and the nearby traffic.\"]", "time_sec": 45.794, "generation_time_seconds": 44.519, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "459", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a black striped Blue tshirt was playing an instrument in the room, his hands pressing constantly to make the sound of it.", "pred": "A person wearing a striped shirt is playing a clarinet, which produces a sequence of musical notes.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing a striped shirt is playing a clarinet, which produces a sequence of musical notes.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing a striped shirt is playing a clarinet, which produces a sequence of musical notes.\", \"A person's hands are shown playing a silver clarinet, which produces a series of distinct, high-pitched notes.\", \"A person wearing a light blue t-shirt with dark horizontal stripes is playing a black clarinet. Their hands are positioned on the instrument's keys, and they are blowing into the mouthpiece. The audio consists of a series of high-pitched, reedy, and somewhat dissonant notes characteristic of a clarinet.\", \"A person in a striped shirt plays a silver clarinet, with their fingers moving over the keys as a high-pitched, reedy melody is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 39.211, "generation_time_seconds": 38.6122, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "460", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman in black sits on a yellow sofa holding a baby in a black blotched white dress, the baby making a sound.", "pred": "A baby in a patterned onesie sits on an adult's lap, looking around and opening its mouth, while a high-pitched, distressed cry is heard, followed by the adult saying, \"Okay, buddy, okay.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A baby in a patterned onesie sits on an adult's lap, looking around and opening its mouth, while a high-pitched, distressed cry is heard, followed by the adult saying, \"Okay, buddy, okay.\"", "cot": "[\"A baby in a patterned onesie sits on an adult's lap, looking around and opening its mouth, while a high-pitched, distressed cry is heard, followed by the adult saying, \\\"Okay, buddy, okay.\\\"\", \"A baby in a patterned onesie is held by an older woman on a couch, and the baby is crying and making distressed sounds.\", \"A baby in a white onesie with a blue pattern sits on an adult's lap on a couch, making distressed sounds while the adult speaks softly to comfort them.\", \"A baby in a patterned onesie is held by an adult and makes crying sounds, while an adult female voice speaks in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 39.383, "generation_time_seconds": 38.8048, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "461", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the woman spoke, a group of small black dogs screamed, and inside a large yellow dog looked.", "pred": "A group of dark brown puppies are gathered together on a brown surface.\n Behind them, a large, shaggy brown dog is standing behind a white gate, looking down, while the puppies make high-pitched yipping sounds and a person speaks to them.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A group of dark brown puppies are gathered together on a brown surface.\n Behind them, a large, shaggy brown dog is standing behind a white gate, looking down, while the puppies make high-pitched yipping sounds and a person speaks to them.", "cot": "[\"A group of dark brown puppies are gathered together on a brown surface.\\n Behind them, a large, shaggy brown dog is standing behind a white gate, looking down, while the puppies make high-pitched yipping sounds and a person speaks to them.\", \"A group of dark puppies vocalizes as a large, long-haired dog stands behind a white barrier, also barking, while a person speaks to them.\", \"A woman speaks to a group of small, dark puppies that are vocalizing on a tan mat. Behind them, a large, long-haired brown dog stands behind a white gate, also vocalizing with a high-pitched sound.\", \"A large, light-brown dog stands behind a white wooden barrier, looking down at a group of small, dark-colored puppies on a tan mat, while the puppies vocalize and a person speaks to them.\"]", "time_sec": 44.108, "generation_time_seconds": 43.5118, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 4.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "462", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A girl in a white dress and a girl in a yellow dress were on the grass singing and dancing to the music.", "pred": "The video shows two women, one in a yellow dress and one in a white dress, walking on a grassy bank beside a pond with lily pads, while a children's song in Burmese plays.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows two women, one in a yellow dress and one in a white dress, walking on a grassy bank beside a pond with lily pads, while a children's song in Burmese plays.", "cot": "[\"The video shows two women, one in a yellow dress and one in a white dress, walking on a grassy bank beside a pond with lily pads, while a children's song in Burmese plays.\", \"A woman in a yellow dress and headpiece is shown in close-up and then walking beside another woman in a white dress on a grassy bank beside a pond with lily pads, while a female voice sings over upbeat, rhythmic music.\", \"The audio features a Burmese pop song with a female vocalist over a synthesized beat. The video shows a woman in a white top with a black wig, then two women in traditional-style dresses walking by a pond with lotus plants.\", \"The video displays multiple individuals, including a woman in a yellow dress, walking in a grassy area beside a pond with lily pads. This visual sequence is accompanied by upbeat, rhythmic music featuring a female vocalist singing in a non-English language.\"]", "time_sec": 47.741, "generation_time_seconds": 47.1846, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "463", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A car speed up on the road, its engine roaring, and then it drifted. There were many people standing on either side of the road, some waving to the car.", "pred": "A black car with headlights on is seen driving at night on a wet road. The audio captures the sound of a car's engine revving loudly, tires screeching, and the vehicle speeding away.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black car with headlights on is seen driving at night on a wet road. The audio captures the sound of a car's engine revving loudly, tires screeching, and the vehicle speeding away.", "cot": "[\"A black car with headlights on is seen driving at night on a wet road. The audio captures the sound of a car's engine revving loudly, tires screeching, and the vehicle speeding away.\", \"At night, a car with bright headlights is seen on a wet street as another vehicle accelerates and screeches loudly.\", \"A dark, blurry night scene on a city street is illuminated by streetlights and car headlights, where a dark car with its headlights on is seen driving on the road, and the loud, deep roar of its engine is heard as it accelerates away from the camera.\", \"A dark-colored car with its headlights on is seen driving on a wet city street at night, and the sound of its tires squealing and the engine revving loudly is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 42.254, "generation_time_seconds": 41.4564, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "464", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two men spoke, one of them manipulating the orange object, and another smelled it on the table to compare it with another bottle of yellow liquid.", "pred": "A person in a dark shirt pours an orange liquid from a small glass pitcher into a large glass mixing beaker using a long metal spoon, while a male voice speaks in the background, suggesting a preparation process in a kitchen or bar setting.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a dark shirt pours an orange liquid from a small glass pitcher into a large glass mixing beaker using a long metal spoon, while a male voice speaks in the background, suggesting a preparation process in a kitchen or bar setting.", "cot": "[\"A person in a dark shirt pours an orange liquid from a small glass pitcher into a large glass mixing beaker using a long metal spoon, while a male voice speaks in the background, suggesting a preparation process in a kitchen or bar setting.\", \"A man in a dark jacket is shown making a cocktail by pouring an orange liquid into a glass with ice, while another person watches. In the background, the audio captures a conversation where one person suggests blending it with a little water.\", \"In a dimly lit bar, a bartender in a dark blazer pours an orange liquid from a small carafe into a glass, while another person observes; the background features shelves lined with bottles and glasses, and the sound of a man speaking is heard.\", \"A bartender pours a red liquid from a glass pitcher into a cocktail shaker, while a man with a mustache observes. In the background, two people are having a conversation, and one of them mentions blending something with water.\"]", "time_sec": 48.398, "generation_time_seconds": 47.5585, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.89, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "465", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "To the music, a man in a black suit sat in his chair playing a black harp. ", "pred": "A woman in a brown suit sits and plays a large black and gold concert harp in a room with red walls. The sound of the harp is a slow, arpeggiated melody.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman in a brown suit sits and plays a large black and gold concert harp in a room with red walls. The sound of the harp is a slow, arpeggiated melody.", "cot": "[\"A woman in a brown suit sits and plays a large black and gold concert harp in a room with red walls. The sound of the harp is a slow, arpeggiated melody.\", \"A man in a brown suit sits on a stool, playing a black and gold concert harp with his hands. The clear, resonant sound of the harp playing a melodic piece fills the room.\", \"A person in a brown jacket sits and plucks the strings of a black and gold concert harp, producing a sequence of resonant, arpeggiated notes in a room with red walls.\", \"A woman in a brown jacket sits on a stool, playing a large black and gold harp in a room with red walls. The audio consists of the clear, resonant plucking of the harp strings, producing a melodic and harmonic musical piece.\"]", "time_sec": 45.393, "generation_time_seconds": 44.7814, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "466", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man on stage with a microphone was talking to a woman sitting in a chair, with a dripping trumpet sound.", "pred": "A man holds a microphone towards a woman seated on a stage, while the audience laughs and a loud horn honks repeatedly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man holds a microphone towards a woman seated on a stage, while the audience laughs and a loud horn honks repeatedly.", "cot": "[\"A man holds a microphone towards a woman seated on a stage, while the audience laughs and a loud horn honks repeatedly.\", \"A man in a black jacket holds a microphone and speaks to a woman on stage, while the audience laughs and a loud, distorted horn sound plays.\", \"A man in a dark jacket stands holding a microphone, interacting with a woman in a black shirt who is sitting on a chair. In the background, a man in a plaid shirt is bent over. The scene is accompanied by the sounds of a crowd laughing and a loud, continuous horn.\", \"A man in a black jacket speaks into a microphone for a seated audience, following which a loud, repeating, low-pitched electronic buzzer sounds.\"]", "time_sec": 40.99, "generation_time_seconds": 39.7778, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 34.78, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "467", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "To the music, a group of motorcyclists tilted their bodies and ride their bikes in a curve.", "pred": "A motorcycle rider in white and red gear accelerates on a racetrack, and the loud, sustained engine roar of the motorcycle dominates the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A motorcycle rider in white and red gear accelerates on a racetrack, and the loud, sustained engine roar of the motorcycle dominates the audio.", "cot": "[\"A motorcycle rider in white and red gear accelerates on a racetrack, and the loud, sustained engine roar of the motorcycle dominates the audio.\", \"A motorcycle rider in a white, black, and red racing suit maneuvers a white and red sport motorcycle along a paved track, with audio featuring a loud, fast-paced electronic music track with a driving beat.\", \"A person in white and red racing gear rides a red and white Yamaha motorcycle on a paved road, with a large concrete pillar and a mountainous landscape visible in the background, all while heavily distorted electronic music plays.\\n\\\\boxed{A person in racing gear rides a red and white Yamaha motorcycle on a road, with a concrete pillar and mountains in the background, as distorted electronic music plays.}\", \"A motorcycle rider in white and red gear drives a red and white Yamaha motorcycle on a paved road, with the engine sound audible.\"]", "time_sec": 45.395, "generation_time_seconds": 44.6212, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "468", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On the road outside, a man in white made a clattering horseshoe sound as he rode.", "pred": "A man in a white shirt and dark pants rides a brown horse with white socks at a trot on a grassy area next to a paved surface. A man's voice is heard speaking, followed by the distinct sound of a horse's hooves clopping on the hard ground.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a white shirt and dark pants rides a brown horse with white socks at a trot on a grassy area next to a paved surface. A man's voice is heard speaking, followed by the distinct sound of a horse's hooves clopping on the hard ground.", "cot": "[\"A man in a white shirt and dark pants rides a brown horse with white socks at a trot on a grassy area next to a paved surface. A man's voice is heard speaking, followed by the distinct sound of a horse's hooves clopping on the hard ground.\", \"A person in a white shirt and dark pants rides a brown horse with white feet at a fast gait along a paved path next to a grassy area with houses. A vehicle engine idles nearby, and a person gives instructions to \\\"get up in front a little bit\\\" before a loud, rhythmic clattering sound, like a cart on tracks, begins.\", \"A person wearing a white long-sleeved shirt and dark pants is riding a brown horse with white socks and a blaze on its face. The horse is trotting on a paved path, moving from left to right past a grassy area, a parking meter, and a building with a dark roof. A male voice says, \\\"Get up and crawl over a little bit,\\\" while the rhythmic sound of the horse's hooves clip-clopping on the hard surface is heard.\", \"A man rides a brown horse with white socks at a canter on a paved path next to grass and a house, while a person speaks and a rhythmic, metallic clanking sound is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 60.109, "generation_time_seconds": 59.3942, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "469", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the forest, there was a trees and animal  cackling sound.", "pred": "The video displays a dense forest with green foliage and tree trunks. Simultaneously, the audio captures the distinct, repetitive clucking of a chicken.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a dense forest with green foliage and tree trunks. Simultaneously, the audio captures the distinct, repetitive clucking of a chicken.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a dense forest with green foliage and tree trunks. Simultaneously, the audio captures the distinct, repetitive clucking of a chicken.\", \"The video shows a dense forest with numerous thin tree trunks and green foliage.\\n Simultaneously, the distinct high-pitched vocalization of a peacock can be heard.\\n This creates a scene where the visual is of a natural wooded environment, but the auditory cue is from a specific, non-native animal.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A dense forest of thin trees and green undergrowth is accompanied by the high-pitched squawking call of a peacock.}\", \"The video shows a static view of a dense forest with green and brown foliage. The audio consists of a series of distinct, high-pitched, rapid animal vocalizations.\", \"This is a forest scene with dense green foliage and tree trunks. The audio consists of a sequence of distinct animal vocalizations, starting with a sharp, high-pitched squeak, followed by a series of rapid, lower-pitched clucking or cackling sounds.\"]", "time_sec": 50.75, "generation_time_seconds": 50.0698, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "470", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A buzzing machine is dumping dirt into the yellow sink, where sprinklers spray water to wash the soil. There was music in the picture.", "pred": "\\boxed{The video shows an excavator and conveyor belt moving wet earth, while the audio features a man singing a pop song.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The provided audio and video streams are from entirely different sources and do not describe the same event.\n\nStep 1: Analyze the visual stream.\nThe video shows a large piece of orange construction machinery, an excavator, with a large conveyor belt system. The conveyor belt is actively moving a large quantity of dark, wet material, likely mud or slurry, from a pile into the excavator's bucket. The scene is set outdoors in a bright, sunny environment.\n\nStep 2: Analyze the audio stream.\nThe audio consists of a person singing a song. The lyrics are clearly audible and include the phrase \"...to the world, you're just a man with a life...\" The music is a pop or soft rock song with a male vocalist and a prominent bassline.\n\nStep 3: Combine observations.\nThe visual content depicts a heavy industrial or earth-moving operation. The audio content is a piece of music. There is no direct correlation between the singing and the operation of the machinery. The two streams are independent.\n\nBased on the analysis, a single sentence describing both is required.\n\n\\boxed{The video shows an excavator and conveyor belt moving wet earth, while the audio features a man singing a pop song.}", "cot": "[\"The provided audio and video streams are from entirely different sources and do not describe the same event.\\n\\nStep 1: Analyze the visual stream.\\nThe video shows a large piece of orange construction machinery, an excavator, with a large conveyor belt system. The conveyor belt is actively moving a large quantity of dark, wet material, likely mud or slurry, from a pile into the excavator's bucket. The scene is set outdoors in a bright, sunny environment.\\n\\nStep 2: Analyze the audio stream.\\nThe audio consists of a person singing a song. The lyrics are clearly audible and include the phrase \\\"...to the world, you're just a man with a life...\\\" The music is a pop or soft rock song with a male vocalist and a prominent bassline.\\n\\nStep 3: Combine observations.\\nThe visual content depicts a heavy industrial or earth-moving operation. The audio content is a piece of music. There is no direct correlation between the singing and the operation of the machinery. The two streams are independent.\\n\\nBased on the analysis, a single sentence describing both is required.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{The video shows an excavator and conveyor belt moving wet earth, while the audio features a man singing a pop song.}\", \"A large, yellow Caterpillar excavator with a bucket full of dark soil is positioned on a dirt mound under a clear blue sky. The excavator's bucket is lowered, and the soil is dumped into a large, orange, vibrating, industrial machine, which is actively processing the material. As the soil falls, the machine's metal components vibrate and produce a loud, rhythmic, mechanical clanking sound, accompanied by the sounds of the soil tumbling and settling.\", \"The sound of a large, heavy-duty machine operating is accompanied by the visual of a bucket being filled with dark material and then dumping it, with water spraying from the machinery during the process.\", \"A large excavator loads dark earth into a dump truck. The truck's engine starts and revs as it drives away, while a song with a male vocalist plays in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 83.388, "generation_time_seconds": 82.8662, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "471", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Along with the music and the barking of the dog, the picture shows several dogs in hats.", "pred": "The audio features a cacophony of dogs barking and howling, while the visual shows five golden retriever puppies wearing colorful party hats, confetti, and party blowers, followed by a screen displaying the website americangreetings.com.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features a cacophony of dogs barking and howling, while the visual shows five golden retriever puppies wearing colorful party hats, confetti, and party blowers, followed by a screen displaying the website americangreetings.com.", "cot": "[\"The audio features a cacophony of dogs barking and howling, while the visual shows five golden retriever puppies wearing colorful party hats, confetti, and party blowers, followed by a screen displaying the website americangreetings.com.\", \"Five golden-colored puppies wear festive party hats and props on a white surface with confetti. The scene abruptly cuts to a static graphic with a red rose logo, the text 'americangreetings.com', and a red button labeled 'view more like this'.\", \"The visual displays five golden retriever puppies wearing colorful party hats and holding party blowers, followed by a website banner for 'americangreetings.com'. Simultaneously, the audio consists of multiple dogs barking and a high-pitched howl.\", \"The video displays five golden retriever puppies wearing colorful party hats and holding party favors, followed by a website banner for americangreetings.com with a \\\"view more like this\\\" button, all while the audio consists of a dog barking and a high-pitched electronic tone.\"]", "time_sec": 50.49, "generation_time_seconds": 49.9067, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.24, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "472", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a blue sea, the puppy, summoned by a woman, broke free from the man and swam out of the water.", "pred": "A man in a white shirt and yellow shorts stands in shallow, clear ocean water, holding a small, light-colored dog. The dog is then placed on the shore and runs up a rocky beach. The dominant sound is the loud, continuous crashing of ocean waves, accompanied by a person speaking to the dog.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a white shirt and yellow shorts stands in shallow, clear ocean water, holding a small, light-colored dog. The dog is then placed on the shore and runs up a rocky beach. The dominant sound is the loud, continuous crashing of ocean waves, accompanied by a person speaking to the dog.", "cot": "[\"A man in a white shirt and yellow shorts stands in shallow, clear ocean water, holding a small, light-colored dog. The dog is then placed on the shore and runs up a rocky beach. The dominant sound is the loud, continuous crashing of ocean waves, accompanied by a person speaking to the dog.\", \"A man in yellow swim trunks stands in shallow, clear water, releasing a small white dog onto a rocky shore as it runs off; the sound of crashing waves is constant, and a woman's voice encourages the animal, saying, \\\"Come on, boy,\\\" and \\\"Good boy.\\\".\", \"A man in a white shirt and yellow shorts stands in shallow, clear water, guiding a small, light-colored dog onto a pebble beach as waves crash loudly and a woman encourages the animal with the words, \\\"Come on, buddy. Good boy. Good boy. That's a good boy.\\\"\", \"A man in a white shirt and yellow shorts stands in shallow, clear water, holding a small, light-colored dog. The dog swims away from the man towards a pebble beach as large waves crash in the background. A woman's voice can be heard encouragingly, saying, \\\"Come on, man. Woo. Good boy. Good boy. You're so good.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 58.06, "generation_time_seconds": 57.4141, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "473", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A large plane taxied on the runway, its engines roaring.", "pred": "A large, white, four-engine passenger aircraft is taxiing on a wet runway, kicking up spray from its tires, while the sound of its powerful jet engines dominates the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large, white, four-engine passenger aircraft is taxiing on a wet runway, kicking up spray from its tires, while the sound of its powerful jet engines dominates the audio.", "cot": "[\"A large, white, four-engine passenger aircraft is taxiing on a wet runway, kicking up spray from its tires, while the sound of its powerful jet engines dominates the audio.\", \"I observe a large, white, four-engine passenger airplane, an Airbus A380, positioned on a runway. Its landing gear is down, and its nose landing gear lights are illuminated. The aircraft's engines are producing a significant amount of exhaust and smoke, indicating they are at high power. The plane is stationary or moving very slowly. In the background, there is a hazy sky and a treeline. The 'Top World News' logo is visible in the upper left corner. The sound is of a large aircraft engine running at high power, with a deep, powerful roar and a high-frequency turbine whine.\", \"A large white passenger airplane with four engines is shown from the front as it moves forward on a wet runway, kicking up spray from its tires, while the loud, deep roar of its jet engines dominates the audio.\", \"An Airbus A380 aircraft with its landing gear down and lights on is on a runway, while a loud, low-pitched engine sound, like a large truck or bus, dominates the audio.\"]", "time_sec": 56.932, "generation_time_seconds": 55.9883, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "474", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On a dark night, the owl came from the woods.", "pred": "The video displays a dark, nighttime forest with tall, dark tree trunks. The accompanying audio consists of a series of high-pitched squeaks and chirps, followed by softer, lower-pitched hoots, characteristic of an owl.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a dark, nighttime forest with tall, dark tree trunks. The accompanying audio consists of a series of high-pitched squeaks and chirps, followed by softer, lower-pitched hoots, characteristic of an owl.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a dark, nighttime forest with tall, dark tree trunks. The accompanying audio consists of a series of high-pitched squeaks and chirps, followed by softer, lower-pitched hoots, characteristic of an owl.\", \"The visual content is an extremely dark, blurry image, possibly depicting a dense forest at night. The audio consists of a high-pitched, repetitive bleating sound, characteristic of a goat.\", \"A blurry, dark scene shows the faint shapes of tree trunks. A high-pitched, repetitive squeaking sound is heard, followed by a deep, resonant \\\"boing\\\" sound effect.\", \"The video displays a dark, blurry forest at night, while the audio features a series of high-pitched, distressed animal squeaks or whistles, followed by the hooting of an owl.\"]", "time_sec": 43.668, "generation_time_seconds": 43.1727, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "475", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the music, many fish swim in the water, a golden fish swim in the red coral.", "pred": "The video displays a sunlit, vibrant coral reef teeming with diverse fish, including clownfish near anemones, while a solo piano plays a gentle, melodic tune in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a sunlit, vibrant coral reef teeming with diverse fish, including clownfish near anemones, while a solo piano plays a gentle, melodic tune in the background.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a sunlit, vibrant coral reef teeming with diverse fish, including clownfish near anemones, while a solo piano plays a gentle, melodic tune in the background.\", \"The video presents an underwater view of a coral reef populated by orange-and-white clownfish, while the audio features a solo piano playing a slow, gentle, and somewhat melancholic melody.\", \"Observing the visual scene, a vibrant coral reef teems with numerous small fish. The camera focuses on a large, fleshy red anemone, within which at least two orange-and-white striped clownfish are visible. The entire scene is set underwater in a blue ocean environment. Simultaneously, the auditory information consists of a solo piano playing a slow, gentle melody. These two sensory streams—the visual of the reef and the audio of the music—are presented together in the video.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A vibrant coral reef teeming with small fish, featuring a prominent red anemone housing clownfish, is accompanied by a slow, gentle piano melody.}\", \"The video displays an underwater coral reef with fish and a red anemone, while the audio features a solo piano playing a slow, gentle melody.\"]", "time_sec": 56.38, "generation_time_seconds": 54.9722, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "476", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a white vest sat talking on a red track as he spoke and the insects barked.", "pred": "A young man with blond hair, wearing a white tank top and black shorts, sits on a red running track. He looks at the camera and speaks, while the sound of wind and his voice are audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young man with blond hair, wearing a white tank top and black shorts, sits on a red running track. He looks at the camera and speaks, while the sound of wind and his voice are audible.", "cot": "[\"A young man with blond hair, wearing a white tank top and black shorts, sits on a red running track. He looks at the camera and speaks, while the sound of wind and his voice are audible.\", \"A young man in a white tank top and black shorts sits on a red running track, stretching his legs. The audio consists of a person speaking and the sound of wind blowing into the microphone.\", \"A young man in a white tank top and black shorts sits on a red running track, talking and gesturing with his hands, while the sound of wind blowing through trees is heard in the background.\", \"A young man with blond hair, wearing a white tank top, black shorts, and red-and-white athletic shoes, sits on a red running track with his knees drawn up. He is looking to his left and talking, while the audio consists of his speech and the continuous sound of wind.\"]", "time_sec": 45.925, "generation_time_seconds": 45.267, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "477", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "There was a blue bottom, green leaves, pink toy flowers, and the little flower toys kept clicking green leaves up and down.", "pred": "A small, blue, solar-powered potted flower toy with a pink flower and green leaves sits on a windowsill, its leaves slowly moving. Simultaneously, the distinct, rhythmic ticking of a mechanical clock is audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A small, blue, solar-powered potted flower toy with a pink flower and green leaves sits on a windowsill, its leaves slowly moving. Simultaneously, the distinct, rhythmic ticking of a mechanical clock is audible.", "cot": "[\"A small, blue, solar-powered potted flower toy with a pink flower and green leaves sits on a windowsill, its leaves slowly moving. Simultaneously, the distinct, rhythmic ticking of a mechanical clock is audible.\", \"A small, blue, spherical solar-powered toy flower with pink petals and green leaves sits on a windowsill, its leaves and petals slowly moving as a continuous, low-frequency buzzing sound is heard.\", \"A green-lit, blue pot holds a pink-flowered, green-leaved solar-powered plant that is moving. A continuous, low-frequency electronic hum is audible.\", \"The audio contains the continuous sound of crackling fire, while the visual shows a static blue potted flower with a pink bloom, green leaves, and a yellow center. The flower pot has the text 'Flip Flop' printed on it and sits on a light-colored surface.\"]", "time_sec": 44.894, "generation_time_seconds": 44.2878, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 35.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "478", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man was on the grass, hitting the engine open in the bucket with his hand, and then the engine began to work, making a rumble and splashing from the bucket.", "pred": "A small, light-blue outboard motor is mounted on a tripod and submerged in a grey bucket of water on a grassy lawn. A person's hand on the right side operates the motor's throttle, causing the propeller to churn the water. The loud, high-pitched buzzing and whirring of the motor's two-stroke engine starts and then revs up, filling the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A small, light-blue outboard motor is mounted on a tripod and submerged in a grey bucket of water on a grassy lawn. A person's hand on the right side operates the motor's throttle, causing the propeller to churn the water. The loud, high-pitched buzzing and whirring of the motor's two-stroke engine starts and then revs up, filling the audio.", "cot": "[\"A small, light-blue outboard motor is mounted on a tripod and submerged in a grey bucket of water on a grassy lawn. A person's hand on the right side operates the motor's throttle, causing the propeller to churn the water. The loud, high-pitched buzzing and whirring of the motor's two-stroke engine starts and then revs up, filling the audio.\", \"A portable blue outboard motor, labeled 'cruise 'n carry', is mounted on a wooden tripod on a grassy lawn. The motor is submerged in a grey bucket of water and is started by a hand pulling a cord, causing it to churn the water and produce a loud, powerful, low-pitched engine noise.\", \"A hand starts a small, blue portable outboard motor, which begins to churn water in a gray bucket; the high-pitched whine of the engine intensifies into a loud, powerful roar as it revs, accompanied by significant splashing and churning sounds.\", \"A hand pulls the starter cord of a blue portable engine, which is mounted on a wooden frame and submerged in a gray bucket of water, producing a loud, high-pitched whirring sound followed by a sputtering, low-pitched engine idle.\"]", "time_sec": 57.549, "generation_time_seconds": 56.7577, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "479", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a small room, a man made a rattling sound in origami with small paper.", "pred": "A pair of hands folds a white rectangular piece of paper on a wooden surface, accompanied by the clear, crisp rustling of the paper being manipulated.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A pair of hands folds a white rectangular piece of paper on a wooden surface, accompanied by the clear, crisp rustling of the paper being manipulated.", "cot": "[\"A pair of hands folds a white rectangular piece of paper on a wooden surface, accompanied by the clear, crisp rustling of the paper being manipulated.\", \"The video shows a pair of hands folding a white rectangular piece of paper on a wooden surface, accompanied by the distinct, crinkling sounds of the paper being manipulated.\", \"The audio captures the distinct, sharp sound of a knife being used to cut something. Simultaneously, the visual shows a pair of hands folding a piece of white paper on a wooden surface.\", \"A pair of hands folds a rectangular piece of white paper on a wooden surface, accompanied by the distinct crinkling sound of the paper being manipulated.\"]", "time_sec": 38.999, "generation_time_seconds": 38.176, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "480", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man plays the cello on stage, which makes a wonderful sound, surrounded by instruments.", "pred": "An older man with white hair, wearing a grey shirt, plays a double bass in a dimly lit room with a drum kit in the background, while a low, resonant, and rhythmic cello melody is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "An older man with white hair, wearing a grey shirt, plays a double bass in a dimly lit room with a drum kit in the background, while a low, resonant, and rhythmic cello melody is heard.", "cot": "[\"An older man with white hair, wearing a grey shirt, plays a double bass in a dimly lit room with a drum kit in the background, while a low, resonant, and rhythmic cello melody is heard.\", \"A man plays a double bass, creating a deep, rhythmic, and suspenseful musical piece.\", \"A man plays a double bass, the bow dragging across the strings to create a low, resonant sound.\", \"A man in a grey shirt plays a large, wooden upright bass with a bow, producing deep, resonant, and rhythmic notes in a dimly lit room with musical instruments in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 38.616, "generation_time_seconds": 37.759, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "481", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "There were many people in the swimming pool, and a light music filled the whole pool.", "pred": "The video displays a crowded outdoor pool area on a cruise ship under a sunny sky, while the audio consists of upbeat Latin music with percussion and a male vocalist.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a crowded outdoor pool area on a cruise ship under a sunny sky, while the audio consists of upbeat Latin music with percussion and a male vocalist.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a crowded outdoor pool area on a cruise ship under a sunny sky, while the audio consists of upbeat Latin music with percussion and a male vocalist.\", \"The video displays a crowded cruise ship pool deck under a sunny sky, while the audio features upbeat Latin music with percussion and a male vocalist.\", \"The image displays a crowded cruise ship pool deck on a sunny day, while the audio features upbeat Latin music with a prominent, rhythmic cowbell.\", \"A crowded cruise ship pool deck with people swimming and sunbathing is shown, accompanied by upbeat, rhythmic Latin music featuring a prominent keyboard.\"]", "time_sec": 37.257, "generation_time_seconds": 35.7528, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "482", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the city of night, a woman's speech is heard in a video of a large ancient clock clocking at the hour of the hour.", "pred": "At night, the illuminated London Eye and Big Ben are visible as a female narrator announces a countdown, followed by the sound of a large clock chiming.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "At night, the illuminated London Eye and Big Ben are visible as a female narrator announces a countdown, followed by the sound of a large clock chiming.", "cot": "[\"At night, the illuminated London Eye and Big Ben are visible as a female narrator announces a countdown, followed by the sound of a large clock chiming.\", \"The clock face of the Elizabeth Tower, illuminated at night, shows the time as midnight, just as a loud, deep bell begins to toll for a countdown.\", \"The video shows an illuminated London Eye and a large clock as a female announcer begins a countdown, followed by the sound of a large bell tolling.\", \"The London Eye illuminated in blue and the clock face of Big Ben are shown as a large bell tolls, accompanied by a female narrator announcing the start of a countdown.\"]", "time_sec": 38.054, "generation_time_seconds": 37.3455, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "483", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the spacious room, a baby sits in a crib, his mother coughing to attract his attention.", "pred": "A baby in a crib looks up and to the side. A person says \"tchau, tchau, tchau\" in Portuguese, followed by a series of coughs.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A baby in a crib looks up and to the side. A person says \"tchau, tchau, tchau\" in Portuguese, followed by a series of coughs.", "cot": "[\"A baby in a crib looks up and to the side. A person says \\\"tchau, tchau, tchau\\\" in Portuguese, followed by a series of coughs.\", \"A baby in a striped shirt sits inside a wooden playpen, looking around, accompanied by a coughing sound and a person saying \\\"tchau, tchau, tchau\\\" in Portuguese.\", \"A baby in a striped shirt sits in a crib, looking towards the right as a person speaks and then coughs.\", \"A baby sits inside a wooden crib; a person off-screen speaks in Portuguese, saying \\\"tchau\\\" (bye), followed by a series of loud, wet coughs.\"]", "time_sec": 39.676, "generation_time_seconds": 39.0315, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "484", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On the lake, surrounded by mountains, a man sat on a boat with his mobile phone out of his hand to photograph the landscape, as the horn rang in the reverberating mountains.", "pred": "A person leans out of a boat's window, holding a phone to record a scenic view of a mist-covered lake and surrounding mountains, while a loud, sustained horn from the boat sounds twice.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person leans out of a boat's window, holding a phone to record a scenic view of a mist-covered lake and surrounding mountains, while a loud, sustained horn from the boat sounds twice.", "cot": "[\"A person leans out of a boat's window, holding a phone to record a scenic view of a mist-covered lake and surrounding mountains, while a loud, sustained horn from the boat sounds twice.\", \"A person stands on a boat, holding a phone and waving, as the boat travels on a lake shrouded in mist, with mountains visible in the background, while a loud, sustained, and mournful horn, like a foghorn or a ship's horn, sounds in the distance.\", \"A person on a boat extends their arm out the side, holding a white object, while a loud, brassy horn sounds over the misty lake and mountains.\", \"A person on a boat leans out the window, waving a white object, as a loud, sustained horn, similar to a foghorn or ship's horn, blares repeatedly over the water.\"]", "time_sec": 44.808, "generation_time_seconds": 44.1642, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "485", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Fireworks in the night sky accompanied by firecrackers, blooming colorful flowers, a man talking to himself.", "pred": "A series of fireworks explode in the dark night sky, creating bright trails of light. This is accompanied by a loud, rapid-fire sound resembling gunfire.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A series of fireworks explode in the dark night sky, creating bright trails of light. This is accompanied by a loud, rapid-fire sound resembling gunfire.", "cot": "[\"A series of fireworks explode in the dark night sky, creating bright trails of light. This is accompanied by a loud, rapid-fire sound resembling gunfire.\", \"The audio features the loud, rapid-fire sound of automatic gunfire, while the visual shows a display of fireworks exploding with green and red trails in a dark night sky.\", \"A series of bright, colorful fireworks explode in a night sky, accompanied by a loud, sustained, and chaotic barrage of gunfire.\", \"A sustained barrage of rapid, percussive gunfire erupts, followed by a single, sharp metallic clink, all while a multi-colored firework display explodes and fades in the dark night sky.\"]", "time_sec": 38.066, "generation_time_seconds": 37.0724, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.63, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "486", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A train was running on the tracks, and people were talking.", "pred": "A first-person view from a moving steam train shows the wooden cabin and black front boiler, while a loud, high-pitched metallic screech is heard, followed by a low, guttural growl and a horn blast.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A first-person view from a moving steam train shows the wooden cabin and black front boiler, while a loud, high-pitched metallic screech is heard, followed by a low, guttural growl and a horn blast.", "cot": "[\"A first-person view from a moving steam train shows the wooden cabin and black front boiler, while a loud, high-pitched metallic screech is heard, followed by a low, guttural growl and a horn blast.\", \"The video shows a first-person view from a moving train, with a steam locomotive and its operator visible ahead. Loud, rhythmic clanking and chugging sounds from the train dominate, accompanied by a continuous hiss of steam and ambient sounds of an outdoor environment.\", \"The visual shows a point-of-view shot from inside a moving train car, revealing a wooden structure, tracks, and surrounding scenery. Simultaneously, the audio features the loud, metallic clatter and rhythmic chugging of the train's wheels and engine, accompanied by the excited shouts of children. The combination of these sensory inputs strongly indicates the train is an amusement park ride.\", \"A small, open-sided train with a black front moves forward along a track. The operator, wearing a white hat and red shirt, is visible at the front. The train passes by structures resembling a mine, including a wooden building with a lamp and a large orange mining machine. In the background, trees and bushes are visible. The sound of the train moving on the tracks is prominent, accompanied by human speech.\"]", "time_sec": 59.77, "generation_time_seconds": 58.7936, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.2, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "487", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a man in a short-sleeved top sat in a chair talking and eating cookies.", "pred": "A man in a dark polo shirt sits in a chair and speaks, stating that something was better than he thought it would be and that he originally felt the premise was a little thin.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a dark polo shirt sits in a chair and speaks, stating that something was better than he thought it would be and that he originally felt the premise was a little thin.", "cot": "[\"A man in a dark polo shirt sits in a chair and speaks, stating that something was better than he thought it would be and that he originally felt the premise was a little thin.\", \"A man in a dark polo shirt sits in a chair, gesturing with his hands as he speaks, stating that something was better than he thought it would be and that he originally felt the premise was thin.\", \"A man in a dark blue polo shirt sits in a chair, speaking and gesturing with his hands as he expresses that something was better than he expected and admits he originally thought the premise was a little thin.\", \"A man in a black polo shirt sits in a chair, speaking and gesturing with his hands, while a dog barks faintly in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 42.423, "generation_time_seconds": 41.7384, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "488", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the small room, two doctors were treating the girl's teeth, and the drill hissed.", "pred": "A dentist and an assistant treat a young girl in a dental chair, where a high-pitched whirring from a dental drill is heard, accompanied by a male voice saying, \"Okay, let's get 'em polished all nice for you.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A dentist and an assistant treat a young girl in a dental chair, where a high-pitched whirring from a dental drill is heard, accompanied by a male voice saying, \"Okay, let's get 'em polished all nice for you.\"", "cot": "[\"A dentist and an assistant treat a young girl in a dental chair, where a high-pitched whirring from a dental drill is heard, accompanied by a male voice saying, \\\"Okay, let's get 'em polished all nice for you.\\\"\", \"A dentist and assistant are treating a patient in a dental chair. The dentist speaks, saying, \\\"Okay, let's get 'em polished all nice for you,\\\" before a dental drill is activated.\", \"A dentist polishes a patient's teeth in a dental chair while a dental assistant holds a suction tube, and the sound of a dental drill is heard after a male voice says, \\\"Let's get 'em polished all nice for you.\\\"\", \"In a dental operatory, a dentist and an assistant are treating a young patient, while a male voice says, \\\"Okay, let's get 'em polished all nice for you,\\\" followed by the sound of a dental drill.\"]", "time_sec": 46.65, "generation_time_seconds": 45.7829, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "489", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a man spoke, outside a sheep licked the dog lying on the ground and bleated.", "pred": "A grey goat stands and sniffs a large, white, furry dog that is sleeping on the ground next to a green bucket.\nThe audio contains a person speaking, identifying the animals as Gypsy and her kid, while the bleating of goats and a dog's whine are heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A grey goat stands and sniffs a large, white, furry dog that is sleeping on the ground next to a green bucket.\nThe audio contains a person speaking, identifying the animals as Gypsy and her kid, while the bleating of goats and a dog's whine are heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A grey goat stands and sniffs a large, white, furry dog that is sleeping on the ground next to a green bucket.\\nThe audio contains a person speaking, identifying the animals as Gypsy and her kid, while the bleating of goats and a dog's whine are heard in the background.\", \"A large, fluffy white dog and a small black and white puppy lie sleeping on hay in a pen next to a grey goat, while a person speaks and a goat bleats.\", \"A gray goat stands beside a large, white, furry dog that is lying down and sleeping on a bed of hay, while the goat briefly nudges the dog's head and the sound of a bleating goat is heard.\", \"The audio features a person speaking about a white dog, a goat named Gypsy, and a baby goat, while the corresponding visual shows a large white dog sleeping on the ground next to a grey goat and a small black and white baby goat, with a green bucket nearby.\"]", "time_sec": 48.755, "generation_time_seconds": 48.1544, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "490", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In midair, the windmill was spinning fast, making a clicking sound and some text was appear.", "pred": "\\boxed{A still image of a wind turbine is accompanied by the loud, continuous rushing sound of strong wind.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The provided image is a static frame showing a wind turbine with overlaid text explaining that the noise of such a device is familiar to boaters. The audio consists of the continuous, low-frequency rushing sound of strong wind, which is corroborated by the on-screen text. The sound of the wind is the dominant auditory element, and there are no sounds of the turbine's blades rotating or any other environmental noise. The visual and auditory information together depict the experience of being near a wind turbine during a high-wind event.\n\n\\boxed{A still image of a wind turbine is accompanied by the loud, continuous rushing sound of strong wind.}", "cot": "[\"The provided image is a static frame showing a wind turbine with overlaid text explaining that the noise of such a device is familiar to boaters. The audio consists of the continuous, low-frequency rushing sound of strong wind, which is corroborated by the on-screen text. The sound of the wind is the dominant auditory element, and there are no sounds of the turbine's blades rotating or any other environmental noise. The visual and auditory information together depict the experience of being near a wind turbine during a high-wind event.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A still image of a wind turbine is accompanied by the loud, continuous rushing sound of strong wind.}\", \"A multi-bladed wind turbine spins rapidly against a cloudy sky, its motion creating a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine that is completely masked by the even louder roar of strong wind.\", \"A small, three-bladed wind turbine spins rapidly against a cloudy sky, accompanied by a loud, constant, high-pitched whirring sound.\", \"The video displays a spinning three-bladed wind turbine against a cloudy sky, accompanied by the loud, continuous roaring sound of strong wind.\"]", "time_sec": 53.116, "generation_time_seconds": 52.5472, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "491", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Inside the playground, the beautiful fireworks spread out in the air, and the onlookers cheered.", "pred": "The video shows a series of colorful fireworks exploding in a dark night sky, while the audio captures a loud, chaotic roar of a large crowd screaming and cheering in excitement.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a series of colorful fireworks exploding in a dark night sky, while the audio captures a loud, chaotic roar of a large crowd screaming and cheering in excitement.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a series of colorful fireworks exploding in a dark night sky, while the audio captures a loud, chaotic roar of a large crowd screaming and cheering in excitement.\", \"The video shows a large, colorful fireworks display exploding in a dark night sky, while the audio captures the sharp, loud report of the explosions and the subsequent cheering and shouting of a large crowd in the background.\", \"Multiple fireworks burst in the dark sky, creating a shower of golden and white sparks, while a loud, sustained, high-pitched electronic tone plays in the background.\", \"A massive, multi-colored fireworks display erupts in the dark sky, accompanied by the loud, continuous roar of the crowd and the sharp, percussive reports of the explosions.\"]", "time_sec": 40.472, "generation_time_seconds": 39.8328, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "492", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A forklift jammed into an abandoned car and rumbled in a field full of waste.", "pred": "A large yellow vehicle lifts a blue SUV into a metal container, while the sound of a powerful engine or hydraulic system operates in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large yellow vehicle lifts a blue SUV into a metal container, while the sound of a powerful engine or hydraulic system operates in the background.", "cot": "[\"A large yellow vehicle lifts a blue SUV into a metal container, while the sound of a powerful engine or hydraulic system operates in the background.\", \"A blue SUV is being crushed by a yellow mechanical arm in a junkyard, accompanied by the loud, grinding noise of the machinery.\", \"A blue and silver SUV is being crushed by a yellow hydraulic press at what sounds like a scrapyard.\", \"A blue SUV is being crushed by a large yellow hydraulic press at a junkyard, while the loud, continuous roar of the machinery operates in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 36.013, "generation_time_seconds": 34.2944, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "493", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A car was parked on a fumes road, and several men came up and got in before making the sound of the car's engine starting.", "pred": "A light-colored sedan is parked on a dusty dirt road next to a person.\n The engine starts, the car accelerates, and the sound of tires crunching on the loose surface is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A light-colored sedan is parked on a dusty dirt road next to a person.\n The engine starts, the car accelerates, and the sound of tires crunching on the loose surface is heard.", "cot": "[\"A light-colored sedan is parked on a dusty dirt road next to a person.\\n The engine starts, the car accelerates, and the sound of tires crunching on the loose surface is heard.\", \"A light-colored vintage car drives forward on a dirt road, kicking up dust, and then stops. A person in dark clothing stands beside the vehicle. The audio begins with the sound of footsteps, followed by the distinct rustling of a car door opening and the metallic creak of the car's suspension as it settles.\", \"A light-colored sedan is stopped on a dusty dirt road with one person standing by the front driver's side door and another person in the back seat. A loud, deep engine roars to life, and the car accelerates away, kicking up a large cloud of dust.\", \"A light-colored sedan is parked on a dusty road next to a person, with trees in the background. The audio consists of footsteps on a hard surface, the distinct sound of a car door opening and closing, and a final electronic chime.\"]", "time_sec": 50.684, "generation_time_seconds": 49.731, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.3, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "494", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man plays the cello in the room, and a makes wonderful music.", "pred": "A young man in a white t-shirt plays a brown cello with a bow in a room with a brown wall, a black cello case, and a black speaker, producing a clear, resonant, and melancholic melody.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young man in a white t-shirt plays a brown cello with a bow in a room with a brown wall, a black cello case, and a black speaker, producing a clear, resonant, and melancholic melody.", "cot": "[\"A young man in a white t-shirt plays a brown cello with a bow in a room with a brown wall, a black cello case, and a black speaker, producing a clear, resonant, and melancholic melody.\", \"The video shows a man playing a double bass, which is accompanied by the sound of a cello.\", \"A young man is shown playing a cello, and the audio consists of the deep, resonant tones of the cello being played.\", \"A man in a white t-shirt plays a cello in a room with tan walls. A black instrument case stands to his left, and a speaker on a stand is to his right. The audio consists of the deep, resonant, and melancholic sound of the cello being played.\"]", "time_sec": 41.822, "generation_time_seconds": 40.9765, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "495", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man rides his bike on the outdoor playground talking, then rides across the railing and gets stuck, and a man's laugh comes from beside him.and background so many peoples are there.", "pred": "A young man in a yellow shirt and helmet on a BMX bike speaks before grinding the rail, which produces a loud, high-pitched metallic scraping sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young man in a yellow shirt and helmet on a BMX bike speaks before grinding the rail, which produces a loud, high-pitched metallic scraping sound.", "cot": "[\"A young man in a yellow shirt and helmet on a BMX bike speaks before grinding the rail, which produces a loud, high-pitched metallic scraping sound.\", \"A person wearing a yellow shirt and a helmet is at a skatepark. They are standing next to a bike and then ride the bike over a rail. A male voice speaks about doing a double peg over grind, followed by the loud, high-pitched sound of metal scraping against metal.\", \"A young man wearing a yellow t-shirt and a helmet on a BMX bike at a skatepark speaks to the camera, then rides to a grind rail and performs a trick, producing the distinct sound of metal scraping against metal.\", \"A man in a yellow shirt and helmet prepares to ride his bike at a skate park, then grinds down a metal rail, creating a loud, sustained screeching sound.\"]", "time_sec": 44.968, "generation_time_seconds": 44.0322, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "496", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "To the music, a crowd beat and cheered on the ground.", "pred": "The scene is a wide shot of a massive crowd gathered for a nighttime outdoor concert, with many people raising their hands towards a brightly lit stage area in the distance, while the audio consists of loud, fast-paced electronic dance music with a prominent drum beat and synthesized melodies.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The scene is a wide shot of a massive crowd gathered for a nighttime outdoor concert, with many people raising their hands towards a brightly lit stage area in the distance, while the audio consists of loud, fast-paced electronic dance music with a prominent drum beat and synthesized melodies.", "cot": "[\"The scene is a wide shot of a massive crowd gathered for a nighttime outdoor concert, with many people raising their hands towards a brightly lit stage area in the distance, while the audio consists of loud, fast-paced electronic dance music with a prominent drum beat and synthesized melodies.\", \"The visual shows a massive, dark crowd at a nighttime outdoor concert, illuminated by distant stage lights and a hot air balloon, while the audio features upbeat instrumental music with a prominent synthesizer melody.\", \"The video shows a massive crowd of people at a nighttime outdoor concert, with numerous hands raised towards a brightly lit stage in the distance. Simultaneously, the audio features an energetic, fast-paced electronic dance music track with a driving beat and a repeating synth melody.\", \"The video shows a massive crowd at a nighttime outdoor concert, their arms raised under bright stage lights, while a loud, fast-paced electronic dance music track with a heavy beat and synth melodies plays.\"]", "time_sec": 47.426, "generation_time_seconds": 46.3807, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "497", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the sound of the wind, a ship slowly stopped in the water.", "pred": "A small white and green tugboat with a red crew member is seen from the deck of a larger vessel, moving through choppy, turquoise water under a bright sky, while the loud, rushing sound of strong wind is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A small white and green tugboat with a red crew member is seen from the deck of a larger vessel, moving through choppy, turquoise water under a bright sky, while the loud, rushing sound of strong wind is heard.", "cot": "[\"A small white and green tugboat with a red crew member is seen from the deck of a larger vessel, moving through choppy, turquoise water under a bright sky, while the loud, rushing sound of strong wind is heard.\", \"A white tugboat with red and yellow accents cuts through choppy, deep green water under a bright, partly cloudy sky, creating a large, swirling wake. Strong, gusting wind creates a loud, buffeting roar in the audio.\", \"A boat with a white and yellow cabin moves through choppy blue water, creating a large white wake, while the loud, constant sound of wind is heard.\", \"A large white and yellow tugboat moves across choppy blue water, creating a large wake, while a person in a red jacket stands on the deck. The dominant sound is a loud, powerful, and continuous roar of rushing air, characteristic of being on a vessel moving at high speed.\"]", "time_sec": 46.4, "generation_time_seconds": 45.6921, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "498", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the sheep bleating sound and the cage, several black and white sheep bleat.", "pred": "A black and white goat stands in a dirt pen behind a wire fence, while the audio features the distinct bleating of goats and a single, sharp slap.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black and white goat stands in a dirt pen behind a wire fence, while the audio features the distinct bleating of goats and a single, sharp slap.", "cot": "[\"A black and white goat stands in a dirt pen behind a wire fence, while the audio features the distinct bleating of goats and a single, sharp slap.\", \"A black and white goat stands in a pen with a concrete wall and wire mesh fencing, while the audio captures the distinct bleating of multiple goats.\", \"The audio features the distinct bleating of goats, and the visual confirms this, showing multiple black and white goats within an enclosure, with one small kid standing in the foreground.\", \"The scene shows a black and white goat standing in a dirt pen next to a white wall and a chain-link fence. The goat bleats repeatedly, and another goat is visible behind the fence.\"]", "time_sec": 39.108, "generation_time_seconds": 38.5012, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "499", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man teased the pigeon in the wooden box and made a cooing pigeon cry.", "pred": "The video shows a close-up of a black-and-white bird's head inside a wooden enclosure, which is then followed by a view of a grey pigeon standing on the floor. The audio consists of the cooing and wing-flapping of multiple pigeons and doves, accompanied by a prominent, high-pitched insect chirp.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of a black-and-white bird's head inside a wooden enclosure, which is then followed by a view of a grey pigeon standing on the floor. The audio consists of the cooing and wing-flapping of multiple pigeons and doves, accompanied by a prominent, high-pitched insect chirp.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a close-up of a black-and-white bird's head inside a wooden enclosure, which is then followed by a view of a grey pigeon standing on the floor. The audio consists of the cooing and wing-flapping of multiple pigeons and doves, accompanied by a prominent, high-pitched insect chirp.\", \"A hand places a black and white bird into a wooden box. A white pigeon is already inside. The sound of pig oinking is heard.\", \"The audio features prominent pig grunting and snorting sounds. Visually, a person's hand holds a black and white bird inside a wooden enclosure. A white bird is also present in the enclosure, and a white bottle is visible on the wooden floor.\", \"The video shows a person's hand holding a black and white bird inside a wooden structure, which is immediately followed by a loud, deep, guttural roar that sounds like a large animal.\"]", "time_sec": 47.083, "generation_time_seconds": 46.4147, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "500", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man stood on the ground and sprayed water into the wall with a water sprayer, which whirled.", "pred": "A person wearing a white shirt and blue jeans stands outdoors in front of a brick wall and a window. They are holding a long, black pole-like tool. A loud, low-pitched engine rumble is heard throughout the clip.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing a white shirt and blue jeans stands outdoors in front of a brick wall and a window. They are holding a long, black pole-like tool. A loud, low-pitched engine rumble is heard throughout the clip.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing a white shirt and blue jeans stands outdoors in front of a brick wall and a window. They are holding a long, black pole-like tool. A loud, low-pitched engine rumble is heard throughout the clip.\", \"A man in a white shirt and jeans uses a pressure washer to clean a brick wall beside a window, while the loud, high-pitched whine of the machine's engine dominates the audio.\", \"A person in a white shirt and jeans uses a pressure washer on a brick wall, while the loud, continuous sound of a nearby vehicle engine idles.\", \"A person in a white shirt and jeans uses a pressure washer on a wall, producing a loud, high-pitched whirring sound from the machine.\"]", "time_sec": 41.028, "generation_time_seconds": 40.286, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "501", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "By a roadside Bush, there were three elephants, two of them walking, the baby sitting on the ground, beside the buzzing of flies.", "pred": "A large elephant and a small elephant calf stand on a dirt road next to green bushes, while the distinct buzzing sound of a swarm of insects is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large elephant and a small elephant calf stand on a dirt road next to green bushes, while the distinct buzzing sound of a swarm of insects is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A large elephant and a small elephant calf stand on a dirt road next to green bushes, while the distinct buzzing sound of a swarm of insects is heard in the background.\", \"An adult elephant walks along a dirt path, followed by a baby elephant, while the continuous buzzing of an insect and a low, sustained horn sound are heard in the background.\", \"Two elephants, an adult and a baby, walk together on a dirt path. The adult elephant uses its trunk to touch the baby elephant, which is walking beside the adult. The entire scene is accompanied by the continuous buzzing sound of insects.\", \"A baby elephant sits on a dirt path next to an adult elephant, with the distinct buzzing of insects audible in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 39.999, "generation_time_seconds": 39.0825, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.45, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "502", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "At night, the house was burned, and the fire was so bright that it crackled.", "pred": "The audio contains the sound of a crackling fire, which corresponds to the visual of a large building completely engulfed in bright orange flames at night.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio contains the sound of a crackling fire, which corresponds to the visual of a large building completely engulfed in bright orange flames at night.", "cot": "[\"The audio contains the sound of a crackling fire, which corresponds to the visual of a large building completely engulfed in bright orange flames at night.\", \"The audio features the distinct, rhythmic clatter of a train moving on tracks. Simultaneously, the video shows a large building completely engulfed in intense, bright orange flames, with the fire violently consuming it against a pitch-black night sky.\", \"The scene is a large building completely engulfed in intense orange flames at night, while the audio consists of the sound of flowing water.\", \"A large building is fully engulfed in intense orange flames at night, while the sound of heavy rain falling and splashing is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 38.636, "generation_time_seconds": 37.9802, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "503", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A bird fluttered its wings back and forth in its cage, making a clap and a hoof cry.", "pred": "A small bird with a yellow and black body is inside a wire cage. The cage contains a perch and a small dish. The bird hops around inside the cage. The sound of a loud, low-frequency mechanical hum is present in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A small bird with a yellow and black body is inside a wire cage. The cage contains a perch and a small dish. The bird hops around inside the cage. The sound of a loud, low-frequency mechanical hum is present in the background.", "cot": "[\"A small bird with a yellow and black body is inside a wire cage. The cage contains a perch and a small dish. The bird hops around inside the cage. The sound of a loud, low-frequency mechanical hum is present in the background.\", \"The video shows two birds inside a wire cage, while the audio captures the sound of strong wind blowing, accompanied by the distinct bleating of a goat.\", \"Inside a metal cage, a grey bird with a red beak stands on a perch, while a black and white bird is visible below. The loud, rhythmic clanking of metal collides with the sharp, resonant peal of a bell.\", \"Inside a wooden birdcage, a grey and white bird and a smaller dark bird are moving around. The distinct sound of a rooster crowing is heard, mixed with the flapping of wings and a faint, low-frequency engine rumble in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 46.437, "generation_time_seconds": 45.8053, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "504", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A little baby was sitting on a stool,  and making sound.", "pred": "A baby sits on a white potty in a crib as an adult speaks to it in a gentle tone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A baby sits on a white potty in a crib as an adult speaks to it in a gentle tone.", "cot": "[\"A baby sits on a white potty in a crib as an adult speaks to it in a gentle tone.\", \"A baby wearing a white and red patterned onesie sits on a person's lap, positioned as if sitting in a white high chair, while the person's arm and hand are visible holding the baby, and the person is heard speaking to the baby in a comforting tone.\", \"A baby in a white patterned onesie sits on an adult's lap next to a white crib. A male voice speaks, followed by the baby cooing and making gurgling sounds.\", \"A baby sits on a white changing table next to a crib, and a man speaks to it as the baby makes soft vocalizations.\"]", "time_sec": 40.994, "generation_time_seconds": 39.6487, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "505", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man pushed the clock with his hand, and the clock was shaking and ringing outside.", "pred": "A large, greenish-brown bell inside a stone structure is struck, producing a series of loud, metallic, resonant clangs with a long decay.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large, greenish-brown bell inside a stone structure is struck, producing a series of loud, metallic, resonant clangs with a long decay.", "cot": "[\"A large, greenish-brown bell inside a stone structure is struck, producing a series of loud, metallic, resonant clangs with a long decay.\", \"A massive, green-tinted metal bell is struck by a clapper, producing a loud, sustained, and resonant metallic ringing sound that echoes within what appears to be a stone bell tower.\", \"A large, green bell is suspended within a mechanical apparatus featuring a large wheel; it is then struck by a hammer, producing a loud, resonant, metallic ringing sound.\", \"A large, green-patinated bell is rotating within a mechanical bell-ringing apparatus, while a high-pitched, metallic bell is ringing repeatedly.\"]", "time_sec": 40.013, "generation_time_seconds": 38.9043, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "506", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On a white carpet, a  fan swung and blew, with the wind.", "pred": "The audio features a continuous, low-frequency buzzing sound. Simultaneously, the video shows a small, vintage-style electric fan with a metal cage resting on a light-colored carpet.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features a continuous, low-frequency buzzing sound. Simultaneously, the video shows a small, vintage-style electric fan with a metal cage resting on a light-colored carpet.", "cot": "[\"The audio features a continuous, low-frequency buzzing sound. Simultaneously, the video shows a small, vintage-style electric fan with a metal cage resting on a light-colored carpet.\", \"A vintage, wire-caged electric fan with a dark base sits on a light-colored carpet. The fan blade is rotating at high speed, and the sound of its motor is audible.\", \"A static, vintage-style electric fan sits on a light-colored carpet. Its blades are spinning rapidly, creating a blur. The fan is positioned in front of a patterned curtain or sofa, and its power cord trails behind it on the floor. The sound is a continuous, low-frequency, buzzing mechanical hum, consistent with a running electric motor.\", \"A vintage metal-caged fan is operating on a light-colored carpet, producing a loud, continuous buzzing sound.\"]", "time_sec": 43.485, "generation_time_seconds": 42.9195, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "507", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On the flat ground, a dog whimpered, leaning its head.", "pred": "The video shows a black and white goat standing on a mat and looking over a barrier, while its bleating vocalizations are heard in the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a black and white goat standing on a mat and looking over a barrier, while its bleating vocalizations are heard in the audio.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a black and white goat standing on a mat and looking over a barrier, while its bleating vocalizations are heard in the audio.\", \"A small black and white goat stands on a doormat, looking at the camera, then walks away as a person speaks in the background.\", \"A black and white goat is seen standing on a doormat, then it lowers its head and butts it against a low, dark green wall or gate; simultaneously, the goat emits a loud, high-pitched bleating sound.\", \"A black and white goat stands on a doormat and bleats loudly, while a person speaks in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 38.632, "generation_time_seconds": 38.0351, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "508", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "There was music in the room, and a dog was playing with balloons on the ground, and laughter and talk were heard and there so many chairs .", "pred": "In a dimly lit room, a dog excitedly plays with a pile of colorful balloons, while in the background, multiple people can be heard talking and laughing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "In a dimly lit room, a dog excitedly plays with a pile of colorful balloons, while in the background, multiple people can be heard talking and laughing.", "cot": "[\"In a dimly lit room, a dog excitedly plays with a pile of colorful balloons, while in the background, multiple people can be heard talking and laughing.\", \"A dog investigates a box filled with colorful balloons, while people laugh and speak in the background.\", \"A brown dog runs around a cluttered room with colorful balloons, while a person laughs and shouts encouragement in the background.\", \"A dog leaps into a cardboard box filled with colorful Easter eggs, while a person laughs and shouts nearby.\"]", "time_sec": 32.891, "generation_time_seconds": 32.1315, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "509", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A vacuum cleaner on the ground is cleaning the ground.", "pred": "The visual shows a small, white robotic vacuum cleaner on a dark brown rug in a room with light-colored wooden flooring.\n Simultaneously, the audio captures the loud, high-pitched whirring of the vacuum cleaner's motor as it operates.\n The sound is consistent with the visual of the active cleaning appliance.\n\n\\boxed{A robotic vacuum cleaner operates on a dark rug, producing a loud, high-pitched whirring sound.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The visual shows a small, white robotic vacuum cleaner on a dark brown rug in a room with light-colored wooden flooring.\n Simultaneously, the audio captures the loud, high-pitched whirring of the vacuum cleaner's motor as it operates.\n The sound is consistent with the visual of the active cleaning appliance.\n\n\\boxed{A robotic vacuum cleaner operates on a dark rug, producing a loud, high-pitched whirring sound.}", "cot": "[\"The visual shows a small, white robotic vacuum cleaner on a dark brown rug in a room with light-colored wooden flooring.\\n Simultaneously, the audio captures the loud, high-pitched whirring of the vacuum cleaner's motor as it operates.\\n The sound is consistent with the visual of the active cleaning appliance.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A robotic vacuum cleaner operates on a dark rug, producing a loud, high-pitched whirring sound.}\", \"A white and grey robotic vacuum cleaner with a blue top moves across a dark brown rug on a light brown wooden floor, while the distinct high-pitched whirring of its motor is audible.\", \"The audio captures the sound of a vacuum cleaner starting up and running, which corresponds to the visual of a robotic vacuum cleaner moving on a wooden floor.\", \"A white robotic vacuum cleaner operates on a dark brown rug, its wheels making a distinct whirring sound as it moves across the floor.\"]", "time_sec": 47.041, "generation_time_seconds": 45.9276, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "510", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A flock of turkeys was walking on the green grass, and a woman's voice came from beside them. and in screen text also came.", "pred": "The scene features white turkeys in a green, grassy field with white flowers, while on-screen text proclaims \"Certified Organic\" and \"raised on GREEN pasture soy-free Cocofeed.\" A narrator describes the birds as being raised on pasture and fed a soy-free mixture that includes coconut.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The scene features white turkeys in a green, grassy field with white flowers, while on-screen text proclaims \"Certified Organic\" and \"raised on GREEN pasture soy-free Cocofeed.\" A narrator describes the birds as being raised on pasture and fed a soy-free mixture that includes coconut.", "cot": "[\"The scene features white turkeys in a green, grassy field with white flowers, while on-screen text proclaims \\\"Certified Organic\\\" and \\\"raised on GREEN pasture soy-free Cocofeed.\\\" A narrator describes the birds as being raised on pasture and fed a soy-free mixture that includes coconut.\", \"The video displays white turkeys in a grassy field with superimposed text, while a voiceover describes a product as \\\"Certified Organic,\\\" \\\"raised on GREEN pasture,\\\" and \\\"soy-free Cocofeed.\\\"\", \"The video displays white turkeys in a grassy field while an off-screen narrator describes them as certified organic, raised on green pasture, and fed a soy-free diet that includes coconut.\", \"The video displays white turkeys in a green, flower-filled pasture while a narrator describes the birds as certified organic, pasture-raised, and fed a soy-free, coconut-based diet.\"]", "time_sec": 47.5, "generation_time_seconds": 46.2035, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "511", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the concert hall, a group of men in black were playing with the drumming.", "pred": "An orchestra performs a piece of music featuring a prominent brass section, including French horns and trumpets, accompanied by rhythmic percussion, in front of a seated audience.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "An orchestra performs a piece of music featuring a prominent brass section, including French horns and trumpets, accompanied by rhythmic percussion, in front of a seated audience.", "cot": "[\"An orchestra performs a piece of music featuring a prominent brass section, including French horns and trumpets, accompanied by rhythmic percussion, in front of a seated audience.\", \"A large orchestra performs a dramatic, powerful piece of music in a concert hall, featuring a prominent percussionist striking large timpani drums, while an audience watches from tiered seating.\", \"An orchestra performs on a stage before an audience, with musicians playing brass, woodwinds, strings, and percussion instruments as a timpanist strikes a large timpani drum, all accompanied by the sound of a loud, percussive brass fanfare.\", \"An orchestra performs in a concert hall, with percussionists actively playing timpani and cymbals while brass and woodwind musicians play their instruments, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic, and percussive music of the ensemble.\"]", "time_sec": 44.26, "generation_time_seconds": 43.2608, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "512", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the studio, a man laughing and making sound, and his back is blue.", "pred": "A man in a suit is seen laughing on a television screen, accompanied by a distinct, continuous buzzing sound from the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a suit is seen laughing on a television screen, accompanied by a distinct, continuous buzzing sound from the audio.", "cot": "[\"A man in a suit is seen laughing on a television screen, accompanied by a distinct, continuous buzzing sound from the audio.\", \"A man in a dark suit and tie laughs heartily on a television set with a blue backdrop, covering his mouth, while the CNN logo and the show title 'The Ridiculist' are visible; this is accompanied by the sound of a dog panting and whimpering nearby.\", \"A man in a suit laughs heartily, covering his mouth and nose with his hand, while the sound of a person laughing is heard.\\n\\\\boxed{A man in a suit laughs heartily, covering his mouth and nose with his hand.}\", \"A man in a dark suit and tie is smiling and laughing while covering his mouth with his hand. Overlapping this, the distinct sound of a horse whinnying can be heard in the audio.\"]", "time_sec": 44.595, "generation_time_seconds": 44.0695, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "513", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the zoo, as if, amid the sound of birdsong, an animal, waving its tail.", "pred": "A dense forest at dusk is shown, featuring a paved path and a small structure.\n Simultaneously, the prominent sound of a high-pitched, rhythmic cricket or katydid chorus is heard, creating an ambient nighttime atmosphere.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A dense forest at dusk is shown, featuring a paved path and a small structure.\n Simultaneously, the prominent sound of a high-pitched, rhythmic cricket or katydid chorus is heard, creating an ambient nighttime atmosphere.", "cot": "[\"A dense forest at dusk is shown, featuring a paved path and a small structure.\\n Simultaneously, the prominent sound of a high-pitched, rhythmic cricket or katydid chorus is heard, creating an ambient nighttime atmosphere.\", \"At dusk, a paved path winds through a dense, dark green tropical forest, with a small, dark animal walking away from the camera. The scene is accompanied by a constant, high-pitched chorus of numerous crickets and cicadas chirping.\", \"A dark, shaky camera pans across a paved path in a dense, tropical forest at dusk, where the prominent sound of a chorus of various birds is heard.\", \"A blurred, dark, low-resolution video shows a paved path in a dense, tropical-looking area with palm trees, a small building on the left, and a fence on the right, while the audio consists of loud, continuous, high-pitched insect chirping.\"]", "time_sec": 46.919, "generation_time_seconds": 46.2938, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "514", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Outside, with ring bells, red lights were on the fence.", "pred": "The image displays a low-angle, grainy night shot of a building's facade, featuring a bright light source, arched windows, and a balcony railing. Simultaneously, the audio consists of a loud, dissonant, and complex peal of many large bells ringing together.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The image displays a low-angle, grainy night shot of a building's facade, featuring a bright light source, arched windows, and a balcony railing. Simultaneously, the audio consists of a loud, dissonant, and complex peal of many large bells ringing together.", "cot": "[\"The image displays a low-angle, grainy night shot of a building's facade, featuring a bright light source, arched windows, and a balcony railing. Simultaneously, the audio consists of a loud, dissonant, and complex peal of many large bells ringing together.\", \"The video shows a shaky, tilted, low-resolution view of a dark building at night lit by a streetlamp, while the audio features the loud, dissonant, and metallic ringing of multiple bells or chimes.\", \"The audio consists of the loud, resonant pealing of a large bell. Visually, the scene is dark with a bright, warm light source on the right, casting a glow on a building with architectural details including a railing and what appears to be a window or archway.\", \"This is a low-quality, tilted nighttime video of a building featuring arched windows, a decorative railing, and a large bright light source, all accompanied by the loud, resonant sound of a large bell or bell tower.\"]", "time_sec": 49.517, "generation_time_seconds": 48.8913, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "515", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a man plays his harmonica affectionately, and posters are plastered against the background.", "pred": "A man in a room plays a harmonica while a band plays blues music in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a room plays a harmonica while a band plays blues music in the background.", "cot": "[\"A man in a room plays a harmonica while a band plays blues music in the background.\", \"A man in a grey and white jacket plays a harmonica in a room with posters on the wall. The sound of an electric guitar, bass, and drums joins him, playing a blues-rock song.\", \"A man plays a harmonica in a room while an upbeat instrumental song featuring a prominent harmonica, guitar, and bass plays.\", \"A man plays a harmonica while gesturing with his right hand, as a blues rock song featuring a prominent electric guitar, bass, and drums plays in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 36.705, "generation_time_seconds": 35.9878, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 52.63, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "516", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "An animal is preying on its prey, and a man is speaking.", "pred": "The audio features the distinct sound of a large crocodilian, likely an alligator, hissing and moving through water, while the accompanying Arabic narration translates to \"It's a luxurious feast.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features the distinct sound of a large crocodilian, likely an alligator, hissing and moving through water, while the accompanying Arabic narration translates to \"It's a luxurious feast.\"", "cot": "[\"The audio features the distinct sound of a large crocodilian, likely an alligator, hissing and moving through water, while the accompanying Arabic narration translates to \\\"It's a luxurious feast.\\\"\", \"The audio states, \\\"إنها وليمة فاخرة\\\" (Inna wa liymatun fakhiira), meaning \\\"It's a lavish feast,\\\" while the visuals show a large, textured, brownish creature, possibly a turtle, moving slowly in a dark, murky, underwater environment with dim, greenish-brown lighting.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a large, brown, textured animal, possibly a caiman, in a dark, murky environment, accompanied by low growling sounds and a male voice speaking in Arabic.\", \"A large, dark-colored alligator with textured skin is seen swimming slowly in murky water, its head and snout breaking the surface. A male voice speaks in Arabic, saying, \\\"إنها وليمة فاخرة\\\" (Indeed, it is a luxurious feast), while a low, ominous rumbling sound plays in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 51.766, "generation_time_seconds": 51.215, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "517", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The two children were sitting on the floor in the room crying, and a woman's voice came from beside them and background toilet flush sound.", "pred": "Two infants in red, black-spotted pajamas sit on a carpet; one cries while the other smiles at the camera as a woman speaks and a loud, continuous, low-pitched electronic beep sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Two infants in red, black-spotted pajamas sit on a carpet; one cries while the other smiles at the camera as a woman speaks and a loud, continuous, low-pitched electronic beep sounds.", "cot": "[\"Two infants in red, black-spotted pajamas sit on a carpet; one cries while the other smiles at the camera as a woman speaks and a loud, continuous, low-pitched electronic beep sounds.\", \"Two infants, dressed in red onesies with black polka dots, sit on a carpeted floor. They are both crying loudly and audibly at the same time. An adult female can be heard speaking in the background.\", \"Two babies in red, black-spotted pajamas are sitting on a beige carpet; one is crying loudly while a woman speaks in the background.\", \"Two babies in red, black-spotted outfits sit on a carpet, one crying loudly while the other looks at the camera, as an off-screen female voice speaks about the difficulty of holding them both.\"]", "time_sec": 42.668, "generation_time_seconds": 41.6534, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.56, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "518", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A string of letters appeared on the screen to the music.", "pred": "The video presents a black screen with white text listing attributes of Jesus, such as 'The Word of God' and 'The Lamb of God,' while a dramatic, orchestral musical score with prominent brass instruments plays in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video presents a black screen with white text listing attributes of Jesus, such as 'The Word of God' and 'The Lamb of God,' while a dramatic, orchestral musical score with prominent brass instruments plays in the background.", "cot": "[\"The video presents a black screen with white text listing attributes of Jesus, such as 'The Word of God' and 'The Lamb of God,' while a dramatic, orchestral musical score with prominent brass instruments plays in the background.\", \"The video displays a sequence of religious epithets for Jesus Christ in white text against a black background, with a red glow behind the word 'JESUS'. The scene is accompanied by solemn and majestic orchestral music featuring prominent brass instruments.\", \"The video displays a sequence of religious titles in white text on a black background, while an orchestral piece of music featuring prominent brass instruments plays.\", \"The audio features a solemn brass band playing a slow, grand, and majestic fanfare. Simultaneously, the video displays a list of religious titles in white text against a black background, each appearing sequentially with a red, glowing light effect behind it.\"]", "time_sec": 44.78, "generation_time_seconds": 44.231, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "519", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman murmured words in her mouth, and the clothes rustled as she moved on her hands.", "pred": "A woman with long blonde hair, wearing a red top, brings her hand to her neck and speaks to the camera, while a person whispers \"thank you\" and the sound of crinkling plastic is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman with long blonde hair, wearing a red top, brings her hand to her neck and speaks to the camera, while a person whispers \"thank you\" and the sound of crinkling plastic is heard.", "cot": "[\"A woman with long blonde hair, wearing a red top, brings her hand to her neck and speaks to the camera, while a person whispers \\\"thank you\\\" and the sound of crinkling plastic is heard.\", \"A woman with long blonde hair, wearing a red top, is shown in a close-up, looking at the camera and gently touching her neck.\", \"A blonde woman in a red top looks at the camera, then the view abruptly shifts to a close-up of a person's feet in dark shoes walking on a gravel path, accompanied by the sound of crunching footsteps and a whispering voice saying, \\\"Let me give you a hug.\\\"\", \"A blonde woman in a red top is shown in a close-up against a dark purple background. She speaks with a soft, breathy whisper, saying \\\"Let me give you a hug,\\\" while the sound of rustling fabric, like a blanket or clothes, is heard in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 46.861, "generation_time_seconds": 46.3143, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "520", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A blue car started on the flat, its engine rumbling.", "pred": "A close-up shows the rear of a blue car with a circular exhaust pipe, while the car's engine is started and revved, producing a loud, deep, and throaty roar.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A close-up shows the rear of a blue car with a circular exhaust pipe, while the car's engine is started and revved, producing a loud, deep, and throaty roar.", "cot": "[\"A close-up shows the rear of a blue car with a circular exhaust pipe, while the car's engine is started and revved, producing a loud, deep, and throaty roar.\", \"A close-up of a blue car's rear shows its exhaust pipe, which emits dark exhaust fumes as the engine starts and then revs loudly.\", \"A blue car's exhaust pipe is shown, followed by the sound of a powerful engine starting and revving aggressively.\", \"A close-up shows the rear of a blue vehicle with a circular exhaust pipe on a gravel surface. A powerful engine starts and then revs, producing a deep, loud, and aggressive roaring sound.\"]", "time_sec": 38.125, "generation_time_seconds": 37.6041, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "521", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Outside on the barren mountain, a sigh accompanied by the sound of the wind, many climbers are seen stopping.", "pred": "A person in outdoor gear stands on a rocky mountainside, while the sound of a person breathing heavily is heard, accompanied by wind noise.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in outdoor gear stands on a rocky mountainside, while the sound of a person breathing heavily is heard, accompanied by wind noise.", "cot": "[\"A person in outdoor gear stands on a rocky mountainside, while the sound of a person breathing heavily is heard, accompanied by wind noise.\", \"A person in hiking gear stands on a vast, rocky mountain ridge under a clear sky, while heavy, rhythmic breathing is heard.\", \"A person wearing a hat and backpack stands on a rocky mountainside, with another figure visible in the distant background, while sounds of heavy panting and wind are heard.\", \"A person walks across a barren, rocky mountainside under a blue sky, while another person walks in the distant background; the sound of heavy, rhythmic breathing is audible.\"]", "time_sec": 37.683, "generation_time_seconds": 36.2936, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "522", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two characters fight in the air, and the voice of the game, and the back ground music come out.", "pred": "I observe a fast-paced video game battle with anime-style characters, glowing energy effects, and Japanese text on screen. Simultaneously, I hear energetic, synthesized music, sharp impact sounds, and a female character shouting in Japanese.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "I observe a fast-paced video game battle with anime-style characters, glowing energy effects, and Japanese text on screen. Simultaneously, I hear energetic, synthesized music, sharp impact sounds, and a female character shouting in Japanese.", "cot": "[\"I observe a fast-paced video game battle with anime-style characters, glowing energy effects, and Japanese text on screen. Simultaneously, I hear energetic, synthesized music, sharp impact sounds, and a female character shouting in Japanese.\", \"The video displays a fast-paced fighting game. A blonde female anime character battles multiple opponents in a dark, rocky arena. Visual effects accompany her attacks, with health bars and Japanese text visible on the screen. The accompanying audio consists of sharp impact sounds, whooshes, and a female voice shouting a phrase in Japanese.\", \"The video displays a Japanese fantasy action game with multiple characters battling in a dark, star-filled environment, accompanied by fast-paced orchestral music, impactful sound effects, and a female voice shouting a battle cry.\", \"The video displays a character in a fantasy battle, with on-screen text and health bars, accompanied by the sounds of sword clashes, energetic music, and a female voice shouting in Japanese.\"]", "time_sec": 47.298, "generation_time_seconds": 46.6502, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0009, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "523", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man stands outside, playing to the music and the voice of the woman, and a picture of the man is shown.", "pred": "The video opens with a man on a solar-paneled roof, followed by another man setting up a GO SUN stove in a forest, and then a man working in a factory, all while a narrator speaks over soft ambient music.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video opens with a man on a solar-paneled roof, followed by another man setting up a GO SUN stove in a forest, and then a man working in a factory, all while a narrator speaks over soft ambient music.", "cot": "[\"The video opens with a man on a solar-paneled roof, followed by another man setting up a GO SUN stove in a forest, and then a man working in a factory, all while a narrator speaks over soft ambient music.\", \"A man in a blue collared shirt stands on a rooftop covered in solar panels, overlooking a city skyline under a blue sky. The scene then cuts to a black and white shot of a man in a workshop with the text \\\"The Plan\\\" superimposed. A female narrator speaks over the visuals, stating, \\\"We aim to use the Go Sun Stove to help break the cycle of poverty while reducing pressures on critical resources.\\\"\", \"The video presents a series of static images and text: a man in a blue shirt beside solar panels, a man in a forest with a portable stove, and a worker in a factory with the text \\\"The Plan\\\". Over this, a female voice narrates a plan to use the \\\"Go Sun Stove\\\" to break the cycle of poverty and reduce pressure on critical resources.\", \"The video displays a series of short clips: a man on a rooftop with solar panels, a man outdoors with a solar cooker, and a man in a workshop, all while a narrator discusses using a 'sun stove' to break the cycle of poverty.\"]", "time_sec": 58.818, "generation_time_seconds": 58.0374, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.65, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "524", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman sat in the room talking and took out a hairdryer to blow her hair.", "pred": "A young woman with blonde and red hair, wearing a red cardigan, speaks to the camera while sitting in a room with a bookshelf and orange armchair. She says her eye itched and she rubbed it, and that it is a \"washout,\" hoping washing her face will remove it. Subsequently, the loud, continuous buzzing of an electric shaver or trimmer is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young woman with blonde and red hair, wearing a red cardigan, speaks to the camera while sitting in a room with a bookshelf and orange armchair. She says her eye itched and she rubbed it, and that it is a \"washout,\" hoping washing her face will remove it. Subsequently, the loud, continuous buzzing of an electric shaver or trimmer is heard.", "cot": "[\"A young woman with blonde and red hair, wearing a red cardigan, speaks to the camera while sitting in a room with a bookshelf and orange armchair. She says her eye itched and she rubbed it, and that it is a \\\"washout,\\\" hoping washing her face will remove it. Subsequently, the loud, continuous buzzing of an electric shaver or trimmer is heard.\", \"A woman with red-tipped hair speaks to the camera, stating her eye itched and she rubbed it, believing the substance is meant to wash out and can be removed by washing her face.\", \"A young woman with red hair in a ponytail, wearing a red cardigan over a blue and white top, is in a living room with bookshelves and a red armchair. She speaks to the camera, stating that her eye itched and she rubbed it, and that the substance is meant to wash out. Immediately after she finishes speaking, a loud, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound, like a blender or mixer, begins and continues until the end of the clip.\", \"A woman with blonde and red hair, wearing a red cardigan, speaks to the camera. She explains that her eye itched, she rubbed it, and now makeup is on her face. She believes washing her face will remove the makeup. She then brings a black hairdryer up to her face, and the sound of the hairdryer running is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 63.682, "generation_time_seconds": 63.1401, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.02, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "525", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man mowed the lawn outside with a lawnmower.", "pred": "A person pushes a manual lawn aerator across a green lawn, and the machine emits a continuous, low-pitched grinding or crunching sound as it moves.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person pushes a manual lawn aerator across a green lawn, and the machine emits a continuous, low-pitched grinding or crunching sound as it moves.", "cot": "[\"A person pushes a manual lawn aerator across a green lawn, and the machine emits a continuous, low-pitched grinding or crunching sound as it moves.\", \"A person is pushing a manual reel lawnmower across a grassy area next to a paved surface. The loud, rhythmic, metallic grinding sound is produced by the mower's rotating blades as they cut the grass.\", \"A person is pushing a manual lawn aerator across a green lawn, and the device is making a continuous, rhythmic ratcheting sound.\", \"A person pushes a manual lawn roller across green grass next to a paved edge, while the loud, rhythmic grinding of a lawnmower motor operates in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 40.077, "generation_time_seconds": 39.2207, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.52, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "526", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the music, three children appeared looking at the window.", "pred": "A series of close-ups show a young boy and a young girl looking pensively out of a train window at a blurry, passing landscape, accompanied by a high-pitched, sustained, and ethereal electronic tone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A series of close-ups show a young boy and a young girl looking pensively out of a train window at a blurry, passing landscape, accompanied by a high-pitched, sustained, and ethereal electronic tone.", "cot": "[\"A series of close-ups show a young boy and a young girl looking pensively out of a train window at a blurry, passing landscape, accompanied by a high-pitched, sustained, and ethereal electronic tone.\", \"The video displays a sequence of children looking out of a window while a high-pitched, synthesized tone plays in the audio.\", \"The video shows a series of close-up shots of different children looking pensively out a window, accompanied by a continuous, low, and resonant electronic tone.\", \"The video displays a series of black and white close-ups of children looking out of windows, while a high-pitched, sustained, and dissonant electronic tone plays.\"]", "time_sec": 38.257, "generation_time_seconds": 37.7632, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "527", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The baby and dad were playing and then held in their arms by the mother, with the woman's voice, music and baby's voice in the background.", "pred": "A baby lies on a blue mat while a woman's arm reaches into the frame, as the baby makes gurgling sounds and a narrator speaks about the foundations of good speech development.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A baby lies on a blue mat while a woman's arm reaches into the frame, as the baby makes gurgling sounds and a narrator speaks about the foundations of good speech development.", "cot": "[\"A baby lies on a blue mat while a woman's arm reaches into the frame, as the baby makes gurgling sounds and a narrator speaks about the foundations of good speech development.\", \"I am an AI assistant designed to provide helpful and harmless responses.\", \"A baby babbles with a rhythmic, gurgling sound while lying on a blue mat, seemingly interacting with an unseen adult whose arm is visible, all within a brightly lit indoor play area with a large red and white exercise ball in the background.\", \"This audio-visual clip presents a scene of infant and toddler development, with a narrator discussing the foundations of speech development while showing a baby making babbling sounds and a toddler playing with toys.\"]", "time_sec": 40.49, "generation_time_seconds": 39.6253, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "528", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman is pouring something into a bottle and shaking it, shaking it and talking, surrounded by vegetables and spices.", "pred": "A person's hands shake a clear glass bottle containing a cloudy liquid on a wooden countertop, while a voice says it must dissolve the salt in it.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands shake a clear glass bottle containing a cloudy liquid on a wooden countertop, while a voice says it must dissolve the salt in it.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands shake a clear glass bottle containing a cloudy liquid on a wooden countertop, while a voice says it must dissolve the salt in it.\", \"A person holds a glass bottle containing a cloudy liquid over a wooden cutting board. On the board, there is a head of cabbage, a spice jar, and stacked bowls. The person speaks in French, saying to let salt dissolve in the liquid.\", \"A person shakes a clear glass bottle containing a cloudy liquid on a wooden cutting board, while a female voice gives the instruction to let the salt dissolve.\", \"A person wearing a patterned sweater shakes a glass bottle containing a cloudy liquid, while a female voice speaks in French about letting salt dissolve.\"]", "time_sec": 39.754, "generation_time_seconds": 38.6821, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "529", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Four men played their instruments in the bright lights of the stage. The background is a beautiful musical instrument. and they ware a white and orange dress.", "pred": "The audio features the loud, high-pitched sound of bagpipes playing a melody. Simultaneously, the video displays four men on a stage, each wearing a red tartan kilt and a white shirt, playing bagpipes.\n\n\\boxed{Four men in red tartan kilts perform on a stage, playing bagpipes while a drum kit is visible behind them.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features the loud, high-pitched sound of bagpipes playing a melody. Simultaneously, the video displays four men on a stage, each wearing a red tartan kilt and a white shirt, playing bagpipes.\n\n\\boxed{Four men in red tartan kilts perform on a stage, playing bagpipes while a drum kit is visible behind them.}", "cot": "[\"The audio features the loud, high-pitched sound of bagpipes playing a melody. Simultaneously, the video displays four men on a stage, each wearing a red tartan kilt and a white shirt, playing bagpipes.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{Four men in red tartan kilts perform on a stage, playing bagpipes while a drum kit is visible behind them.}\", \"The scene is a live performance of a four-person Scottish bagpipe and drum band on a dark stage. Bright spotlights illuminate the performers, who are dressed in traditional kilts and white shirts. They are playing their instruments in unison, creating a loud, rhythmic, and melodic sound. The music is characterized by the high-pitched, reedy sound of the bagpipes playing a fast, traditional tune, accompanied by the deep, resonant beat of the snare drum. The overall atmosphere is energetic and culturally specific to Scottish tradition, with the visual focus on the synchronized musicians and their instruments under the stage lights.\", \"On a dark stage illuminated by spotlights, four men in tartan kilts play bagpipes, accompanied by the rhythmic beat of a snare drum. A high-pitched, reedy melody from the bagpipes is played over a steady, percussive beat, creating a traditional, ceremonial sound.\", \"The video shows four male musicians in kilts performing on a dark stage under spotlights. Two on the left and right play bagpipes, while two in the center play snare drums. The audio consists of the high-pitched, droning melody of the bagpipes and the rhythmic, percussive beat of the drums, creating a traditional marching band sound.\"]", "time_sec": 70.96, "generation_time_seconds": 69.9378, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "530", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The seats are filled with paper cups and white liquids, with a cheerful Christmas music in the background.", "pred": "This is a high-angle, static shot of a large, organized grid of white disposable cups, each filled with a pale yellow liquid, resting on a grey floor. Simultaneously, a music box plays a clear, simple, and slightly melancholic melody.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "This is a high-angle, static shot of a large, organized grid of white disposable cups, each filled with a pale yellow liquid, resting on a grey floor. Simultaneously, a music box plays a clear, simple, and slightly melancholic melody.", "cot": "[\"This is a high-angle, static shot of a large, organized grid of white disposable cups, each filled with a pale yellow liquid, resting on a grey floor. Simultaneously, a music box plays a clear, simple, and slightly melancholic melody.\", \"The video displays a vast, organized grid of white cups holding a white liquid. Simultaneously, a music box plays a clear, high-pitched, and slightly metallic melody.\", \"A large quantity of white paper cups filled with a light-colored liquid are arranged in neat rows on a table, while a music box plays a melody in the background.\", \"A grid of white paper cups filled with a white liquid is shown from above, while a music box plays a melody.\"]", "time_sec": 41.01, "generation_time_seconds": 40.1259, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "531", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A video with a black background shows two English sentences as the music plays.", "pred": "A black screen displays the white text \"We thought so.\" A high-pitched, shimmering electronic tone begins, gradually joined by a deep, sustained, and ominous drone that creates a suspenseful atmosphere.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black screen displays the white text \"We thought so.\" A high-pitched, shimmering electronic tone begins, gradually joined by a deep, sustained, and ominous drone that creates a suspenseful atmosphere.", "cot": "[\"A black screen displays the white text \\\"We thought so.\\\" A high-pitched, shimmering electronic tone begins, gradually joined by a deep, sustained, and ominous drone that creates a suspenseful atmosphere.\", \"A black screen displays the white text \\\"We thought so.\\\". The audio features a low, sustained, and ominous ambient drone that builds in intensity.\", \"The video displays the white text 'We thought so.' on a black screen while the audio consists of a slow, ambient synthesizer drone with a high-pitched, shimmering bell-like sound.\", \"This is a black screen with white, centered, sans-serif text that reads 'We thought so.' This is accompanied by a slow, ambient electronic music track featuring a low, sustained synthesizer drone and a high-pitched, shimmering arpeggiated synth melody.\"]", "time_sec": 42.938, "generation_time_seconds": 42.2571, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "532", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The movie theater was full of laughter and discussion, with one man taking off his hat and smiling and saying something, and then another man saying something.", "pred": "In a dark, crowded room with vertical light panels, a person in a grey hoodie and green cap smiles at the camera while a crowd talks and a male voice speaks.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "In a dark, crowded room with vertical light panels, a person in a grey hoodie and green cap smiles at the camera while a crowd talks and a male voice speaks.", "cot": "[\"In a dark, crowded room with vertical light panels, a person in a grey hoodie and green cap smiles at the camera while a crowd talks and a male voice speaks.\", \"In a dark, crowded indoor setting, a young man in a grey hoodie and green hat smiles and speaks to the camera, with a crowd of people visible behind him; his speech is indistinct, but a male voice can be heard saying, \\\"These kids are like an overload of...\\\" over the ambient sounds of the crowd.\", \"In a dark, crowded indoor space with vertical light fixtures, a young man in a grey hoodie smiles at the camera while a constant murmur of many people talking fills the air.\", \"The video shows a young man in a dark room with vertical blinds, wearing a grey hoodie and a backwards green hat, as he talks. The audio captures him saying, \\\"you never say never. So, peace out,\\\" followed by the comment, \\\"These kids are like an overload of...\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 48.822, "generation_time_seconds": 48.1174, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "533", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A sound of music sounded, the yellow text was sliding up and down, the grassland and snow and animals other background images are constantly changing.", "pred": "The video displays a sequence of landscape scenes—a rocky canyon, a winding path, and a snowy path with a lone walker—while yellow text overlays appear sequentially. Simultaneously, an instrumental piece of music plays, featuring a prominent, somber melody performed by a synthesized string instrument.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a sequence of landscape scenes—a rocky canyon, a winding path, and a snowy path with a lone walker—while yellow text overlays appear sequentially. Simultaneously, an instrumental piece of music plays, featuring a prominent, somber melody performed by a synthesized string instrument.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a sequence of landscape scenes—a rocky canyon, a winding path, and a snowy path with a lone walker—while yellow text overlays appear sequentially. Simultaneously, an instrumental piece of music plays, featuring a prominent, somber melody performed by a synthesized string instrument.\", \"The video displays a series of text overlays on changing natural backgrounds, including a grassy field, a rocky canyon, and a snowy path, while an instrumental piece featuring a prominent piano melody and a string section plays.\", \"The audio features a solo piano playing a slow, clear melody with a gentle, reflective mood. Simultaneously, the video displays a series of static, yellow text overlays with a serif font, which appear sequentially over different, unchanging natural backgrounds, including a grassy field, a rocky canyon, and a snowy path.\", \"The video displays text on a background of a snowy landscape with trees. The text identifies a figure named \\\"Abraham\\\" who writes books and leads workshops. Overlaid on this is a slow, gentle instrumental piece of music featuring a string ensemble and a harp.\"]", "time_sec": 52.542, "generation_time_seconds": 51.8735, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "534", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A silver car was parked in the wild, and the man went over and pulled the door handle with his hand, and the door opened automatically.", "pred": "A hand opens a car door, revealing the interior, while a male voice speaks over the sounds of a car door closing and a car engine starting.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand opens a car door, revealing the interior, while a male voice speaks over the sounds of a car door closing and a car engine starting.", "cot": "[\"A hand opens a car door, revealing the interior, while a male voice speaks over the sounds of a car door closing and a car engine starting.\", \"A hand pulls a car door handle, opening the door with a creak and a metallic slam, followed by a man speaking.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A hand pulls a car door handle, opening the door with a creak and a metallic slam, followed by a man speaking.}\", \"A hand opens a silver car door, followed by the sound of a car door closing and a man speaking.\", \"A person's hand opens a car door, the sound of the latch releasing is heard, followed by a man speaking.\"]", "time_sec": 38.555, "generation_time_seconds": 37.86, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.25, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "535", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the music, a man and a woodpecker prepare to fight, followed by a fire that turns a tree into a stump and fires.", "pred": "The video displays a fighting game with a woodpecker versus a bear, accompanied by a voice shouting, a punch sound, and a subsequent explosion.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a fighting game with a woodpecker versus a bear, accompanied by a voice shouting, a punch sound, and a subsequent explosion.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a fighting game with a woodpecker versus a bear, accompanied by a voice shouting, a punch sound, and a subsequent explosion.\", \"The video displays a two-player fighting game interface with health bars for 'VAL' and 'DMITRI'. A large, grey, bipedal creature with a long neck attacks a tree, causing it to explode in a burst of orange and yellow fire, followed by a close-up of the tree stump with a large crack, all while a male voice shouts in Russian and intense electronic music with a loud crash plays.\", \"This is a video game scene from the Mortal Kombat series, featuring a character resembling a woodpecker on the left and a humanoid figure on the right. The scene transitions from a forest setting to an autumnal ground. Overlapping this visual is a synthesized voice exclaiming \\\"Kachi!\\\", followed by combat sound effects including a punch and a character death sound.\", \"A red-headed woodpecker is on a tree in a forest, then a large fire erupts on the ground, which is then shown as a tree stump with a glowing core, while the audio features a man yelling, followed by a dog barking, a loud crash, and an explosion.\"]", "time_sec": 57.121, "generation_time_seconds": 55.9265, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "536", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Three men stood in front of the projector playing an instrument.", "pred": "Three performers are on a stage in front of an audience. The central figure plays a large didgeridoo, producing a deep, resonant drone. The person on the left sings into a microphone, while the person on the right holds a small percussion instrument.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Three performers are on a stage in front of an audience. The central figure plays a large didgeridoo, producing a deep, resonant drone. The person on the left sings into a microphone, while the person on the right holds a small percussion instrument.", "cot": "[\"Three performers are on a stage in front of an audience. The central figure plays a large didgeridoo, producing a deep, resonant drone. The person on the left sings into a microphone, while the person on the right holds a small percussion instrument.\", \"Three performers are on a stage in a presentation room. The central figure plays a long didgeridoo, producing a low, resonant drone, while the person on the left sings into a microphone and the person on the right claps.\", \"Three musicians perform in a conference room: one sings into a microphone, another plays a didgeridoo producing a deep, resonant drone, and a third plays a smaller wind instrument.\", \"Three people perform on stage with musical instruments while a loud, sustained, and distorted low-frequency buzzing sound plays in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 43.831, "generation_time_seconds": 43.3061, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.75, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "537", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two women sat in the car, singing while driving, and a man and a woman hugged in the room to the music.", "pred": "The audio features a female singer performing a pop song with lyrics about a relationship, while the visual shows a woman with a straight fringe and sunglasses sitting in the driver's seat of a car.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features a female singer performing a pop song with lyrics about a relationship, while the visual shows a woman with a straight fringe and sunglasses sitting in the driver's seat of a car.", "cot": "[\"The audio features a female singer performing a pop song with lyrics about a relationship, while the visual shows a woman with a straight fringe and sunglasses sitting in the driver's seat of a car.\", \"A woman with a long, straight bob haircut and dark sunglasses drives a light-colored car, her mouth open as if singing or speaking, while a passenger sits beside her; simultaneously, a female voice sings a pop song with lyrics about friendship and being wrong.\", \"The video shows a woman in a car with a large, toothy steering wheel, while another woman fans herself in the backseat; this visual is paired with an audio track featuring a female singer performing a contemporary R&B song.\", \"The audio features a female singer performing a contemporary R&B song with lyrics about friendship and betrayal, accompanied by a modern electronic beat, while the visual shows a woman with long dark hair and bangs in a close-up.\"]", "time_sec": 45.552, "generation_time_seconds": 44.8726, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "538", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the music, an animation with the English alphabet is visible, followed by a few hands of different colors beating in black and clapping.", "pred": "The video displays a title card for \"Glen Prior - Piece For Three Pairs Of Clapping Hands,\" followed by a shot of three hands, colored blue, purple, and green, poised to clap, which is then accompanied by the sound of a deep, sustained gong followed by a sharp, percussive clap.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a title card for \"Glen Prior - Piece For Three Pairs Of Clapping Hands,\" followed by a shot of three hands, colored blue, purple, and green, poised to clap, which is then accompanied by the sound of a deep, sustained gong followed by a sharp, percussive clap.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a title card for \\\"Glen Prior - Piece For Three Pairs Of Clapping Hands,\\\" followed by a shot of three hands, colored blue, purple, and green, poised to clap, which is then accompanied by the sound of a deep, sustained gong followed by a sharp, percussive clap.\", \"The video displays a title card for \\\"Glen Prior - Piece For Three Pairs Of Clapping Hands,\\\" followed by three hands painted blue, purple, and green against a black background, while the audio features a low, sustained synthesizer chord, a sharp percussive snap, and a low-pitched, resonant strike.\", \"A title card displays the text \\\"Glen Prior\\\" and \\\"Piece For Three Pairs Of Clapping Hands\\\" above a red wave on a black background. This is followed by a visual of three hands painted purple, blue, and green, positioned as if to clap, accompanied by a deep, resonant gong sound and a subsequent rhythmic clapping sound.\", \"The video opens with a title card for \\\"Glen Prior - Piece For Three Pairs Of Clapping Hands\\\" on a black background with a red wave. This is followed by a shot of three hands with colored paint—blue, purple, and green—clapping together in the dark. The audio consists of a deep, resonant gong or bell being struck, followed by a brief period of silence, and then a sharp, high-pitched electronic tone.\"]", "time_sec": 65.149, "generation_time_seconds": 64.4009, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.95, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "539", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A flame of sparks splashed and rattled.", "pred": "A bright, vertical orange and yellow flame erupts from laboratory equipment, its light reflecting on a surface below, while the loud, high-pitched whirring of a motor dominates the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A bright, vertical orange and yellow flame erupts from laboratory equipment, its light reflecting on a surface below, while the loud, high-pitched whirring of a motor dominates the audio.", "cot": "[\"A bright, vertical orange and yellow flame erupts from laboratory equipment, its light reflecting on a surface below, while the loud, high-pitched whirring of a motor dominates the audio.\", \"A bright, elongated orange and yellow flame burns from a stationary apparatus in a dark, indoor setting, while the continuous, high-pitched whirring of a power tool is audible in the background.\", \"A bright, intense orange and red flame is produced at the base of a dark, stationary object, possibly a torch, which emits a loud, continuous hissing sound.\\n\\\\boxed{A stationary object emits a loud hissing sound and produces a bright, intense orange and red flame at its base.}\", \"A bright, orange, and red flame burns in a laboratory setup, emitting a continuous high-pitched whirring sound, characteristic of a Bunsen burner, while a person speaks and laughs in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 46.585, "generation_time_seconds": 46.1038, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "540", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a farm sheepfold, a large shed was supported by pipes, and under the shed there were many white sheep walking back and forth, making occasional calls in background one car was moving", "pred": "I observe a flock of sheep and goats in a large, metal-fenced pen with a roof. I hear the distinct bleating of sheep, the rhythmic sound of a horse's hooves on a hard surface, and faint, indistinct human voices in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "I observe a flock of sheep and goats in a large, metal-fenced pen with a roof. I hear the distinct bleating of sheep, the rhythmic sound of a horse's hooves on a hard surface, and faint, indistinct human voices in the background.", "cot": "[\"I observe a flock of sheep and goats in a large, metal-fenced pen with a roof. I hear the distinct bleating of sheep, the rhythmic sound of a horse's hooves on a hard surface, and faint, indistinct human voices in the background.\", \"The scene shows a flock of sheep and goats within a large, covered pen with a dirt floor, while the audio captures multiple distinct bleating sounds from the animals.\", \"A flock of sheep is inside a large, open-sided, metal-roofed pen with dirt ground. The sheep are standing and moving around. A text overlay appears on the screen that says, \\\"Easy access to feed and water troughs\\\".\\n\\\\boxed{A flock of sheep stands and moves within a large, dirt-floored, open-sided pen, accompanied by the sound of a goat bleating.}\", \"The audio captures the sound of a flock of sheep, while the visual shows a large herd of sheep and goats inside a spacious, open-sided metal pen with feed and water troughs.\"]", "time_sec": 50.693, "generation_time_seconds": 49.9224, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.04, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "541", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "An uncle in a hat sat in a chair and spoke, and three gulls flew in the blue sky in China and made a yelling.", "pred": "The video displays a series of short clips: a man in camouflage with a snowmobile, a spinning fishing lure, a logo for 'FIA BRAND', and a flock of birds flying in a grey sky, all while an off-screen male voice gives motivational advice followed by the sound of a goose honking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a series of short clips: a man in camouflage with a snowmobile, a spinning fishing lure, a logo for 'FIA BRAND', and a flock of birds flying in a grey sky, all while an off-screen male voice gives motivational advice followed by the sound of a goose honking.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a series of short clips: a man in camouflage with a snowmobile, a spinning fishing lure, a logo for 'FIA BRAND', and a flock of birds flying in a grey sky, all while an off-screen male voice gives motivational advice followed by the sound of a goose honking.\", \"The video displays a man in camouflage gear and a truck, followed by a logo and a title card reading \\\"Alberta Trophy Hunts\\\". Over this, a male voice provides instruction, then a deep roar is heard, followed by the distinct honking of a goose.\", \"The video opens on a man in camouflage sitting on a snowmobile, then cuts to a logo, a flock of birds in the sky, and a close-up of a goose's head. A man's voice says, \\\"Do what you gotta do, but don't quit,\\\" followed by a dramatic whoosh sound and the distinct honking of a goose.\", \"The video opens with a black-and-white shot of a man in camouflage sitting on a snowmobile, followed by a logo for 'Final Approach' and a shot of birds flying. A man's voice is heard speaking, after which a large, deep whooshing sound is heard, followed immediately by a series of high-pitched, rapid honking sounds.\"]", "time_sec": 58.669, "generation_time_seconds": 58.2018, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.65, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "542", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A number of toy police cars were placed on the table to play with and sound alarm.", "pred": "A person's hands maneuver a collection of toy police cars on a flat surface, while the loud, wailing siren of a toy emergency vehicle is activated.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands maneuver a collection of toy police cars on a flat surface, while the loud, wailing siren of a toy emergency vehicle is activated.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands maneuver a collection of toy police cars on a flat surface, while the loud, wailing siren of a toy emergency vehicle is activated.\", \"A child's hand moves a white police toy SUV on a light-colored surface, which has a blue light bar on its roof.\\n\\nSimultaneously, a loud, high-pitched electronic siren, similar to a police car alarm, is sounding.\", \"A person's hands manipulate a white toy police car on a light-colored surface, which is accompanied by a high-pitched, electronic siren sound.\", \"A hand operates a white toy police SUV on a light-colored surface, while the toy vehicle emits a loud, high-pitched electronic siren sound.\"]", "time_sec": 40.53, "generation_time_seconds": 39.8079, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "543", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red fire truck was backing up on a road and beeping, and the environmental buzz.", "pred": "A red and white fire truck is parked on a grey road under a cloudy sky. The loud, high-pitched whine of a saw blade, accompanied by the sound of a small engine, is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A red and white fire truck is parked on a grey road under a cloudy sky. The loud, high-pitched whine of a saw blade, accompanied by the sound of a small engine, is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A red and white fire truck is parked on a grey road under a cloudy sky. The loud, high-pitched whine of a saw blade, accompanied by the sound of a small engine, is heard in the background.\", \"The sound of a loud, high-pitched power tool, like a saw, is heard, while a red and white fire truck is parked on a paved surface next to a grassy area and a sign.\", \"A red and white fire engine is shown from the side as it drives forward, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched whine of its engine.\", \"A red and white fire truck is stationary on a paved road.\\n Simultaneously, a loud, high-pitched, mechanical buzzing sound, like a chainsaw, is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 41.537, "generation_time_seconds": 40.9073, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "544", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A cat lay on the bed under the voice of the woman and sneezed after the woman.", "pred": "A white cat is lying on a dark surface. It is seen blinking and then sneezing, followed by a human laughing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white cat is lying on a dark surface. It is seen blinking and then sneezing, followed by a human laughing.", "cot": "[\"A white cat is lying on a dark surface. It is seen blinking and then sneezing, followed by a human laughing.\", \"A white cat lies on a dark surface, blinking slowly. A person nearby repeatedly sniffles and then lets out a loud sneeze.\", \"A white cat lies down and then sneezes, followed by a person laughing.\", \"A white cat lies on a dark surface, blinking slowly and shifting its head. A person nearby sniffs, coughs, and then chuckles.\"]", "time_sec": 33.959, "generation_time_seconds": 33.404, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "545", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man holds a piece of glass on the floor, then takes a transparent ruler and compares it, takes out the art knife, , the glass and the floor collision sound.", "pred": "A person's hands are visible on a tiled floor as a metallic object is dropped, creating a loud clang, followed by a series of smaller, lighter metallic impacts.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands are visible on a tiled floor as a metallic object is dropped, creating a loud clang, followed by a series of smaller, lighter metallic impacts.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands are visible on a tiled floor as a metallic object is dropped, creating a loud clang, followed by a series of smaller, lighter metallic impacts.\", \"A hand is shown opening a multi-tool, likely a Swiss Army knife, on a tiled floor. The sound of the tool's multiple blades or implements being unfolded or manipulated is heard, accompanied by a constant low-frequency hum in the background.\", \"First, the camera shows a hand holding a black and silver object. Then, the hand and object are dropped onto a light-colored, reflective floor. Next, the hand picks up a long, thin, silver object, possibly a knife, and places it on the floor. A human foot wearing a dark shoe is visible in the background. The audio consists of a continuous low-frequency hum, a single sharp metallic clang, and a final sustained electronic tone.\", \"A person's hands are visible on a tiled floor as they manipulate a long, silver metal object, which makes scraping and clanking sounds.\"]", "time_sec": 49.317, "generation_time_seconds": 48.771, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "546", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a woman sits on the ground, slightly shaking, to the music of the carnation.", "pred": "The video shows a woman in a purple sari performing a ritual in front of a large, multi-armed goddess statue. Simultaneously, a female voice is singing in a devotional style, accompanied by a stringed instrument.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a woman in a purple sari performing a ritual in front of a large, multi-armed goddess statue. Simultaneously, a female voice is singing in a devotional style, accompanied by a stringed instrument.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a woman in a purple sari performing a ritual in front of a large, multi-armed goddess statue. Simultaneously, a female voice is singing in a devotional style, accompanied by a stringed instrument.\", \"A woman in a purple sari sits on a platform before a large, dark-skinned goddess statue, singing devotionally as a harmonium plays a slow, melancholic melody.\", \"A woman in a purple sari kneels before a large, ornate shrine housing a dark-skinned, multi-armed statue of a goddess. She sings devotional music in a high-pitched voice while a harmonium plays a slow, melodic accompaniment.\", \"A woman in a purple sari sits on a step in front of a large, dark-skinned statue of a multi-armed deity, which is adorned with a garland and set within an ornate, arched alcove; she sings a melodic phrase in a devotional style, accompanied by the distinct, resonant notes of a sitar.\"]", "time_sec": 51.827, "generation_time_seconds": 51.0505, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0009, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "547", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the park, a black crow turns its head, and a voice is heard.", "pred": "A person speaks to a bird named Ruby while the bird calls out.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person speaks to a bird named Ruby while the bird calls out.", "cot": "[\"A person speaks to a bird named Ruby while the bird calls out.\", \"A black bird, resembling a raven, sits on a tree branch while a woman speaks to it, and it responds with a series of loud, harsh caws.\", \"A black bird, possibly a crow, is perched on a tree branch within what appears to be an enclosure, while a female voice calls out to someone named Ruby and the bird vocalizes loudly.\", \"A large black bird, possibly a crow or raven, sits on a branch in a tree. A human female speaks, greeting an animal named Ruby, and then the bird emits a series of loud, harsh caws.\"]", "time_sec": 40.782, "generation_time_seconds": 40.0565, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "548", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the man's voice, a man manipulates the game.", "pred": "The video shows a player opening a chest in a Minecraft game, followed by the sound of a male voice planning to build a shelter.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a player opening a chest in a Minecraft game, followed by the sound of a male voice planning to build a shelter.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a player opening a chest in a Minecraft game, followed by the sound of a male voice planning to build a shelter.\", \"A video game user interface displays items in a chest, while a person speaks about building a shelter.\", \"The video displays a first-person view within the Minecraft Netha v1.21_01 game, showing a character's inventory and then a large tree in the game world, while a male voice narrates his plan to build a shelter.\", \"A first-person perspective shows a Minecraft player's inventory and chest open, then moving through a blocky forest, while a male voice discusses building a shelter and dealing with zombies.\"]", "time_sec": 39.839, "generation_time_seconds": 39.3177, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.05, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "549", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the music played, a man was playing with a guitar, which made a sound.", "pred": "A person wearing a dark t-shirt plays a black electric guitar. The audio features a bluesy, distorted guitar riff with a clean bassline and a simple drum beat.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing a dark t-shirt plays a black electric guitar. The audio features a bluesy, distorted guitar riff with a clean bassline and a simple drum beat.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing a dark t-shirt plays a black electric guitar. The audio features a bluesy, distorted guitar riff with a clean bassline and a simple drum beat.\", \"A musician in a dark t-shirt plays a black electric guitar with a tremolo arm, producing blues-rock music with a clean tone and a distinct vibrato effect.\", \"A musician in a dark t-shirt plays a black electric guitar, with two guitar effects pedals, a 'Seafom' and a 'REDR', visible on the right, while a blues rock song with a prominent, wailing guitar solo plays.\", \"A musician plays a black electric guitar, with a black pedalboard visible in the background, while an electric guitar plays a bluesy solo with a clean tone, supported by a bass guitar and a drum kit.\"]", "time_sec": 44.374, "generation_time_seconds": 43.7415, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "550", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, the game is constantly changing, with the sound of talking coming from the side.", "pred": "A player deploys a tower to attack a red bloon on a fiery orange track, while a narrator warns that ice towers are ineffective against non-Moab-class bloons and mentions boomers and villages.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A player deploys a tower to attack a red bloon on a fiery orange track, while a narrator warns that ice towers are ineffective against non-Moab-class bloons and mentions boomers and villages.", "cot": "[\"A player deploys a tower to attack a red bloon on a fiery orange track, while a narrator warns that ice towers are ineffective against non-Moab-class bloons and mentions boomers and villages.\", \"The image displays a top-down view of a 'Bloons TD 5' game level on a lava-themed map with multiple towers and a path of red and blue bloons. Simultaneously, a male voice provides gameplay advice, mentioning \\\"ice towers,\\\" \\\"Moab class bloons,\\\" and \\\"boomers.\\\"\", \"A top-down view of a 'Bloons TD Battles' game shows a green monkey tower shooting at red, blue, and yellow bloons on an orange, lava-like track, while a male voice gives gameplay advice about towers and a 'Moab class bloon'.\", \"The audio features a male voice providing commentary about 'ice towers' and 'Moab class bloons', while the video displays a gameplay screen from the game Bloons TD 5, showing a green tower attacking a red bloon on an orange, cratered map.\"]", "time_sec": 54.534, "generation_time_seconds": 53.3868, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "551", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In one room, a man in a black coat was hammering a piece of glass with a hammer.", "pred": "A person swings a sledgehammer in a warehouse-like space, repeatedly striking a large pane of bulletproof glass that is mounted within a metal frame, causing it to crack and shatter with loud, sharp impacts.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person swings a sledgehammer in a warehouse-like space, repeatedly striking a large pane of bulletproof glass that is mounted within a metal frame, causing it to crack and shatter with loud, sharp impacts.", "cot": "[\"A person swings a sledgehammer in a warehouse-like space, repeatedly striking a large pane of bulletproof glass that is mounted within a metal frame, causing it to crack and shatter with loud, sharp impacts.\", \"A person in blue overalls swings an axe at a ballistic shield, and each impact produces a loud, sharp cracking sound.\", \"A person in blue overalls swings a sledgehammer in a large indoor space, striking a glass panel within a metal frame, resulting in a loud, sharp impact sound with a brief echo.\", \"A person in overalls swings an axe at a large pane of glass, producing a series of loud, sharp cracking sounds as the glass shatters.\"]", "time_sec": 41.134, "generation_time_seconds": 40.5888, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "552", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a room bed, a husky sound like a wolf barking, as the alarm drips.", "pred": "A brown and white dog sits on a bed with a floral comforter, howling loudly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A brown and white dog sits on a bed with a floral comforter, howling loudly.", "cot": "[\"A brown and white dog sits on a bed with a floral comforter, howling loudly.\", \"A brown and white dog sits on a bed with a patterned comforter, howling loudly and continuously.\", \"A brown and white dog sits on a floral bedspread and howls, which is immediately followed by a loud, repetitive electronic alarm.\", \"A brown and white dog sits on a bed with floral bedding and howls, its head tilted back, as the high-pitched, wavering sound of a theremin plays in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 36.015, "generation_time_seconds": 35.2114, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "553", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the ghostly images and sounds, some English followed and music sounds.", "pred": "The video displays a dark, grainy, and heavily pixelated scene with a yellow object and a chain-link fence, while the audio features a low, ominous drone, a high-pitched sustained electronic tone, and a recurring metallic clanking sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a dark, grainy, and heavily pixelated scene with a yellow object and a chain-link fence, while the audio features a low, ominous drone, a high-pitched sustained electronic tone, and a recurring metallic clanking sound.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a dark, grainy, and heavily pixelated scene with a yellow object and a chain-link fence, while the audio features a low, ominous drone, a high-pitched sustained electronic tone, and a recurring metallic clanking sound.\", \"The video displays a dark, blurry, and glitching image of what appears to be an industrial setting, with the text 'The factory isn't safe...' and 'safe...' appearing sequentially. This visual is accompanied by a low, ominous, and suspenseful musical score.\", \"A dark, blurry, and glitchy video shows a yellow object and text reading \\\"factory isn't safe...\\\" in a pixelated font, accompanied by suspenseful, low-frequency electronic music.\", \"The video displays a dark, grainy, and glitchy scene featuring a chain-link fence and a yellow object. Overlaid text reads \\\"The factory isn't safe...\\\". This visual is accompanied by a suspenseful musical score, a distinct clicking sound, and a loud electronic buzz.\"]", "time_sec": 50.822, "generation_time_seconds": 49.8576, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "554", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a little brother swung his racket, and the sound of rapping music came from beside him.", "pred": "A person with blue hair makes a hand gesture, then the scene cuts to a young boy in a white shirt standing at a blue ping pong table with a red paddle as a rap song plays and a loud buzzer sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person with blue hair makes a hand gesture, then the scene cuts to a young boy in a white shirt standing at a blue ping pong table with a red paddle as a rap song plays and a loud buzzer sounds.", "cot": "[\"A person with blue hair makes a hand gesture, then the scene cuts to a young boy in a white shirt standing at a blue ping pong table with a red paddle as a rap song plays and a loud buzzer sounds.\", \"The video starts with a close-up of a young man with blue hair, then cuts to him standing behind a blue ping pong table in a room with orange walls. A male voice raps, \\\"Bitch, I'm a boss,\\\" over a hip-hop beat, which is then punctuated by a loud, sharp slap sound.\", \"A young man wearing a white t-shirt and a blue baseball cap dances indoors to a rap song, then the scene cuts to him playing ping pong in a room with orange walls and white radiators while the music continues to play.\", \"First, a person with blue hair and a white shirt is shown making gestures and speaking, accompanied by a hip-hop song. The scene then cuts to a different person playing ping pong in a room with orange walls and white radiators.\"]", "time_sec": 52.116, "generation_time_seconds": 51.6188, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 4.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "555", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a woman with a toothpick, fiddling with a piece of paper, beside the sound of speech.", "pred": "A person's hands use a wooden stick on a white paper surface, manipulating a small, white, viscous droplet while a woman speaks in Korean and a crinkling sound is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands use a wooden stick on a white paper surface, manipulating a small, white, viscous droplet while a woman speaks in Korean and a crinkling sound is heard.", "cot": "[\"A person's hands use a wooden stick on a white paper surface, manipulating a small, white, viscous droplet while a woman speaks in Korean and a crinkling sound is heard.\", \"A hand uses a wooden stick to manipulate a white, viscous substance on a small white card, while another identical dollop of the substance rests on a separate card nearby; a person speaks in Korean, mentioning the preparation of something similar.\", \"A person's hands are shown on a patterned surface, using a wooden stick to apply a white substance from a small paper square. The person speaks in Korean, and a crinkling sound occurs.\", \"A hand uses a wooden stick to pick up a white, gel-like substance from a piece of paper, while a person speaks in Korean and a crinkling sound is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 46.265, "generation_time_seconds": 44.9826, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "556", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On a tree, a man was chopping the tree with a machete in his hand, and cheers were sent from below and back so many green.", "pred": "A crowd cheers loudly and a man speaks over the noise while a person in dark clothing stands on a large log outdoors.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A crowd cheers loudly and a man speaks over the noise while a person in dark clothing stands on a large log outdoors.", "cot": "[\"A crowd cheers loudly and a man speaks over the noise while a person in dark clothing stands on a large log outdoors.\", \"A man wearing a baseball cap stands on a thick wooden log, holding an axe, while a crowd cheers loudly and a male announcer says, \\\"And there it is for Dion.\\\"\", \"A man in dark clothing stands atop a large wooden stump, holding an axe. The crowd cheers loudly, and a man's voice can be heard saying, \\\"And there it is for Dion.\\\"\", \"A man stands on a log, then raises a tool above his head as a crowd cheers loudly.\"]", "time_sec": 38.462, "generation_time_seconds": 37.2781, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "557", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Music was heard in the picture, and English words flashed in the margins on both sides of the phone they are setting a ringtone.", "pred": "An iPhone displays a list of chime options, while a high-pitched, melodic electronic chime plays in a repeating cycle.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "An iPhone displays a list of chime options, while a high-pitched, melodic electronic chime plays in a repeating cycle.", "cot": "[\"An iPhone displays a list of chime options, while a high-pitched, melodic electronic chime plays in a repeating cycle.\", \"This is a screen recording of an iPhone displaying the \\\"Chimes\\\" music app. The user selects the \\\"Circuit\\\" ringtone, which then plays a repeating, synthesized, electronic melody through the phone's speaker.\", \"The video shows a black smartphone displaying a settings menu labeled 'Chimes', which is then replaced by a list of songs, while a synthesized chime melody plays in the background.\", \"The image displays a black smartphone showing a settings menu with a list of options. An electronic chime plays, followed by a repeating three-note arpeggiated melody.\"]", "time_sec": 39.916, "generation_time_seconds": 38.9918, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "558", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With music and the sound of the engine, a man in red drove a blue pickup truck in a circle, one side of the truck wheels off the ground.", "pred": "A blue ice cream truck with white and yellow graphics is driving through an asphalt lot, accompanied by the loud, low-pitched roar of its engine and the clanking of its large wheels on the pavement.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A blue ice cream truck with white and yellow graphics is driving through an asphalt lot, accompanied by the loud, low-pitched roar of its engine and the clanking of its large wheels on the pavement.", "cot": "[\"A blue ice cream truck with white and yellow graphics is driving through an asphalt lot, accompanied by the loud, low-pitched roar of its engine and the clanking of its large wheels on the pavement.\", \"A small, light blue ice cream truck drives through a paved lot, its engine emitting a deep, constant rumble.\", \"A blue ice cream truck with yellow and white lettering is driving in a paved lot. The sound of a loud, low-pitched, and steady engine idling is heard.\", \"A light blue ice cream truck with \\\"HOLLAND'S\\\" written on it drives through a paved lot. The sound of a large vehicle's engine is audible throughout the clip.\"]", "time_sec": 39.483, "generation_time_seconds": 38.8428, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "559", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The puppy squatted in the woods half a hill, turning and running when he heard a roar like a tiger.", "pred": "A white and black animal is visible among the trees in a forest, accompanied by loud animal growling and snarling sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white and black animal is visible among the trees in a forest, accompanied by loud animal growling and snarling sounds.", "cot": "[\"A white and black animal is visible among the trees in a forest, accompanied by loud animal growling and snarling sounds.\", \"The video shows a dense forest with a small, white and dark-colored animal moving through the underbrush, while the audio features the deep, guttural growl of a large animal.\", \"The video shows a blurry, moving forest scene. The audio features the loud, low growl of a large animal, followed by a sharp crack.\", \"A small, dark-furred animal moves through a tangle of green foliage and a fallen tree trunk, while a deep, guttural growl is heard in the audio.\"]", "time_sec": 38.838, "generation_time_seconds": 37.6438, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "560", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the sound of voice, the blue front truck, the red-yellow body of the cart, slowly backward in front of the house.", "pred": "A large yellow and black Caterpillar 330 LN excavator is being transported on a flatbed truck. A person speaks in the background, saying, \"Otvaramo vrat, ta bingo, da se popravi.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large yellow and black Caterpillar 330 LN excavator is being transported on a flatbed truck. A person speaks in the background, saying, \"Otvaramo vrat, ta bingo, da se popravi.\"", "cot": "[\"A large yellow and black Caterpillar 330 LN excavator is being transported on a flatbed truck. A person speaks in the background, saying, \\\"Otvaramo vrat, ta bingo, da se popravi.\\\"\", \"A large tracked excavator sits on a flatbed trailer being pulled by a blue truck. People are speaking in a foreign language, and there is a distinct hissing sound, possibly from a pneumatic system or tire leak.\", \"A large Caterpillar 330 LN excavator is being transported on a flatbed truck, which is being pulled by a blue semi-truck. In the background, people are speaking in Serbian, with one person saying, \\\"Let's open the wheel, Bingo, to fix it.\\\"\", \"A large yellow and black Caterpillar 330 LN excavator is being transported on a red flatbed truck. In the background, a person can be heard speaking in Serbian, saying, \\\"We will open the wheels, bingo, to fix it.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 49.985, "generation_time_seconds": 49.3439, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "561", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A blue-dominated, tailed, two-legged creature, in the hallway of the green floor with white walls, moves from the air to the lower left corner of the picture, like touching the ground, suddenly accelerates to the left to move away from the picture, the picture flashes white light and starts to shake, sending out a rhythmic alarm.", "pred": "I see a blue, spiky dinosaur-like character with a red shell and long brown tail walking through a school hallway with lockers and a fire extinguisher sign, while a loud, electronic buzzer sounds repeatedly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "I see a blue, spiky dinosaur-like character with a red shell and long brown tail walking through a school hallway with lockers and a fire extinguisher sign, while a loud, electronic buzzer sounds repeatedly.", "cot": "[\"I see a blue, spiky dinosaur-like character with a red shell and long brown tail walking through a school hallway with lockers and a fire extinguisher sign, while a loud, electronic buzzer sounds repeatedly.\", \"A blue, dinosaur-like character is seen jumping in a school hallway with lockers.\\nThe character then suddenly falls through the floor, and a loud, electronic buzzing alarm sounds.\", \"The animated character Bowser is seen jumping in a school hallway with lockers.\\n Simultaneously, a repetitive, high-pitched mechanical alarm sound is heard.\", \"A blue, spiky character resembling Bowser jumps in a school hallway with lockers and a fire exit sign.\\nA loud, electronic alarm sounds continuously.\"]", "time_sec": 39.907, "generation_time_seconds": 39.1072, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 3.39, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "562", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman in a dark v-necked top holds a blue vacuum cleaner in the room to clean the carpet and continues to explain while cleaning.", "pred": "A woman is using a blue upright vacuum cleaner to clean a light-colored carpet in a living room, with a dog resting nearby, while a narrator describes the machine's cleaning capabilities.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman is using a blue upright vacuum cleaner to clean a light-colored carpet in a living room, with a dog resting nearby, while a narrator describes the machine's cleaning capabilities.", "cot": "[\"A woman is using a blue upright vacuum cleaner to clean a light-colored carpet in a living room, with a dog resting nearby, while a narrator describes the machine's cleaning capabilities.\", \"A blue Bissell vacuum cleaner moves across a light-colored carpet and a dark wooden floor, its motor audibly running, as a voice describes its multi-cyclonic system and pet hair removal capabilities.\", \"A woman operates a blue upright vacuum cleaner on a carpeted floor, then on a wooden floor, while a narrator describes the vacuum's multi-cyclonic system and suction power.\", \"A blue upright vacuum cleaner moves across a light-colored carpet and a dark wood floor, while a narrator describes its multi-cyclonic system and extended suction for removing dirt, debris, and pet hair.\"]", "time_sec": 41.403, "generation_time_seconds": 40.7591, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 48.48, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "563", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A Black Cat was chasing the mice around the house, and the voice of his master came from the room.", "pred": "A black cat runs across a wooden floor in a kitchen, while off-screen voices argue, one mentioning \"obviously\" and another stating, \"He comes out,\" and \"He doesn't even look like a mouse.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A black cat runs across a wooden floor in a kitchen, while off-screen voices argue, one mentioning \"obviously\" and another stating, \"He comes out,\" and \"He doesn't even look like a mouse.\"", "cot": "[\"A black cat runs across a wooden floor in a kitchen, while off-screen voices argue, one mentioning \\\"obviously\\\" and another stating, \\\"He comes out,\\\" and \\\"He doesn't even look like a mouse.\\\"\", \"A black cat walks across a glossy, light-brown hardwood floor in a kitchen, while a conversation between a woman and a man plays in the background.\", \"A black cat runs across a hardwood floor while a person speaks and a dog barks.\", \"A black cat runs across a hardwood floor as two people talk off-screen, one of them mentioning a mouse and another saying, \\\"He comes out.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 37.377, "generation_time_seconds": 36.8406, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "564", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man and the woman lay on the bed, the women talking with the man and the man gasped twice also made a puff.", "pred": "A woman in bed shouts in Greek at a man next to her, who then lets out a loud sneeze.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman in bed shouts in Greek at a man next to her, who then lets out a loud sneeze.", "cot": "[\"A woman in bed shouts in Greek at a man next to her, who then lets out a loud sneeze.\", \"A woman in a bed shouts in Greek, \\\"Go away from the center, three-two!\\\", while a man lies beside her and a loud, sustained electronic buzzer sounds.\", \"A woman in a bed shouts in Greek while a man next to her remains still, and a loud farting sound is heard.\", \"A woman and a man lie awake in bed under a white blanket. The woman speaks in Greek, saying a phrase that translates to \\\"The three of you have come from the center.\\\" A loud fart is heard immediately after she finishes speaking.\"]", "time_sec": 38.69, "generation_time_seconds": 38.093, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "565", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black male dentist in purple spoke to a woman in a pink top, her heart pounding sound, then she took a white towel and lay on a chair.", "pred": "The scene cuts between a woman with red hair and wide eyes, and a man in a blue shirt and tie, who is speaking and then the sound of a heartbeat is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The scene cuts between a woman with red hair and wide eyes, and a man in a blue shirt and tie, who is speaking and then the sound of a heartbeat is heard.", "cot": "[\"The scene cuts between a woman with red hair and wide eyes, and a man in a blue shirt and tie, who is speaking and then the sound of a heartbeat is heard.\", \"A woman with red hair is shown, followed by a man in a blue shirt and tie speaking. The man says, \\\"Yes, of course. Well, let's have a look, shall we? Hop in the chair, please,\\\" as a loud, rhythmic thumping sound begins.\", \"The video alternates between shots of a woman with red hair and a man in a blue shirt. The man speaks, saying, \\\"Oh, yes, of course. Well, let's have a look, shall we? Hop in the chair, please,\\\" followed by the sound of a heartbeat.\", \"A woman with red hair and blue eyes is shown in close-up, then a man in a blue shirt and striped tie speaks to the camera in a room with light-colored walls and a sink, followed by a return to a close-up of the woman, all while a heartbeat sound plays.\"]", "time_sec": 51.224, "generation_time_seconds": 50.7595, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "566", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man with a green stick banged the object on the ground, and there was a voice in the picture.", "pred": "A person wearing dark pants and sneakers uses a green-handled shovel to smash a disassembled white electronic device on a concrete floor, creating loud crashes and breaking glass, while the person remarks, \"Oh geez, the poor thing even had a little insulation in there.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing dark pants and sneakers uses a green-handled shovel to smash a disassembled white electronic device on a concrete floor, creating loud crashes and breaking glass, while the person remarks, \"Oh geez, the poor thing even had a little insulation in there.\"", "cot": "[\"A person wearing dark pants and sneakers uses a green-handled shovel to smash a disassembled white electronic device on a concrete floor, creating loud crashes and breaking glass, while the person remarks, \\\"Oh geez, the poor thing even had a little insulation in there.\\\"\", \"A person uses a green tool to smash a disassembled electronic device on a concrete floor, creating loud crashing sounds, followed by a man speaking.\", \"The audio captures a person speaking, while the visual shows a person's foot in a black and white sneaker next to a pile of shattered white electronics and tangled black wires on a grey floor.\", \"A person wearing dark pants and grey sneakers uses a green-handled tool to smash several electronic components, including a white speaker, on a grey concrete floor. The loud, sharp cracking sounds of the breaking objects are accompanied by a male voice commenting, \\\"Oh, geez, the folk ones even had a little insulation in there.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 48.192, "generation_time_seconds": 46.841, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "567", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The child in blue placed a red object in the toy pirate boat, followed by a white end with a voice and music.", "pred": "A young child is shown with a brown pirate ship ride-on toy on a beige carpet. The toy has a white sail with a black skull and crossbones, a blue seat, a yellow mast, and a small blue bucket on top. A small pirate flag with a skull and crossbones is attached to the back of the toy. The toy has four wheels. A \"Little Tikes\" logo is visible in the bottom right corner of the screen. The child moves the toy slightly, then the scene cuts to the \"Little Tikes\" logo on a white background with blue dots. The child is not seen again. A female voice speaks, saying, \"in the hatch when the adventures are done for the day.\" Upbeat, synthesized music plays in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young child is shown with a brown pirate ship ride-on toy on a beige carpet. The toy has a white sail with a black skull and crossbones, a blue seat, a yellow mast, and a small blue bucket on top. A small pirate flag with a skull and crossbones is attached to the back of the toy. The toy has four wheels. A \"Little Tikes\" logo is visible in the bottom right corner of the screen. The child moves the toy slightly, then the scene cuts to the \"Little Tikes\" logo on a white background with blue dots. The child is not seen again. A female voice speaks, saying, \"in the hatch when the adventures are done for the day.\" Upbeat, synthesized music plays in the background.", "cot": "[\"A young child is shown with a brown pirate ship ride-on toy on a beige carpet. The toy has a white sail with a black skull and crossbones, a blue seat, a yellow mast, and a small blue bucket on top. A small pirate flag with a skull and crossbones is attached to the back of the toy. The toy has four wheels. A \\\"Little Tikes\\\" logo is visible in the bottom right corner of the screen. The child moves the toy slightly, then the scene cuts to the \\\"Little Tikes\\\" logo on a white background with blue dots. The child is not seen again. A female voice speaks, saying, \\\"in the hatch when the adventures are done for the day.\\\" Upbeat, synthesized music plays in the background.\", \"A child's hand pushes a brown Little Tikes pirate ship ride-on toy. A female voice says, \\\"In the hatch when the adventures are done for the day.\\\" The \\\"Little tikes\\\" logo is visible.\\n\\\\boxed{A child's hand pushes a brown pirate ship ride-on toy as a female voice says, \\\"In the hatch when the adventures are done for the day.\\\"}\", \"A young boy sits on a brown and blue pirate ship ride-on toy with a skull and crossbones sail. He pushes the toy across a beige carpet, and a narrator says, \\\"In the hatch when the adventures are done for the day,\\\" over upbeat music.\", \"A young child sits on a brown and beige Little Tikes pirate ship ride-on toy on a carpeted floor as a woman's voice speaks over upbeat background music.\"]", "time_sec": 68.707, "generation_time_seconds": 68.1247, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.73, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "568", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the music went on, a man covered his face with his hand, and the picture turned, a woman with a pair of ponytails tilted her head against the tree.", "pred": "This is a music video montage. The visuals alternate between a close-up of a hand with a painted smiling face and a young woman in a white dress standing in a foggy, dark forest. The audio consists of a male vocalist singing in English, accompanied by a rock band with electric guitar, bass, and drums.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "This is a music video montage. The visuals alternate between a close-up of a hand with a painted smiling face and a young woman in a white dress standing in a foggy, dark forest. The audio consists of a male vocalist singing in English, accompanied by a rock band with electric guitar, bass, and drums.", "cot": "[\"This is a music video montage. The visuals alternate between a close-up of a hand with a painted smiling face and a young woman in a white dress standing in a foggy, dark forest. The audio consists of a male vocalist singing in English, accompanied by a rock band with electric guitar, bass, and drums.\", \"The video displays a close-up of a hand with a painted face on the palm, followed by a person in a light-colored dress standing in a dark, foggy environment. Over this, a male vocalist sings a rock song accompanied by an electric guitar and drums.\", \"A young woman with pigtails stands in a misty, wooded area, while a male vocalist sings a slow rock song with drums, bass, and keyboard accompaniment.\", \"A woman with dreadlocks is shown in a dark, misty forest. She wears a light-colored top and stands beside a tree with a heart carved into it. In the foreground, a hand with painted eyelashes and lips covers a person's face. The audio features a male vocalist singing over a rock song with a prominent electric guitar.\"]", "time_sec": 53.213, "generation_time_seconds": 52.3968, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "569", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On a rainy night in the street, a man in a red and black coat drove a black car, knocked down a man in red, then got out to check and the two talked. During the rain.", "pred": "A person in a red hooded sweatshirt is seen in a rainy, urban environment, first looking down at a car and then looking up and speaking. Simultaneously, the audio captures a loud scream, the sound of heavy rain, and the person speaking in French.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a red hooded sweatshirt is seen in a rainy, urban environment, first looking down at a car and then looking up and speaking. Simultaneously, the audio captures a loud scream, the sound of heavy rain, and the person speaking in French.", "cot": "[\"A person in a red hooded sweatshirt is seen in a rainy, urban environment, first looking down at a car and then looking up and speaking. Simultaneously, the audio captures a loud scream, the sound of heavy rain, and the person speaking in French.\", \"Based on the audio, a man is shouting in distress, followed by another man speaking in French with concern. The scene is filled with loud crashing and shattering sounds, as if a car has just crashed.\", \"A man in a red hooded sweatshirt looks up in surprise as another man in a dark coat stands beside a car in the rain. The man in the red hoodie shouts in French, \\\"Oh mon dieu, ça va? Vous n'êtes pas mort?\\\" The other man replies, \\\"Bienvenue, Monsieur le Directeur,\\\" to which the first man responds, \\\"Monsieur Baïal?\\\"\", \"A person in a red hooded sweatshirt gets out of a car in the rain. The person in the red hoodie yells in surprise, then speaks in French to another person.\"]", "time_sec": 52.543, "generation_time_seconds": 52.0309, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.74, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "570", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man dressed in white shouted and struck the board in front of him with his hand. There was a round of applause. and beside a one person was sat in the ground.", "pred": "A person in a white uniform breaks a wooden board, followed by the loud crack of the board breaking, a yell from the breaker, and a crowd cheering.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a white uniform breaks a wooden board, followed by the loud crack of the board breaking, a yell from the breaker, and a crowd cheering.", "cot": "[\"A person in a white uniform breaks a wooden board, followed by the loud crack of the board breaking, a yell from the breaker, and a crowd cheering.\", \"A person in a white karate uniform performs a hand strike on a wooden board, which then breaks apart, while a crowd cheers loudly in the background.\", \"The audio captures the sound of shattering glass, a man yelling in pain, and a roaring crowd, while the visual shows a martial artist in a white gi breaking a wooden board with their hand, sending splinters flying.\", \"A person in a white uniform performs a jumping side kick, breaking a wooden board. A loud crack is heard, followed by a shout and crowd applause.\"]", "time_sec": 40.105, "generation_time_seconds": 39.5126, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "571", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A white dog, lying in a white quilt, snoring with his eyes closed.", "pred": "I see two small, light-colored dogs lying together on white bedding. I hear one of them snoring deeply and rhythmically.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "I see two small, light-colored dogs lying together on white bedding. I hear one of them snoring deeply and rhythmically.", "cot": "[\"I see two small, light-colored dogs lying together on white bedding. I hear one of them snoring deeply and rhythmically.\", \"This is a very low-quality, blurry close-up of two small, light-colored dogs sleeping on white bedding. The audio consists of a continuous, low-frequency electronic hum, with no other discernible sounds.\", \"A small, light-colored dog is sleeping on rumpled white sheets, and its breathing produces audible snoring sounds.\", \"Two small, light-colored dogs are curled up and sleeping together on a white, crumpled surface. The audio consists of a loud, low-pitched, continuous buzzing sound, similar to a large insect like a bumblebee, with no discernible speech or other sounds.\"]", "time_sec": 41.362, "generation_time_seconds": 40.8692, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "572", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the music went on, two white animals poured something into their mouths, and next to the gray stone wall, images of several small animals burping were switched to play.", "pred": "The scene is a chaotic beach party where animated animal characters are gathered around a table with bottles. Amidst this, a large, white rabbit with an exaggerated open mouth is prominently featured. The audio consists of a loud, deep, guttural growl, similar to that of a monster or dinosaur, layered over upbeat electronic music.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The scene is a chaotic beach party where animated animal characters are gathered around a table with bottles. Amidst this, a large, white rabbit with an exaggerated open mouth is prominently featured. The audio consists of a loud, deep, guttural growl, similar to that of a monster or dinosaur, layered over upbeat electronic music.", "cot": "[\"The scene is a chaotic beach party where animated animal characters are gathered around a table with bottles. Amidst this, a large, white rabbit with an exaggerated open mouth is prominently featured. The audio consists of a loud, deep, guttural growl, similar to that of a monster or dinosaur, layered over upbeat electronic music.\", \"The audio consists of a continuous sequence of loud, guttural burps and groans. The video shows a cartoon raccoon-like character with a large afro and a blindfold, roaring aggressively, interspersed with a shot of a white rabbit with an open mouth.\", \"A group of anthropomorphic rabbit characters are on a sunny beach with lounge chairs and bottles, then the scene cuts to a close-up of a single white rabbit with a wide, toothy grin, all while a prominent, loud, and wet gagging or retching sound is heard.\", \"The video shows a cartoon rabbit with a green blindfold and a long snout, wearing a brown vest, standing in a sunlit outdoor setting with beach chairs and a picnic blanket. The rabbit's mouth is open, and it is making loud, guttural belching sounds.\"]", "time_sec": 54.916, "generation_time_seconds": 54.3522, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "573", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "There was a voice in the picture, and a hand pressed a button on the black machine, making a dripping sound.", "pred": "A finger presses the 'Master Enable' button on a black APC Back-UPS ES 750 power strip, which then emits a series of electronic beeps.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A finger presses the 'Master Enable' button on a black APC Back-UPS ES 750 power strip, which then emits a series of electronic beeps.", "cot": "[\"A finger presses the 'Master Enable' button on a black APC Back-UPS ES 750 power strip, which then emits a series of electronic beeps.\", \"A person presses a button on a black APC Back-UPS ES 750 power protector, and as they do, a continuous electronic alarm sound begins to play.\", \"A close-up shows a finger pressing a black toggle switch labeled 'Master ENABLE' on a black APC Back-UPS ES 750 device, which is accompanied by a person speaking and a high-pitched electronic beep.\", \"A finger presses a button on a black APC Back-UPS ES 750 device, and a man explains the function of the 'master enable' button as the device emits a mechanical click and a high-pitched electronic beep.\"]", "time_sec": 42.107, "generation_time_seconds": 41.4654, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "574", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A fan on a large black machine that makes a buzzing sound during slow rotation, and a person's voice.", "pred": "The audio features the deep, resonant rumble of a large aircraft engine, while the visuals show a detailed, cutaway model of a jet engine with a large fan and densely packed internal components.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features the deep, resonant rumble of a large aircraft engine, while the visuals show a detailed, cutaway model of a jet engine with a large fan and densely packed internal components.", "cot": "[\"The audio features the deep, resonant rumble of a large aircraft engine, while the visuals show a detailed, cutaway model of a jet engine with a large fan and densely packed internal components.\", \"The video displays a close-up of a large jet engine's fan blades and internal turbine structure. Simultaneously, the audio presents the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large vehicle engine.\", \"The video displays a detailed, static, cross-sectional view of a large jet engine's fan and turbine components, while the audio captures the low, continuous hum of the engine and the indistinct murmur of people in a large, echoing indoor space.\", \"The video shows a detailed, cross-sectional view of a large jet engine's fan blades and compressor stages. Simultaneously, the audio captures the loud, low-frequency roar of the engine itself, accompanied by a continuous, high-pitched mechanical whine.\"]", "time_sec": 45.861, "generation_time_seconds": 45.1416, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "575", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Four men were digging a ditch on a grass, and three men in the distance shoveled the earth with spades, making a rustling sound, and a man close by tapped down with a hammer, making a clicking sound, while a woman spoke.", "pred": "Several people dig a long trench in a grassy yard, with one man in a dark hooded sweatshirt operating a jackhammer that produces a loud, rhythmic, mechanical sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Several people dig a long trench in a grassy yard, with one man in a dark hooded sweatshirt operating a jackhammer that produces a loud, rhythmic, mechanical sound.", "cot": "[\"Several people dig a long trench in a grassy yard, with one man in a dark hooded sweatshirt operating a jackhammer that produces a loud, rhythmic, mechanical sound.\", \"The audio contains the distinct sound of a film camera shutter clicking rapidly, followed by two women speaking. Simultaneously, the visual scene shows four people working outdoors in a grassy area; one person is bent over and digging into a long trench with a shovel, while another person stands in the trench and two others stand on the ground nearby.\", \"Several people are digging a long trench in a grassy yard, with one person operating a jackhammer from within the trench, while a woman's voice can be heard asking another woman if something is coming out.\", \"In a sunlit garden, four people dig a trench, with one man in a blue shirt operating a mechanical trencher that produces a loud, high-pitched grinding sound, while another person in a grey shirt stands on the trench's edge, and a woman's voice is heard asking, \\\"Is it coming out?\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 51.889, "generation_time_seconds": 50.3743, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.3, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "576", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On the singing stage, a man and a woman were singing heartily with a microphone.", "pred": "The scene opens on a woman with long hair and a sparkly top holding a microphone to her ear. The camera then cuts to a man with short dark hair wearing a dark long-sleeved shirt, who is actively singing into a microphone. Throughout the entire clip, the audio consists of a loud, sustained, high-pitched electronic tone, similar to a synthesizer or siren, with no speech or other background sounds audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The scene opens on a woman with long hair and a sparkly top holding a microphone to her ear. The camera then cuts to a man with short dark hair wearing a dark long-sleeved shirt, who is actively singing into a microphone. Throughout the entire clip, the audio consists of a loud, sustained, high-pitched electronic tone, similar to a synthesizer or siren, with no speech or other background sounds audible.", "cot": "[\"The scene opens on a woman with long hair and a sparkly top holding a microphone to her ear. The camera then cuts to a man with short dark hair wearing a dark long-sleeved shirt, who is actively singing into a microphone. Throughout the entire clip, the audio consists of a loud, sustained, high-pitched electronic tone, similar to a synthesizer or siren, with no speech or other background sounds audible.\", \"The video shows a female singer on stage, followed by a male singer, both performing with microphones. The audio consists of the live performance, including music, crowd cheering, and a loud, sustained horn-like sound.\", \"The video shows a woman in a sparkly top and a man in a dark long-sleeved shirt, both singing into microphones on a dark stage. The audio consists of a loud, high-pitched, and sustained electronic tone.\", \"The video shows a man in a dark shirt singing into a microphone on a stage with a dark background, while the audio features the loud wail of a siren, crowd cheering, and music.\"]", "time_sec": 52.192, "generation_time_seconds": 51.6603, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "577", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two men in yellow and black clothes held a rope and a man ascended the stairs with an alarm.", "pred": "A firefighter in full gear climbs a wooden ladder, with a large yellow pole visible nearby, while a loud, rhythmic, high-pitched beeping sound, like a reversing vehicle alarm, is heard continuously in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A firefighter in full gear climbs a wooden ladder, with a large yellow pole visible nearby, while a loud, rhythmic, high-pitched beeping sound, like a reversing vehicle alarm, is heard continuously in the background.", "cot": "[\"A firefighter in full gear climbs a wooden ladder, with a large yellow pole visible nearby, while a loud, rhythmic, high-pitched beeping sound, like a reversing vehicle alarm, is heard continuously in the background.\", \"A firefighter in full gear climbs a ladder on the side of a building while a loud, continuous alarm sounds and people shout urgently in the background.\", \"A firefighter in yellow-striped gear climbs a ladder while a loud, continuous alarm sounds and a male voice shouts in the background.\", \"A firefighter in a yellow and black uniform climbs a ladder next to a building with white siding, while an alarm sounds and a male voice shouts in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 38.107, "generation_time_seconds": 37.383, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0005, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "578", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man gently fiddled with the strings of the instrument, the sound of the strings jingling from the fingertips.", "pred": "A close-up of a ukulele fretboard shows a white 'G' note marker, with a light blue Korg tuner above it, while a single, clear 'G' note is played on the instrument.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A close-up of a ukulele fretboard shows a white 'G' note marker, with a light blue Korg tuner above it, while a single, clear 'G' note is played on the instrument.", "cot": "[\"A close-up of a ukulele fretboard shows a white 'G' note marker, with a light blue Korg tuner above it, while a single, clear 'G' note is played on the instrument.\", \"A hand plucks a single string on a ukulele, producing a clear, high-pitched musical note.\", \"A close-up shows a ukulele fretboard with a white 'G' note marker. Next to it is a small, light blue electronic tuner. A person plucks a single, clean note on the ukulele, which the tuner then displays.\", \"A hand plucks a single, sustained note on a ukulele. The sound is a clear, high-pitched G, and the note rings out with a natural reverb.\"]", "time_sec": 42.516, "generation_time_seconds": 42.0553, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "579", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "There was a little brown gray wolf with a blue tie on his neck,  jumping around and around, his mouth still rattling.", "pred": "A brown cartoon canine with a blue tie and striped arm band stands against a white background, its arms moving as if dancing to a synthesized, high-pitched melody accompanied by distinct 'meow' sound effects.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A brown cartoon canine with a blue tie and striped arm band stands against a white background, its arms moving as if dancing to a synthesized, high-pitched melody accompanied by distinct 'meow' sound effects.", "cot": "[\"A brown cartoon canine with a blue tie and striped arm band stands against a white background, its arms moving as if dancing to a synthesized, high-pitched melody accompanied by distinct 'meow' sound effects.\", \"A cartoon drawing of a brown, bipedal wolf-like creature with a blue tie and a striped cast on its left arm waves its arms against a white background while the sound of a simple, synthesized, chiptune-like melody and a high-pitched, repetitive \\\"nya\\\" sound play.\", \"This is an animated sequence featuring a brown, anthropomorphic wolf character with its eyes closed and arms raised, wearing a blue tie with a red heart; the character repeatedly performs a waving motion while a synthesized, chiptune-style melody plays, accompanied by a high-pitched, game-like \\\"meow\\\" sound effect.\", \"A static image of a cartoon fennec fox with a blue tie and a black-and-white striped arm band is shown, accompanied by a repetitive, synthesized, high-pitched 'meow' sound.\"]", "time_sec": 49.628, "generation_time_seconds": 49.1245, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "580", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man skillfully manipulates the typewriter on the desk, which clicks and clicks to a white paper.", "pred": "A pair of hands types on a vintage, dark green portable typewriter. The rhythmic, mechanical clatter of the keys and the sound of the carriage return lever being operated are clearly audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A pair of hands types on a vintage, dark green portable typewriter. The rhythmic, mechanical clatter of the keys and the sound of the carriage return lever being operated are clearly audible.", "cot": "[\"A pair of hands types on a vintage, dark green portable typewriter. The rhythmic, mechanical clatter of the keys and the sound of the carriage return lever being operated are clearly audible.\", \"A person's hands are actively typing on a vintage, olive-green typewriter, which is producing the rapid, rhythmic clattering and distinct mechanical sounds of the keys and carriage return.\", \"A person's hands type on a vintage typewriter, which produces the rhythmic clatter of keys and the mechanical sound of the carriage return.\", \"A person's hands type on a vintage, olive-drab typewriter, producing rapid, mechanical clacking sounds as the carriage return lever is pulled.\"]", "time_sec": 38.972, "generation_time_seconds": 38.345, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "581", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the crickets croaked, a white-haired man in a green dress and headphones sat in a chair in an Internet cafe, with a crowd of people whining and talking, and a woman in a yellow-green dress and a red backpack in her hands talking to him .", "pred": "The scene opens with a group of people in a dimly lit room, focused on computer screens, accompanied by the sounds of cricket chirping and overlapping male and female voices speaking in Mandarin.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The scene opens with a group of people in a dimly lit room, focused on computer screens, accompanied by the sounds of cricket chirping and overlapping male and female voices speaking in Mandarin.", "cot": "[\"The scene opens with a group of people in a dimly lit room, focused on computer screens, accompanied by the sounds of cricket chirping and overlapping male and female voices speaking in Mandarin.\", \"The scene is a crowded anime room where people watch a screen, and a man with white hair and headphones smiles, all while a cricket chirps and multiple people speak in Mandarin Chinese.\", \"The scene shows a group of young people in a dimly lit room, with one person in the foreground wearing a headset and a white-haired person smiling, while a loud, high-pitched electronic beep sounds in the background.\", \"A group of animated characters are gathered in a dimly lit room, with one individual in the foreground wearing a headset and looking towards the viewer, while the sounds of crickets chirping and multiple people exclaiming in Chinese can be heard.\"]", "time_sec": 43.829, "generation_time_seconds": 43.0615, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.55, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "582", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On the table there was a plate of chicken legs, a plate of green dishes and a plate of white dishes, and with the sound of chewing the food, a pair of orange chopsticks held up a shrimps, and the chopsticks turned the dishes through the plate.", "pred": "The image displays a meal of braised chicken, stir-fried greens, and a shrimp dish with chopsticks, while the audio contains sounds of chewing and crunching, consistent with eating the food.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The image displays a meal of braised chicken, stir-fried greens, and a shrimp dish with chopsticks, while the audio contains sounds of chewing and crunching, consistent with eating the food.", "cot": "[\"The image displays a meal of braised chicken, stir-fried greens, and a shrimp dish with chopsticks, while the audio contains sounds of chewing and crunching, consistent with eating the food.\", \"The video shows a meal of barbecued chicken, shrimp and egg, and blanched greens on plates, while the audio captures the distinct sound of someone chewing and crunching food.\", \"The audio captures the wet, rhythmic chewing of someone eating a meal of braised chicken legs, a bowl of shrimp and egg salad, and a side of blanched greens.\", \"A person uses pink chopsticks to eat scrambled eggs with shrimp from a white bowl, alongside braised chicken legs on a white plate and steamed greens on a green checkered plate, while the sound of chewing is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 43.091, "generation_time_seconds": 42.0359, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.51, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "583", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "To the music, a man was in the room with one hand in his mouth and one hand dragging the instrument in front of it.", "pred": "A man wearing glasses is indoors, holding a long, decorated didgeridoo to his mouth and blowing into it, producing a deep, continuous, resonant drone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man wearing glasses is indoors, holding a long, decorated didgeridoo to his mouth and blowing into it, producing a deep, continuous, resonant drone.", "cot": "[\"A man wearing glasses is indoors, holding a long, decorated didgeridoo to his mouth and blowing into it, producing a deep, continuous, resonant drone.\", \"A man wearing glasses holds a long, decorated didgeridoo to his mouth and blows into it, producing a deep, low-pitched, droning sound.\", \"A man with glasses is playing a long, decorated didgeridoo indoors, creating a deep, resonant, and continuous drone.\", \"A man with glasses is playing a long, decorated didgeridoo in a room, which produces a deep, resonant drone.\\n\\\\boxed{A man with glasses plays a long, decorated didgeridoo in a room, producing a deep, resonant drone.}\"]", "time_sec": 40.901, "generation_time_seconds": 40.3883, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "584", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The yellow bird in the outdoor cage makes a sound, alongside the woman's voice.", "pred": "Two cockatiels are inside a wire cage, with one bird perched near a yellow toy. A person can be heard speaking to them, saying, \"You're pretty, Fred\" and \"Pretty bird,\" while the birds vocalize with high-pitched chirps and whistles.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Two cockatiels are inside a wire cage, with one bird perched near a yellow toy. A person can be heard speaking to them, saying, \"You're pretty, Fred\" and \"Pretty bird,\" while the birds vocalize with high-pitched chirps and whistles.", "cot": "[\"Two cockatiels are inside a wire cage, with one bird perched near a yellow toy. A person can be heard speaking to them, saying, \\\"You're pretty, Fred\\\" and \\\"Pretty bird,\\\" while the birds vocalize with high-pitched chirps and whistles.\", \"Two light-colored cockatiels are inside a wire cage. One bird perches on a yellow enrichment toy while the other is on a wooden bar. The bird on the toy vocalizes with a high-pitched chirp, and a human female speaks to the birds, saying, \\\"You're pretty, Fred. Pretty bird.\\\"\", \"Two cockatiels are inside a wire cage with a yellow toy; a person is heard speaking to them, saying, \\\"You're pretty Fred, pretty bird.\\\".\", \"Two light-colored cockatiels are inside a wire cage, and one of them is chirping. A person speaks to the bird, calling it \\\"Fred\\\" and a \\\"pretty bird.\\\"\\n\\\\boxed{Two cockatiels are inside a wire cage, and one chirps while a person speaks to it, calling it Fred and a pretty bird.}\"]", "time_sec": 53.421, "generation_time_seconds": 52.7617, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "585", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the woman spoke, a hand reached into the nest of a beak, which purred.", "pred": "A toucan with an orange, black, and white beak peeks from a dark cavity, while the sound of a woman speaking is followed by the clinking of ice cubes in a glass.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A toucan with an orange, black, and white beak peeks from a dark cavity, while the sound of a woman speaking is followed by the clinking of ice cubes in a glass.", "cot": "[\"A toucan with an orange, black, and white beak peeks from a dark cavity, while the sound of a woman speaking is followed by the clinking of ice cubes in a glass.\", \"A toucan with a large orange bill and blue eye-ring pecks at a human hand inside a dark crevice, while a person speaks and a mechanical whirring sound occurs.\", \"The video shows a toucan with an orange beak peeking from a dark hole in a wooden structure, while a person's hand touches its beak, accompanied by human speech and a rattling sound.\", \"A toucan peeks from a tree hollow as a human hand enters the frame; simultaneously, a person speaks, followed by a loud mechanical whirring and buzzing sound.\"]", "time_sec": 42.525, "generation_time_seconds": 41.8715, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "586", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A toy man in the room rode a toy horse, walking on the ground, the horse hissed.", "pred": "A white toy horse with a rider is shown, its eyes illuminated with red LEDs, while the audio features the high-pitched, rhythmic squeaking of a mechanical toy being operated.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A white toy horse with a rider is shown, its eyes illuminated with red LEDs, while the audio features the high-pitched, rhythmic squeaking of a mechanical toy being operated.", "cot": "[\"A white toy horse with a rider is shown, its eyes illuminated with red LEDs, while the audio features the high-pitched, rhythmic squeaking of a mechanical toy being operated.\", \"A white toy horse with a brown-haired rider performs a mechanical walk, its eyes flashing red, as the distinct sound of a goat bleating is heard in the background.\", \"A white toy horse with a rider is shown, with its eyes illuminated by red lights. This visual is accompanied by the sound of a goat bleating, followed by a person speaking.\", \"A toy horse with a rider moves, its eyes glowing red, while a goat bleats loudly in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 38.326, "generation_time_seconds": 37.7819, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "587", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A house is burning with white smoke, and there is a noise and a man's voice.", "pred": "A large building is fully engulfed in intense orange flames and thick smoke at night. Simultaneously, the sounds of a fire and a male voice communicating over a radio are heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large building is fully engulfed in intense orange flames and thick smoke at night. Simultaneously, the sounds of a fire and a male voice communicating over a radio are heard.", "cot": "[\"A large building is fully engulfed in intense orange flames and thick smoke at night. Simultaneously, the sounds of a fire and a male voice communicating over a radio are heard.\", \"At night, a large building is fully engulfed in bright orange flames and thick smoke, with the crackling and roaring sounds of a major fire dominating the audio.\", \"The video shows a large fire at night, with intense flames and thick smoke engulfing a structure. This visual is accompanied by the loud, continuous roar of water being sprayed, likely from a fire hose, and the crackling of the fire itself.\\n\\\\boxed{A building burns fiercely at night, its windows ablaze with orange flames and billowing smoke, while the loud roar of firefighting water sprays fills the air.}\", \"A building is engulfed in flames at night. Radio chatter from a dispatcher and a responder can be heard over the loud crackle of the fire and the hiss of water being sprayed onto the blaze.\"]", "time_sec": 48.851, "generation_time_seconds": 48.0929, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "588", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Several brown sheep rested with the birds and the bleating of the sheep.", "pred": "The video shows a goat in a sandy enclosure, and the audio contains the distinct, repeated bleating of a goat.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a goat in a sandy enclosure, and the audio contains the distinct, repeated bleating of a goat.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a goat in a sandy enclosure, and the audio contains the distinct, repeated bleating of a goat.\", \"The video shows several dark and brown goats standing in a sandy, outdoor enclosure with a wall and palm trees in the background. The audio consists of the distinct bleating of goats, along with the sound of their hooves shuffling on the dry ground.\", \"A brown goat and a black goat stand in a dirt enclosure; the brown goat faces the camera and bleats while the black goat stands in the background.\", \"The video shows several goats in a dirt enclosure. One goat walks toward the camera, and the distinct bleating sound of a goat can be heard.\"]", "time_sec": 39.883, "generation_time_seconds": 39.1975, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "589", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the music, multiple images are switched continuously.", "pred": "The audio features a male vocalist singing a slow R&B song with a prominent, melodic bassline. Simultaneously, the video displays a series of rapid, disjointed visual clips, including close-ups of different individuals, a person holding a microphone, and a television screen showing lyrics.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The audio features a male vocalist singing a slow R&B song with a prominent, melodic bassline. Simultaneously, the video displays a series of rapid, disjointed visual clips, including close-ups of different individuals, a person holding a microphone, and a television screen showing lyrics.", "cot": "[\"The audio features a male vocalist singing a slow R&B song with a prominent, melodic bassline. Simultaneously, the video displays a series of rapid, disjointed visual clips, including close-ups of different individuals, a person holding a microphone, and a television screen showing lyrics.\", \"The provided audio is a musical recording of a male vocalist singing a slow R&B song over a smooth, melodic instrumental track. This audio is playing simultaneously with a video that contains a series of unrelated and rapidly changing visual scenes, including a close-up of a person's face, another person with their eyes closed, a view of a white staircase, and a final shot of a person standing in front of a large screen displaying the lyrics \\\"She's a brick...house, She's mighty, mighty just letting it hang\\\".\", \"A man with braided hair in a barber's chair is shown in close-up as a man sings the lyrics, \\\"What do I do with these feelings?\\\" and \\\"Longing to have you\\\" over a contemporary R&B track featuring a smooth bassline and keyboard chords.\", \"The visual shows a man with a goatee, a close-up of a hairdryer, and a presentation slide with the text \\\"She's a brick...house She's mighty, mighty just letting it hang\\\", while the audio features a male vocalist singing a contemporary R&B song with a smooth, melodic voice, accompanied by a keyboard and a steady drum beat.\"]", "time_sec": 64.9, "generation_time_seconds": 64.0201, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "590", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the open field, a black, white-smoking aircraft slowly moved along the runway, with the blender roaring sound .", "pred": "A military jet is on a runway in a dry, grassy field, and a loud, repetitive electronic alarm is sounding.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A military jet is on a runway in a dry, grassy field, and a loud, repetitive electronic alarm is sounding.", "cot": "[\"A military jet is on a runway in a dry, grassy field, and a loud, repetitive electronic alarm is sounding.\", \"A dark, twin-engine military jet is on a runway in a dry, brown field under an overcast sky, while a loud, two-tone air raid siren wails in the background.\", \"A dark military jet is on a runway in a flat, arid landscape, while a loud, wailing siren sounds in the background.\", \"A dark-colored jet aircraft is on a runway in a flat, grassy landscape. It is moving forward very slowly and appears to be stationary. Simultaneously, the loud, wailing sound of an emergency vehicle siren is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 39.736, "generation_time_seconds": 39.1661, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.39, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "591", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red plush toy and a blue plush toy are placed on the bed, and a red toy is thrown at the green plush toy in one hand, with a voice in the picture.", "pred": "The video shows a close-up of a red plush toy and a green plush toy on a carpeted floor. A child's voice says, \"And then I'll show you what I can do. Okay. Oh.\" This is followed by a loud, wet, and forceful spitting sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of a red plush toy and a green plush toy on a carpeted floor. A child's voice says, \"And then I'll show you what I can do. Okay. Oh.\" This is followed by a loud, wet, and forceful spitting sound.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a close-up of a red plush toy and a green plush toy on a carpeted floor. A child's voice says, \\\"And then I'll show you what I can do. Okay. Oh.\\\" This is followed by a loud, wet, and forceful spitting sound.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a red stuffed animal head, then a green stuffed animal on a carpet, and finally a person's foot next to the green animal. A child's voice is heard saying, \\\"And then I'll show you what I can do. Okay. Ah. Pfft. Grrr.\\\"\", \"The video shows a blurry close-up of a red toy, then a green and white stuffed animal on a light-colored carpet, while the audio captures a child speaking, followed by a loud belch and a subsequent fart sound effect.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a red, fluffy object and a green plush toy on a carpeted floor, accompanied by a child speaking, followed by the sound of a person consuming something wetly.\"]", "time_sec": 51.55, "generation_time_seconds": 50.8371, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "592", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman was in the room with an eyeshadow brush and talking as she drew it, and finally took two small bottles.", "pred": "A woman with blue hair applies makeup with a brush, then holds up two bottles of foundation while a voice describes the steps of blending and applying the product.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman with blue hair applies makeup with a brush, then holds up two bottles of foundation while a voice describes the steps of blending and applying the product.", "cot": "[\"A woman with blue hair applies makeup with a brush, then holds up two bottles of foundation while a voice describes the steps of blending and applying the product.\", \"A woman applies makeup with a brush while holding up two bottles of foundation. A narrator explains how to blend a reddish color and then begins to introduce the L'Oreal True Match foundation.\", \"A woman with blue hair uses a brush on her face, then holds up two bottles of foundation while a voiceover discusses blending colors and applying foundation.\", \"A woman with blue hair applies a reddish-brown liquid to her face with a brush, then holds up two bottles of foundation, as a voiceover identifies the product as L'Oreal True Match.\"]", "time_sec": 40.467, "generation_time_seconds": 39.6445, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.59, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "593", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red pen in one hand was written on the white board, making a rustle.", "pred": "A hand holds a red marker, drawing a thick, stylized 'S' letter on a white surface, while a person repeatedly inhales sharply through their nose.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A hand holds a red marker, drawing a thick, stylized 'S' letter on a white surface, while a person repeatedly inhales sharply through their nose.", "cot": "[\"A hand holds a red marker, drawing a thick, stylized 'S' letter on a white surface, while a person repeatedly inhales sharply through their nose.\", \"A hand uses a red marker to draw a graffiti-style tag on a white surface, accompanied by the continuous scratching sound of the marker on the paper.\", \"A hand uses a red marker to draw letters on a white surface, while the distinct sound of a knife being sharpened on a steel is heard in the background.\", \"A hand uses a red marker to draw graffiti on a white surface, while a dog pants and sniffs nearby.\"]", "time_sec": 36.189, "generation_time_seconds": 35.5748, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "594", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in green and black headphones, holding the machine in his hand, made a rumbling sound as a crowd stood watching.", "pred": "The scene shows a large, olive-drab military engine on a transport stand, surrounded by people in a workshop. A person in a camouflage uniform is atop the engine, and a blue barrel is beside it. The engine is running, producing a loud, low-frequency rumble.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The scene shows a large, olive-drab military engine on a transport stand, surrounded by people in a workshop. A person in a camouflage uniform is atop the engine, and a blue barrel is beside it. The engine is running, producing a loud, low-frequency rumble.", "cot": "[\"The scene shows a large, olive-drab military engine on a transport stand, surrounded by people in a workshop. A person in a camouflage uniform is atop the engine, and a blue barrel is beside it. The engine is running, producing a loud, low-frequency rumble.\", \"A large, olive-drab military engine is displayed on a stand, surrounded by people, while a loud, deep, and continuous mechanical rumbling sound is audible.\", \"A large, olive-drab military engine on a stand is stationary in a garage, while the loud, low-pitched rumble of a nearby idling large vehicle engine is heard.\", \"A large, olive-green radial aircraft engine mounted on a frame is idling loudly inside a large building, with people observing it.\"]", "time_sec": 42.341, "generation_time_seconds": 41.4764, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "595", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the outdoor parking lot, there are cars, one of which is a white BMW, the exhaust pipes are white smoke and buzzing, and men are talking.", "pred": "A person in a parking lot says, \"Let's do a little rev time,\" followed by the loud, deep roar of a car engine being revved aggressively.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person in a parking lot says, \"Let's do a little rev time,\" followed by the loud, deep roar of a car engine being revved aggressively.", "cot": "[\"A person in a parking lot says, \\\"Let's do a little rev time,\\\" followed by the loud, deep roar of a car engine being revved aggressively.\", \"I see a white BMW M4 with a quad exhaust system parked in a lot with other cars. A man speaks, and then the car's engine is revved loudly multiple times.\", \"A white BMW M4 with dual exhausts is shown from the rear in a parking lot, its engine being revved repeatedly as a person speaks.\", \"A white BMW M4 with a quad exhaust is showcased in a parking lot, and a man's voice is heard saying, \\\"Let's do a little rev time,\\\" immediately before a loud engine revs powerfully.\"]", "time_sec": 41.613, "generation_time_seconds": 40.5495, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "596", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Fireworks flickered in the streets and sky, and there was talk in the picture.", "pred": "I observe blurry, low-light night footage from a moving vehicle, showing bare trees, streetlights, and distant buildings, while the audio features a man speaking in German about setting off fireworks at 12 o'clock, followed by the loud sound of an actual firework exploding and crackling.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "I observe blurry, low-light night footage from a moving vehicle, showing bare trees, streetlights, and distant buildings, while the audio features a man speaking in German about setting off fireworks at 12 o'clock, followed by the loud sound of an actual firework exploding and crackling.", "cot": "[\"I observe blurry, low-light night footage from a moving vehicle, showing bare trees, streetlights, and distant buildings, while the audio features a man speaking in German about setting off fireworks at 12 o'clock, followed by the loud sound of an actual firework exploding and crackling.\", \"The video shows a shaky, nighttime view of bare trees and streetlights, with flashes of light suggesting fireworks in the sky, while a person speaks in German about not setting off fireworks before midnight, contrasting it with their own habit of doing so after 12:30 AM.\", \"The audio features a man speaking over the loud crackling and popping of fireworks, while the visual shows a nighttime street scene with bare trees, a street lamp, and streaks of light from fireworks in the sky.\", \"The audio features a man speaking in German about a firework display, while the video shows a blurry, shaky nighttime view of trees, streetlights, and distant, indistinct lights that could be fireworks.\"]", "time_sec": 49.564, "generation_time_seconds": 49.0117, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.26, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "597", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the sound of music, a group of men in black suits sat in the hall with their cellars.", "pred": "Two male musicians in black suits are seated on stage, one playing a violin and the other playing a cello, performing classical music.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Two male musicians in black suits are seated on stage, one playing a violin and the other playing a cello, performing classical music.", "cot": "[\"Two male musicians in black suits are seated on stage, one playing a violin and the other playing a cello, performing classical music.\", \"Two male musicians in dark suits perform a classical duet on a wooden stage; one plays the violin while the other plays the viola, their bows moving in unison as they play a somber, string-led piece of music.\", \"Two men in dark suits are seated on a wooden stage, playing string instruments. The man on the left is playing a violin, and the man on the right is playing a viola. They are both looking down at sheet music on stands in front of them. A slow, melancholic piece of classical music is being performed by a string quartet.\", \"Two men in black suits are performing on the violin and cello, accompanied by the sound of a string section.\"]", "time_sec": 45.002, "generation_time_seconds": 44.2324, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 4.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "598", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the picture, a tool is cutting a piece of wood and making a noisy sound.", "pred": "A power saw blade rapidly spins and cuts a rectangular block of light-colored wood, guided by a stationary red laser line, while a loud, high-pitched whirring sound is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A power saw blade rapidly spins and cuts a rectangular block of light-colored wood, guided by a stationary red laser line, while a loud, high-pitched whirring sound is heard.", "cot": "[\"A power saw blade rapidly spins and cuts a rectangular block of light-colored wood, guided by a stationary red laser line, while a loud, high-pitched whirring sound is heard.\", \"A circular saw blade spins rapidly, cutting through a piece of light-colored wood along a red laser line, while the high-pitched whir of the power tool dominates the audio.\", \"A power saw blade spins rapidly and cuts through a piece of light-colored wood, guided by a horizontal red laser line and a vertical black line, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched whirring of the machine.\", \"The video shows a close-up of a power saw blade cutting along a red laser line on a piece of light-colored wood, while the audio captures the high-pitched whine of the saw motor and the abrasive sound of the blade cutting through the material.\"]", "time_sec": 44.645, "generation_time_seconds": 43.9146, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "599", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Three women in white and black trousers, standing in front of a white background, with white square boxes in their hands, were speaking while passing a man in a gray leopard print jacket and a phone in his left hand.", "pred": "The video shows three women in white \"AFROBEAT 360\" t-shirts holding white boxes against a white background, with a man joining them. The audio features a person speaking the website \"afrobeat360.com\" over background music, which is then interrupted by a loud, harsh electronic buzzer sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows three women in white \"AFROBEAT 360\" t-shirts holding white boxes against a white background, with a man joining them. The audio features a person speaking the website \"afrobeat360.com\" over background music, which is then interrupted by a loud, harsh electronic buzzer sound.", "cot": "[\"The video shows three women in white \\\"AFROBEAT 360\\\" t-shirts holding white boxes against a white background, with a man joining them. The audio features a person speaking the website \\\"afrobeat360.com\\\" over background music, which is then interrupted by a loud, harsh electronic buzzer sound.\", \"The video displays a series of static promotional images for \\\"Afrobeat 360,\\\" featuring different groups of people posing with white boxes against a white background. Over this, a female voice speaks a website address, followed by a male voice and music, before being abruptly cut off by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.\", \"The audio consists of a male voiceover advertising \\\"Afrobeat360.com.\\\" Simultaneously, the visuals show three women in white t-shirts holding white boxes against a white background, followed by a logo screen, and then a scene with the same women and two men.\", \"The scene opens with three women holding white objects against a plain background. A male voice sings a brief phrase, followed by the sound of a large splash. The scene then changes to show four people, two women and two men, standing together.\"]", "time_sec": 56.832, "generation_time_seconds": 56.0313, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.58, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "600", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the sound of the water and the rustling of the conversation, a man in a gray coat squatted and spoke, and water spilled over the grey cloth toward the plastic bag in the forest.", "pred": "A man in camouflage pants kneels under a grey tarp in a wooded area, speaking while a clear bag collects liquid from a red and yellow hose attached to a tree; the sound of running water is heard as he explains he is using the hose to collect water for filtration in the morning.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in camouflage pants kneels under a grey tarp in a wooded area, speaking while a clear bag collects liquid from a red and yellow hose attached to a tree; the sound of running water is heard as he explains he is using the hose to collect water for filtration in the morning.", "cot": "[\"A man in camouflage pants kneels under a grey tarp in a wooded area, speaking while a clear bag collects liquid from a red and yellow hose attached to a tree; the sound of running water is heard as he explains he is using the hose to collect water for filtration in the morning.\", \"A man in a forest setting under a tarp explains that he will use a hose to collect water, as he notes that it is not raining. The sound of flowing water from the hose begins immediately after he speaks.\", \"A man in camouflage pants crouches under a tarp in a wooded area, explaining he will collect water, but as he speaks, the sound of a hose spraying water is heard.\", \"A man in camouflage crouches by a tarp shelter in a forest and explains he'll collect water, but as no rain is falling, he turns on a hose to demonstrate, the sound of flowing water filling the air.\"]", "time_sec": 48.48, "generation_time_seconds": 46.8975, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "601", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A white-bearded old man in a hat was talking to the next person, and the room was covered with decorative paintings.", "pred": "A man with a white beard, glasses, and a grey fedora is speaking in a room with framed pictures on the wall.\nThe audio contains a conversation between two men discussing a phone call, a person named Paul Heyman, and doing a \"money mailbag\".", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man with a white beard, glasses, and a grey fedora is speaking in a room with framed pictures on the wall.\nThe audio contains a conversation between two men discussing a phone call, a person named Paul Heyman, and doing a \"money mailbag\".", "cot": "[\"A man with a white beard, glasses, and a grey fedora is speaking in a room with framed pictures on the wall.\\nThe audio contains a conversation between two men discussing a phone call, a person named Paul Heyman, and doing a \\\"money mailbag\\\".\", \"I see a man with a white beard and hat, wearing glasses and a blue shirt, walking in a room with a wall of framed pictures and a plant. I hear a male voice asking if someone thought he was Paul Heyman on the phone, then another voice saying, \\\"You said, God, I'm gonna answer the phone,\\\" followed by a third voice saying, \\\"Okay,\\\" and then the first voice saying, \\\"You're not going nowhere, you gotta do the money mailbag,\\\" and the third voice replying, \\\"Alright, let's do the money mailbag, get it over with.\\\"\", \"An older man with a white beard and glasses, wearing a hat, speaks to the camera in a room with many pictures on the wall, while other men can be heard talking in the background.\", \"An older man with a white beard and glasses, wearing a hat, is speaking in a room with framed pictures and a plant, while a conversation about answering a phone and doing a 'money mailbag' is audible.\"]", "time_sec": 60.151, "generation_time_seconds": 59.2668, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "602", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two men in sunglasses were listening to the bells talking by the blue sky and the white clouds and the high mountains of the lake.", "pred": "A shirtless man wearing sunglasses and a necklace stands next to a body of water with mountains in the background, while distant male voices speak in English and a loud, sustained bell tolls.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A shirtless man wearing sunglasses and a necklace stands next to a body of water with mountains in the background, while distant male voices speak in English and a loud, sustained bell tolls.", "cot": "[\"A shirtless man wearing sunglasses and a necklace stands next to a body of water with mountains in the background, while distant male voices speak in English and a loud, sustained bell tolls.\", \"A man wearing sunglasses is on a boat on a lake with mountains in the background, and he is speaking while a large bell is ringing.\", \"A man wearing sunglasses and a necklace is on a boat on a lake with mountains in the background, while the sound of large bells ringing is audible.\", \"A man wearing sunglasses and a necklace is on a boat on a lake, looking around at mountains and buildings while people talk and a large bell rings in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 38.47, "generation_time_seconds": 37.7993, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "603", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black man and a white man, playing instruments in the grocery room, made a loud, poo-poo.", "pred": "A Black man in a black t-shirt plays a loud, high-pitched, and dissonant note on a brass trumpet. The sound is immediately followed by a second man in a blue shirt playing a rapid, high-pitched, and dissonant phrase on a second brass trumpet.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A Black man in a black t-shirt plays a loud, high-pitched, and dissonant note on a brass trumpet. The sound is immediately followed by a second man in a blue shirt playing a rapid, high-pitched, and dissonant phrase on a second brass trumpet.", "cot": "[\"A Black man in a black t-shirt plays a loud, high-pitched, and dissonant note on a brass trumpet. The sound is immediately followed by a second man in a blue shirt playing a rapid, high-pitched, and dissonant phrase on a second brass trumpet.\", \"The video shows two different men sequentially playing a brass trumpet, which produces a loud, high-pitched, and technically demanding solo performance.\", \"A man in a black t-shirt plays a bright, brassy trumpet solo in a room with a grey electrical panel.\\nThe audio consists of a loud, high-pitched trumpet playing a complex, virtuosic solo with rapid notes and slides.\\nThe visual and audio elements are synchronized, showing the man actively playing the instrument.\\n\\\\boxed{A man plays a loud, complex trumpet solo in a room with a grey electrical panel.}\", \"After a man plays a brass instrument, another man plays a trumpet while a loud, high-pitched, and sustained electronic buzzer sounds.\"]", "time_sec": 49.273, "generation_time_seconds": 48.6301, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.03, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "604", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "One man found the house in front of him on fire, braving thick smoke, talking and walking, with a dog barking.", "pred": "A house is engulfed in flames and thick black smoke, while a dog barks in the foreground.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A house is engulfed in flames and thick black smoke, while a dog barks in the foreground.", "cot": "[\"A house is engulfed in flames and thick black smoke, while a dog barks in the foreground.\", \"A house is engulfed in a large fire, emitting thick black smoke, while a person stands in the foreground and a dog barks in the audio.\", \"A house is engulfed in flames with thick black smoke rising into the sky, while a person is visible in the distance and a dog barks repeatedly in the foreground.\", \"A house is fully engulfed in flames, producing a large column of black smoke, while a dog barks in the foreground.\"]", "time_sec": 35.607, "generation_time_seconds": 35.0245, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 34.78, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "605", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a blue coat and glasses spoke at a black table on the stage, where there was a lot of stuff and a click of photos from below.", "pred": "A man in a lab coat stands on a stage, speaking about the 20th anniversary of an event while gesturing, as a low-frequency hum is audible in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a lab coat stands on a stage, speaking about the 20th anniversary of an event while gesturing, as a low-frequency hum is audible in the background.", "cot": "[\"A man in a lab coat stands on a stage, speaking about the 20th anniversary of an event while gesturing, as a low-frequency hum is audible in the background.\", \"A woman in a lab coat stands on a stage in a gymnasium, speaking to an audience with a microphone in front of a \\\"SCHIA\\\" banner, while a low-frequency hum is audible in the background.\", \"A man in a white lab coat stands on a stage behind a table, speaking to an audience in a gymnasium with a \\\"SCHIA\\\" banner visible behind him.\", \"A woman in a lab coat stands on a stage, speaking to an audience while holding a small object. A large black backdrop behind her displays the word \\\"SCIENCE\\\" in white letters. The audio consists of the woman's voice and faint background music.\"]", "time_sec": 44.78, "generation_time_seconds": 43.6399, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "606", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the lush woods, a man with a bamboo tube blew a beep.", "pred": "A person sits outdoors on a stool, playing a large wooden didgeridoo, producing a deep, rhythmic drone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person sits outdoors on a stool, playing a large wooden didgeridoo, producing a deep, rhythmic drone.", "cot": "[\"A person sits outdoors on a stool, playing a large wooden didgeridoo, producing a deep, rhythmic drone.\", \"A person wearing a dark t-shirt and beanie is sitting on a chair outdoors, playing a large wooden didgeridoo. The sound is a continuous, low-pitched, rhythmic drone, characteristic of the instrument.\", \"A person sits on a stool in a wooded area, blowing a long, wooden didgeridoo, producing a deep, rhythmic drone.\", \"A young man sits on a chair in a wooded area, blowing into a long, wooden didgeridoo. The instrument produces a continuous, low-pitched, droning sound.\"]", "time_sec": 39.528, "generation_time_seconds": 38.9208, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "607", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man explains the cs game and looks at the fatality rate of hitting each part of the player on the opposite side, then kills the player on the opposite side.", "pred": "\\boxed{A first-person video game scene in a dark environment features other characters and a heads-up display, accompanied by a continuous buzzing sound, gunfire, and a male voice speaking.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "1. **Visual Analysis**: The video displays a dark, first-person perspective of a video game. The player character is in an underground or ruined environment. The heads-up display (HUD) shows health, ammo, and an objective. Other characters, including one with glowing green skin, are present.\n2. **Audio Analysis**: The audio consists of multiple distinct sounds: a loud, continuous buzzing sound, the sharp report of gunfire, and a male voice speaking.\n3. **Integration**: Combining these observations, the scene is a first-person video game with a dark setting, featuring other characters, accompanied by a buzzing noise and gunfire, with a male voice providing commentary.\n\n\\boxed{A first-person video game scene in a dark environment features other characters and a heads-up display, accompanied by a continuous buzzing sound, gunfire, and a male voice speaking.}", "cot": "[\"1. **Visual Analysis**: The video displays a dark, first-person perspective of a video game. The player character is in an underground or ruined environment. The heads-up display (HUD) shows health, ammo, and an objective. Other characters, including one with glowing green skin, are present.\\n2. **Audio Analysis**: The audio consists of multiple distinct sounds: a loud, continuous buzzing sound, the sharp report of gunfire, and a male voice speaking.\\n3. **Integration**: Combining these observations, the scene is a first-person video game with a dark setting, featuring other characters, accompanied by a buzzing noise and gunfire, with a male voice providing commentary.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A first-person video game scene in a dark environment features other characters and a heads-up display, accompanied by a continuous buzzing sound, gunfire, and a male voice speaking.}\", \"In a dark, ruined environment, a player character holds a weapon while a large, glowing, shadowy creature with a fiery head is highlighted by a targeting reticle; during this, a voice says, \\\"Let's fight the guys with the guns first,\\\" followed by a loud, booming explosion and a distorted male voice saying, \\\"Get me off.\\\"\", \"A first-person view in a dark, ruined environment shows a player character with a glowing green object, as a male voice says, \\\"Let's fight the guys with the guns first,\\\" immediately before intense gunfire erupts.\", \"The scene shows a first-person video game where a player character with a gun aims at an enemy in a dim, stone-walled environment. Simultaneously, a male voice says, \\\"Let's fight the guys with the guns first,\\\" before a loud explosion and subsequent gunfire are heard.\"]", "time_sec": 73.584, "generation_time_seconds": 72.7595, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "608", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Three fowls were cackling at food in the wild, and people were talking.", "pred": "Multiple roosters and hens are in a dirt-floored enclosure with a white crate and a bucket. A person speaks in a non-English language, and the sounds of roosters crowing and chickens clucking can be heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Multiple roosters and hens are in a dirt-floored enclosure with a white crate and a bucket. A person speaks in a non-English language, and the sounds of roosters crowing and chickens clucking can be heard.", "cot": "[\"Multiple roosters and hens are in a dirt-floored enclosure with a white crate and a bucket. A person speaks in a non-English language, and the sounds of roosters crowing and chickens clucking can be heard.\", \"A rooster with dark, iridescent feathers and a red comb stands in a dirt pen, facing the camera, while a man speaks in Hindi and the distinct clucking of chickens is heard in the background.\", \"Multiple chickens, including a prominent black rooster, are seen moving around on a dirt ground within a wire mesh enclosure, while the distinct sounds of chickens clucking and a rooster crowing are heard in the background.\", \"In a dirt-floored aviary, a large black rooster with red wattles stands prominently as another rooster walks nearby and chickens cluck in the background, while a man speaks in Hindi.\"]", "time_sec": 46.289, "generation_time_seconds": 45.328, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "609", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the narration went on, a big dog was growling at a puppy lying on the floor.", "pred": "A large, light-colored dog stands over a small, white puppy on a rug in a living room, while a person speaks and a dog growls.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large, light-colored dog stands over a small, white puppy on a rug in a living room, while a person speaks and a dog growls.", "cot": "[\"A large, light-colored dog stands over a small, white puppy on a rug in a living room, while a person speaks and a dog growls.\", \"A large, light-colored dog stands over a small, white puppy on a wood floor, with a dark-furred dog visible in the foreground. A woman speaks, saying Oakley has played with the puppy a few times, while the dogs bark and growl.\", \"A large, light-colored dog stands over a small, white puppy on a wooden floor, while a larger, dark-furred dog is visible in the foreground. The sound of a woman speaking is followed by a deep, guttural growl.\", \"A large husky dog playfully interacts with a small white puppy on a rug in a cluttered living room, while a woman speaks in the background and the dog growls.\"]", "time_sec": 44.993, "generation_time_seconds": 44.1507, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.39, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "610", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a small child at the computer desk clicked his keyboard and mouse in a random manner, making a clicking sound, and a grown-up voice said something.", "pred": "A young child in a floral shirt stands at a desk, touching a black keyboard. A zipper opens, followed by a man's voice saying \"Ah\" and \"Yeah.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young child in a floral shirt stands at a desk, touching a black keyboard. A zipper opens, followed by a man's voice saying \"Ah\" and \"Yeah.\"", "cot": "[\"A young child in a floral shirt stands at a desk, touching a black keyboard. A zipper opens, followed by a man's voice saying \\\"Ah\\\" and \\\"Yeah.\\\"\", \"A young child in a floral shirt stands at a desk, pressing keys on a black keyboard. This action is accompanied by the distinct sound of a manual typewriter in operation.\", \"A young child in a floral shirt stands at a desk, pressing keys on a black computer keyboard while a person makes a soft 'aww' sound and another voice makes a clicking sound.\\n\\\\boxed{A young child presses keys on a black computer keyboard while a person makes an 'aww' sound and another voice makes a clicking sound.}\", \"The toddler presses keys on the black keyboard, then looks up and speaks as a person in the background says 'ah' and 'eh'.\"]", "time_sec": 45.292, "generation_time_seconds": 44.0386, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.86, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "611", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Inside the iron cage in the wild, the locked leopard sits on the ground and growls at the outside of the cage.", "pred": "A large feline sits behind a chain-link fence as a person makes several high-pitched, guttural vocalizations.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A large feline sits behind a chain-link fence as a person makes several high-pitched, guttural vocalizations.", "cot": "[\"A large feline sits behind a chain-link fence as a person makes several high-pitched, guttural vocalizations.\", \"A large spotted feline, possibly a puma, sits behind a chain-link fence in an outdoor enclosure with a blue tarp roof, and it emits several loud, guttural roars.\", \"A large, tawny wild cat sits inside a chain-link enclosure with a blue tarp roof, its head turned to the right as it emits a series of loud, powerful, deep roars and growls.\", \"A large, tawny-furred puma sits within a chain-link fence enclosure and emits a series of loud, sustained, high-pitched screams.\"]", "time_sec": 40.709, "generation_time_seconds": 39.9053, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.7, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "612", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a child with short hair stood at the table and snorted to the man beside him, who giggled with amusement. Behind her, the woman lay on the sofa watching.", "pred": "A baby in a pink shirt sits at a coffee table, making crying sounds while a woman smiles from a couch in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A baby in a pink shirt sits at a coffee table, making crying sounds while a woman smiles from a couch in the background.", "cot": "[\"A baby in a pink shirt sits at a coffee table, making crying sounds while a woman smiles from a couch in the background.\", \"A baby in a pink shirt stands at a wooden table, looking at the camera, while a woman lies on a couch behind her; the baby makes a series of high-pitched, cooing vocalizations.\", \"A baby in a pink shirt sits at a coffee table, vocalizing with open-mouthed coos and squeals as a woman on a couch in the background laughs in amusement.\", \"A baby in a pink shirt sits at a table, making cooing sounds while a woman lies on a couch in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 38.981, "generation_time_seconds": 37.7945, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "613", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, two men's are in red jackets were shooting at human targets, and the laughter was heard.", "pred": "A person wearing a red jacket is in a store with workout equipment. The person kicks a red, cylindrical punching bag, which swings back and forth after being struck. The sound of the kick is followed by the distinct, high-pitched squeaking of the bag's support chain.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing a red jacket is in a store with workout equipment. The person kicks a red, cylindrical punching bag, which swings back and forth after being struck. The sound of the kick is followed by the distinct, high-pitched squeaking of the bag's support chain.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing a red jacket is in a store with workout equipment. The person kicks a red, cylindrical punching bag, which swings back and forth after being struck. The sound of the kick is followed by the distinct, high-pitched squeaking of the bag's support chain.\", \"A person wearing a red shirt is seen in a store aisle, striking a large, flesh-colored torso punching bag. The bag is secured to a black metal rack, and a red cylindrical bag is attached to its side. A man in a red jacket walks past in the background. The distinct sound of a physical impact is heard, followed by a person laughing, indicating the person is punching the bag.\", \"A person in a red jacket swings a black object at a life-sized mannequin in a store. A sneeze is heard, followed by a series of thudding impacts as the object repeatedly strikes the mannequin.\", \"A person in a red jacket is in a store, throwing a series of punches at a red, torso-shaped punching bag, accompanied by the sounds of heavy thuds and a dull impact.\"]", "time_sec": 53.244, "generation_time_seconds": 52.5832, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.26, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "614", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Outside with the sound of birds, a blue car shows both sides.", "pred": "A blue Volkswagen hatchback is parked on a wet brick driveway next to green bushes. The sounds of birds chirping and a dog barking are audible in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A blue Volkswagen hatchback is parked on a wet brick driveway next to green bushes. The sounds of birds chirping and a dog barking are audible in the background.", "cot": "[\"A blue Volkswagen hatchback is parked on a wet brick driveway next to green bushes. The sounds of birds chirping and a dog barking are audible in the background.\", \"A blue Volkswagen Golf hatchback is parked on a wet, paved surface next to a brick wall and green hedge, while the audio captures the distinct sound of a dog barking.\", \"A blue Volkswagen hatchback is parked on a wet paved surface next to a hedge, while the distinct sound of a dog barking is heard in the background.\", \"A blue Volkswagen hatchback is parked on a wet paved surface next to a hedge, while the audio captures the sound of a dog barking in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 39.518, "generation_time_seconds": 38.1936, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "615", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the music, the picture is transformed from a man holding a remote-controlled plane to a yacht sailing on the water.", "pred": "The visual shows a first-person perspective from a drone flying over a canal in Venice, passing colorful buildings and a white speedboat. The audio consists of loud, fast-paced electronic dance music with a prominent, repetitive synth riff.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The visual shows a first-person perspective from a drone flying over a canal in Venice, passing colorful buildings and a white speedboat. The audio consists of loud, fast-paced electronic dance music with a prominent, repetitive synth riff.", "cot": "[\"The visual shows a first-person perspective from a drone flying over a canal in Venice, passing colorful buildings and a white speedboat. The audio consists of loud, fast-paced electronic dance music with a prominent, repetitive synth riff.\", \"I see a series of aerial drone shots showing boats navigating the narrow, colorful canals of Venice, Italy.\\n I hear a fast-paced, high-energy electronic music track with a driving beat and synthesized melodies.\\n The visual of the serene city contrasts with the intense and frantic audio.\\n\\\\boxed{Aerial drone footage of boats in Venice's canals is paired with frantic, high-energy electronic music.}\", \"The video shows a boat moving down a canal flanked by buildings, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched electronic music track.\", \"The video displays a rapid sequence of urban and aquatic scenes, starting with a person holding a drone, then showing a boat moving along a canal lined with buildings, followed by a view of a city skyline from the water, and concluding with a wooden boat navigating the same canal. This visual progression is accompanied by a continuous, high-energy electronic dance music track featuring a prominent, distorted bassline, a fast-paced synthesized melody, and rapid percussive elements.\"]", "time_sec": 56.724, "generation_time_seconds": 55.8463, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "616", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the dark of the night, the firecrackers were lit, and with a flash of fire, they flew up to the sky, making a loud noise, and falling a few wisps of white smoke.", "pred": "The video opens with dark, smoky visuals and a low-frequency hum. A bright orange light appears, and the word \"Materials!\" is displayed in a gold font. This is immediately followed by a high-pitched alarm sound and the loud report of a gunshot.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video opens with dark, smoky visuals and a low-frequency hum. A bright orange light appears, and the word \"Materials!\" is displayed in a gold font. This is immediately followed by a high-pitched alarm sound and the loud report of a gunshot.", "cot": "[\"The video opens with dark, smoky visuals and a low-frequency hum. A bright orange light appears, and the word \\\"Materials!\\\" is displayed in a gold font. This is immediately followed by a high-pitched alarm sound and the loud report of a gunshot.\", \"A dark night sky is illuminated by an orange explosion and billowing smoke, followed by a flashing yellow text overlay that reads \\\"Materials!\\\", while the audio consists of a loud, high-pitched alarm, a heavy thud, and a final descending electronic tone.\", \"The video displays a dark screen with a bright orange light and smoke, followed by a black screen with the word \\\"Materials!\\\" in yellow text. Simultaneously, a loud air horn sounds, followed by a gunshot, which is then echoed by a single, clear church bell.\", \"The video opens on a dark, smoky background with a small orange light, then cuts to a black screen with the word \\\"Materials!\\\" in yellow text, all while a loud, high-pitched tire screech is immediately followed by a sharp, explosive pop.\"]", "time_sec": 51.929, "generation_time_seconds": 51.368, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.52, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "617", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the noise, the numbers are constantly changing and the machine is moving.", "pred": "A close-up of a sewing machine's digital display showing 'Auto Embroidery Mode' is accompanied by the distinct sound of a motor, likely an engine, running at high speed.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A close-up of a sewing machine's digital display showing 'Auto Embroidery Mode' is accompanied by the distinct sound of a motor, likely an engine, running at high speed.", "cot": "[\"A close-up of a sewing machine's digital display showing 'Auto Embroidery Mode' is accompanied by the distinct sound of a motor, likely an engine, running at high speed.\", \"A close-up of a black machine's control panel shows a green digital display reading \\\"Bull Pattern Mode\\\" and \\\"System: 381:11200\\\". The view pans down to reveal multiple colored spools of thread and a light green work surface. The entire scene is accompanied by the loud, continuous, rhythmic chugging sound of a machine's engine running.\", \"A computerized embroidery machine's digital display shows 'Auto Embroidery Mode' and 'System: 600-11000'. The machine's needle moves rapidly, creating a pattern on a piece of reddish-orange fabric, accompanied by the loud, high-pitched whirring of its motor.\", \"The video displays a close-up of a machine's digital control panel, which is illuminated with a green screen showing text such as 'Auto Embroidery Mode' and 'System Ref: 11900', while the audio consists of the loud, rhythmic clattering of a rapidly operating mechanical device, resembling an old-fashioned typewriter.\"]", "time_sec": 58.697, "generation_time_seconds": 57.5759, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "618", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, one woman and another were talking, with a lamp behind them and coughing sound.", "pred": "A young boy and girl are visible in a room, with the girl laughing and the boy coughing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young boy and girl are visible in a room, with the girl laughing and the boy coughing.", "cot": "[\"A young boy and girl are visible in a room, with the girl laughing and the boy coughing.\", \"Two young people are sitting together at a table in a dimly lit room with a lamp visible behind them.\\nThe person on the left is laughing, while the person on the right is coughing and laughing simultaneously.\\nA female voice says, \\\"We do a content about coughing.\\\"\", \"Two young people, a girl and a boy, are sitting at a table in a dimly lit room and laughing heartily. Their laughter is immediately followed by a very loud, wet, and forceful coughing fit from one of them, which sounds like a violent hacking cough.\", \"Two young people, a girl and a boy, are sitting next to each other at a table. The girl is laughing while the boy makes a strained, gagging sound, followed by a female voice saying, \\\"We do a content about coughing.\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 47.216, "generation_time_seconds": 46.625, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.05, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "619", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "To the music, a man in white was singing with a microphone in the room. and all peoples are enjoying.", "pred": "A woman in white clothing kneels on a wooden floor and sings into a microphone, while loud, distorted rock music with screaming vocals plays from an unseen source.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman in white clothing kneels on a wooden floor and sings into a microphone, while loud, distorted rock music with screaming vocals plays from an unseen source.", "cot": "[\"A woman in white clothing kneels on a wooden floor and sings into a microphone, while loud, distorted rock music with screaming vocals plays from an unseen source.\", \"An individual in a white robe and hat stands at a lectern in a room with wood paneling, holding a microphone and gesturing, while a separate, loud, distorted, and chaotic recording of a heavy metal concert with screaming vocals and fast-paced music plays.\", \"A woman in a white dress and hat stands on a stage in front of a wooden lectern, singing into a microphone, while a loud, distorted male voice shouts aggressively in the background.\", \"A woman in white robes kneels and sings into a microphone, while a crowd shouts and cheers in a reverberant space.\"]", "time_sec": 41.194, "generation_time_seconds": 40.5698, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "620", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Outside, a boy in a Blue Jacket gargles and makes a sound.", "pred": "A young boy in a blue t-shirt sits outdoors and makes a series of loud, guttural, and exaggerated vocalizations, similar to a duck's quacking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young boy in a blue t-shirt sits outdoors and makes a series of loud, guttural, and exaggerated vocalizations, similar to a duck's quacking.", "cot": "[\"A young boy in a blue t-shirt sits outdoors and makes a series of loud, guttural, and exaggerated vocalizations, similar to a duck's quacking.\", \"A young boy with his eyes closed and mouth open is shown in a close-up. He is making gurgling, guttural vocalizations that resemble the braying of a donkey.\", \"A young boy with his eyes closed and mouth open is making a series of rapid, guttural, frog-like croaking sounds, while sitting on a light-colored wooden bench in a wooded area.\", \"A young boy wearing a blue t-shirt sits on a wooden bench outdoors, his head tilted back with his eyes closed and mouth open, while a loud, guttural, squawking sound is heard.\"]", "time_sec": 42.154, "generation_time_seconds": 41.4973, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.27, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "621", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Outside in the green grass, there is the chirping of birds, ahead of a stretch of water.", "pred": "The video displays a wide, panoramic view of a large body of water with hazy city skylines on the distant horizon under a cloudy sky, while the audio captures the sounds of multiple people conversing in a foreign language, suggesting the presence of a crowd.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a wide, panoramic view of a large body of water with hazy city skylines on the distant horizon under a cloudy sky, while the audio captures the sounds of multiple people conversing in a foreign language, suggesting the presence of a crowd.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a wide, panoramic view of a large body of water with hazy city skylines on the distant horizon under a cloudy sky, while the audio captures the sounds of multiple people conversing in a foreign language, suggesting the presence of a crowd.\", \"This is a low-resolution, shaky video. The visual shows a wide, elevated view of a large body of water with a distant city skyline and a ship under a cloudy sky. The audio consists of indistinct human speech and a loud, sustained electronic tone.\", \"This is a wide, static shot of a large, hazy bay with a distant city skyline, viewed from a grassy, bush-covered hill.\\nThe audio consists of a continuous, low-frequency mechanical hum, possibly from a vehicle engine, overlaid with the distinct, melodic calls of a bird and faint, unintelligible human speech.\", \"The visual shows a wide, hazy landscape with a large body of water, distant land, and a city skyline under a cloudy sky, while the accompanying audio features the distinct, high-pitched calls of a peacock.\"]", "time_sec": 52.044, "generation_time_seconds": 51.5479, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "622", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the bamboo grove, a string of wind bells swayed in the wind, making a collision sound.", "pred": "FORMATTING INSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Compression: Pack all objective sensory details into a maximum of 30 words.\n2. Directness: Skip all introductory phrases. Start immediately with the main subject.\n3. Keywords: Prioritize specific nouns and adjectives.\nCORE RULE: Be extremely dense, strictly factual, and under 30 words. Final answer in \\boxed{}.\nThe visual shows a bamboo forest and a hanging wind chime, while the audio exclusively features the sound of a mechanical, high-pitched, intermittent bell. The two sensory streams are independent of one another.\n\\boxed{A bamboo forest with a hanging wind chime is shown, while the audio features the sound of a mechanical bell.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "This is a high-density, expert-level description in ONE SHORT sentence.\nCRITICAL ANTI-HALLUCINATION DIRECTIVES:\n1. MODALITY INDEPENDENCE: Analyze what you SEE and HEAR independently. DO NOT let the visual scene change your interpretation of the audio, and vice versa.\n2. NO SEMANTIC SMOOTHING: If visuals and audio seem contradictory (e.g., a forest visual but an engine sound), report BOTH exactly as they are. Do not invent details like 'chirping birds' to make it natural.\n3. AVOID ASSUMPTIONS: Rely on audio to confirm ambiguous visuals (e.g., a 'baaing' sound confirms a goat, do not assume it is a cat).\n\nFORMATTING INSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Compression: Pack all objective sensory details into a maximum of 30 words.\n2. Directness: Skip all introductory phrases. Start immediately with the main subject.\n3. Keywords: Prioritize specific nouns and adjectives.\nCORE RULE: Be extremely dense, strictly factual, and under 30 words. Final answer in \\boxed{}.\nThe visual shows a bamboo forest and a hanging wind chime, while the audio exclusively features the sound of a mechanical, high-pitched, intermittent bell. The two sensory streams are independent of one another.\n\\boxed{A bamboo forest with a hanging wind chime is shown, while the audio features the sound of a mechanical bell.}", "cot": "[\"This is a high-density, expert-level description in ONE SHORT sentence.\\nCRITICAL ANTI-HALLUCINATION DIRECTIVES:\\n1. MODALITY INDEPENDENCE: Analyze what you SEE and HEAR independently. DO NOT let the visual scene change your interpretation of the audio, and vice versa.\\n2. NO SEMANTIC SMOOTHING: If visuals and audio seem contradictory (e.g., a forest visual but an engine sound), report BOTH exactly as they are. Do not invent details like 'chirping birds' to make it natural.\\n3. AVOID ASSUMPTIONS: Rely on audio to confirm ambiguous visuals (e.g., a 'baaing' sound confirms a goat, do not assume it is a cat).\\n\\nFORMATTING INSTRUCTIONS:\\n1. Compression: Pack all objective sensory details into a maximum of 30 words.\\n2. Directness: Skip all introductory phrases. Start immediately with the main subject.\\n3. Keywords: Prioritize specific nouns and adjectives.\\nCORE RULE: Be extremely dense, strictly factual, and under 30 words. Final answer in \\\\boxed{}.\\nThe visual shows a bamboo forest and a hanging wind chime, while the audio exclusively features the sound of a mechanical, high-pitched, intermittent bell. The two sensory streams are independent of one another.\\n\\\\boxed{A bamboo forest with a hanging wind chime is shown, while the audio features the sound of a mechanical bell.}\", \"A dark, multi-tiered wind chime hangs suspended in a dense bamboo forest. The chime is activated by the wind, producing a high-pitched, tinkling sound. White Japanese text is superimposed over the scene.\", \"A dark, cylindrical wind chime hangs amidst a dense bamboo forest, its long, thin metal tubes audibly clanging and chiming as they move in the wind.\\n\\\\boxed{A dark cylindrical wind chime hangs in a bamboo forest, its long metal tubes audibly clanging and chiming in the wind.}\", \"A black wind chime hangs in a dense bamboo forest, and it produces a series of high-pitched metallic clinks and jingles as it is moved by the wind.\"]", "time_sec": 87.227, "generation_time_seconds": 86.6096, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "623", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the drumming, two brown bears bite in the snow, behind them rockery.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{Two brown bears are seen fighting and then sitting calmly in a snowy, rocky enclosure while dramatic orchestral music plays.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "This is a video recording of two brown bears in an outdoor, rocky enclosure. They are initially seen standing on their hind legs and grappling with each other. The scene then shifts to show the bears sitting on the ground, interacting calmly. Throughout the entire clip, there is a loud, dramatic orchestral score with prominent brass instruments and a fast, repetitive percussive beat playing in the background. The \"ZOO.org\" logo is visible in the bottom right corner of the frame.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Two brown bears are seen fighting and then sitting calmly in a snowy, rocky enclosure while dramatic orchestral music plays.}}", "cot": "[\"This is a video recording of two brown bears in an outdoor, rocky enclosure. They are initially seen standing on their hind legs and grappling with each other. The scene then shifts to show the bears sitting on the ground, interacting calmly. Throughout the entire clip, there is a loud, dramatic orchestral score with prominent brass instruments and a fast, repetitive percussive beat playing in the background. The \\\"ZOO.org\\\" logo is visible in the bottom right corner of the frame.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{\\\\text{Two brown bears are seen fighting and then sitting calmly in a snowy, rocky enclosure while dramatic orchestral music plays.}}\", \"Two brown bears stand on their hind legs in a rocky, snowy environment, interacting with each other by smelling and touching their heads, while dramatic orchestral music plays in the background.\", \"Two large brown bears engage in a physical confrontation, standing on their hind legs and grappling with each other in a rocky, snowy enclosure, while a dramatic, orchestral brass fanfare plays in the background.\", \"The audio features an epic orchestral fanfare with brass and timpani, while the video shows two brown bears play-fighting by biting each other's necks in a rocky, snowy enclosure.\"]", "time_sec": 55.668, "generation_time_seconds": 54.9971, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.39, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "624", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a woman was talking, a cat sitting in a chair, a cat sitting on the ground, meowing.", "pred": "A blurry view of a cat sitting on a wooden chair transitions to a Siamese cat looking at the camera as a woman calls its name, \"Louis,\" and it meows in reply.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A blurry view of a cat sitting on a wooden chair transitions to a Siamese cat looking at the camera as a woman calls its name, \"Louis,\" and it meows in reply.", "cot": "[\"A blurry view of a cat sitting on a wooden chair transitions to a Siamese cat looking at the camera as a woman calls its name, \\\"Louis,\\\" and it meows in reply.\", \"A fluffy grey and white cat sits on a wooden chair, looking left. A Siamese cat with dark points is visible in a dark room. A woman calls out, \\\"Louis?\\\", followed by a cat meowing, and she says, \\\"Oh, I'm sure that's all right.\\\".\", \"The video displays a series of cats, beginning with a close-up of a fluffy, long-haired cat with white and dark markings, followed by a Siamese cat. The audio consists of a person calling a name, which is answered by a cat meowing.\", \"A multi-colored cat sits on a wooden chair next to a white spray can, then the scene cuts to a Siamese cat sitting on the floor, while a person repeatedly calls out the name \\\"Louis\\\" and a cat meows in response.\"]", "time_sec": 49.661, "generation_time_seconds": 49.1263, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 35.71, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "625", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "There was a man sitting in the room playing an electric guitar music.", "pred": "A person wearing a dark blue zip-up jacket plays a black electric guitar in a room with a checkered floor. The audio is dominated by the sound of the guitar, which produces a low, sustained, heavily distorted power chord followed by a high-pitched, vibrato-rich, and expressive melodic phrase.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person wearing a dark blue zip-up jacket plays a black electric guitar in a room with a checkered floor. The audio is dominated by the sound of the guitar, which produces a low, sustained, heavily distorted power chord followed by a high-pitched, vibrato-rich, and expressive melodic phrase.", "cot": "[\"A person wearing a dark blue zip-up jacket plays a black electric guitar in a room with a checkered floor. The audio is dominated by the sound of the guitar, which produces a low, sustained, heavily distorted power chord followed by a high-pitched, vibrato-rich, and expressive melodic phrase.\", \"A person wearing a dark blue zip-up jacket plays a black electric guitar with a white pickguard on a black and white checkered floor, producing loud, sustained, high-pitched, and distorted notes with aggressive string bends.\", \"A person plays a black electric guitar, fretting notes on the neck with their left hand and strumming with their right. The audio consists of heavily distorted, high-gain electric guitar riffs and a sustained, high-pitched wailing guitar tone.\", \"A person in a blue jacket plays a black electric guitar, generating loud, heavily distorted, and sustained high-pitched feedback sounds.\"]", "time_sec": 47.71, "generation_time_seconds": 46.7246, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "626", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the sound of fire in the game, the character walks through the burning staircase to the corridor.", "pred": "A first-person perspective shows a character moving through a narrow corridor with orange-lit walls and a wooden ceiling, while a loud, continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble plays in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A first-person perspective shows a character moving through a narrow corridor with orange-lit walls and a wooden ceiling, while a loud, continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble plays in the background.", "cot": "[\"A first-person perspective shows a character moving through a narrow corridor with orange-lit walls and a wooden ceiling, while a loud, continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble plays in the background.\", \"A character descends a wooden staircase within a stone-walled building, the scene illuminated by an intense orange glow caused by fire; simultaneously, the powerful, resonant roar of a large engine is heard, accompanied by the continuous sound of rushing water.\", \"The video shows a player character in dark clothing sprinting down a narrow, wooden staircase inside a building with orange walls, while the audio consists of the continuous, low rumble of a large vehicle engine, followed by a loud explosion.\", \"A character in dark clothing is on a wooden staircase inside a building, with a large fire burning to the right side of the frame and a health bar visible at the top; simultaneously, the audio consists of a loud, deep, and continuous rumbling sound, like a massive engine or heavy machinery operating.\"]", "time_sec": 48.157, "generation_time_seconds": 47.359, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "627", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man with a blue coat painted a size on the cloth under the hum and horn.", "pred": "A man in a blue shirt uses a yellow ruler to draw lines on dark fabric, while the loud, persistent beeping of a reversing vehicle is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a blue shirt uses a yellow ruler to draw lines on dark fabric, while the loud, persistent beeping of a reversing vehicle is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A man in a blue shirt uses a yellow ruler to draw lines on dark fabric, while the loud, persistent beeping of a reversing vehicle is heard in the background.\", \"A man in a blue shirt uses a yellow ruler to measure dark fabric on a table, while the sound of a train approaching and a horn is heard.\", \"A man in a blue shirt marks dark fabric with chalk while a train approaches, its horn blowing twice.\", \"A man in a blue shirt marks a large piece of dark fabric on a table with a yellow ruler and chalk, while the sound of a vehicle's horn and its engine are heard in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 37.742, "generation_time_seconds": 36.689, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 4.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "628", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman sat on a toy fish and stepped on water in a swimming pool, with several people watching and laughing.", "pred": "A woman laughs while riding a large inflatable orca in a swimming pool, and the sound of her splashing in the water is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A woman laughs while riding a large inflatable orca in a swimming pool, and the sound of her splashing in the water is heard.", "cot": "[\"A woman laughs while riding a large inflatable orca in a swimming pool, and the sound of her splashing in the water is heard.\", \"A person in a black and white inflatable orca ride floats in a swimming pool, while another person laughs and splashes in the water nearby.\", \"A woman in a pool holds a large inflatable orca while laughing and making splashing sounds.\", \"A young girl in a green swimsuit holds onto a large inflatable orca whale in a swimming pool while laughing and splashing water.\"]", "time_sec": 34.584, "generation_time_seconds": 33.905, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "629", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a small child around lots of toys is there made a sound as a woman spoke.", "pred": "A baby in a green activity center looks up, and a woman says, \"Hello, baby girl.\" The baby then vocalizes, and the woman laughs.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A baby in a green activity center looks up, and a woman says, \"Hello, baby girl.\" The baby then vocalizes, and the woman laughs.", "cot": "[\"A baby in a green activity center looks up, and a woman says, \\\"Hello, baby girl.\\\" The baby then vocalizes, and the woman laughs.\", \"A baby in a green and yellow bouncer looks at the camera as a woman speaks and the baby vocalizes.\", \"A baby in a green and blue bouncer looks upward and vocalizes, while a woman off-screen speaks to her, and a cat meows in the background.\", \"The video shows a baby in a green and yellow activity center making baby sounds, while a woman's voice can be heard speaking to her and asking if she said hello back.\"]", "time_sec": 36.821, "generation_time_seconds": 35.7665, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "630", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In one room, a woman in red made a sound in her mouth and clapped her hands.", "pred": "A young girl in a red zip-up hoodie stands indoors, clapping her hands rhythmically. She sings or chants in Arabic, her voice echoing slightly in the room, while the sharp sound of her hand claps creates a percussive beat.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young girl in a red zip-up hoodie stands indoors, clapping her hands rhythmically. She sings or chants in Arabic, her voice echoing slightly in the room, while the sharp sound of her hand claps creates a percussive beat.", "cot": "[\"A young girl in a red zip-up hoodie stands indoors, clapping her hands rhythmically. She sings or chants in Arabic, her voice echoing slightly in the room, while the sharp sound of her hand claps creates a percussive beat.\", \"A young girl in a red zip-up jacket stands indoors, rhythmically clapping her hands and moving her arms in time with a repeating, high-pitched, childlike chant that includes the phrase \\\"pashto dikto\\\" and the sound of her hands hitting a surface.\", \"A young girl in a red zip-up hoodie stands in a room with a tiled floor and sings a repetitive phrase in Spanish while clapping her hands in time with the music.\", \"A young girl wearing a red zip-up hoodie stands in a room with a door and dances. She sings in a high-pitched voice, saying \\\"beto gido\\\" and \\\"pashneko\\\" in a rhythmic, chant-like manner, accompanied by hand claps.\"]", "time_sec": 49.333, "generation_time_seconds": 48.4056, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "631", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Inside, a man was speaking, pressing the cash register on the table, which was dripping.", "pred": "A person's hand presses buttons on a white cash register with a green digital display, while a male voice describes the item and a paper roll dispenses from the machine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hand presses buttons on a white cash register with a green digital display, while a male voice describes the item and a paper roll dispenses from the machine.", "cot": "[\"A person's hand presses buttons on a white cash register with a green digital display, while a male voice describes the item and a paper roll dispenses from the machine.\", \"A hand presses buttons on a white cash register that displays \\\"0.00\\\" on its digital screen, while a voice explains that a PDF file will be sent along with the register.\", \"A person's hand is shown operating a white Sharp cash register on a countertop, while a male voice speaks about sending a PDF and the register.\", \"A person's hand operates a white Sharp cash register on a kitchen counter, while a male voice speaks about a PDF file and the register's functionality.\"]", "time_sec": 38.386, "generation_time_seconds": 37.4267, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "632", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A man in a pink plaid top spoke with a phone, then sped to another man, and the grey colour man will be answer the phone.", "pred": "Two men stand on a sidewalk in front of a building and lush greenery; one in a red and white plaid shirt holds a phone to his ear and speaks, while the other in a grey shirt stands beside him.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Two men stand on a sidewalk in front of a building and lush greenery; one in a red and white plaid shirt holds a phone to his ear and speaks, while the other in a grey shirt stands beside him.", "cot": "[\"Two men stand on a sidewalk in front of a building and lush greenery; one in a red and white plaid shirt holds a phone to his ear and speaks, while the other in a grey shirt stands beside him.\", \"Two men are standing on a paved walkway in front of lush green plants and a building. The man on the right, wearing a grey shirt, speaks into a mobile phone while the man on the left, in a plaid shirt, looks at him and talks. A short, upbeat electronic music sting plays, followed by a male voice speaking in a foreign language, after which the man on the right answers his phone with \\\"Hello?\\\".\", \"Two men stand on a sidewalk in front of a building with green foliage; one man on the right holds a cell phone to his ear and speaks while the other man on the left talks. A phone rings, followed by a man speaking in Telugu, and a female voice says \\\"Hello\\\".\", \"The audio features a man speaking in Telugu, followed by a notification sound, and then another man saying \\\"Hello\\\". The corresponding visual shows a man in a plaid shirt handing a phone to a man in a grey shirt, who then holds it to his ear as if answering a call.\"]", "time_sec": 57.565, "generation_time_seconds": 56.8922, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "633", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the sound of the water, a child bathed in the bathtub, his hands were moving, the water from the faucet rushed toward the child's body, the child kissed the faucet, and there was a voice beside it.", "pred": "A person holds a chrome shower head, spraying water onto a young child or baby in a bathtub, while the continuous sound of running water is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person holds a chrome shower head, spraying water onto a young child or baby in a bathtub, while the continuous sound of running water is heard.", "cot": "[\"A person holds a chrome shower head, spraying water onto a young child or baby in a bathtub, while the continuous sound of running water is heard.\", \"The sound of a shower running accompanies a young child in a bathtub being washed by an unseen person holding the shower head.\", \"A child is being washed in a bathtub by an adult holding a handheld shower head, while the continuous sound of running water is audible.\", \"A young child with light hair is being washed with a chrome shower head, and the sound of rushing water is audible.\"]", "time_sec": 34.828, "generation_time_seconds": 34.2008, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.03, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "634", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man at the sewing machine clatters while talking.", "pred": "A person's hands guide a piece of white fabric and a blue ribbon under the needle of a white sewing machine, which produces a loud, rhythmic whirring sound as it operates, accompanied by a female voice speaking in French, saying \"prenez votre couture\".", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands guide a piece of white fabric and a blue ribbon under the needle of a white sewing machine, which produces a loud, rhythmic whirring sound as it operates, accompanied by a female voice speaking in French, saying \"prenez votre couture\".", "cot": "[\"A person's hands guide a piece of white fabric and a blue ribbon under the needle of a white sewing machine, which produces a loud, rhythmic whirring sound as it operates, accompanied by a female voice speaking in French, saying \\\"prenez votre couture\\\".\", \"A person's hands guide a piece of white fabric with a blue trim under the needle of a white sewing machine, which is actively stitching. A female voice speaks in French, followed by the loud, rhythmic whirring and clacking of the machine's motor and mechanics.\", \"A person's hands guide a piece of white fabric and a strip of blue tape under the presser foot of a white sewing machine, while the machine operates with a rhythmic mechanical clatter and a voice gives instructions in French.\", \"A person's hands guide white fabric with a blue edge under the needle of a white sewing machine, which is actively stitching a seam while the speaker gives instructions in French.\"]", "time_sec": 47.81, "generation_time_seconds": 47.2125, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "635", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a man was drumming and thumping.", "pred": "The video shows a person's hands playing a cowbell percussion instrument, which is mounted on a drum kit. The audio consists of a rhythmic, percussive sound, matching the visual action of the cowbell being struck.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video shows a person's hands playing a cowbell percussion instrument, which is mounted on a drum kit. The audio consists of a rhythmic, percussive sound, matching the visual action of the cowbell being struck.", "cot": "[\"The video shows a person's hands playing a cowbell percussion instrument, which is mounted on a drum kit. The audio consists of a rhythmic, percussive sound, matching the visual action of the cowbell being struck.\", \"A close-up shows a person's hands using a wooden stick to strike a silver metal percussion instrument, which is producing a rhythmic, percussive sound with a metallic, resonant quality.\", \"A person's hands play a cowbell and a drum simultaneously, producing a continuous, syncopated Latin percussion rhythm with a distinct cowbell accent.\", \"A person plays a cowbell percussion instrument, producing a steady, rhythmic beat that matches the sound of the cowbell being struck.\"]", "time_sec": 39.39, "generation_time_seconds": 38.702, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "636", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the sound of his voice, a mouse jumped into the plants.", "pred": "A person's hands use pliers on a blue object, followed by a shot of green plants. A voice says \"He's out. You can go.\" A woman then exclaims, \"Yay!\" A man says, \"I don't know what that was,\" and a woman asks, \"Where is he?\" A man suggests, \"A bird feeder?\" The woman asks, \"Where is he?\" while another voice says, \"It's a bird feeder. It's the kind that closes down.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A person's hands use pliers on a blue object, followed by a shot of green plants. A voice says \"He's out. You can go.\" A woman then exclaims, \"Yay!\" A man says, \"I don't know what that was,\" and a woman asks, \"Where is he?\" A man suggests, \"A bird feeder?\" The woman asks, \"Where is he?\" while another voice says, \"It's a bird feeder. It's the kind that closes down.\"", "cot": "[\"A person's hands use pliers on a blue object, followed by a shot of green plants. A voice says \\\"He's out. You can go.\\\" A woman then exclaims, \\\"Yay!\\\" A man says, \\\"I don't know what that was,\\\" and a woman asks, \\\"Where is he?\\\" A man suggests, \\\"A bird feeder?\\\" The woman asks, \\\"Where is he?\\\" while another voice says, \\\"It's a bird feeder. It's the kind that closes down.\\\"\", \"A brown and tan snake is seen moving through green leaves and dirt, while a person says, \\\"He's out. You can go,\\\" followed by a woman saying, \\\"Yay!\\\" and another person identifying the object as a \\\"bird feeder.\\\"\", \"The audio captures a group of people reacting with surprise and excitement as they discover a small animal, possibly a fawn, struggling in a garden.\", \"A person is seen using pliers to cut something on the ground, then the camera moves through green foliage, and finally a hand is shown holding a brown, rectangular object. In the background, a man and a woman are talking, with the woman exclaiming \\\"Yay!\\\" and the man asking, \\\"I don't know what that was,\\\" before the woman identifies the object as a bird feeder.\"]", "time_sec": 59.26, "generation_time_seconds": 58.6679, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "637", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a man stood in front of the television playing a violin, making a beautiful musical sound.", "pred": "A man plays a violin in front of a computer monitor showing a Christmas-themed video, while a Christmas song is played on a violin.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man plays a violin in front of a computer monitor showing a Christmas-themed video, while a Christmas song is played on a violin.", "cot": "[\"A man plays a violin in front of a computer monitor showing a Christmas-themed video, while a Christmas song is played on a violin.\", \"A man in a patterned sweater plays a violin in front of a computer monitor. The monitor displays a festive scene of people in Santa hats dancing in the snow. The audio features the man playing the violin, accompanied by a guitar.\", \"A man with glasses plays a violin while watching a Christmas-themed music video on a computer monitor. The audio features a solo string instrument, likely a violin, performing a melody.\", \"A man wearing glasses and a patterned sweater plays a violin in a room, with a computer monitor displaying a Christmas-themed music video of women in red and white outfits singing in the background; the audio consists of the man's violin performance and a continuous, low-frequency hum.\"]", "time_sec": 43.888, "generation_time_seconds": 42.8128, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "638", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "There was a lion in the cage. A man reached into the cage and touched the lion. There was a sound of water running around.", "pred": "A man wearing a brown jacket and blue jeans stands next to the bars of a cage, reaching his hand in to touch a large, tawny lion. The sound of a toilet flushing is heard in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man wearing a brown jacket and blue jeans stands next to the bars of a cage, reaching his hand in to touch a large, tawny lion. The sound of a toilet flushing is heard in the background.", "cot": "[\"A man wearing a brown jacket and blue jeans stands next to the bars of a cage, reaching his hand in to touch a large, tawny lion. The sound of a toilet flushing is heard in the background.\", \"A man in a brown jacket stands outside a green-barred cage, petting a lion's head and mane. The lion whimpers and growls in response. The sound of a faucet running is audible in the background.\\n\\\\boxed{A man pets a lion in a cage while a faucet runs in the background.}\", \"A man wearing a brown jacket and a blue baseball cap stands beside a barred cage, petting a lion's head. The sound of a large volume of water being poured or sprayed is prominent in the background.\", \"A man in a brown jacket and blue jeans stands next to a large lion in a metal-barred cage, touching its head. The sound of rushing water, possibly from a hose, is heard, followed by a low animal vocalization from the lion.\"]", "time_sec": 49.939, "generation_time_seconds": 48.725, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "639", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room a woman with glasses spoke, and a woman with long hair cried and answered.", "pred": "A young woman with dark hair and glasses, wearing a blue top, displays a pained and distressed facial expression while speaking in Sinhala, with the sound of birds chirping in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young woman with dark hair and glasses, wearing a blue top, displays a pained and distressed facial expression while speaking in Sinhala, with the sound of birds chirping in the background.", "cot": "[\"A young woman with dark hair and glasses, wearing a blue top, displays a pained and distressed facial expression while speaking in Sinhala, with the sound of birds chirping in the background.\", \"A woman with long dark hair speaks in a concerned tone, accompanied by the continuous chirping of birds in the background.\", \"A woman with dark hair and glasses looks to the side with a surprised expression, then turns to speak while birds chirp in the background.\", \"A woman with long dark hair and glasses, wearing a patterned top, looks to her right with a concerned expression, while in the background, another woman with dark hair is visible near a purple curtain; a female voice speaks in Sinhala, followed by the sound of a vehicle engine starting and revving.\"]", "time_sec": 42.485, "generation_time_seconds": 41.6955, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "640", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "To the music, two men in white vests sang and danced in front of a dazzling with background music.", "pred": "The video displays a young man in a white tank top singing against a rapidly changing, colorful, abstract background, with a logo at the top left and text at the bottom, all while a hip-hop song with a male vocalist plays.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The video displays a young man in a white tank top singing against a rapidly changing, colorful, abstract background, with a logo at the top left and text at the bottom, all while a hip-hop song with a male vocalist plays.", "cot": "[\"The video displays a young man in a white tank top singing against a rapidly changing, colorful, abstract background, with a logo at the top left and text at the bottom, all while a hip-hop song with a male vocalist plays.\", \"The scene opens with a bright yellow lens flare, transitioning to a young man in a white tank top singing and dancing against a colorful, swirling background. Another man in a red cap joins him. The audio features a male voice rapping in a non-English language over a hip-hop beat with scratching sounds.\", \"The video shows a young man in a white tank top dancing and singing on a colorful stage, while another man in a red cap appears beside him; the audio consists of a male voice rapping in a non-English language over a prominent hip-hop beat with a heavy bassline and a repeating synth melody.\", \"The video displays a man in a white tank top singing against a colorful, animated background, while the audio features a male voice rapping in a non-English language over a prominent hip-hop beat.\"]", "time_sec": 51.527, "generation_time_seconds": 50.8765, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "641", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A little girl coughed ,and the person next to her brushed her face with a towel as she spoke.", "pred": "A young child in a light blue shirt sits on a floor and makes gagging sounds, while a person off-screen holds their chin and speaks.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A young child in a light blue shirt sits on a floor and makes gagging sounds, while a person off-screen holds their chin and speaks.", "cot": "[\"A young child in a light blue shirt sits on a floor and makes gagging sounds, while a person off-screen holds their chin and speaks.\", \"A young child in a light blue sweater sits indoors, crying and making gagging sounds while an adult hand holds their chin.\", \"A young child in a light blue shirt has their face held by a hand and is audibly gagging and retching, while an adult speaks in the background.\", \"A young child with dark hair, wearing a light blue turtleneck sweater, sits indoors and makes gagging sounds while a person's hand holds their chin, all accompanied by the sound of a baby crying and a woman speaking.\"]", "time_sec": 38.41, "generation_time_seconds": 37.8624, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 4.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "642", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On a green meadow, a man in a hat was herding a cow, a dog barked at the cow, some of which had bells around their necks and rang as they moved.", "pred": "A herd of brown and white cows stands in a grassy pasture, with a man in dark clothing walking behind them near a fence. The sound of a cowbell ringing is followed by the barking of a dog.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A herd of brown and white cows stands in a grassy pasture, with a man in dark clothing walking behind them near a fence. The sound of a cowbell ringing is followed by the barking of a dog.", "cot": "[\"A herd of brown and white cows stands in a grassy pasture, with a man in dark clothing walking behind them near a fence. The sound of a cowbell ringing is followed by the barking of a dog.\", \"A herd of light-brown cows with black markings stands on a grassy mountainside, while a person in dark clothing stands among them; the sound of a dog barking and a person speaking is followed by a loud, rhythmic cowbell.\", \"The video displays a herd of cows in a grassy, mountainous pasture, and the accompanying audio consists of the sound of a dog barking followed by a series of loud, metallic bells.\", \"A person and a dog herd a group of cows through a mountainous pasture, while the audio captures the deep, resonant ringing of multiple cowbells.\\n\\\\boxed{A herd of cows, some with cowbells, moves across a grassy, mountainous pasture while the deep, resonant ringing of the bells is heard.}\"]", "time_sec": 49.645, "generation_time_seconds": 48.9508, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.26, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "643", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man spoke by a tree, then appeared on a bridge where vehicles whistled, then switched to a picture of people riding bicycles, a man washing a face with a water bottle  and finally a hand unlocking..", "pred": "A man in a black t-shirt speaks to the camera. The scene changes to show a train moving on a bridge over a river at sunset. The clip ends with a close-up of feet on a skateboard, accompanied by the sound of a vehicle's engine revving and tires screeching.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A man in a black t-shirt speaks to the camera. The scene changes to show a train moving on a bridge over a river at sunset. The clip ends with a close-up of feet on a skateboard, accompanied by the sound of a vehicle's engine revving and tires screeching.", "cot": "[\"A man in a black t-shirt speaks to the camera. The scene changes to show a train moving on a bridge over a river at sunset. The clip ends with a close-up of feet on a skateboard, accompanied by the sound of a vehicle's engine revving and tires screeching.\", \"A man in a dark t-shirt speaks to the camera at a skatepark, which then cuts to a series of quick action shots of a skateboarder grinding a rail and a train moving past graffiti-covered underpasses, all accompanied by a male voiceover and upbeat music.\", \"A man speaks in a skatepark, followed by the sound of a skateboard rolling on concrete and the deep roar of a powerful engine starting up.\", \"The visuals show a man speaking to the camera, followed by a close-up of a BMX bike on a concrete ledge, and then a train moving along a graffiti-covered railway bridge. Over this, a male voice speaks, followed by the sound of a vehicle engine starting and revving, and concluding with a loud, sustained screeching noise.\"]", "time_sec": 51.0, "generation_time_seconds": 50.2638, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "644", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A band played instruments in the middle of the square, with the sounds of conversation among the people around it.", "pred": "A group of bagpipers in orange kilts plays in the rain in front of a large stone arch. The sound of their bagpipes is accompanied by the voice of a man speaking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A group of bagpipers in orange kilts plays in the rain in front of a large stone arch. The sound of their bagpipes is accompanied by the voice of a man speaking.", "cot": "[\"A group of bagpipers in orange kilts plays in the rain in front of a large stone arch. The sound of their bagpipes is accompanied by the voice of a man speaking.\", \"A military band in kilts and formal uniforms plays bagpipes in unison on a wet, paved area in front of a large stone archway.\\n\\nThe audio consists of the loud, high-pitched, and rhythmic melody of multiple bagpipes playing together, with a low-level ambient murmur of a crowd in the background.\", \"A group of bagpipers in kilts marches in formation on a wet plaza in front of a large stone archway, while the sound of their bagpipes playing a melody is heard.\", \"A group of bagpipers in kilts performs in the rain at a large stone archway, while the low, droning sound of the bagpipes is heard.\\n\\\\boxed{A group of bagpipers in kilts performs in the rain at a large stone archway, while the low, droning sound of the bagpipes is heard.}\"]", "time_sec": 51.931, "generation_time_seconds": 51.2829, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
